�脢id�48e31b5b8830�body���单位质量甲烷在20年尺度的增温潜势约为CO2的80余倍，因其红外吸收能力强；但它大气寿命仅约12年，会被羟基自由基氧化分解，而CO2可存留数百年，所以两者在气候策略中需区别对待。�Per unit mass, methane's 20-year warming potential is over 80 times that of CO2 because it absorbs infrared strongly; but its atmospheric lifetime is only about 12 years, broken down by hydroxyl radicals, whereas CO2 persists for centuries—so the two need distinct policy treatment.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�49883daa26e6�body��可持续发展指既满足当代人的需要，又不损害后代满足其需要能力的发展，由联合国布伦特兰委员会于1987年正式定义。它强调经济、社会和环境三个维度的协调，而非以牺牲生态或公平为代价换取增长。�ZSustainable development is development that meets the needs of the present without compromising the ability of future generations to meet their own needs, a definition formalized by the UN Brundtland Commission in 1987. It emphasizes balancing economic, social, and environmental dimensions rather than growth at the expense of ecology or equity.�ans��src��L联合国世界环境与发展委员会《我们共同的未来》（1987）�NUN World Commission on Environment and Development, 'Our Common Future' (1987)��id�4c65063f76e3�body��城市因混凝土和沥青吸热、绿地和水体少，气温往往高于周边郊区的现象称为城市热岛。缓解手段包括增加树木和屋顶绿化、使用高反射材料以及保留水体。热岛会加剧夏季用电和人体健康风险。�3Cities are often warmer than surrounding suburbs because concrete and asphalt absorb heat while greenery and water are scarce; this is the urban heat island effect. Relief comes from more trees and green roofs, reflective materials and retained water bodies. It worsens summer power demand and health risks.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�524626a79c6a�body�ٳ吸管体积小、重量轻、回收经济性差，极易进入海洋被海龟海鸟误食，象征'不必要的一次性塑料'，因而成为减塑宣传与立法的切入点。��Straws are tiny, light, uneconomic to recycle, and easily ingested by turtles and seabirds, epitomizing 'unnecessary single-use plastic,' making them a natural focus for reduction campaigns and bans.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�52fcde13f158�body���泥炭地仅占陆地面积约 3%，却储存了约相当于全部森林两倍多的土壤有机碳（约 30% 的陆地土壤碳），是缓慢积累、极易因排干而释放的“碳宝库”。٩Peatlands are ~3% of land but hold over twice the soil carbon of all forests (about 30% of terrestrial soil carbon)—a slowly built, easily released store once drained.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�53f656c1a0a4�body��农业排放以甲烷（反刍动物肠胃发酵、稻田）和氧化亚氮（化肥施用）为主，外加部分CO2来自农机与土地利用。畜牧业尤其是牛肉和奶制品贡献突出。改进饲喂、肥料管理与沼气利用可显著降低排放。�Agriculture emits mainly methane from ruminant digestion and rice paddies and nitrous oxide from fertilizer use, plus some CO2 from machinery and land use. Livestock, especially beef and dairy, stand out. Better feeds, fertilizer management, and biogas can markedly cut emissions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�54ca6d255ede�body���三角箭头中的数字1至7标识树脂种类：1是PET，2是HDPE，3是PVC，4是LDPE，5是PP，6是PS，7是其他类。它帮助分拣但不保证当地一定能回收。了解代码有助于正确投放和选择易回收包装。��The numbers 1 to 7 in the recycling triangle identify resin type: 1 PET, 2 HDPE, 3 PVC, 4 LDPE, 5 PP, 6 PS, 7 others. They aid sorting but do not guarantee local recyclability. Knowing the codes helps correct disposal and choosing recyclable packaging.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�5584eeb23f54�body���个人碳足迹主要来自居家能源、交通出行、饮食和所购商品与服务四类。对多数人而言，开车和飞行、住宅供暖制冷以及肉类消费往往占大头。记账式App可帮助识别最大的减排空间。�A personal carbon footprint mainly comes from home energy, transport, diet and purchased goods and services. For most people, driving and flying, home heating and cooling, and meat consumption dominate. Tracking apps help identify the biggest reduction opportunities.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�56e1469e88b3�body���回收利用是把废纸、塑料、玻璃和金属等废弃物加工成新产品原料的过程，能减少对原生资源的开采。做好垃圾分类是顺利回收的前提。回收既节约能源，又减少填埋和焚烧带来的污染。�Recycling processes waste like paper, plastic, glass, and metal into raw materials for new products, reducing the need to extract virgin resources. Proper sorting is the prerequisite for successful recycling. It saves energy and cuts pollution from landfills and incineration.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�585329be82ec�body���道路、农田和城市把连片栖息地切成小块，使种群被隔离、基因交流减少。小块栖息地更易受边缘效应和外来干扰，局部灭绝风险上升。修建生态廊道可帮助动物重新连通。��Roads, farmland and cities split continuous habitat into patches, isolating populations and reducing gene flow. Small patches suffer stronger edge effects and disturbances, raising local extinction risk. Ecological corridors help animals reconnect.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5ae0c5335149�body�ٮ连片的树木廊道为鸟类、传粉昆虫提供迁徙与觅食通道，减少生境破碎；搭配本土灌木与枯木留存，能在混凝土中重建微生境网络。ٷConnected tree corridors give birds and pollinators movement and feeding routes, easing habitat fragmentation; native shrubs and retained deadwood rebuild microhabitats amid concrete.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�5f4f582d39ae�body��红树林是生长在热带海岸的木本植物群落，单位面积固碳能力极高，是重要的蓝碳生态系统。它们的根系缓冲风暴潮、保护海岸并养育大量海洋生物。破坏红树林会同时损失碳储量和海岸防护功能。�0Mangroves are woody plant communities on tropical coasts with very high per-area carbon storage, making them important blue-carbon ecosystems. Their roots buffer storm surges, protect shorelines, and nurture abundant marine life. Destroying mangroves sacrifices both carbon stores and coastal protection.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5f768a908453�body���叶片表面的绒毛和黏液能拦截颗粒物，部分气态污染物也可被吸收和降解。树木还能通过降低气温减缓臭氧生成。其净化能力因树种、株距和周边污染水平而异。��Leaf surfaces with hairs and mucus trap particulate matter, and some gaseous pollutants are absorbed and broken down. Trees also cut ozone formation by lowering temperature. Cleaning capacity varies with species, spacing and local pollution levels.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6123e1ab36f9�body���能效标识通常用分级或星级表示耗电水平，等级越高越省电，如中国的一级最优、五级最差。购买时对比同规格产品的年耗电量更直观。高能效机型虽贵但长期电费更低。��Energy labels use grades or stars to show power use; the higher the grade the more efficient, such as China's grade 1 best and grade 5 worst. Comparing annual kWh for the same size is more direct. Efficient models cost more upfront but save on bills.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�620529188af3�body�ٮ约四分之三的粮食作物或多或少依赖动物传粉，蜜蜂等减少会降低果实与种子产量，直接影响苹果、坚果、咖啡等许多食物的供给。٫Roughly three-quarters of crops rely partly on animal pollination; fewer bees and others lower fruit and seed yields, directly hitting apples, nuts, coffee and many foods.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�627f062a2ab1�body���高山冰川是许多河流的固体水库，融水支撑旱季流量与数十亿人的饮水灌溉。冰川退缩初期可能增加径流，但长期萎缩将导致旱季供水锐减。依赖冰川的地区面临水资源不安全。�Mountain glaciers act as solid reservoirs, with melt supporting dry-season flow and the water supply for billions. Early retreat may increase runoff, but long-term shrinkage will sharply reduce dry-season supply. Glacier-dependent regions face growing water insecurity.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6388e0186c2b�body���快时尚以低价高频推出新款，导致过度生产与大量废弃衣物。纺织生产耗水耗能并排放微塑料与温室气体。延长衣物使用寿命、二手循环可显著减轻其影响。�Fast fashion pushes cheap, frequent new styles, driving overproduction and massive clothing waste. Textile production consumes water and energy and emits microplastics and greenhouse gases. Extending garment life and secondhand cycling markedly reduce its impact.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�65277796dd75�body���截至近年，大气CO2浓度已突破420ppm，远高于工业化前约280ppm的水平。这是至少80万年来未有的高浓度。持续上升的浓度是全球变暖最直接的信号之一。��In recent years atmospheric CO2 has exceeded 420 ppm, far above the preindustrial level of about 280 ppm. This is the highest concentration in at least 800,000 years. Its continued rise is among the clearest signals of global warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�66943e77c436�body���微塑料通常指粒径小于五毫米的塑料颗粒，包括生产时就制成的微珠和由大塑料破碎形成的次级碎片。纳米塑料则指小于一微米的更小颗粒。由于体积极小，它们易进入生物组织和食物链。��Microplastics are generally plastic particles under 5 millimetres, including manufactured microbeads and fragments broken from larger plastic. Nanoplastics are smaller than one micrometre. Their tiny size lets them enter tissues and food chains.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�687a25fb7a3f�body���二手交易延长了物品的使用寿命，减少新品制造带来的资源和能源消耗。它把闲置资产重新投入使用，符合循环经济的再利用原则。平台化和维修文化能进一步放大这一效益。��Second-hand trading extends an item's useful life and reduces the resource and energy needed for new production. It puts idle assets back to use, matching the reuse principle of circular economy. Platforms and repair culture amplify the benefit.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�690b12140ddf�body���水力发电利用河流或水库中水流下落的动能推动水轮机旋转，再带动发电机发电。它是目前全球发电量最大的可再生能源之一。但大型水坝可能改变河流生态、淹没土地，因此也需权衡利弊。�
Hydropower uses the kinetic energy of falling water from rivers or reservoirs to spin turbines that drive generators. It is among the largest renewable sources by generation today. But large dams can alter river ecology and flood land, so trade-offs must be weighed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�69b64d50a1c6�body���植物光合作用把大气CO2转成有机物，动物呼吸与微生物分解又把碳送回大气和土壤，海洋也不断吸收释放碳，形成动态平衡；人类活动打破了这个平衡。��Plants fix atmospheric CO2 into organic matter via photosynthesis; respiration and decomposition return it to air and soil, while oceans constantly exchange carbon—a dynamic balance that human activity has broken.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6b4c08c4b39b�body�ٛ混凝土和沥青白天吸热、夜里慢慢放出，而乡村植被和土壤散热快；到了晚上城市比郊外"余温"更高，温差反而拉大。ٵConcrete and asphalt store daytime heat and release it at night, while rural vegetation and soil cool fast; after dark the city's "leftover warmth" makes the gap with suburbs wider.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6b94d1522421�body���能源效率是指用更少的能源完成同样的工作，比如LED灯比白炽灯更省电却一样亮。提高能效是应对能源和环境问题最经济快捷的办法之一。更换节能家电、做好建筑保温都是常见措施。�6Energy efficiency means doing the same work with less energy, like an LED bulb that uses less power than an incandescent yet shines the same. Improving efficiency is among the cheapest, fastest ways to address energy and environmental problems. Efficient appliances and building insulation are common measures.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6d76d6b217c0�body���北太平洋环流形成的垃圾带是全球最大，面积可达数百万平方公里，由洋流把塑料碎片汇聚而成。它并非实体岛屿，而是分散在海面及水柱中的碎屑浓度区。清理难度大，预防入海更关键。�The North Pacific gyre forms the largest accumulation, spanning millions of square kilometres as currents gather fragments. It is not a solid island but a zone of elevated debris across the surface and water column. Cleanup is hard; preventing entry to the sea matters more.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6e100d11c14a�body��空气污染是指有害物质（如烟尘、二氧化硫、氮氧化物、臭氧）进入大气，使空气质量下降并危害健康。汽车尾气、工厂排放和燃烧煤炭都会造成空气污染。长期吸入污染的空气可能引发咳嗽、哮喘甚至心脏病。�7Air pollution occurs when harmful substances such as soot, sulfur dioxide, nitrogen oxides, and ozone enter the atmosphere, degrading air quality and harming health. Vehicle exhaust, factory emissions, and coal burning all contribute to it. Long-term exposure can cause coughing, asthma, and even heart disease.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�6ebc1ecd3a08�body��地球生态超载日是一年中人类耗尽当年可再生资源额度的日期，之后便在透支自然资本。它在1970年代后不断提前，反映生态足迹持续超出生物承载力。推迟这一日期需要降低消耗与提高资源效率。�;Earth Overshoot Day is the date each year when humanity has used up that year's renewable resource budget, after which it lives on ecological deficit. It has moved earlier since the 1970s, reflecting footprints exceeding biocapacity. Pushing the date later requires lower consumption and higher resource efficiency.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6f100ed9e589�body�ٮ海獭捕食海胆，控制其数量；海胆少了，海带森林得以繁茂并为众多生物提供栖息地。海獭虽少，却是维系整个群落结构的关键种。ٮOtters eat urchins, keeping them in check; fewer urchins let kelp forests thrive and shelter many species. Though few, otters are the keystone holding the community together.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�717d7f326307�body���森林通过光合作用吸收大气中的CO2，把碳固定在树木、落叶和土壤里。健康的森林每年净吸收大量碳，从而抵消部分人为排放。毁林则会把这些储存的碳重新释放回大气。�Forests absorb atmospheric CO2 through photosynthesis and store the carbon in trees, litter, and soils. Healthy forests take up large amounts of carbon each year, offsetting some human emissions. Deforestation releases that stored carbon back to the atmosphere.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�71f5a3118671�body�٢落叶层是昆虫越冬、土壤保湿和种子萌发的温床，也为小鸟提供觅食处；适度留枯叶比扫得精光更能养住一小片微型生态。ٮThe leaf layer is a cradle for overwintering insects, soil moisture and seeds, and feeds small birds; leaving some litter nurtures a tiny ecosystem better than sweeping bare.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�727bdbe75fe4�body���湿地里的水草、微生物和泥沙能拦截泥沙、吸收过量的氮磷等养分，并把污染物慢慢分解。所以它们能净化流入河流湖泊的水，还能调蓄洪水、为鱼虾提供栖息地。��Wetland plants, microbes and sediments trap silt, take up excess nitrogen and phosphorus, and slowly break down pollutants. They therefore clean water flowing into rivers and lakes, while also buffering floods and providing fish and wildlife habitat.�ans��src��$拉姆萨尔公约（湿地公约）�Ramsar Convention��id�7320c41e83cb�body�١三维的珊瑚结构像城市，提供无数洞穴、缝隙和食物链位；空间复杂又食物丰富，于是小小礁盘成了海洋里的"物种公寓"。١3-D coral structure is like a city with countless caves, crevices and feeding niches; complex space and rich food make a small reef a marine "species apartment".�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7cad1b5738d1�body��海平面上升主要有两个原因：一是全球变暖使海水受热膨胀，二是冰川和冰盖融化把更多水注入海洋。上升的海水会淹没沿海低地、侵蚀海岸并加剧风暴潮的破坏。许多岛国和沿海城市因此面临严重威胁。�Sea level rises mainly for two reasons: warming oceans expand the water, and melting glaciers and ice sheets add more water to the sea. Higher seas flood low-lying coasts, erode shorelines, and worsen storm surges. Many island nations and coastal cities face serious threats as a result.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7e47f1d1e20a�body�٨不能。新林固碳慢且容量有限，远追不上当前化石燃料排放增速；植树重要但须与大幅减排配合，不能当作继续高排放的理由。ٶNo. New forests store carbon slowly and have limited capacity, far behind current emission growth; planting matters but must pair with deep cuts, not excuse continued high emissions.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7f153d9a3944�body���净零指人为温室气体排放与通过自然或技术手段移除的排放量相抵消，使净增加为零。它不同于彻底不排放，而是排放等于移除的平衡。实现净零是《巴黎协定》长期目标的核心。�&Net zero means human-caused greenhouse gas emissions are balanced by removals through natural or technological means, so the net addition is zero. It differs from zero emissions entirely; it is a balance of emit and remove. Achieving net zero is central to the Paris Agreement's long-term goal.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�846af94035d4�body���风推动涡轮机叶片旋转，带动发电机内的转子切割磁感线产生电能。风速越大，可发电功率越高，但超过安全限值会停机保护。海上与陆上风电场已成为许多国家主力清洁电源。�0Wind pushes turbine blades to spin a rotor in the generator, where moving conductors cut magnetic lines to produce electricity. More wind means more power, but turbines shut down above safe limits to protect themselves. Onshore and offshore wind farms are now major clean power sources in many countries.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�852d215827e7�body��A生物多样性通常分为三个层次：遗传多样性（同一物种内部的基因差异）、物种多样性（物种的数量和丰富度）和生态系统多样性（不同生态系统类型的多样程度）。这三个层次相互支撑，缺一不可。保护生物多样性需要在三个层面同时努力。�3Biodiversity is usually divided into three levels: genetic diversity (gene variation within a species), species diversity (number and abundance of species), and ecosystem diversity (variety of ecosystem types). These levels support one another and none can be neglected. Conservation must work at all three.�ans��src��$《生物多样性公约》（CBD）�(Convention on Biological Diversity (CBD)��id�85541c0a11ac�body��室内污染源密集且通风有限，包括装修材料释放的甲醛、烹饪油烟、二手烟和清洁剂的挥发性有机物。人在室内停留时间往往占全天八成以上，暴露量因此被放大。改善通风和使用低释放材料是主要对策。�AIndoor pollution sources are concentrated and ventilation is often limited, including formaldehyde from building materials, cooking fumes, second-hand smoke and VOCs from cleaners. People spend over 80 percent of their day indoors, amplifying exposure. Better ventilation and low-emission materials are the main remedies.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8acdf8f09496�body��主要温室气体包括水蒸气、二氧化碳(CO2)、甲烷(CH4)、氧化亚氮(N2O)和多种人造含氟气体。其中二氧化碳因排放量大、存留时间长，是对现代变暖贡献最大的气体。甲烷的单位增温能力虽强，但在大气中存留时间较短。�QThe main greenhouse gases are water vapor, carbon dioxide (CO2), methane (CH4), nitrous oxide (N2O), and various human-made fluorinated gases. Carbon dioxide contributes most to modern warming because of its large emissions and long lifetime. Methane is far more potent per molecule but lingers in the atmosphere for a much shorter time.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8c43b45149fb�body���《巴黎协定》是2015年达成的全球气候条约，目标是把升温控制在远低于2℃、努力限于1.5℃。各国自主提交减排贡献（NDC），并每五年更新加强。它是首个几乎覆盖所有国家的气候治理框架。�1The Paris Agreement is a global climate treaty adopted in 2015 aiming to keep warming well below 2°C and pursue 1.5°C. Countries submit their own emission-reduction contributions (NDCs), revised and strengthened every five years. It is the first climate governance framework covering nearly all nations.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8dc1d6161415�body���珊瑚与虫黄藻共生，后者为珊瑚提供颜色和养分。当海水异常升温或遭受其他环境胁迫时，珊瑚会排出虫黄藻而变白，失去主要能量来源。若高温持续，珊瑚将饥饿死亡，礁生态系统随之崩溃。�Corals live with zooxanthellae that give them colour and nutrients. When seas warm abnormally or face other environmental stressors, corals expel these algae and turn white, losing their main energy source. If heat persists, corals starve and the reef ecosystem collapses.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�8e64bcfe14ef�body��《巴黎协定》是2015年通过的全球气候条约，目标是把本世纪全球升温控制在远低于2℃，并努力限制在1.5℃以内。各国自主提出减排计划，并定期汇报进展。它是目前国际社会应对气候变化最重要的合作框架。�The Paris Agreement, adopted in 2015, aims to keep global warming well below 2°C this century and pursue efforts to limit it to 1.5°C. Countries submit their own emission-reduction plans and report progress regularly. It is the central international framework for climate action today.�ans��src��《巴黎协定》公开文本�Paris Agreement public text��id�90b7025b2635�body���它们把大量有机碳埋进缺氧的水下沉积物，分解慢、保存久，且植物生产力高；单位面积土壤碳埋藏速率可数倍于陆地森林，只是总面积小得多。��They bury organic carbon in waterlogged, low-oxygen sediments where decay is slow, and have high plant productivity; per-area soil carbon burial can be several times terrestrial forests, though their total area is far smaller.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�90e0099850e0�body���日照变短、气温下降，树停止制造叶绿素，原本被盖住的黄橙色显现；一些树还会合成红色花青素护叶、回收养分，是植物对季节变化的“主动告别”。��Shorter days and cooler air stop chlorophyll making, revealing hidden yellow-orange; some trees also make red anthocyanins to protect leaves while reclaiming nutrients—a plant's active farewell to the season.�ans��src��Raven 等《植物生物学》�%Raven, P.H. et al., Biology of Plants��id�931606a691f4�body���世界地球日是每年4月22日呼吁人们关注和保护环境的节日，1970年起源于美国，现已在各国广泛开展。这一天人们会参加清洁活动、植树和环保宣传。它提升了公众对污染和生态保护的意识。�Earth Day is observed every April 22 to promote environmental protection; it began in the United States in 1970 and is now marked worldwide. People join cleanups, tree planting, and awareness campaigns. It raised public awareness of pollution and conservation.�ans��src��&地球日网络（Earth Day Network）�Earth Day Network��id�94aec9043b51�body���入侵物种在新环境中缺少天敌制约，会快速繁殖并抢占本地物种的食物和空间。它们可能改变土壤、水文甚至引发火灾模式，导致本地物种衰退。防治关键在于源头把关和早期快速清除。�Invasive species lack natural predators in new environments, so they multiply fast and seize the food and space of natives. They can alter soils, hydrology and even fire regimes, driving native decline. Prevention at the source and early rapid removal are key.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�96d4b8d28414�body��地球超载日是全球在一年内耗尽当年可再生资源预算的日期，之后人类便在透支自然资本。它由生态足迹与地球生物承载力之比推算，近年多在每年八月初。推迟这一日期需要降低消费和提高资源效率。�8Earth Overshoot Day is the date when humanity has used up the year's renewable resource budget, after which it runs a deficit. It is calculated from the ecological footprint versus Earth's biocapacity and now usually falls in early August. Pushing it later needs lower consumption and higher resource efficiency.�ans��src��Global Footprint Network�Global Footprint Network��id�972b95bf3e16�body���减少红肉摄入、优先步行骑行与公共交通、节约用电和选择可再生能源套餐都有明显效果。延长物品使用寿命、减少浪费也能降低隐含碳排放。个人行动汇聚起来对总需求影响可观。�Eating less red meat, walking, cycling, or using transit, saving electricity, and choosing renewable tariffs all help noticeably. Extending product lifespans and cutting waste also lower embedded emissions. Individual actions add up to meaningful effects on total demand.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�974341c666f5�body���水循环是水在海洋、大气和陆地之间不断蒸发、凝结、降水和流回海洋的循环过程。太阳提供能量，使海水蒸发成云，再以雨、雪的形式落回地面。这个循环让地球上的淡水得以不断更新。�The water cycle is the continuous movement of water among oceans, atmosphere, and land through evaporation, condensation, precipitation, and flow back to the sea. The sun powers evaporation, forming clouds that return as rain or snow. This cycle constantly renews Earth's freshwater.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�97cd5eba70f0�body��核电在发电时不排放二氧化碳，因此常被归为低碳能源，有助于应对气候变化。但它会产生需要长期安全管理的放射性废料，且建设成本高、周期长。是否把它视为“清洁能源”在不同国家存在争议。�*Nuclear power emits no CO2 while generating electricity, so it is often classed as low-carbon and helps fight climate change. But it produces radioactive waste needing long-term safe management, and plants are costly and slow to build. Whether it counts as clean energy is debated across countries.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�980b0a9922d4�body�ٜ食物链是“草被兔吃、兔被狐吃”这样能量传递的链条；食物网是许多食物链交错成的网络，更能反映真实生态关系。ٕA food chain is a linear energy path (grass→rabbit→fox); a food web is many interlocking chains, better reflecting real ecological relationships.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9a9460da13f5�body��化石燃料是远古动植物遗体经过漫长地质作用形成的煤、石油和天然气，储存了亿万年的太阳能。燃烧它们会释放大量二氧化碳，是当前全球温室气体的主要来源。由于储量有限且污染大，正逐步被清洁能源替代。�4Fossil fuels are coal, oil, and natural gas formed from ancient plants and animals over geological time, storing solar energy from eons ago. Burning them releases large amounts of CO2, the main source of today's greenhouse gases. Being finite and polluting, they are gradually being replaced by clean energy.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9e412c07a744�body��环境影响评价是在修路、建厂等大型项目开工前，系统分析其可能对环境造成的影响，并提出减缓措施的程序。它能帮助决策者提前避免污染和生态破坏。许多国家把环评作为项目获批的必要条件。�&An environmental impact assessment systematically analyzes a project's potential environmental effects—like a road or factory—before it starts, and proposes mitigation. It helps decision-makers avoid pollution and ecological harm in advance. Many countries require EIA for project approval.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9e6b22d56883�body��天然雨水因溶解二氧化碳本身呈弱酸性，pH约为5.6；pH低于此值通常被视为酸雨。其主要成分是硫酸和硝酸，来自燃煤和机动车排放的二氧化硫与氮氧化物。酸雨会酸化土壤和湖泊，并腐蚀建筑材料。�SNatural rain is already weakly acidic at about pH 5.6 due to dissolved carbon dioxide; values below that are generally considered acid rain. Its main components are sulphuric and nitric acids from sulphur dioxide and nitrogen oxides emitted by coal burning and vehicles. Acid rain acidifies soils and lakes and corrodes building materials.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a0b6ab0bf287�body�٘楼缝像峭壁、绿地和鸽群提供猎物，城市反而给它们"人造悬崖"和稳定食源；只要少打扰，猛禽也能在人底下安家。٭Building gaps mimic cliffs, and greens and pigeons supply prey, so the city offers "artificial cliffs" and steady food; with little disturbance, raptors nest right above us.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a2db165d257f�body�ٱ全球约75%的粮食作物依赖动物传粉，蜜蜂、蝴蝶等维持着农作物与野生植物的繁殖；其数量下降会直接威胁粮食安全与生态系统稳定。��About 75% of global food crops rely on animal pollination; bees and butterflies sustain both crops and wild-plant reproduction, so their decline directly threatens food security and ecosystem stability.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a36b9bb51dc1�body���本地树种已适应当地气候和土壤，抗病虫害能力强且耗水较少，养护成本更低。它们还能为本土昆虫和鸟类提供适宜的食物和栖所。盲目引种外来树种易带来入侵或养护难题。��Native trees are adapted to local climate and soil, resist pests better and need less water, lowering maintenance. They also feed and shelter native insects and birds. Blindly introducing exotics risks invasion and upkeep problems.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a36dcc529630�body���纸张、塑料、金属、玻璃被分别收集后送再生工厂，清洗破碎再制成再生原料或新产品；未被污染的纯净分类才能有效回收，混有厨余油污会大幅降低再生价值。��Paper, plastic, metal and glass are collected separately and sent to reprocessing plants that clean, shred and remake them into recycled feedstock or new products; clean separation matters—food or oil contamination sharply lowers recyclability.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a40c690ee3c3�body���口袋公园是利用小块闲置地建成的微型绿地，能就近为居民提供休憩和遮荫。它们改善局部空气、支持传粉昆虫并提升社区归属感。投资小、落地快，是密度城市补绿的有效方式。�Pocket parks are tiny green spaces built on small idle plots, offering nearby rest and shade to residents. They improve local air, support pollinators and strengthen community belonging. Low-cost and quick to build, they are an effective way to add greenery in dense cities.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a40f3f92c93e�body�٢碳足迹是指一个人、一件商品或一项活动在生产与使用中排放的温室气体总量，通常用“相当于多少吨二氧化碳”来衡量。ٞA carbon footprint is the total amount of greenhouse gases emitted by a person, product, or activity, usually measured in tonnes of carbon-dioxide equivalent.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a6ad09b0eafb�body���一次性塑料袋使用时间短却消耗石化原料并产生废弃，重复使用布袋或厚质袋可摊薄单次环境成本。研究认为一只布袋需重复使用数十次才能抵消其生产能耗。关键是真正多次使用而非囤积。�6Single-use plastic bags consume petrochemicals and create waste for only minutes of use, while a reusable cloth or thick bag spreads its environmental cost over many trips. Studies suggest a cloth bag must be reused dozens of times to offset its production energy. The point is real repeated use, not hoarding.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a7262f1c982e�body���碳定价是对温室气体排放设定货币成本的政策，使污染者为其排放付费。常见形式包括碳税和碳排放交易体系。它的目的是用市场信号激励减排。��Carbon pricing is a policy that assigns a monetary cost to greenhouse gas emissions so polluters pay for what they emit. Common forms are carbon taxes and emissions trading systems. Its aim is to use market signals to incentivize reductions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�aaf6ae909607�body���自然保护区是为保护珍稀动植物、自然遗迹或生态系统而划定并严格管理的区域。区内通常限制开采、狩猎和开发，让自然得以休养生息。建立保护区是保护生物多样性的最直接手段之一。�2A nature reserve is an area set aside and strictly managed to protect rare plants and animals, natural landmarks, or ecosystems. Activities like extraction, hunting, and development are usually restricted so nature can recover. Establishing reserves is one of the most direct ways to conserve biodiversity.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�abc3fe2bb224�body��水电清洁、可调、寿命长，且水库可兼顾防洪与供水，是目前最大的可再生电力来源。但它依赖大型水坝，可能淹没土地、阻断鱼类洄游并影响下游生态。气候变化导致的干旱也会削弱其出力稳定性。�BHydropower is clean, dispatchable, and long-lived, and its reservoirs can also control floods and store water, making it the largest renewable electricity source. But it relies on large dams that can flood land, block fish migration, and affect downstream ecology. Droughts from climate change also weaken its reliability.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ac0031cb488a�body�ٛ虫黄藻住在珊瑚体内，靠光合作用给珊瑚供糖和氧；珊瑚则提供保护与二氧化碳，双方互相"喂饭"，离了对方都难活。ٝZooxanthellae live inside corals, photosynthesizing sugar and oxygen for them; corals give shelter and CO₂—each feeds the other, and apart both struggle.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ac2eb15452f2�body��太阳短波辐射穿过大气到达地表，地表吸收后以长波（红外）辐射向外释放热量。二氧化碳、甲烷等温室气体能吸收并重新辐射这部分红外辐射，使热量滞留在低层大气中，从而抬升全球平均温度。�Solar shortwave radiation passes through the atmosphere and warms the surface, which then emits heat as long-wave infrared radiation. Greenhouse gases like CO2 and methane absorb and re-emit that infrared, trapping heat in the lower atmosphere and raising the global mean temperature.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ae09ecf3521f�body��>雾霾是空气中污染物与雾或水汽混合形成的可见污染层，主要有两种类型：传统“煤烟型”雾霾（以二氧化硫和烟尘为主）和“光化学烟雾”（阳光促使氮氧化物与挥发性有机物反应生成臭氧等）。光化学烟雾在阳光强的城市夏季尤为常见。�Smog is a visible layer of pollution formed when air pollutants mix with fog or water vapor, and it has two main types: classic 'coal' smog (dominated by sulfur dioxide and soot) and photochemical smog (formed when sunlight drives reactions among nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds to produce ozone). Photochemical smog is especially common in sunny cities during summer.�ans��src�ٶ美国环保署（EPA）国家环境空气质量标准（NAAQS）对臭氧与颗粒物的界定；美国环保署（EPA）《臭氧及相关光化学氧化剂空气污染物标准》��U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), National Ambient Air Quality Standards (NAAQS) for ozone and particulate matter; EPA 'Air Quality Criteria for Ozone and Related Photochemical Oxidants'��id�ae46c0ae5c38�body�ٙ自然保护区是法律划定、限制人类开发的区域，用来保护珍稀动植物和自然景观，让生态系统不受干扰地自我恢复。ٜA nature reserve is a legally protected area with restricted human activity, safeguarding rare species and landscapes so ecosystems can recover undisturbed.�ans��src��YIUCN《受保护地区分类系统》(The IUCN Category System for Protected Areas, 2008)�8IUCN, The IUCN Category System for Protected Areas, 2008��id�ae63eb59d554�body���节气是中国人按太阳位置划分的时令，对应动植物的明显变化：清明前后草木萌发、燕归花开，霜降后草木枯黄、虫藏越冬。它们是农事与自然的“时间表”。��Solar terms mark the year by the sun's position and match visible nature shifts: around Qingming plants sprout and swallows return, after Frost's Descent foliage yellows and insects hibernate—a timetable for farming and nature.�ans��src��=竺可桢、宛敏渭《物候学》，科学出版社，1963�=竺可桢、宛敏渭《物候学》，科学出版社，1963��id�b0d19f040eae�body���碳汇是指能够吸收并储存大气中二氧化碳的自然或人工系统，如森林、土壤和海洋。森林通过光合作用把碳固定在树木和土壤中。保护和扩大碳汇是减缓气候变化的重要手段。�␀A carbon sink is a natural or human-made system that absorbs and stores atmospheric CO2, such as forests, soils, and oceans. Forests lock carbon in trees and soil through photosynthesis. Protecting and expanding sinks is a major way to slow climate change.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b5c0b7dffaab�body�ٴ主要通过食用受污染的食物（海鲜、盐、水）和吸入空气中的纤维与颗粒进入，部分能在肠道、肺部被检出，长期健康影响仍在研究中。ٴMainly via contaminated food (seafood, salt, water) and inhaled airborne fibers and particles; they are detectable in gut and lungs, but long-term health effects are still studied.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b681438a6402�body�٥海草通过光合作用把碳埋入沉积物的能力强；密集草叶还能消减波浪与水流能量，稳定底质、减轻侵蚀，为鱼类提供育幼场。٬Seagrass buries carbon efficiently in sediments, and its dense leaves dampen wave and current energy, stabilizing substrate, reducing erosion and sheltering fish nurseries.�ans��src��Nature Communications�Nat Commun��id�b7160a768f5e�body���可持续发展的三大支柱是经济、社会和环境，常被称为“三重底线”。经济发展要带来收入，社会进步要保障公平与健康，环境保护要守住生态底线。只有三者平衡，发展才是真正可持续的。�1The three pillars of sustainable development are economy, society, and environment, often called the triple bottom line. The economy must generate income, society must ensure fairness and health, and the environment must set ecological limits. Only when all three balance is development truly sustainable.�ans��src��C联合国布伦特兰委员会《我们共同的未来》（1987）�2UN Brundtland Commission, Our Common Future (1987)��id�b97ce2271131�body�ٟ能。照明耗电来自电网，关灯减少发电需求，也就减少燃煤燃气排放的CO2；积少成多，家庭节能是低成本减碳的一部分。ٽYes. Lighting draws grid power, so switching off reduces generation demand and thus the CO2 from coal or gas plants; small acts add up, and household efficiency is low-cost decarbonization.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ba4b7a76343b�body�ٞ植被和土层遮挡日晒、蒸发吸热，给顶层降温；同时像海绵蓄住一部分雨水，减轻下水道压力，是"一绿多用"的小基建。٧Vegetation and soil block sun and cool by evaporation, lowering top-floor heat; they also sponge up rain, easing sewers—a small "one-green-many-uses" infrastructure.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�bb84dc3bbc3d�body�ٙ自然保护区通过限制开发为物种和栖息地提供避难所，保护基因库、水源与碳汇，并作为科研与生态恢复的基准点。ٹNature reserves restrict development to give species and habitats refuge, safeguarding gene pools, water sources and carbon sinks, and serving as baselines for research and restoration.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�bc794fde0f77�body���PM2.5指空气动力学直径≤2.5微米的颗粒物，可深入肺泡并进入血液，携带重金属、多环芳烃等毒物，与心肺疾病、卒中直接相关，而较大颗粒多被鼻腔阻挡。��PM2.5 particles are ≤2.5 micrometers wide; they penetrate deep into alveoli and enter the bloodstream, carrying heavy metals and PAHs linked to heart and lung disease and stroke, whereas larger dust is mostly trapped by the nose.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�bdf5f31dc175�body�ي陆地上的冰川和冰盖融化成水流入海洋会增加海水总量；同时海水受热膨胀，两者共同导致海平面上升。فMeltwater from land-based glaciers and ice sheets adds volume to the ocean, and warming seawater expands, both raising sea level.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�beda73e409bd�body���净零是指在一定时期内，人为排放的温室气体与被自然或技术手段移除的量相抵消，使净增加为零。注意它不等于完全不排放，而是“排放=移除”。��Net zero means that, over a period, human-caused greenhouse gas emissions are balanced by removal through natural sinks or technology, so the net addition is zero. It is not zero emissions, but emissions equal removals.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�bfd9a50f5487�body�ٙ它们繁殖极快、食性广，又缺少天敌；水葫芦盖住水面夺光夺氧，福寿螺啃食作物还传播寄生虫，治理起来很头疼。ٜThey reproduce fast and eat widely with few enemies; hyacinth mats steal light and oxygen, apple snails damage crops and spread parasites—hard to control.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�c090629785a5�body�٥这是一个正反馈循环：升温让林区更干、火更频，燃烧把储存的碳送回大气，进一步推高温度，可能让森林从碳汇转为碳源。پIt is a positive feedback loop: warming dries forests and sparks more fires, burning releases stored carbon that raises temperature further, potentially flipping forests from sink to source.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c13ef6397c3f�body���一般认为物种越多，功能冗余与互补越强，面对干旱、病害等扰动时总体生产力与功能更不易崩溃；但也有研究指出多样性提升“稳定性”而非所有维度的“不变”。��More species usually mean more functional redundancy and complementarity, so productivity and function resist drought or disease better; some note diversity boosts 'stability' but not invariance in every dimension.�ans��src��Ecology Letters 综述�Ecol Lett��id�c53a8942f348�body��可再生能源指在合理利用下能不断补充、不会枯竭的能源，主要包括太阳能、风能、水能、地热能和生物质能。与煤炭、石油等化石燃料相比，它们通常在发电过程中不直接排放二氧化碳，因而被视为低碳能源。�!Renewable energy comes from sources that are continuously replenished and not depleted with use, mainly solar, wind, hydropower, geothermal, and biomass. Unlike coal or oil, they typically emit little or no CO2 during electricity generation and are therefore regarded as low-carbon energy.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c772000468cd�body��湿地（如沼泽、湖泊边缘）被称为“地球之肾”，能过滤污染物、储存洪水和为大量水鸟提供家园。许多鱼虾也在湿地繁殖，是重要渔业的源头。围填和污染正使全球湿地快速减少，保护它们非常紧迫。�>Wetlands such as marshes and lake edges are called Earth's kidneys because they filter pollutants, store floodwater, and provide homes for many waterbirds. Countless fish and shrimp breed there, supporting important fisheries. Reclamation and pollution are shrinking wetlands worldwide, making their protection urgent.�ans��src��*《拉姆萨尔公约》（湿地公约）�Ramsar Convention on Wetlands��id�c8121adea087�body��预防原则指当某种活动存在造成严重或不可逆环境损害的科学不确定时，不应以“证据不足”为由推迟采取防范性措施。它体现在《里约环境与发展宣言》等国际文件中，强调在不确定性下优先保护生态与人类健康。�aThe precautionary principle holds that lack of full scientific certainty should not be used as a reason to postpone measures when an activity threatens serious or irreversible environmental harm. It appears in instruments such as the Rio Declaration on Environment and Development and stresses protecting ecology and human health even under uncertainty.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c91f962d8af1�body��Y生产者（如绿色植物）能自己制造有机物，是生态系统的能量基础；消费者（如动物）通过吃其他生物获取能量；分解者（如真菌和细菌）把动植物遗体分解为无机物，归还环境。三者共同维持着生态系统的物质循环。缺少任何一类，生态系统都难以正常运转。��Producers, such as green plants, make their own organic matter and form the energy base of ecosystems. Consumers, like animals, gain energy by eating other organisms, while decomposers, such as fungi and bacteria, break down dead material into inorganic substances returned to the environment. Together they maintain the ecosystem's nutrient cycling, and the loss of any group disrupts the system.�ans��src��%Odum 与 Barrett《生态学基础》�3Odum, E.P. & Barrett, G.W., Fundamentals of Ecology��id�c9225ffe424e�body���个人低碳选择有示范与需求侧信号作用，但能源、交通、工业的结构性减排取决于政策、基础设施与碳价等系统杠杆；二者互补，不能只靠个人责任替代制度变革。��Personal low-carbon choices signal demand and set examples, but structural cuts in energy, transport and industry depend on policy, infrastructure and carbon pricing; the two complement, and individual duty must not replace institutional change.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cb0304e63bd8�body���光伏板中的半导体（通常是硅）受阳光照射后，光子激发电子产生直流电。再通过逆变器转为可用的交流电。阳光取之不竭且无排放，使太阳能成为增长最快的清洁能源。�#In a photovoltaic panel, a semiconductor—usually silicon—is struck by sunlight, and photons excite electrons to produce direct current. An inverter then converts it to usable alternating current. Sunlight is inexhaustible and emission-free, making solar the fastest-growing clean energy.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cb043cb0adcb�body�٧天然物质也可能有毒、毁林或高耗水，比如野生植物贸易会掏空山林；是否环保要看来源、用量和全程影响，而非"天然"二字。پNatural substances can be toxic, deforestation-driving or water-hungry—wild plant trade empties forests. Eco-friendliness depends on source, amount and full impact, not the word "natural".�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ccbaf461e9cc�body���二氧化碳是主要的温室气体，太多会让温室效应增强，使地球越来越热。变暖会带来冰川融化、海平面上升和极端天气。此外，海洋吸收过多CO2还会变酸，伤害珊瑚和贝类。��CO2 is a major greenhouse gas; too much strengthens the greenhouse effect and heats the planet. Warming brings melting ice, rising seas, and extreme weather. Oceans that absorb excess CO2 also turn acidic, harming corals and shellfish.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�cce4141acff6�body���城市里混凝土、沥青吸热又少有植被蒸腾，加上人为散热，气温常比周围郊區高出几度，这就是城市热岛。它会在热浪期间放大健康风险，尤其影响老人和穷人。��Cities of concrete and asphalt absorb heat and lack plant cooling, plus human-made heat, so temperatures run several degrees above suburbs—the urban heat island. It amplifies health risks during heatwaves, especially for the elderly and poor.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�cfe83ec9be9c�body�٨它用于帮助最脆弱、最少排放却受气候灾害冲击最严重的国家，提供灾后恢复与无法避免的损失补偿，是气候资金体系的补充。ٺIt helps the most vulnerable, lowest-emitting nations hit hardest by climate disasters, funding recovery and compensation for unavoidable losses—complementing existing climate finance.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d22474ae37d6�body�ٺ指海岸与海洋生态系统（红树林、盐沼、海草床）通过光合作用固定的碳，并长期埋藏在沉积物中。它们单位面积固碳效率常高于陆地森林。��It is carbon fixed by coastal and marine ecosystems (mangroves, salt marshes, seagrass beds) via photosynthesis and stored long-term in sediments. Their per-area sequestration is often higher than terrestrial forests.�ans��src��Blue Carbon Initiative�Blue Carbon Initiative��id�d2d4aa2bda6d�body��循环经济以减量化、再利用、再循环为核心，目标是让资源在系统中尽可能长久地保持价值。它强调产品设计易于维修和回收，并用可再生能源替代。与线性经济相比，它力求减少废弃物和原生资源开采。�.The circular economy centres on reducing, reusing and recycling, aiming to keep resources in use at high value for as long as possible. It stresses products designed for repair and recyclability and shifts to renewable energy. Unlike the linear model, it seeks to minimise waste and primary extraction.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d2f874fb87c1�body���外来入侵物种被带到新地方后，往往没有天敌制约，会迅速繁殖并挤占本地物种的生存空间和食物。它们每年给农业、渔业和生态系统带来巨大损失，是全球生物多样性下降的主要原因之一。��Invasive alien species moved to new places often lack natural enemies, so they spread fast and crowd out native species for space and food. They cost agriculture, fisheries and ecosystems dearly each year and are a leading driver of biodiversity loss.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�d32626ac02b6�body���IPCC即政府间气候变化专门委员会，负责评估全球气候变化的最新科学、影响与对策。它本身不做新研究，而是综合数千篇论文为各国政府提供权威报告。这些报告是气候谈判的关键科学依据。�3The IPCC, the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change, assesses the latest science, impacts, and responses to climate change. It does not conduct new research but synthesizes thousands of papers into authoritative reports for governments. These reports are a key scientific basis for climate negotiations.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d6948857feb2�body���零废弃倡导通过拒绝、减量、重复使用、回收和堆肥，让进入填埋和焚烧的垃圾趋近于零。它强调从源头避免一次性用品、自带容器购物。目标是重新设计产品和系统，而非只靠末端处理。�Zero waste aims to make landfill and incineration approach zero by refusing, reducing, reusing, recycling and composting. It stresses avoiding disposables at source and bringing your own containers. The goal is redesigning products and systems, not just end-of-pipe treatment.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d9f5e07d064c�body��,塑料污染是指塑料制品（尤其是一次性塑料）在环境中大量累积，难以自然降解而造成危害的现象。塑料会破碎成微塑料，进入土壤、河流和海洋，甚至被鱼类误食并进入食物链。减少使用、回收再利用是缓解塑料污染的关键。�MPlastic pollution is the accumulation of plastic products, especially single-use plastics, in the environment where they persist and cause harm. Plastics break into microplastics that enter soil, rivers, and oceans, and can be ingested by fish and pass into the food chain. Reducing use and improving recycling are key to mitigation.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�dcfa3c98bd42�body�ٜ约三分之一的人类食物依赖昆虫传粉，蜜蜂等帮助果树和庄稼结果，没有它们许多水果、坚果和油料作物会大幅减产。٫About one third of human food relies on animal pollination; bees and others help fruit trees and crops set fruit, without which many fruits, nuts and oil crops would fail.�ans��src��+IPBES《传粉者全球评估报告》,2016�7IPBES, The 2016 Global Assessment Report on Pollinators��id�dffa29730864�body�٢多样性包含基因、物种和生态系统三层，植物、真菌、微生物和栖息地同样关键；没了土壤生物和植被，动物也无处安身。ٗDiversity spans genes, species and ecosystems; plants, fungi, microbes and habitats matter too. Without soil life and vegetation, animals have no home.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e05c1931a37e�body�٧全球变暖由全人类排放叠加而成，某地干旱洪水是整体气候失衡的局部表现；我们的用电、吃穿都在为这张"全球气候网"添线。ٲGlobal warming sums everyone's emissions, and a distant drought or flood is a local face of that imbalance; our power, food and clothes all add threads to the global climate web.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e67ef5f09a32�body�ٰ人类排放的CO2约三成被海水吸收，与水反应生成碳酸，释放氢离子使pH下降；虽仍偏碱，但酸化速度在地质史上罕见，威胁钙化生物。��The ocean absorbs about a third of human CO2, which forms carbonic acid and releases hydrogen ions, lowering pH; still alkaline, but the pace of acidification is rare in geologic history and threatens shell-building life.�ans��src��cFeely 等,《Impact of anthropogenic CO2 on the CaCO3 system in the oceans»,Science 第305卷,2004�dR. A. Feely et al., Impact of anthropogenic CO2 on the CaCO3 system in the oceans, Science 305, 2004��id�e76985b47977�body���分类把可回收物、厨余和有害垃圾分开，能提升再生料纯度并降低处理难度。有害垃圾单独收集可避免污染土壤和水体。做好源头分类比末端分选更经济高效。��Sorting separates recyclables, kitchen waste and hazardous waste, raising recyclate purity and easing treatment. Separate hazardous collection prevents soil and water contamination. Source sorting is cheaper and more efficient than end-of-pipe separation.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�e907b5f338a0�body��&土壤污染是指重金属、农药、石油类物质等有害物质进入土壤并超过其自净能力，使土壤质量下降的现象。受污染的土壤会降低作物产量、通过食物链危害人体，还可能污染地下水。治理常采用植物修复、客土置换等方法。�MSoil contamination occurs when harmful substances such as heavy metals, pesticides, or petroleum exceed the soil's self-cleaning capacity and degrade its quality. Contaminated soil lowers crop yields, threatens human health via the food chain, and may pollute groundwater. Remediation often uses phytoremediation or soil replacement.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�e90cb5bf12b8�body��m温室效应指大气中的某些气体（如二氧化碳、水蒸气、甲烷）吸收并重新辐射地表向外散发的红外热辐射，使地球表面比没有大气时更温暖。若没有自然温室效应，地球平均地表温度约为-18℃，而非适宜生命的约15℃，因此适度的温室效应是维持地表液态水和生命的必要条件。��The greenhouse effect occurs when certain atmospheric gases—such as carbon dioxide, water vapor, and methane—absorb and re-radiate the infrared heat that Earth's surface emits outward, keeping the surface warmer than it would be without an atmosphere. Without the natural greenhouse effect, the average surface temperature would be about -18°C instead of the habitable ~15°C, so a moderate greenhouse effect is essential for liquid water and life.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e965793f21c3�body�ٲ联合国环境规划署（UNEP）牵头协调全球环境议题与纪念活动，推动各国政府、企业与公众共同参与，但不是拥有执法权的超国家政府。��The UN Environment Programme (UNEP) coordinates global environmental issues and campaigns like World Environment Day, engaging governments, business and the public—but it is not a supranational enforcer with police power.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�eb711ada9713�body���砍伐森林既消除了吸收CO2的碳汇，又把储存的碳通过燃烧和腐烂释放出来。它还会改变区域水循环和地表反照率，进一步影响气候。全球约一成温室气体排放与毁林和土地利用变化有关。�Deforestation removes a CO2-absorbing sink and releases stored carbon through burning and decay. It also alters regional water cycles and surface albedo, further affecting climate. Roughly a tenth of global greenhouse gas emissions come from deforestation and land-use change.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ec20b6f3bb0c�body���太阳能电池板利用光伏效应，把太阳光中的光子直接转化为电能，不燃烧任何燃料、运行时也不排放温室气体。过去十年其成本大幅下降，已成为许多地方最便宜的电力来源之一。��Solar panels use the photovoltaic effect to turn sunlight's photons directly into electricity, with no fuel burned and no emissions during operation. Their cost has fallen sharply in a decade, making them among the cheapest power sources in many places.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ed3cacd75131�body��海绵城市通过透水铺装、下凹绿地、雨水花园和蓄水池等设施，让城市像海绵一样吸收、蓄存和净化雨水。它减少内涝和合流制溢流污染，并补充地下水。核心是源头分散滞蓄而非单纯靠管道排放。�6A sponge city uses permeable paving, sunken green spaces, rain gardens and storage tanks so the city absorbs, stores and cleans rainwater like a sponge. It cuts flooding and combined-sewer overflow pollution and recharges groundwater. The core is decentralised source storage rather than relying only on pipes.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�ee27fe8badb5�body���可持续发展是指既满足当代人的需要，又不损害后代满足其需要能力的发展方式。它要求我们在使用资源时留有余地，不把环境“用光”。节约用水、使用清洁能源都是可持续发展的具体做法。�Sustainable development meets the needs of the present without compromising future generations' ability to meet their own. It means using resources with restraint rather than exhausting the environment. Saving water and using clean energy are concrete examples of it.�ans��src��!联合国布伦特兰报告共识�UN Brundtland Report consensus��id�ef3ebf826410�body���城市热岛指城区气温明显高于周边郊区的现象，因混凝土和沥青吸热、绿地与水体少。缺乏遮荫、密集建筑和汽车与空调散热会进一步加剧夜间高温。��The urban heat island is when city centers are markedly warmer than surrounding countryside, because concrete and asphalt absorb heat and there is little greenery or water. Sparse shade, dense buildings, and heat from cars and AC worsen nighttime heat.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_24_001�body��生命周期评价(LCA)的答案常出人意料:单看丢弃后的降解,纸占优;但从造林制浆的高水耗到运输(同容量纸袋重约6倍),每只纸袋的碳与水足迹往往数倍于薄塑料袋。英国环境署2011年研究估算,棉布袋要用131次以上,全周期影响才低于一次性HDPE袋。这正是LCA的价值:把「环保直觉」换成从摇篮到坟墓的定量核算——取材、生产、运输、复用次数、末端处置计入,结论随电网与复用习惯而变,没有免检的绿色选项。�vLife-cycle assessment often surprises: paper wins on degradation alone, but counting forestry, energy-hungry pulping and transport (a paper sack weighs about six times more for the same volume), its carbon and water footprints per bag frequently dwarf thin plastic. A 2011 UK Environment Agency study estimated a cotton bag must be reused over 130 times to beat single-use HDPE on overall impacts. LCAs value lies in replacing green intuition with cradle-to-grave accounting — materials, manufacture, transport, reuse counts, disposal — where conclusions shift with local grids and habits, leaving nothing automatically green.�ans��src��q英国环境局,《Evidence: Life Cycle Assessment of Supermarket Carrier Bags》,Environment Agency Bristol,2011�aUK Environment Agency, Evidence: Life Cycle Assessment of Supermarket Carrier Bags, Bristol, 2011��id�env_24_004�body��城市把自己的能量收支改写了。混凝土与沥青的反照率低、热容大,白天存下的热量夜里缓慢释放,使城郊温差在日落后反而达到峰值;建筑密集阻挡地表长波辐射向天空散逸,形成峡谷保温;空调、汽车与工业直接注入人为热;绿地和水面的蒸发冷却又被压缩。多重因素叠加,大城市市区可比郊区高出3至5摄氏度,夜间热浪对老人与户外工作者的健康风险随之放大——热岛不是气象学趣闻,而是公共卫生议题。�OCities rewrite their own energy balance. Concrete and asphalt have low albedo and high heat capacity, storing daytime heat and releasing it after sunset — so the urban-suburban temperature gap peaks at dusk; dense buildings block outgoing longwave radiation, canyon geometry traps warmth, air conditioners and traffic inject anthropogenic heat, and evaporation from vegetation and water shrinks. Big-city cores run three to five degrees Celsius above suburbs, magnifying nighttime heat-wave risks for the elderly and outdoor workers — less meteorological trivia than public-health issue.�ans��src��7Oke,《Boundary Layer Climates》第2版,Routledge,1987�<T. R. Oke, Boundary Layer Climates, 2nd ed., Routledge, 1987��id�env_24_006�body��7消融区的冰川像一条缓慢流动的河流:上游堆积带降雪压实成冰,下游因气温升高而质量亏损。强烈的地形起伏把冰面撕成锯齿状冰塔林(喜马拉雅常见);夏季融水在低洼冰面汇成蓝绿色的冰面湖——颜色来自悬浮的细岩粉对光的散射。这些湖泊是危险信号:冰碛湖被松散终碛垄拦着,一旦垮坝即爆发洪水,喜马拉雅与安第斯已多次成灾。卫星监测显示全球山地冰川近几十年普遍退缩,成为海平面上升与下游干旱区供水焦虑的双重来源。�RAblation-zone glaciers flow like slow rivers: snow compacts to ice in the upper accumulation zone while downstream losses outpace gains. Rugged relief tears ice surfaces into sawtooth serac forests, common in the Himalaya; summer meltwater pools into blue-green supraglacial lakes tinted by suspended rock flour. These lakes are warning lights — dammed by loose moraine, they burst as glacial lake outburst floods that have repeatedly struck the Himalaya and Andes. Satellites show mountain glaciers retreating worldwide, feeding both sea-level rise and drought anxiety in downstream valleys.�ans��src��XImmerzeel 等,《Climate change will affect Asian water towers》,Science 第328卷,2010�XW. W. Immerzeel et al., Climate change will affect Asian water towers, Science 328, 2010��id�env_24_013�body��M一吨废旧手机的含金量约是金矿石的三百倍:每部手机含金约0.03克,还有银、钯、铜与稀土。正规拆解流程是手工拆除电池防燃、破碎分选出金属富集体、湿法或火法冶金提炼,贵金属回收率可达九成以上。但全球电子垃圾的正规回收率仅两成出头,大量流入非正规渠道:露天酸洗烧板释放铅与二噁英,加纳阿格博罗什等地的污染触目惊心。《巴塞尔公约》限制危废跨境转移,欧盟WEEE指令强制生产者回收——你的抽屉深处,其实囤着一座待开采的矿山。��A tonne of discarded phones holds roughly three hundred times the gold of raw ore: about 0.03 grams per phone plus silver, palladium, copper and rare earths. Proper flows hand-strip batteries to prevent fires, shred and sort metal concentrates, then hydrometallurgically or pyrometallurgically recover precious metals above ninety percent rates. Yet barely a fifth of global e-waste enters formal channels; informal acid-leaching and cable-burning poison sites like Agbogbloshie in Ghana. The Basel Convention restricts hazardous exports and the EU WEEE directive mandates producer take-back — your drawer is hoarding an unmined urban mine.�ans��src��IBalde 等,《The Global E-waste Monitor》,United Nations University,2017�OC. P. Balde et al., The Global E-waste Monitor, United Nations University, 2017��id�env_26_001�body���主要来自陆地。据Jambeck等人估算,仅2010年就有约480万至1270万吨塑料废物由陆地进入海洋,其中沿海50公里内管理不善的城市固体废弃物占大头;入海途径包括河流集中输送、沿海倾倒与旅游遗留垃圾,以及渔业和航运丢弃的废弃渔具。塑料入海后在紫外线与风浪作用下不断碎裂成微塑料,并随表层环流长距离扩散,演变为遍布全球的持续性污染。�@Mostly from land. Jambeck and colleagues estimated that in 2010 alone about 4.8 to 12.7 million tonnes of plastic waste entered the ocean from land-based sources, dominated by poorly managed municipal solid waste in coastal populations living within fifty kilometres of the sea. It reaches the water chiefly via rivers acting as concentrated conveyors, along with coastal dumping, tourism litter, and fishing or shipping gear abandoned at sea. Once afloat, ultraviolet light and wave action fragment the debris into microplastics that surface currents spread across the globe.�ans��src��dJambeck JR等论文《Plastic waste inputs from land into the ocean》,Science 2015(佐治亚大学)�iJambeck JR et al., 'Plastic waste inputs from land into the ocean', Science, 2015 (University of Georgia)��id�env_26_003�body���核心是「总量控制与交易」。监管方先为电力等覆盖行业设定逐年收紧的排放上限,配额经免费发放或拍卖分给企业;每排放一吨CO₂须上缴一份配额,减排成本低的企业出售富余配额获利,成本高的企业购入,交易形成的碳价即社会的边际减排成本,从而以最小总成本完成既定减排量。欧盟碳市场2005年启动,目前覆盖约四成欧盟温室气体排放。�RCap-and-trade. The regulator fixes a declining ceiling on emissions for covered sectors such as power generation and allocates allowances free of charge or by auction; every tonne of CO2 emitted must be covered by one surrendered allowance. Firms whose abatement is cheap sell spare allowances for profit while those facing costly cuts buy them, so trading turns the marginal cost of abatement into the observed carbon price and achieves the agreed emission reduction at minimum overall cost. Launched in 2005, the EU ETS now covers roughly forty percent of the bloc's greenhouse-gas emissions.�ans��src�ٱConvery & Redmond,《Market and Price Developments in the European Union Emissions Trading Scheme》,Review of Environmental Economics and Policy,2007 (DOI: 10.1093/reep/rem010)ٯConvery & Redmond, 'Market and Price Developments in the European Union Emissions Trading Scheme', Review of Environmental Economics and Policy, 2007, DOI: 10.1093/reep/rem010��id�env_26_006�body���一种先修复、后开发的信用交易机制。银行发起人先行恢复或新建整片湿地,经跨机构评审团队验收后按功能面积折算成信用单位出售;依《清洁水法》第404条,开发商对无法避免的湿地损失须购得足够信用方可取得许可,兑换比例通常高于一比一。相比项目方各自零散补救,银行在流域尺度上提前集中修复,生态完整性更好,长期维护责任也更明确。�FA restore-first, sell-later credit system. A bank sponsor restores or creates a consolidated wetland parcel ahead of any impact; once an interagency review team certifies the site, its functional acreage is converted into sellable credits. Under Section 404 of the Clean Water Act, a developer whose project unavoidably damages wetlands must secure enough credits before a permit issues, usually at ratios above one-to-one. Concentrated, completed-in-advance restoration at watershed scale delivers better ecological coherence and clearer long-term stewardship than piecemeal fixes.�ans��src�ك美国陆军工程兵团与环保署联合规章《Compensatory Mitigation for Losses of Aquatic Resources》,Federal Register 2008ـUS Army Corps of Engineers and EPA joint rule, 'Compensatory Mitigation for Losses of Aquatic Resources', Federal Register, 2008��id�env_26_008�body���指城市如生物体般持续吞纳食物、能源、建材与淡水,同时排出废水、垃圾与废气的物质能量流转过程。传统线性模式一头依赖原生资源开采、一头堆放废弃物,带来资源枯竭与污染的双重压力;循环城市据此借鉴自然养分流,把废弃物流重新设计为输入流——建筑垃圾再生骨料、餐厨垃圾厌氧产沼、灰水回收氮磷——以物质闭环让经济增长与原生资源消耗脱钩。�YUrban metabolism describes how a city, like an organism, keeps drawing in food, energy, building materials and freshwater while discharging wastewater, refuse and exhaust gases. The conventional linear pattern leans on virgin resource extraction at one end and piles up waste at the other, producing twin pressures of depletion and pollution. Taking a leaf from natural nutrient cycling, circular cities redesign discard streams into inputs - rubble reborn as aggregate, kitchen waste digested into biogas, nitrogen and phosphorus recovered from greywater - so growth decouples from virgin extraction.�ans��src��nKennedy CA等论文《The changing metabolism of cities》,Journal of Industrial Ecology 2007(多伦多大学)�sKennedy CA et al., 'The changing metabolism of cities', Journal of Industrial Ecology, 2007 (University of Toronto)��id�env_26_012�body���因为施肥量普遍超过作物当季的吸收能力,全球农田一半以上的氮素未被收获带走。它们沿三条路离开农田:挥发成氨气与一氧化二氮——后者是效力远超二氧化碳的温室气体;以硝酸盐形态淋入地下水,威胁饮用水安全;随径流入河入海,引发藻类暴发与近海低氧死区。对策是测土配方精量施肥、缓控释肥、硝化抑制剂并与豆科轮作固氮,让更多氮长进籽粒而非散逸进环境。�uFertiliser is routinely spread far beyond what a crop can absorb in a single season, so worldwide more than half of applied nitrogen leaves the field unharvested. It escapes down three routes: volatilising into ammonia and nitrous oxide, a greenhouse gas vastly more potent than CO2; leaching as nitrate into the groundwater that feeds drinking wells; and washing off into rivers and seas, triggering algal blooms and low-oxygen dead zones. Soil-tested precision dosing, slow-release fertilisers, nitrification inhibitors and rotations with nitrogen-fixing legumes all aim to steer nitrogen into grain instead of the environment.�ans��src��OZhang X等论文《Managing nitrogen for sustainable development》,Nature 2015�MZhang X et al., 'Managing nitrogen for sustainable development', Nature, 2015��id�env_26_020�body���一种让城市像海绵般吸纳、蓄存、净化雨水并在干旱时释放利用的雨洪管理理念,核心是低影响开发。透水铺装、绿色屋顶、下沉式绿地、植草沟与调蓄池塘层层拦蓄径流,从源头就地消纳雨水;中国2014年发布《海绵城市建设技术指南》,年径流总量控制率目标多定在七至八成半之间,2015年起分批开展国家级试点。相较单纯扩容灰色排水管网,分散式绿色设施能同时削峰、补源、降温。��An approach to stormwater that lets a city behave like a sponge - soaking up, storing and cleansing rain, then releasing it for reuse in dry times. Its core is low-impact development: permeable paving, green roofs, sunken lawns, bioswales and retention ponds intercept runoff layer by layer right where it falls. China issued its technical guide for sponge city construction in 2014, with annual runoff volume control targets mostly between seventy and eighty-five percent, and national pilots began rolling out from 2015. Instead of merely enlarging grey drains, dispersed green infrastructure trims peaks, recharges aquifers and cools streets all at once.�ans��src��{中国住房和城乡建设部文件《海绵城市建设技术指南——低影响开发雨水系统构建(试行)》2014ٞMinistry of Housing and Urban-Rural Development of China, Technical Guide for Sponge City Construction: Low-Impact Development Rainwater Systems (Trial), 2014��id�f0118d5f3ed1�body���过度消费是指人们购买和使用的东西超过了实际需要，造成资源浪费和大量垃圾。快时尚、一次性用品和食物浪费都是常见例子。减少过度消费能减轻地球的环境压力。��Overconsumption means buying and using more than we actually need, creating waste and trash. Fast fashion, disposables, and food waste are common examples. Reducing it eases the environmental pressure on Earth.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f1355f99815f�body���物种丰富度是指一个地区内物种数目的多少，是衡量生物多样性的最直接指标之一。它只考虑“有多少种”，并不区分每种数量的多少。热带地区的物种丰富度通常远高于寒带和极地。�Species richness is the number of species in a given area, one of the most direct measures of biodiversity. It counts only how many kinds and does not weigh their abundance. Tropical regions typically have far higher species richness than cold or polar areas.�ans��src��/Miller, G.T. 与 Spoolman, S.《环境科学》�2Miller, G.T. & Spoolman, S., Environmental Science��id�f355bc9a3c05�body��2入侵物种是指被人类无意或故意引入新地区后，因缺乏天敌而大量繁殖、危害本地生态的外来生物，如福寿螺、水葫芦。它们会挤占本土物种的生存空间，造成农业和经济损失。防止外来物种随贸易和旅行传入是最有效的控制办法。�yAn invasive species is a non-native organism introduced to a new area, often by human activity, that spreads rapidly without natural enemies and harms local ecosystems, such as the golden apple snail or water hyacinth. They displace native species and cause agricultural and economic losses. Preventing their introduction through trade and travel is the most effective control.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�f4552e3093d5�body��国家公园是由国家设立、以保护自然风光和生态系统为主，同时适度允许公众游憩的大型保护区。它既守护珍稀动植物，也让人们在受控范围内亲近自然。世界上第一个国家公园是1872年设立的美国黄石公园。�MA national park is a large protected area established by a country to conserve natural landscapes and ecosystems while allowing controlled public recreation. It safeguards rare plants and animals and lets people experience nature responsibly. The world's first national park was Yellowstone in the United States, established in 1872.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f4a6be17b665�body��5生物多样性是地球上生命的多样性，通常包含三个层次：遗传多样性（同一物种内的基因变异）、物种多样性（不同物种的丰富与均匀程度）和生态系统多样性（不同生境与生态过程）。保护生物多样性需要在这三个层次上同时着力。�DBiodiversity is the variety of life on Earth and is usually described at three levels: genetic diversity (gene-level variation within a species), species diversity (richness and evenness of species), and ecosystem diversity (variety of habitats and ecological processes). Conservation must address all three levels together.�ans��src��R联合国《生物多样性公约》（CBD）及《全球生物多样性展望5》�IConvention on Biological Diversity (CBD); 'Global Biodiversity Outlook 5'��id�f58f772053d9�body�َ微塑料是直径小于5毫米的塑料碎片，来自大塑料破碎或化妆品中的塑料微珠，已进入海洋、土壤甚至人体。ٝMicroplastics are plastic fragments smaller than 5 mm, from broken-down larger plastic or cosmetic beads, now found in oceans, soils and even the human body.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�f73bb5845d90�body�١大气是连通的，CO₂ 混匀只需约一年就散布全球；本地排的碳很快加入全球"公共空气"，远方的高温或海平面都和它有关。١The atmosphere is connected—CO₂ mixes globally in about a year, so local emissions join the shared air almost at once, linking to distant heat and sea level.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f7b55790a34e�body�ٜ通过筛选耐热虫黄藻、杂交或驯化出更耐高温的珊瑚株系，并帮助它们在暖化海域定植，以提升白化事件中的存活率。٨It selects heat-tolerant symbionts, crossbreeds or acclimatizes hardier coral strains and helps them settle in warming reefs to raise survival through bleaching events.�ans��src��"《Science》珊瑚礁修复研究�Science coral reef restoration��id�fb497174864b�body��水资源短缺是指一个地区可用的淡水无法满足居民、农业和工业需求的状态，常由干旱、人口增加和污染造成。全球已有数十亿人面临不同程度的缺水。节约用水、污水净化和跨流域调配是常见对策。�(Water scarcity is when a region's available freshwater cannot meet the needs of households, farms, and industry, often due to drought, population growth, and pollution. Billions of people already face some degree of shortage. Saving water, treating wastewater, and transfers are common responses.�ans��src��5联合国《世界水发展报告》（UNESCO WWAP）�/UN World Water Development Report (UNESCO WWAP)��id�fc22a90df8a5�body��富营养化是指过量的氮、磷等营养盐进入湖泊或海湾，导致藻类等浮游生物暴发性繁殖的现象。藻类死亡分解会消耗大量氧气，造成鱼虾缺氧死亡，形成“死区”。农业化肥流失和生活污水是主要来源。�<Eutrophication occurs when excess nitrogen and phosphorus enter lakes or coastal waters, triggering explosive growth of algae and other plankton. When the algae die and decompose they consume oxygen, causing fish and other life to suffocate and creating dead zones. Fertilizer runoff and sewage are the main sources.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�fc6c2b6d977a�body�ِ太阳晒热海洋和湖泊，水变成水蒸气升上天空成云，再落为雨或雪回到地面，流入河流海洋，如此不断循环。مThe sun evaporates water into vapor that forms clouds and falls as rain or snow, returning to rivers and oceans—a continuous cycle.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�993f6905e6b2�body�ٱ人工湿地模拟自然湿地，让污水缓慢流经芦苇等植物和填料，由植物、微生物和基质共同去除氮磷与有机物，运行成本低、景观友好。��Constructed wetlands mimic natural ones: wastewater slowly flows through reeds and substrate, where plants, microbes and media jointly remove nitrogen, phosphorus and organics—low cost and landscape-friendly.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�bdfacae8bde2�body��O天气是某一地点在短时间（分钟到数周）内的大气状态，包括温度、降水、风等具体瞬时状况；气候则是某一地区在较长时期（通常30年及以上）内天气的统计平均与变率。常言“气候是你所预期、天气是你所经历”，正说明了二者在时间尺度上的差异。�yWeather is the state of the atmosphere at a specific place over a short time (minutes to weeks), including instantaneous conditions like temperature, precipitation, and wind. Climate is the long-term statistical average and variability of weather for a region, typically assessed over 30 years or more. As the saying goes, 'climate is what you expect, weather is what you get.'�ans��src�ي世界气象组织（WMO）《国际气象词汇》（WMO-No. 182）天气与气候定义；美国国家海洋和大气管理局（NOAA）ٝWorld Meteorological Organization (WMO), 'International Meteorological Vocabulary' (WMO-No. 182); U.S. National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA)��id�07eed6d5ca24�body�٥太阳能板像会吸光的蓝色窗户，把照在上面的阳光直接变成电。用阳光发电不用烧煤，干净又取之不尽，是帮地球的好办法。��Solar panels are like blue windows that soak up light and turn the sunlight shining on them straight into electricity. Making power from sunlight needs no coal, so it is clean and never runs out — a great way to help the Earth.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1840eb6546b1�body���青蛙的皮肤很薄，水里的微小变化都能被它吸进去，所以对污染特别敏感。如果一个池塘里青蛙又多又活泼，通常说明那里的水干净、生态很好。��Frogs have thin skin that soaks up even tiny changes in water, so they are very sensitive to pollution. When a pond has many lively frogs, it usually means the water is clean and the ecosystem is healthy.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�21b0c7f200bc�body�ٙ因为能量每传到上一级就只剩约一成，越往上的动物需要越大地盘找食物，所以老虎、鹰这类顶级捕食者数量稀少。وOnly about one tenth of energy passes to the next level, so top predators like tigers and eagles need huge ranges and are naturally few.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�2ccba3b093a4�body�ٱ雷电会把空气中的氧气变成少量清新的臭氧，带来下雨后特有的味道。同时雨水把灰尘和花粉洗到地上，风又把干净的空气吹了过来。��Lightning turns some oxygen in the air into a small amount of fresh-smelling ozone, giving that special after-rain scent. At the same time, rain washes dust and pollen to the ground while wind brings in cleaner air.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�3141b532b4f3�body���关键种对群落结构的影响远超其生物量，例如海獭捕食海胆、保护海带森林。一旦被移除，受其控制的物种会暴发，导致栖息地崩溃与多样性骤降。��A keystone species shapes its community far beyond its biomass—sea otters, for instance, eat sea urchins and protect kelp forests. Remove it and its prey explode, collapsing habitat and diversity.�ans��src��ZPaine, R. T. (1969)《营养级复杂性与群落稳定性》（The American Naturalist）�dPaine, R. T. (1969), 'A Note on Trophic Complexity and Community Stability', The American Naturalist��id�39c6c5c3e148�body�ٷ电池里有金属和化学物质，如果被扔进土里或烧掉，会慢慢渗进泥土和地下水。送到专门的回收点，里面的金属还能被取出来再做新东西。��Batteries hold metals and chemicals that can slowly leak into soil and groundwater if buried or burned. Taken to a special collection point, their metals can be pulled out and made into something new.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�3baf1b659a54�body���菜叶、果皮和蛋壳在堆肥箱里被小虫子和小细菌慢慢分解，变成黑亮亮的营养土。把它撒进花园，植物会长得更壮，也少了被扔进垃圾填埋场的臭味垃圾。��Veggie leaves, peels, and eggshells are slowly broken down by tiny bugs and bacteria in a compost bin into dark, rich soil. Sprinkled in the garden, it helps plants grow strong and keeps smelly waste out of landfills.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�493b99ebbeea�body�ٺ指示物种对环境变化（如污染或温度）特别敏感，其数量变化能提前反映生态系统健康。例如河蚌与两栖类常被用作水质与湿地退化的哨兵。��Indicator species are especially sensitive to environmental change such as pollution or temperature, so their population shifts flag ecosystem health early. Mussels and amphibians, for example, act as sentinels for water quality and wetland decline.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4e40f7934da8�body���鱼用鳃从水里吸取氧气，如果水里有太多垃圾和药水，氧气会变少、还会伤害鱼的身体。干净、流动的水里住着小虫和水草，正好是小鱼的美食和躲藏处。��Fish use their gills to take oxygen from water, so too much trash and chemicals make oxygen drop and harm their bodies. Clean, flowing water holds little bugs and plants that are perfect food and hiding spots for fish.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�51b79a30cc8b�body���每到秋天，成千上万只帝王蝶会从加拿大和美国北部飞到墨西哥温暖的森林里过冬，路程长达几千公里。它们靠体内的罗盘感受阳光方向，一代代接力完成这趟奇妙的旅行。�Every autumn, millions of monarch butterflies fly from Canada and the northern U.S. to warm forests in Mexico for winter, a journey of thousands of kilometers. Guided by an inner compass that senses the sun, they complete this amazing trip across generations.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�53f8bd9a5a30�body�ٱ果皮、菜叶在堆肥里被微生物慢慢消化，变成松软的营养土，正好用来种花种菜。把厨余变成泥土，垃圾场就少了很多会发臭的废物。ټPeels and leaves are slowly digested by microbes in compost into soft, nutritious soil perfect for flowers and veggies. Turning scraps into soil keeps smelly waste out of the garbage dump.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�5c4edf592dc1�body�ٱ高高的风车叶片被风吹得转起来，连着发电机就把转动的力量变成电。风是永远用不完的自然力量，用它发电不会冒烟、也不排废气。ٺTall turbine blades spin in the wind, and the generator turns that spinning motion into electricity. Wind is an endless natural force, and making power from it creates no smoke or fumes.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�5fa00370e0e1�body�ٴ电动公交车用电池驱动，行驶时不排出尾气和雾霾，街道上的空气更清新。它们还很安静，不会像大卡车那样轰隆作响，让城市更宜居。��Electric buses run on batteries and give off no exhaust or smog while driving, so the street air stays fresher. They are also quiet, without the rumble of big trucks, making the city nicer to live in.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6933f89a402e�body���小海龟在沙子里孵化后游向大海，长大后却能凭着对地球磁场的记忆，游回自己出生的那片海滩产卵。保护这些安静的海滩，就能让海龟宝宝安全来到世界上。��Baby sea turtles hatch in the sand and swim to the sea, but as adults they use memory of Earth's magnetic field to return to the very beach where they were born to lay eggs. Protecting these quiet beaches helps turtle babies arrive safely in the world.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7fc9bd972544�body���月亮和太阳用引力轻轻拉着地球上海的水，把海水推向它们那边，就形成了涨潮。当拉力变小，海水又退回去，这就是退潮，一天里通常会出现两次。��The Moon and the Sun gently pull on Earth's seawater with gravity, drawing the water toward them and creating high tide. When the pull eases, the water flows back out, which is low tide — and this usually happens twice a day.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�82eb5ff4c300�body�ٺ海洋覆盖了地球大约七成的表面，制造了我们通过呼吸用到的大部分氧气。它还像地球的空调，吸收太阳的热量，让各地的天气不会太极端。��The ocean covers about seventy percent of Earth's surface and makes most of the oxygen we breathe. It also acts like Earth's air conditioner, soaking up the sun's heat so the weather stays less extreme.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a0c97c40c1be�body�ٱ通过覆盖作物、免耕、轮牧、堆肥等恢复土壤健康与生物多样性，目标是让土地“越种越肥”并固碳，区别于单纯减害的可持续农业。ٲUsing cover crops, no-till, rotational grazing and compost to restore soil health and biodiversity, aiming to make land richer and sequester carbon—beyond merely reducing harm.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a41c1704cd51�body�ٷ沙漠里植物和水很少，白天太阳把沙子晒得滚烫，热量散不出去。到了晚上，干燥的空气留不住热气，温度就很快降下来，变得冷飕飕的。��Deserts have little plant and water, so by day the sun makes the sand scorching and the heat has nowhere to hide. At night the dry air cannot hold the warmth, so the temperature drops quickly and it feels chilly.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b284a3b77d79�body���玻璃是用沙子熔化做成的，把它打碎、高温重熔，就能变成崭新的瓶子，质量不会变差。一只玻璃罐子循环使用很多次，比每次都造新的更省材料和能量。��Glass is made by melting sand, and when crushed and re-melted at high heat it becomes brand-new bottles without losing quality. One glass jar can loop through many lives, saving material and energy versus making new each time.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d63260b27b19�body���鲸鱼在深海和海面之间上下游动，把营养从海底带到阳光能照到的地方，喂饱小小的浮游生物。它们死后沉入海底，还会变成许多深海动物的食物，让生命一直循环下去。��Whales swim up and down between the deep sea and the surface, carrying nutrients from the bottom to where sunlight reaches, feeding tiny plankton. When they die and sink, they become food for deep-sea animals, keeping life cycling onward.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�dc73ae1bd915�body���我们头顶的空气越往上越稀薄，因为大部分空气被地球引力拉在了靠近地面的地方。爬到很高很高的山顶时，每一次呼吸吸到的氧气变少了，所以会觉得气短。��The air gets thinner the higher you go, because Earth's gravity pulls most of it down near the ground. At a very high peak, each breath holds less oxygen, which is why you may feel breathless.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�dc7b548ca916�body���许多花在白天张开花瓣，吸引蜜蜂和蝴蝶来传粉；夜里变冷变暗，它们就合上花瓣保暖、也保护里面的花蕊。等到天亮温度回升，花瓣又会重新打开。��Many flowers open by day to welcome bees and butterflies for pollination; when night turns cold and dark, they fold their petals to stay warm and protect the center. As the morning warms up, the petals open again.�ans��src���Prokop, Fedor,《Why do flowers close at night? Experiments with the Lesser celandineFicaria vernaHuds (Ranunculaceae)》, Biological Journal of the Linnean Society, 2016 (DOI: 10.1111/bij.12752)ٿProkop, Fedor, 'Why do flowers close at night? Experiments with the Lesser celandineFicaria vernaHuds (Ranunculaceae)', Biological Journal of the Linnean Society, 2016, DOI: 10.1111/bij.12752��id�e47a70f47f31�body���珊瑚礁只占海底很小一部分，却住着大约四分之一的海洋鱼类，是海洋里最热闹的城市。它们还像防波堤一样减弱海浪，保护海岸边的沙滩和村庄。��Coral reefs cover only a tiny part of the seafloor yet shelter about one quarter of all ocean fish, making them the busiest cities of the sea. They also work like breakwaters, softening waves and protecting beaches and villages along the coast.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e47f75e32114�body���当北方天气变冷、虫子和果子变少时，许多鸟会顺着固定路线飞到温暖的地方找食物。它们靠太阳、星星和地磁场认路，每年都能飞回同一个小池塘。��When the north grows cold and insects and berries grow scarce, many birds follow set routes to warmer places with food. They navigate by the sun, the stars, and Earth's magnetic field, and return to the same little pond each year.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e894a4d8ada6�body�ٽ红树林长在海水边缘，密密的根像手指一样插进泥里，能挡住海浪、留住泥沙。它们还是小鱼小蟹的育儿房，台风来时也能减轻对村庄的冲击。��Mangroves grow at the edge of the sea, and their dense roots plunge into the mud like fingers, blocking waves and holding the soil. They are nurseries for little fish and crabs, and soften the blow of storms on nearby villages.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_25_013�body���有道理但只是拼图一角。象牙、犀牛角贸易直接驱动盗猎,切断市场能减杀戮。但保护难点还有:栖息地被农田城市切割(动物无处安家)、人兽冲突(庄稼被毁的农民不愿保护)、贫困社区需要生计。成功案例都靠组合拳:藏羚羊保护靠巡山反盗猎、动物通道、牧民补偿替代收入。生态保护的本质是平衡人与野生动物的利益。�iTrue yet one puzzle piece. Ivory and rhino-horn trade directly fuels poaching so cutting markets reduces killing. But habitat fragmentation by farms and cities, human-wildlife conflict and community poverty matter too. Successes combine tools: Tibetan antelope patrols plus highway crossings plus herder compensation. Conservation balances human and wild lives.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_015�body��p流浪动物本身无辜,但泛滥会带来疫病风险、交通事故与本地野生动物被捕食的压力。根源大多是不负责任的弃养和不绝育导致的繁殖。国际上广泛采用的管理组合包括TNR(捕捉-绝育-放归)、领养代替购买和宠物登记制度。爱它就要负责到底——领养前的深思比事后的救助更重要。�kStrays themselves are innocent, but swarms bring disease risk, traffic hazards and predation on wildlife. Roots trace to irresponsible abandonment and unneutered breeding. Widely used toolkits combine TNR (trap-neuter-return), adoption over purchase and registration rules. Loving them means responsibility first — thinking before adopting beats rescuing after.�ans��src��RLoss, Will & Marra,《美国散养家猫对野生动物的影响》, Science, 2014�vLoss SR, Will TT, Marra PP, 'The impact of free-ranging domestic cats on wildlife of the United States', Science, 2014��id�f1225bcc1094�body�٥它主张消费者和独立维修店应能获得备件、图纸和诊断工具，打破厂商垄断维修。延长产品寿命、减少电子废物是核心目标。ټIt argues consumers and independent shops should access parts, schematics and tools, breaking manufacturer repair monopolies. Extending product life and cutting e-waste are the core goals.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f5ac2ee4da35�body�٫海面越暖，海水蒸发越多，把大量热和水汽送进空气里。这些暖湿空气旋转着上升，就像给风暴的马达加了油，使风雨越来越大。��The warmer the sea surface, the more water evaporates and feeds heat and vapor into the air. This warm, moist air rises and spins like fuel for a storm's engine, making the wind and rain grow stronger.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�02d5d9bb937e�body��o鲸鱼、企鹅、海豹和很多鱼都以磷虾为重要食物，它像南大洋食物网的“小齿轮”。�xWhales, penguins, seals and many fish rely on krill as key food; it is like a small gear in the Southern Ocean food web.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�05c20ad211ed�body��地球表面约71%被水覆盖，但其中约97%是咸海水，淡水只占约3%，而绝大部分淡水又被锁在冰川、冰盖和深层地下水中。真正便于人类直接利用的河流湖泊淡水不到全球总水量的1%，因此可用淡水其实相当稀缺。�/About 71% of Earth's surface is water, but roughly 97% is salty ocean water and only about 3% is freshwater—most of which is locked in glaciers, ice sheets, and deep groundwater. Readily accessible freshwater in rivers and lakes is under 1% of all water, so usable freshwater is actually quite scarce.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0bab56b92905�body�ٙ一个旧盒子可以当收纳筐，旧衣服可以改成抹布，这样就不必总买新的。少买少扔，工厂就少制造、地球也少负担。ٵAn old box can become a storage bin and old clothes can turn into rags, so we don't always need to buy new. Buying and tossing less means factories make less and Earth carries less.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�18c9675e3042�body�٨蜜蜂在花朵间传播花粉，帮助许多水果和蔬菜结出果实。没有蜜蜂，苹果、草莓等作物会大幅减产，我们的餐桌也会变得单调。ټBees carry pollen between flowers, helping many fruits and vegetables form their fruits. Without bees, crops like apples and strawberries would drop sharply and our meals would get boring.�ans��src��<联合国粮农组织《栽培植物授粉者汇编》(2018)�PFAO, The Pollination of Cultivated Plants: A Compendium for Practitioners (2018)��id�1e69af34f5e7�body�ٴ不能。对牛羊肉而言，反刍动物肠道甲烷往往占其碳足迹大头，远超运输；本地化对低排放强度的蔬果更有意义，整体需看全生命周期。٬No. For beef and lamb, ruminant methane often dominates the footprint, far above transport; localization matters more for low-emission produce; the whole life cycle counts.�ans��src��Our World in Data�Our World in Data��id�239b630885cb�body�ٟ当高空气温冷到零度以下，云里的小水滴会冻成六角形的小冰晶。这些冰晶越聚越大，轻轻飘下来，就成了漂亮的雪花。ٯWhen the air high up is below freezing, the tiny droplets in clouds freeze into six-sided ice crystals. The crystals clump together and drift down gently as pretty snowflakes.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�2413b5d891b2�body�ٺ干净的水并不是取之不尽的，许多地方的人要走上很久才能打到一桶水。我们随手关紧水龙头、用盆洗菜，就能把更多清水留给需要和地球。��Clean water is not endless, and in many places people walk a long way just to fetch one bucket. By turning off the tap tightly and washing veggies in a basin, we save more fresh water for others and the Earth.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�29f0ad0dd053�body��o它们发电时不烧煤、不冒黑烟，也不会吐出让人咳嗽的气体，所以用它们天空更蓝。�sThey make electricity without burning coal or smoke, and don't release cough-causing gases, so the sky stays bluer.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�31845117b2c1�body���不是。有机偏重禁用合成投入品；再生农业更强调恢复土壤健康、碳与生态功能（免耕、轮牧、覆盖等），二者可重叠但并不等同，也不都承诺净固碳。��No. Organic focuses on banning synthetic inputs; regenerative emphasizes restoring soil health, carbon and ecology (no-till, grazing, cover crops). They overlap but differ and don't all guarantee net carbon gain.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�32cd8414d21c�body�٥小衣服洗干净叠好，送给需要的弟弟妹妹，就能继续发挥作用。旧衣循环起来，既帮助了别人，也少了一些被丢掉的新衣服。٢Clean, folded outgrown clothes given to younger siblings or others can keep being useful. Passing clothes on helps people and means fewer new clothes thrown away.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�338293443c81�body���当气温降到零度以下，湖面最上层的冷水会先结成一薄层冰。有趣的是冰比水轻，会浮在上面，像被子一样盖住湖水，保护下面的小鱼不被冻僵。��When the temperature drops below freezing, the top layer of cold lake water freezes into a thin sheet of ice. Fun fact: ice is lighter than water, so it floats on top like a blanket that protects the fish below from freezing.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3a4eb063c424�body�ٙ回收的旧瓶子和旧纸可以做成新东西，就不用砍那么多树、挖那么多矿。这样垃圾变少，地球的资源也能用得更久。٣Recycled bottles and paper can become new things, so we need to cut fewer trees and dig fewer mines. This leaves less trash and lets Earth's resources last longer.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�3ac3d30f17e5�body�ي因为它们含重金属和有害物，随便扔会污染土壤水源。专门回收能把有用材料取回、把毒东西安全处理。ٕThey contain heavy metals and hazards that pollute soil and water if tossed. Dedicated recycling recovers useful materials and safely handles toxins.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3af2d62d26a1�body��~把纸、塑料、果皮分开，能让能回收的变成新东西、能堆肥的变成泥土养分，垃圾山就会变小。كSeparating paper, plastic and peels lets recyclables become new things and scraps become soil food, shrinking the garbage mountain.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4257dd20ed53�body���太阳把地面晒热，热空气变轻往上升，旁边的冷空气就跑过来填补空位，这就形成了风。海边白天风从海上吹来，晚上又从陆地吹回去，特别有趣。��The sun warms the ground, and the heated air rises because it is lighter, so cooler air rushes in to fill the space — that is wind. At the sea, the wind blows from the ocean by day and back from the land at night, which is fun to notice.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�4a2ea2af8ebc�body�٢被随手丢掉的纸屑和塑料会随风滚进河流和草丛，弄脏小动物们的家。把它们丢进垃圾桶，街道和公园就能一直干干净净。ٮThrown-away paper and plastic roll into rivers and bushes with the wind and dirty the homes of little animals. Putting them in the bin keeps streets and parks clean and tidy.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�4a844b982ed2�body��c红树林像一排排小卫兵，用根挡住大浪保护村庄，还给小鱼小蟹当幼儿园。�{Mangroves are like little guards whose roots block big waves to protect villages and serve as a nursery for fish and crabs.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4c597cbb77fa�body�ٓ会。海龟可能把塑料袋误认成水母吃下，海鸟会被塑料缠住。塑料要很久才消失，所以少丢塑料能救很多动物。٩Yes. Sea turtles may swallow plastic bags mistaking them for jellyfish, and seabirds get tangled. Plastic takes very long to disappear, so using less saves many animals.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�4de5bfbaec30�body�ٱ雨水落在山上，把岩石里一点点盐和矿物冲进小河，再流进大海。海水被太阳晒得蒸发，盐却留了下来，积了很久很久，海就变咸了。��Rain falls on mountains and washes a little salt and minerals from rocks into streams that flow to the sea. The sun evaporates the water but leaves the salt behind, and over a very long time the ocean became salty.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�4e8271781672�body�ٴ蚂蚁虽然很小，但它们会分工合作：有的找食物，有的照顾宝宝，有的守家门。大家一起努力，就能把比自己大很多倍的食物搬回窝里。ٻAnts are tiny, but they divide the work: some search for food, some care for babies, and some guard the nest. By working together, they can carry food many times their own size back home.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�601ec6831abd�body�ٓ汽车烧油会排出废气，而走路和骑车不烧油、也不冒烟。短距离出行多动动腿，既锻炼身体，又让空气更干净。ٞCars burn fuel and puff out fumes, while walking and biking use no fuel and make no smoke. For short trips, using your legs keeps you fit and the air cleaner.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�60c613c504a9�body��x蚯蚓在土里钻洞、吃腐烂叶子排出粪肥，能让土壤更松软、更肥沃，还能帮助雨水渗下去。�tEarthworms tunnel and eat dead leaves, leaving rich casts that loosen and fertilize soil and help rainwater soak in.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�63f00fb043c9�body�ه夜里没有太阳，地面慢慢把白天存的热散掉，气温就降了下来。等到太阳升起，空气才又被慢慢晒暖。ٳAt night there is no sun, so the ground slowly loses the heat it stored during the day, and the temperature drops. When the sun rises, the air is warmed up again little by little.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�6416a0c385de�body�ٍ混凝土、沥青吸热又少蒸发，建筑阻挡通风，加上人为散热与少绿量，使城市比周围乡村在夜间明显更热。��Concrete and asphalt absorb heat with little evaporation, buildings block wind, plus human heat and low greenery make cities noticeably hotter than surrounding countryside, especially at night.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6633504ec0dd�body�ٱ有用。回收一吨废纸能少砍约十几棵树、省下不少水和电；瓶子回炉可比用新塑料少排很多碳。攒对、分对，就是给地球“省原料”。��Yes. Recycling a ton of paper spares roughly a dozen trees and saves water and power; remelting bottles emits far less than new plastic. Sorting right is 'saving raw materials' for the planet.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�670352fe327a�body���两者都属于受威胁级别，但「极危」（CR）比「濒危」（EN）面临更高的近期灭绝风险，其种群下降或分布收缩幅度更大。IUCN 用定量标准（如三代内下降 ≥80%）来划分等级。��Both are threatened categories, but Critically Endangered (CR) faces a far higher near-term extinction risk than Endangered (EN), with steeper population or range decline. IUCN uses quantitative criteria such as ≥80% decline over three generations.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�69b33ebef76b�body�ي用电少，电厂就少烧煤少排碳。每盏灯看着小，全校、全城一起关，累计起来就是实打实的能源和蓝天。٪Less electricity means the plant burns less coal and emits less carbon. One bulb is tiny, but a whole school or city switching off adds up to real energy and cleaner air.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7a0de419944e�body�ِ鱼游过会留下一点点皮肤或黏液的DNA，科学家用水里的这种“环境DNA”就能查出有哪些鱼，不用把鱼捞上来。٢Fish leave tiny bits of skin or mucus DNA as they swim; scientists use this 'environmental DNA' in the water to find which fish are there—without catching them.�ans��src��"Primack《保护生物学基础》�/Primack, R.B., A Primer of Conservation Biology��id�7b756c1fd109�body��x噪声污染是城市中过大的声音，会让人睡不好、动物听不清同伴或猎物，影响健康和生存。ْNoise pollution is excessive unwanted sound; it disturbs human sleep and prevents animals from hearing mates or prey, harming health and survival.�ans��src��ZShaw,《Noise pollution—what can be done?》,Physics Today,1975 (DOI: 10.1063/1.3068772)�XShaw, 'Noise pollution—what can be done?', Physics Today, 1975, DOI: 10.1063/1.3068772��id�8067814516fa�body�ٱ湿地像大地的一块大海绵，能慢慢吸住雨水，还能让植物把水里的脏东西过滤干净。许多小鸟和青蛙都喜欢在湿地里找吃的、生宝宝。پWetlands are like a big sponge for the land, slowly soaking up rainwater and letting plants filter dirt out of the water. Many birds and frogs love to find food and raise babies in wetlands.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�80e57a7859b0�body�ه垃圾会让动物误食或被缠住，塑料要几百年才分解。保持森林干净，鸟儿、小鹿和溪流才能健康安全。١Trash can be eaten or trap animals, and plastic takes hundreds of years to break down. Keeping forests clean lets birds, deer, and streams stay healthy and safe.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�81dd450c63a0�body�ٍ鱼会吃稻田里的虫和杂草，它们的游动还松土增氧；虫子少了，农药自然可以减下来，米和鱼还能一起收。٢Fish eat pests and weeds in the paddy and their movement aerates and loosens soil; with fewer insects, pesticide use drops while both rice and fish are harvested.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�86a7ca5822b8�body��《蒙特利尔议定书》于 1987 年达成，目标是逐步淘汰消耗臭氧层的氟氯碳化物（CFCs）等物质，保护平流层臭氧层。它被广泛视为最成功的国际环境条约，近年还追加了限制强效温室气体 HFCs 的《基加利修正案》。�The 1987 Montreal Protocol aims to phase out ozone-depleting substances like CFCs to protect the stratospheric ozone layer. It is widely seen as the most successful environmental treaty, and later added the Kigali Amendment to curb potent HFC greenhouse gases.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�873ac5d9d865�body�ي可以。人们用海浪上下起伏带动发电机，或用涨落的海潮转动水轮机来发电。这些都属于清洁的海洋能。ٙYes. People use the up-and-down motion of waves to turn generators, or let rising and falling tides spin turbines. These are forms of clean ocean energy.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�8ef21c82b186�body�ٴ少浪费既能省下生产、运输、冷藏的钱，又避免这些环节已产生的温室气体，往往不花钱甚至省钱就能减碳，是性价比最高的措施之一。ٶWasting less saves the money spent producing, shipping and chilling food and avoids the GHGs already emitted—often free or money-saving mitigation, among the highest-value actions.�ans��src��Project Drawdown�Project Drawdown��id�92299e307978�body�ٽ大象是很大的动物，每天要吃很多草和树叶，所以需要广阔的草地和森林走来走去。当森林被分割成小块时，象群就很难找到足够的食物和水。��Elephants are huge animals that eat lots of grass and leaves every day, so they need wide-open land and forests to roam. When forests are split into small pieces, elephant families find it hard to get enough food and water.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9558f27445bf�body��x卫星拍下大地的颜色，森林是深绿；被砍后变成土黄，电脑一比前后照片就知道哪里变了。ٝSatellites photograph Earth's colors; forest is deep green, and after cutting it turns earthy yellow—computers compare before/after photos to spot changes.�ans��src��Global Forest Watch�Global Forest Watch��id�9743a21438d9�body�٥河流把山上的清水一路送到田野和城市，给我们喝水、洗澡和种庄稼。河边的水草和浅滩，也是水鸟、鱼儿和青蛙热闹的家。��Rivers carry fresh water from the mountains all the way to fields and cities, giving us water to drink, wash, and grow crops. The grasses and shallows along the banks are also busy homes for waterbirds, fish, and frogs.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�9a76d5534ba0�body���森林里有高高的树木、灌木和落叶，给小鸟、松鼠和昆虫提供了吃饭、躲藏和养育宝宝的地方。一棵老树就像一个小小的公寓，住着许多不同的动物。��Forests have tall trees, bushes, and fallen leaves that give birds, squirrels, and insects places to eat, hide, and raise their babies. One old tree is like a small apartment where many different animals live.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9c67197c26a9�body�پ净零通常指所有温室气体（含甲烷、氧化亚氮等）的排放与移除相抵；碳中和有时只算 CO2，或可通过境外抵消实现，范围与严格程度略有不同。٥Net-zero usually covers all greenhouse gases balanced by removals; carbon neutrality sometimes counts CO2 only or allows offsets, so scope and strictness can differ.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9e6824b24c71�body���在通风、有水分和微生物的条件下，果皮菜叶等有机物慢慢分解成松软、富含养分的“腐殖质”。它回到土壤里能改善结构、保水保肥，是让废物变资源的典型做法。��With air, moisture and microbes, peels and scraps break down into soft, nutrient-rich humus. Returned to soil it improves structure and holds water and nutrients, a classic way to turn waste into a resource.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�9e78982eb6d7�body��{地球上的淡水很少很少，开着水龙头会白白流走，省下水就能留给植物、小鱼和以后的人用。�~Fresh water on Earth is very scarce; a running tap wastes it, and saving water leaves more for plants, fish and future people.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a063da20fdc1�body�ي分解者是真菌和细菌等，把落叶、死动物变成泥土里的养分，让植物重新生长，是大自然的“清洁工”。�~Decomposers like fungi and bacteria turn dead leaves and animals into soil nutrients for plants to reuse—nature's recyclers.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a257d3ae4c42�body��f海水会变多、海平面上升，低洼的沿海城市更容易被淹、涨潮时更频繁进水。�uMore water means higher seas; low-lying coastal cities flood more easily and get seawater in more often at high tide.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�abbcc8003b9c�body�ٜ瓢虫最爱吃蚜虫，而蚜虫会咬坏蔬菜和小花。一只瓢虫一天能吃掉几十只蚜虫，帮我们的菜园保持健康，不用喷药水。٫Ladybugs love to eat aphids, the tiny bugs that nibble on vegetables and flowers. One ladybug can eat dozens of aphids in a day, keeping our garden healthy without sprays.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�abd472ff7f67�body��微塑料是直径小于5毫米的塑料碎片，分为生产时就很小的一次微塑料（如磨砂颗粒）和由大塑料破损产生的二次微塑料。它们随污水、垃圾和大气沉降进入河流、海洋乃至土壤，已被在深海、极地和人体中检出。�pMicroplastics are plastic fragments smaller than 5 millimeters, divided into primary microplastics made small on purpose (such as scrub beads) and secondary ones formed when larger plastics break apart. They enter rivers, oceans, and even soils via wastewater, litter, and atmospheric deposition, and have been found in the deep sea, polar regions, and the human body.�ans��src�ٚA. L. Andrady，《海洋环境中的微塑料》，《Marine Pollution Bulletin》第62卷（2011）：1596–1605，DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030َA. L. Andrady, 'Microplastics in the marine environment', Marine Pollution Bulletin 62 (2011): 1596-1605, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030��id�aeb058418c97�body�٥热浪是指连续多日异常炎热、超出当地正常水平的天气。它会让老人和病人中暑甚至死亡，还会让农作物枯萎、用电量猛增。ٶA heat wave is a stretch of unusually hot days well above a place's normal levels. It can cause heatstroke and death in the elderly and sick, wither crops, and spike electricity use.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�af84decc46a4�body���生态足迹估算人类为满足消费所需的生产性土地和海洋面积，包括耕地、林地、渔场和吸收 CO₂ 所需的土地。把它和地球的生物承载力相比，就能看出我们是否“透支”了自然。��The ecological footprint estimates the productive land and sea needed to support our consumption, including cropland, forests, fisheries and the land to absorb CO₂. Compared with Earth's biocapacity, it shows whether we are overshooting nature.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b7b44231f202�body�ِ每种动物都是大自然拼图的一块，少了一块整幅画就不完整；保护它们也保护了它们所在的森林和许多邻居。ْEvery animal is a piece of nature's puzzle; lose one and the picture is incomplete. Protecting them also protects their forest and many neighbors.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�be6414ca69ba�body�ٺ章鱼皮肤里藏着许多会变色的小袋子，紧张或想躲起来时，就能瞬间变成周围的颜色。这样它既能悄悄躲开敌人，也能悄悄靠近小虾当晚餐。��An octopus has tiny color-changing pockets in its skin, so it can instantly match the color around it when scared or hiding. This lets it sneak away from enemies and also sneak up on shrimp for dinner.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�c2eda4898a4f�body�ٺ地球是歪着身子绕太阳转的，所以一年里阳光照到每个地方的角度会慢慢变化。当阳光更斜、白天更短时，那里就进入了凉爽的秋天和冬天。��Earth is tilted as it travels around the sun, so the angle of sunlight on each place changes slowly through the year. When the light becomes slanted and days grow short, that place moves into cool autumn and winter.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�cd0846846dda�body�ٱ长期噪声会让人睡不好、心烦、血压升高，对小孩学习和老人心脏都不好。给房间加厚窗帘、关窗、戴耳塞，都是在给耳朵“放假”。ٲChronic noise ruins sleep, raises stress and blood pressure, hurting children's learning and elders' hearts. Thick curtains, closed windows and earplugs give your ears a 'break'.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d37b9ca724dc�body���酸雨是混有二氧化硫和氮氧化物等污染物的雨水，呈酸性。工厂、汽车和燃煤电厂排放的这些气体升到空中，与水汽结合后随雨落下，会伤害树木和湖泊。��Acid rain is rainwater mixed with pollutants like sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides, making it acidic. Factories, cars, and coal plants release these gases, which rise, combine with water vapor, and fall as rain that harms trees and lakes.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�d8dd959180dd�body�ٳ海水持续偏暖会让珊瑚把体内的虫黄藻排走，失去颜色与主要营养来源，露出白骨般的碳酸钙；温度一恢复正常，有的还能重新"上色"。٩Prolonged warm water makes corals expel their zooxanthellae, losing color and main food, leaving white calcium-carbonate skeletons; if heat eases, some can regain color.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�da30fa6143af�body�٢河水流动时会轻轻冲刷河岸，把细小的泥沙卷进水流里带走。这些肥沃的泥土流到平原，能让农田变得更松软、更养庄稼。٭As river water flows, it gently wears the banks and sweeps fine soil into the current. This fertile mud travels to the plains and makes farmland looser and better for crops.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e4c05f4ca0d6�body�ٙ造纸需用水、化学品和能源，且纸吸管常需塑料淋膜防水，回收难。环保与否要看全生命周期，而非只看材料名字。��Papermaking uses water, chemicals and energy, and paper straws often need a plastic coating to resist water, making recycling hard. Greenness depends on the full life cycle, not just the material name.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_25_006�body��塑料瓶和衣服的原料其实是亲戚,都来自石油。回收厂把瓶子洗净、切碎、熔化,拉成比头发还细的丝,再织成布——大约10个瓶子就能做一件T恤。所以每个瓶子放进回收桶,都是在给未来的衣服存原料。��Bottles and clothes are petroleum cousins. Recyclers wash, shred and melt bottles, spin them into threads finer than hair and weave fabric — about ten bottles make one T-shirt. Every bottle in the bin is raw material saved for future clothes.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_008�body��太阳能板里夹着两层特殊的硅材料,阳光里的光子打上去,会把电子撞得跳起来,电子朝一个方向流动就形成了电流。黑色是因为它几乎吸收所有颜色的光,一点不浪费——颜色越深,吃光越多,发电越多。��Panels sandwich special silicon layers: photons from sunlight knock electrons loose, and electrons flowing one way make electric current. Black means absorbing every color without waste — darker panels eat more light and make more power.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_009�body��很多水果蔬菜都要靠蜜蜂传粉:苹果、草莓、西瓜、黄瓜都会大减产,餐桌上只剩米饭和土豆,冰淇淋也没了香草口味(香草也要虫媒授粉)。爱因斯坦那句没说过的名言虽然夸张,但蜜蜂确实扛着全球三分之一的食物生产。�EBees pollinate much of our produce: apples, strawberries, watermelon and cucumbers would shrink badly, leaving mostly rice and potatoes — even vanilla ice cream suffers since vanilla needs insect pollination too. The famous Einstein warning? He never said it — but bees truly carry about a third of world food production.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�f062721c1129�body���回收多在末端处理废弃物；循环经济从设计端就“消除废物与污染、让材料和产品持续循环、并主动修复自然”，追求源头减量与再利用，而非事后补救。��Recycling treats waste at the end; circular economy designs out waste and pollution from the start, keeps materials and products in use, and regenerates nature—prevention and reuse over after-the-fact fixes.�ans��src��Ellen MacArthur 基金会�Ellen MacArthur Foundation��id�f3eb0d0d794e�body���工厂和汽车排放的二氧化硫、氮氧化物在大气中氧化后，与水汽结合生成硫酸和硝酸，随雨雪落到地面形成酸雨。它会酸化湖泊土壤、腐蚀建筑和伤害森林。��Sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides from industry and vehicles oxidize in the air and combine with moisture to form sulfuric and nitric acids that fall as acid rain. It acidifies lakes and soils, damages buildings and harms forests.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�f7e9555bac47�body�ٺ冰是水变成的，但水结冰时分子会排成疏松的晶体格子，让冰比液态水轻。一大块冰从冰川掉进海里，就会像软木塞一样稳稳地浮在水面上。��Ice is made of water, but when water freezes its molecules form a loose crystal lattice that makes ice lighter than liquid water. When a big chunk breaks from a glacier into the sea, it floats steadily like a cork.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�f7ebf18b07b1�body��5碳循环是碳在大气、海洋、陆地生物圈和岩石圈之间不断交换与迁移的过程，包括光合作用固碳、呼吸与分解释碳、海洋吸收和火山释放等途径。它是一个连接生命、气候和地球化学的全球性循环，维持着大气中二氧化碳的基本平衡。��The carbon cycle is the continuous exchange and movement of carbon among the atmosphere, oceans, land biosphere, and lithosphere, through processes such as photosynthesis fixing carbon, respiration and decomposition releasing it, oceanic uptake, and volcanic emissions. It is a global cycle linking life, climate, and geochemistry and helps maintain the basic balance of atmospheric CO2.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�fdc328b6a78e�body�ٳ它从东北到西北、华北横跨十余省区，像一道林带墙阻挡风沙、保护农田与村庄；是世界上规模最大的生态造林工程，故称"绿色长城"。��Stretching across more than ten provinces from northeast to northwest and north China, it forms a wall of trees blocking wind and sand and shielding farms and villages—the world's largest afforestation project, hence the name.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�fe76dfc74a30�body���IUCN 红色名录是全球最权威的物种灭绝风险评估系统，用无危、近危、易危、濒危、极危、野外灭绝、灭绝等等级标示物种受威胁程度。它帮助各国和机构确定保护优先次序。�The IUCN Red List is the world's most authoritative assessment of extinction risk, ranking species as Least Concern, Near Threatened, Vulnerable, Endangered, Critically Endangered, Extinct in the Wild or Extinct. It guides conservation priorities for governments and groups.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�0143b9b0ef09�body�ِ新家具和油漆会慢慢放出看不见的气味分子，开窗让新鲜空气把它们带走，人在里面呼吸才更安全、更舒服。ٟNew furniture and paint slowly release invisible odor molecules; opening windows lets fresh air carry them away so breathing inside is safer and more pleasant.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�01fb40ec7345�body�ف风推动巨大的叶片转动，像风车一样。叶片连着发电机，转动时就产生电，再通过电线送到家里。ٖWind pushes the big blades around like a giant pinwheel. The blades turn a generator that makes electricity, which travels through wires to your home.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�0ad0490f5d4a�body��u电池里有会毒坏泥土和水的东西，随便扔会让花草和小鱼生病，要放到专门的回收箱里。ِBatteries hold stuff that can poison soil and water; tossing them carelessly makes plants and fish sick, so put them in a special recycling bin.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�0e00a490eaef�body��i大树吸进我们呼出的二氧化碳，吐出新鲜氧气，还能给我们遮阴、让小鸟有家。�oThe big tree breathes in the CO2 we exhale and gives out fresh oxygen, and it shades us and gives birds a home.�ans��src��"千年生态系统评估（2005）�&Millennium Ecosystem Assessment (2005)��id�0fd2ccb450c3�body�ٖ回收是把旧瓶子、旧纸张变成新东西的过程。把垃圾分类放好，工厂更容易把它们做成新产品，少砍树、少挖矿。َRecycling turns old bottles and paper into new things. Sorting trash helps factories make new products more easily, saving trees and minerals.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�123d0532f35c�body��i两家不用各买一台，少用一台就更少挖矿、更省电，机器也用得更勤、不浪费。كTwo homes needn't each buy one; one fewer machine means less mining and power, and it gets used more often instead of sitting idle.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�170fd4ff34b2�body�ٙ很多一次性塑料会被风吹进河流、最终漂到海里，被海龟海鸟误当食物。少用它们，就少一些塑料去伤害海洋动物。١Many single-use plastics blow into rivers and end up at sea, where turtles and birds mistake them for food. Using fewer means less plastic harming ocean animals.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�17c35f0e778c�body�ٟ珊瑚礁是珊瑚虫用身体建成的水下城市，形状像石头的树枝。它为许多小鱼提供藏身之处和食物，就像海底的热闹小区。٫A coral reef is an underwater city built by tiny corals that look like stony branches. It gives many small fish shelter and food, like a busy neighborhood on the seafloor.�ans��src��=全球珊瑚礁监测网络《世界珊瑚礁状况：2020》�NGlobal Coral Reef Monitoring Network, Status of Coral Reefs of the World: 2020��id�1c37ca4a5537�body�ٷ治沙不只是种树，还结合了光伏板遮阴固沙、甘草等沙生药材种植、沙漠旅游，让修复本身产生收益；生态改善与经济增收形成正向循环。��Controlling sand means more than planting trees—solar panels shade and fix sand, sand-tolerant herbs like licorice are grown, and desert tourism pays. Restoration itself earns income, creating a positive loop.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�1d8c09961ca5�body�ٙ蚯蚓在泥土里钻来钻去，会把枯叶变成肥沃的养分，让植物长得更好。它们松过的土软软的，小草和小花都很喜欢。٩Earthworms wiggle through the soil and turn dead leaves into rich food for plants, helping them grow strong. The soil they loosen is soft and cozy for grass and flowers.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�1e1f511fcb39�body�ٴ树篱里有很多落叶和虫子，刺猬可以在里面找吃的，还能卷成小球躲起来睡觉。如果我们留一处乱糟糟的小角落，刺猬就会有安全的家。٭Hedgerows are full of leaves and bugs, so hedgehogs can find food there and curl into a ball to sleep safely. If we leave one messy little corner, hedgehogs get a safe home.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�201d4cf3f13a�body�٪它们是古人按太阳位置和气温、物候总结出的时间表，告诉人们何时播种、收割最合时宜；本质是把气候节律"翻译"成农事指南。٦Summarized from the sun's position and temperature and phenology, they tell when to sow and harvest—essentially translating climate rhythms into a farming calendar.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�224fd310519b�body�٥沙滩和礁石边藏着小贝壳、小虫和海藻，都是螃蟹爱吃的零食。涨潮时海水带来食物，退潮时它们就躲在石头缝里不被干到。��The sand and rocks hide little shells, bugs, and seaweed that crabs love to snack on. When the tide comes in it brings food, and when it goes out the crabs hide in cracks so they don't dry out.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�25d1fef03396�body�ٖ蜘蛛会织网抓住蚊子和小飞虫，帮我们减少讨厌的虫子。花园里有一只蜘蛛，就等于多了一位不用付钱的小帮手。ٜSpiders spin webs that catch mosquitoes and little flies, helping us have fewer pesky bugs. A spider in the garden is like a tiny helper who works for free.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�293e83a75e7b�body���大熊猫住在长满竹子的山上，竹子又多又方便吃，所以它们几乎天天吃竹子。一只大熊猫一天能吃掉十几公斤的竹子，吃饱了才有力气在林子里玩耍。��Giant pandas live on mountains covered with bamboo, so it is easy and plentiful to eat and they munch it almost every day. One panda can eat over ten kilograms of bamboo a day, which gives it energy to play.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�31d219904614�body�ٙ它们在城市里长大，发现人类通常不伤害它们，还常在花坛、食堂边找到种子和面包屑，于是慢慢把城市当成了家。ٗBorn in the city, they learn people usually don't hurt them and find seeds and crumbs near gardens and cafés, so they slowly made the city their home.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�3a4a2040d1fc�body�ٓ雨停后，太阳把水坑晒暖，水面变成看不见的小水汽飞到空气里。风一吹，水坑就慢慢变小，最后干干爽爽了。ٲAfter the rain stops, the sun warms the puddle and turns its surface into invisible vapor that floats into the air. With a little breeze, the puddle shrinks and finally dries up.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3c0e16085dc6�body��l水很宝贵，开着水龙头会白白流走很多干净水，关好它小金鱼和小朋友都有水用。�nWater is precious; a running tap wastes clean water, but turning it off keeps water for the fish and the kids.�ans��src��5联合国《世界水发展报告》（UNESCO WWAP）�/UN World Water Development Report (UNESCO WWAP)��id�40e46e5b8c0b�body���人喂的零食常不健康，会让动物生病、变胖、失去自己找食的能力，还可能聚太多而打架传播疾病。远远看着、不打扰，才是对小动物真正的友好。��Human snacks are often unhealthy, making animals sick, fat and unable to find their own food, and crowds can fight and spread disease. Watching from afar without disturbing is the truly kind thing.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�420d190f2704�body�٥我们吃植物和动物，它们用空气中的二氧化碳长大，这些碳就进入我们的身体。所以你身体里的一部分碳，曾经飘在空气里。٧We eat plants and animals that grew by using carbon dioxide from the air, so that carbon ends up in our bodies. Part of the carbon in you was once floating in the air.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�42b18b9711a0�body�ٱ看种子发芽、叶子舒展、开花结果，能让人每天留意生命的节奏；还能顺手摘来调味，把“买来的食物”变成“自己养出来的食物”。٦Watching seeds sprout, leaves open and fruit form lets you notice life's rhythm daily; you can even pick some for cooking, turning 'bought food' into 'food you grew'.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�44cec6d2fef9�body�ٍ科学家把地球切成很多小方块，让电脑用算式推演风、云和温度怎么变，就像用很多积木拼出未来的样子。ٙScientists split Earth into little boxes and let computers calculate how wind, clouds and temperature change—like building the future from many blocks.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�4aa205151d5a�body�٤因为大熊猫需要的大片连片竹林和森林，也是许多其他动植物的家；守住它的家园，就等于撑开一把"大伞"罩住了无数邻居。٣The large connected bamboo forests pandas need are also home to many other species; protecting their home opens a big "umbrella" that shelters countless neighbors.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4b84c4144792�body���它们肚子里的光是求偶的“信号灯”：雄虫闪出特定节奏，雌虫用同样的闪法回答。越多黑暗、越少灯光的地方，越容易看到这场夏夜的“灯语”。��The light in their belly is a mating signal: males flash a pattern and females answer with the same blink. The darker and less lit the place, the easier to see this summer-night 'light language'.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�507c5b8d4497�body�ٱ我们身体里的每一个小细胞都需要氧气才能工作，呼吸就是把氧气送进去、把废气送出来的过程。如果憋住气太久，身体就会不舒服。٪Every tiny cell in our body needs oxygen to work, and breathing brings oxygen in and sends waste air out. If we hold our breath too long, our body starts to feel unhappy.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�5632c11839f7�body���MPA 是在海域里划定、限制或禁止捕捞和开采的特殊区域，让海洋生态系统休养生息、鱼群恢复。全球正朝着 2030 年保护 30% 海洋的“30×30”目标推进。��An MPA is a sea area where fishing and extraction are limited or banned so ecosystems can recover and fish stocks rebound. The world is moving toward the '30×30' goal of protecting 30% of the ocean by 2030.�ans��src��6《Nature Sustainability》海洋保护区成效研究�'Nature Sustainability MPA effectiveness��id�5d5e078f5fac�body��蜜蜂在采蜜时会把花粉从一朵花带到另一朵花，帮助植物结出果实和种子，这叫“传粉”。许多我们吃的水果、蔬菜和坚果都靠蜜蜂传粉才能长出来。如果蜜蜂变少，很多植物和动物都会受到影响。�When bees collect nectar they carry pollen from one flower to another, helping plants produce fruit and seeds—a process called pollination. Many of the fruits, vegetables, and nuts we eat depend on bee pollination. If bees decline, many plants and animals would be affected.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�64cd7f3baa9e�body�ٍ蜜蜂把花里的花蜜带回蜂巢，慢慢酿成蜂蜜，作为冬天吃的食物。甜甜的蜂蜜，是小蜜蜂辛苦劳动的结果。ِBees carry nectar from flowers back to the hive and slowly turn it into honey to eat during winter. Sweet honey is the hard work of little bees.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6793f1ffbad6�body�٥地上的水被太阳晒热，变成看不见的小水汽飞到天上。在高高的冷空气中，小水汽聚成无数小水滴，就变成我们看到的白云。��The sun warms water on the ground, turning it into tiny invisible vapor that floats up high. In the cold upper air, the vapor gathers into countless little droplets, and we see them as white clouds.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�7225946602ff�body��l红树的根把落叶和泥土稳稳抱住，烂掉也不易被冲走，碳就悄悄埋在泥里很多年。ٌMangrove roots hold leaves and mud firmly; even as they rot, they aren't washed away, so carbon is quietly buried in the mud for many years.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�72c93e181756�body�ٖ蜜蜂在花间飞来飞去时，会把花粉带到别的花上，帮助植物结出果实。没有蜜蜂，许多好吃的水果就长不出来啦。َAs bees flutter between flowers, they carry pollen to other blooms and help plants grow fruit. Without bees, many yummy fruits would not grow.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�72ed203d97df�body�٢少用一个塑料瓶，就少一份石油消耗、制造排放和可能的塑料垃圾；一个耐用的水杯能用上千次，平摊下来既省钱又干净。٢One fewer plastic bottle means less oil, less manufacturing emission and less waste; a durable bottle is reused thousands of times, saving money and mess per use.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7a4e75de6c29�body�ٙ蝙蝠晚上飞出来，用耳朵听着抓住许多蚊子和害虫。一只小蝙蝠一晚上能吃掉好几百只虫子，是我们安静的小卫士。٩Bats fly out at night and use their ears to hear and catch many mosquitoes and pests. One little bat can eat hundreds of bugs in a single night, a quiet guardian for us.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7ac96d4570cb�body�ٙ造纸要用到树木里的纤维，所以每造一张纸，都可能少了一小片森林。把纸两面用完、做好回收，就能少砍一些树。َPaper is made from the fibers in trees, so every sheet may mean a little less forest. Using both sides and recycling means we cut fewer trees.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�7ccbc798f7c7�body�ٟ国家公园是受法律保护的、留给野生动物和自然景观的大片土地。通常由国家政府划定和管理，让动物和森林安全生长。ٲA national park is a large area of land protected by law for wildlife and nature. Usually a national government sets it aside and manages it so animals and forests can stay safe.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�82b06ee76c9c�body�ِ纸、塑料、果皮各有各的去处，分开丢才能被好好回收或堆肥。分类就像给垃圾找对家，地球也会轻松一点。��Paper, plastic, and peels each have their own place, and sorting them lets them be recycled or composted properly. Sorting is like finding the right home for trash, and Earth feels a bit lighter.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�86f3cd567987�body�٢它们在为冬天囤粮：把坚果埋进土里，记性好的能找回来吃；有些被忘记的还会发芽长成小树，松鼠其实也在帮森林播种。ٚThey store food for winter, burying nuts and remembering many of the spots; forgotten ones can sprout into trees, so squirrels also help plant the forest.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8ccda54ffe28�body��u灯亮着就要用电，而电很多来自烧煤和天然气。随手关灯，既省钱，又少给空气添麻烦。نA lit lamp uses electricity, and much of it comes from burning coal and gas. Switching off saves money and gives the air less trouble.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8e1170cef963�body�٨人和小动物都需要不被吵闹打扰的地方：可以静静看书、听鸟叫，也让胆小的鸟虫敢来安家。安静，也是城市里很贵的一种绿。٠People and small animals need a break from noise: to read, hear birds and let shy creatures settle. Quiet is a kind of green that's rare and valuable in cities.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8e7866a7a92c�body���退潮把海水暂时退走，原本藏在浅水里的螃蟹、贝壳和海星就露在了湿沙上；这是去海边“赶海”看小生命的好时候，但记得轻轻放下、别带走它们。��The retreating tide temporarily leaves behind crabs, shells and starfish that hid in shallow water, exposed on wet sand—a great time for a gentle 'tide-pool' look, but put them back softly and don't take them.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8eea261e2382�body�٢让城市像海绵一样吸收、蓄存、净化并再利用雨水，用透水铺装、湿地、绿地代替单纯“快排”，缓解内涝并回补地下水。��Make the city absorb, store, clean and reuse rainwater like a sponge—using permeable pavement, wetlands and green space instead of just 'drain fast'—curbing floods and recharging groundwater.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�92b27f4ea8e1�body�٨太阳光看起来是白色的，其实藏着红橙黄绿青蓝紫七种颜色。雨后的小水珠像小棱镜，把阳光分开，就在天上画出弯弯的彩虹。��Sunlight looks white but hides seven colors — red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet. Tiny raindrops after a storm act like little prisms, splitting the light into a curved rainbow.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�9d9df9a8c8d0�body�ٷ风力机用叶片捕获风的动能，带动发电机转子旋转产生电能。海上风电因风速更稳、单机更大，近年增长尤其快，是低碳电力的重要组成。��Wind turbines capture the kinetic energy of wind with their blades, spinning a generator rotor to make electricity. Offshore wind has grown especially fast thanks to steadier winds and larger turbines, becoming a key part of low-carbon power.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9e0823720e9a�body�ٟ可以。风车、太阳能板发的电会汇进大电网，再送到千家万户；你按下开关时，可能正用着千里外戈壁或海上的清洁电。ٲYes. Wind turbines and solar panels feed a big grid that delivers power to homes; when you flip a switch, you might be using clean electricity made far away in deserts or at sea.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9ed5b3f3b69b�body�ٟ游隼把高楼当悬崖筑巢、捕食城市里的鸽子和燕子；狐狸、貉、乌鸦也适应了人类环境，靠垃圾和灯光找到食物与住所。٫Peregrine falcons nest on skyscrapers like cliffs and hunt city pigeons and swifts; foxes, raccoon dogs and crows also adapt, using litter and lights for food and shelter.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a1402e420224�body��{种菜养牛要用水、用地、排碳；剩饭倒掉，这些努力和白白的排放都浪费了。吃完不剩最省。ٌGrowing food uses water, land and emits carbon; tossing leftovers wastes all that effort and emissions. Finishing your plate saves the most.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a40708120280�body��l大树给小鸟做窝，花给蜜蜂吃蜜，大家互相帮忙，森林才热热闹闹、健康又安全。�vBig trees give birds nests, flowers feed bees, they all help each other, so the forest stays lively, healthy and safe.�ans��src��/Miller, G.T. 与 Spoolman, S.《环境科学》�2Miller, G.T. & Spoolman, S., Environmental Science��id�a4f6d7b90480�body�ٜ风轻轻吹过海面，把海水推起一道道小波浪。波浪你追我赶地涌向岸边，就变成了我们在沙滩上看到的一层层白浪花。٣The wind gently blows across the sea and pushes the water into little waves. The waves chase each other to the shore and become the white foam we see on the beach.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�acedf63aa3a4�body��{工厂和汽车排出的气体跑到天上，和水汽混在一起变成酸酸的水落下来，会弄疼叶子和石头。�xGases from factories and cars mix with cloud water high in the sky and fall as sour rain that can hurt leaves and stone.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ae882b460c5d�body���生物群系是在相似气候下形成的大型生态区域，以其典型植被和动物为特征，如热带雨林、沙漠、苔原、温带草原。同一生物群系在不同大陆可以面貌相似但物种不同。�A biome is a large ecological region shaped by a similar climate, recognized by its characteristic plants and animals, such as tropical rainforest, desert, tundra or temperate grassland. The same biome on different continents can look alike yet host different species.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�bf065bd1f40b�body��o风推动风车的大叶片转动，带动里面的小机器发电，电顺着线跑到家里，灯就亮啦。ٍWind pushes the big blades, which spin a little machine that makes electricity, and the electricity travels through wires to light your lamp.�ans��src��0国际能源署（IEA）《世界能源展望》�7International Energy Agency (IEA), World Energy Outlook��id�ccd643129c25�body�ِ大树像一把大伞挡住太阳，叶子还会“出汗”（蒸腾）把热气带走，所以树荫下比太阳直晒的马路凉快很多。٠The big tree is like an umbrella blocking the sun, and its leaves 'sweat' (transpire), carrying heat away—so the shade is much cooler than sun-baked pavement.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d1baeb28a1ae�body�ٞ因为老辈人说那是"风水林"，动不得；这套规矩虽带迷信色彩，却正好把一片林子保护了下来，让鸟、菌、水土都受益。٪Elders call it the "feng shui wood" and say it must not be touched; though superstitious, the rule protected a patch of forest that benefits birds, fungi, soil and water.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�d6e7d953e85f�body�ٞ狼少了鹿就多，鹿多了草就被啃光；捕食者像"刹车"，一旦松开，下游就会失控式增长，这正是食物链相互牵制的体现。٪Fewer wolves means more deer, which overgraze grass; predators are the "brake," and releasing it lets the lower link surge—showing how food chains constrain each other.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�dd123ce8f480�body��`水流进湿地时变慢，泥沙沉到水底，植物还能吸走脏东西，让水变清亮。�oWhen water flows into a wetland it slows down, mud settles, and plants soak up dirt, leaving the water clearer.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�de25a7218479�body�ٜ雨水灌满土壤缝隙，蚯蚓在地下喘不过气，就爬到地面呼吸；它们翻土能让泥土更松软、更肥沃，是花园里的小园丁。٪Rain fills the soil's gaps and worms can't breathe underground, so they surface to breathe; by tunneling they loosen and enrich the soil—little gardeners of the garden.�ans��src��N达尔文《腐殖土的形成——兼论蚯蚓习性》，John Murray，1881�_Charles Darwin, The Formation of Vegetable Mould through the Action of Worms, John Murray, 1881��id�ded09cfecae9�body�ل口罩里的细密滤网能挡住灰尘和很小的脏颗粒，让进到鼻子和肺里的脏东西变少，保护我们的身体。مThe fine filter in a mask blocks dust and tiny dirty particles, so fewer of them reach your nose and lungs and your body stays safer.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�e3bb00a065ce�body�ٙ可以想象成一块慢慢变小的小蛋糕：全世界一起吃，吃完了就不能再多吃，否则地球会太热。所以我们要省着点用。ٙThink of it as a shrinking cake shared by the whole world: once it's eaten, we can't have more or the planet gets too hot. So we should use it sparingly.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ea0eab738de4�body�٨北极放大效应让北极升温速度达到全球平均的三到四倍。冰雪融化后露出颜色更深的海面，吸收更多阳光，使温度进一步上升。��Arctic amplification makes the Arctic warm about three to four times faster than the global average. As ice and snow melt, darker ocean surfaces are exposed and absorb more sunlight, driving further warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ea9090af3ed5�body�٢一克肥沃土壤里可能有数十亿计的细菌，还有真菌、原生动物等，数量比地球上的人还多，它们是土壤健康的“小工人”。ُA gram of fertile soil can hold billions of bacteria plus fungi and protists—more than all humans on Earth—the tiny workers of soil health.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ed9201c4ea5a�body�ٓ我们的身体大半都是水，喝水能帮助运送营养、把废物排出去。出汗和尿尿会带走水分，所以每天都要补回来。ٝMost of our body is water, and drinking helps carry nutrients around and wash waste out. We lose water when we sweat and pee, so we need to refill every day.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_25_001�body���香蕉皮和西瓜皮一样,都是「厨余」,埋进土里几周就变成肥料喂大树;塑料瓶是「可回收」,要送去工厂洗干净变成新瓶子。分开放,它们才能找到自己的家。٫Peels are kitchen waste — buried, they become plant food in weeks. Bottles are recyclables sent to factories to become new bottles. Sorting helps each find its own home.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_002�body�ٽ开着水龙头刷牙,两分钟会流走十几升水,够装满一大盆!地球上的水虽然多,能喝的淡水却像一小勺。关上龙头,刷完牙再开,你就是个节水小卫士。��A running tap pours out more than ten litres in two minutes — enough to fill a big basin! Earth has lots of water but only a spoonful is drinkable. Tap off while you brush — you are a water-saving hero.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_003�body�ٰ树叶上毛茸茸的,还能吞下空气里的小灰尘;树吸进二氧化碳,呼出我们需要的氧气。一棵大树就像一台安静的巨大空气净化器,还不用电!ٯFuzzy leaves catch dust from the air. Trees breathe in carbon dioxide and puff out the oxygen we need. One big tree is a quiet giant air purifier that never needs electricity!�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_004�body���刺猬的妈妈正在草丛里等它回家吃晚饭!野生动物有自己的家和爸爸妈妈,被人抱着会害怕得发抖,离开野外它还会生病。我们远远看它,就是对它最好的喜欢。��Hedgehog mama is waiting in the grass for dinner time! Wild animals have their own homes and parents; being held scares them and life indoors makes them sick. Watching quietly from far away is the best love.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_005�body�ټ植物和我们一样要吃饭,它们的饭是阳光!叶子会用阳光做营养。哪边亮,它就把叶子伸向哪边,像小朋友朝着香喷喷的饭菜转头一样,这叫向光性。��Plants eat too — sunlight turns into their food inside their leaves! Wherever light comes from, they stretch their leaves toward it, just like you turning toward yummy dinner. It is called phototropism.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�f1da6812d590�body��r做新玩具要挖矿、用电、运很远；修一修就能继续玩，省材料又省能量，垃圾也变少。ىMaking a new toy needs mining, energy and long shipping; fixing lets you keep playing, saving materials and energy and making less trash.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f71775bd2edd�body�ِ树荫遮挡阳光直接降温，叶片蒸腾把液态水变成水汽会带走热量，两者叠加能明显降低局部气温、缓解热岛。٩Tree shade blocks sunlight directly, and leaf transpiration turns liquid water into vapor, removing heat; together they lower local temperature and ease the heat island.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�fa2f65c340eb�body�ي秋天果子很多，松鼠会把坚果埋进土里留着冬天吃。有时它们忘记了，埋下的种子就会长出新的小树苗。ٟIn autumn there is lots of food, so squirrels bury nuts in the soil to save for winter. Sometimes they forget, and the buried seeds grow into new little trees.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�fc894d697f5f�body�ٖ太阳像一个巨大的火球，不停地把光和热送到地球上。照到我们身上的阳光，就把暖暖的能量传给了皮肤和衣服。ٟThe sun is like a giant ball of fire that keeps sending light and heat to Earth. The sunlight that reaches us passes its warm energy into our skin and clothes.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�004844ce4dbd�body���减缓旨在减少温室气体排放或增强碳汇以降低升温幅度，针对的是因果链条的源头；适应则是对已发生或预期的气候影响作出调整以减轻损害。二者互补，单靠适应无法阻止长期变暖。��Mitigation seeks to cut greenhouse-gas emissions or enhance sinks to limit warming at the source, while adaptation adjusts to actual or expected impacts to reduce harm. They are complementary; adaptation alone cannot stop long-term warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�004ef087c5c1�body���植树能增加碳汇、改善生态，但单靠造林难以抵消全部化石燃料排放，且碳储存可被火灾逆转。选址不当还可能减少反照率或挤占粮食用地。造林应与深度减排并举，而非替代减排。�	Planting trees adds sinks and improves ecology, but afforestation alone cannot offset all fossil emissions, and stored carbon can be reversed by fire. Poor siting may also lower albedo or squeeze farmland. Afforestation should accompany deep cuts, not replace them.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�00aa29f7eb9d�body��h生态位是一个物种在生态系统中做什么的完整画像，包括它吃什么、何时活动、住在哪一层、与谁竞争或互利。相近物种通过“生态位分化”错开利用资源，比如不同鸟在树冠的不同高度觅食，就能避免直接竞争、和平共存。理解生态位，是保护和管理生物多样性的基础。��A niche is the full job description of a species in an ecosystem — what it eats, when it is active, which layer it inhabits, and whom it competes with or helps. Similar species coexist through niche differentiation: birds that feed at different heights of the same tree, for example, avoid direct competition. Understanding niches underpins biodiversity conservation and management.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�01757ebaf25b�body���约八成海洋塑料来自陆地，经河流和城市径流带入，其余来自渔业丢弃的渔网和海上航运。亚洲几条大型河流是重要输运通道。源头减塑和完善沿岸垃圾收集比事后打捞更有效。�#About 80 percent of marine plastic originates on land and reaches the sea via rivers and urban runoff, with the rest from discarded fishing nets and shipping. Several large Asian rivers are major transport pathways. Source reduction and better coastal waste collection beat post-hoc cleanup.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�01c5152e44bb�body���政府先设定总排放上限并向企业分配或拍卖排放配额。企业若减排低于配额可出售余量，超标则需购买，从而以最低成本实现总量控制。配额逐年收紧以推动整体减排。�The government sets a total emission cap and allocates or auctions allowances to firms. Companies that emit below their allowance can sell the surplus, while those exceeding it must buy, achieving the cap at lowest cost. The cap is tightened over time to drive overall reductions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�01efa59bcbef�body���每次机械回收都会使聚合物链变短、引入杂质，导致强度下降和颜色变差。因此回收料常被做成要求较低的产品，如花盆、管道而非食品级包装。要维持品质需补充新料或采用化学回收。�1Each mechanical recycle shortens polymer chains and introduces impurities, lowering strength and colour quality. Recyclate is therefore often made into lower-demand products like planters or pipes rather than food-grade packaging. Maintaining quality needs virgin feedstock blending or chemical recycling.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�029e58df84c3�body�ْ它供给中线调水，水质直接关系北方饮水安全；因此库区要严控污染、退养、造林，把"水干净"放在产量之前。ٿIt feeds the middle route, so its quality directly affects northern drinking water; the area strictly controls pollution, removes fish pens and plants trees, putting clean water before yield.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�02bd70d05a1d�body�ټ各国自主提交减排与适应目标并定期更新，靠“全球盘点”推动加码；问题在于当前 NDC 加总仍远高于 1.5–2°C 路径，且执行与核算口径不一。��Each country submits its own mitigation/adaptation target and updates it, with a global stocktake pushing ambition up; the problem is current NDCs sum far above the 1.5–2°C path and accounting varies.�ans��src��(《巴黎协定》(UNFCCC, 2015) 第4条�)Paris Agreement (UNFCCC, 2015), Article 4��id�03744a60b2af�body��生物圈保护区是联合国教科文组织“人与生物圈计划”认定的区域，旨在协调生物多样性保护与人类可持续发展。它通常划分为核心区、缓冲区和过渡区三个功能区域。全球已有数百个生物圈保护区分布在各个国家。�A biosphere reserve is a site designated under UNESCO's Man and the Biosphere Programme to reconcile biodiversity conservation with sustainable human development. It is typically divided into core, buffer, and transition zones. Hundreds of biosphere reserves now exist across the world.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�03b63718e08a�body�٥拆除废弃水坝和恢复自然弯曲河道可恢复鱼类洄游通道与洪泛湿地连通性。这类措施常显著提升生物多样性与河流自净能力。��Removing obsolete dams and restoring natural meanders reopens fish migration routes and reconnects floodplain wetlands. Such measures often markedly raise biodiversity and the river's self-purification capacity.�ans��src��*《环境科学》河流生态修复研究�-Environmental Science China river restoration��id�043d79ecb4b4�body�ٱ减缓是减少排放、从源头降温；适应是面对已发生的气候变化，调整社会与自然系统以降低伤害，如海堤、耐旱作物、城市绿地降温。پMitigation cuts emissions to cool the source; adaptation adjusts societies and ecosystems to cope with changes already underway—e.g., seawalls, drought-tolerant crops, urban green cooling.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�046cf536f85a�body�ٷ污染和毁林发生在生产端、好处却在消费端，地理与账本都把它们隔开了；我们买到便宜货，代价却由远方的空气、水土和人或默默承担。پPollution and deforestation happen at production while benefits land at consumption, separated by distance and accounting; we get cheap goods while distant air, water and people quietly pay.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0564f7297a1f�body���绿地通过植被截留与土壤入渗削减地表径流、延缓洪峰，并借助蒸腾调节局地湿度。合理布局的绿地网络还能过滤部分雨水污染物，减轻受纳水体的富营养化压力。�Green spaces intercept rainfall and promote infiltration, reducing runoff and delaying flood peaks, while transpiration moderates local humidity. Well-placed green networks also filter some stormwater pollutants, easing eutrophication pressure on receiving waters.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0567aa57744a�body��T环境信息披露让投资者、消费者和监管者看清企业的气候风险与污染责任，帮助资金流向低碳转型。全球趋势正从自愿走向强制：ISSB国际准则和多数证券交易所的披露要求，使“碳数据”变得与财务报表同等重要，同时也倒逼企业设定减碳目标并真正落实。��Environmental disclosure lets investors, consumers, and regulators see corporate climate risk and pollution liabilities, steering capital toward the low-carbon transition. The global trend runs from voluntary to mandatory: ISSB standards and most stock-exchange requirements make carbon data as important as financial statements, and also push firms to set and actually deliver reduction targets.�ans��src��.国际可持续发展准则理事会（ISSB）�ISSB (IFRS Foundation)��id�060b17597886�body��碳通量指碳在单位时间内从一个储库转移到另一个储库的速率，如光合作用吸碳、呼吸与燃烧排碳。理解通量大小与方向是评估碳汇强弱的关键。通量可正可负，正负之差决定某区域是源还是汇。�IA carbon flux is the rate at which carbon moves from one reservoir to another over time, such as uptake by photosynthesis or release by respiration and burning. Understanding its size and direction is key to judging sink strength. A flux can be positive or negative; their difference decides whether a region is a source or sink.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�066abf9aa25a�body�٫黑碳颜色深、吸光强，降低冰雪反照率，使其吸收更多阳光升温；它还能促进冰内吸热与早期融水，放大北极与高山冰川的退缩。��Black carbon is dark and absorbs light, lowering ice albedo so it soaks up more sun and warms; it also promotes internal heating and early meltwater, amplifying Arctic and mountain glacier loss.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�06ff4ae1d354�body�ٵ未必。纸吸管生产耗水耗能、常含胶黏涂层难回收，若只用一次就丢，优势有限；真正的减塑是“不用吸管”或自带可洗的钢/硅胶吸管。��Not necessarily. Paper straws use water and energy and often have glue coatings that hinder recycling; used once, the edge is small. The real cut is no straw, or a washable steel/silicone one you bring.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0729acd3497e�body�١PFAS 用于塑料的不粘、防水和阻燃，极难降解且可在生物体内累积。它们在塑料回收中还会被带入新制品，扩大暴露途径。��PFAS are used in plastics for non-stick, water-repellent, and flame-retardant properties; they are persistent and bioaccumulative. Recycling can carry them into new products, widening exposure routes.�ans��src��"《Science》全氟化合物综述�Science PFAS review��id�0768f830cda4�body��␀DDT 化学结构稳定、脂溶性强，在环境中半衰期可达数年，并借助大气和洋流从低纬使用区迁移到极地，在食物链高端生物体内生物放大。斯德哥尔摩公约已将其列为首批受控持久性有机污染物。�)DDT is chemically stable and highly lipophilic, with an environmental half-life of years, and it migrates via atmosphere and oceans from low-latitude use areas to the poles, biomagnifying in top predators. The Stockholm Convention lists it among the first controlled persistent organic pollutants.�ans��src��lRachel Carson,《Silent Spring》Houghton Mifflin,1962;中译《寂静的春天》上海译文出版社,2011�iR. Carson, Silent Spring, Houghton Mifflin, 1962; Chinese ed. Shanghai Translation Publishing House, 2011��id�08340e13141a�body��	1.5℃指相对于工业化前水平，努力将全球平均升温控制在1.5摄氏度以内。相比2℃，把升温限制在1.5℃可显著降低极端高温、海平面上升和生态损失的风险。实现它需要在本世纪中叶前后达到净零排放。�%The 1.5°C refers to limiting global average warming to 1.5 degrees Celsius above preindustrial levels. Compared with 2°C, holding at 1.5°C substantially reduces risks of extreme heat, sea level rise, and ecological loss. Achieving it requires reaching net-zero emissions around mid-century.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�098de2e4bccb�body���约七成农作物依赖动物传粉，蜜蜂、蝴蝶等数量下降会直接降低果实和种子产量。这威胁坚果、水果和部分油料作物的供给并推高价格。保护野花带和减少杀虫剂是缓解途径。�Roughly 70 percent of crops rely on animal pollination, so declines in bees and butterflies directly cut fruit and seed yields. This threatens supplies of nuts, fruits and some oil crops and raises prices. Protecting wildflower strips and cutting pesticides help.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�0b154f1c14f3�body��$不同温室气体增温能力和存留时间差异巨大，难以直接用质量比较。CO2e以二氧化碳为基准，按给定时间窗（如100年）的增温潜势把其他气体折算成等效的CO2质量。这使排放清单和政策目标可以用单一单位衡量总温室效应。�eGreenhouse gases differ greatly in warming power and lifetime, so they cannot be compared by mass directly. CO2e uses carbon dioxide as a reference and converts other gases into an equivalent CO2 mass using a warming potential over a set horizon, such as 100 years. This lets emission inventories and policy targets express total warming impact in one unit.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0b86147ab71c�body�ٽ优势是能在种群密度很低时检出、覆盖大面积水域；局限是DNA可随风或水流远距离漂散造成假阳性，且难以区分活体与残留，需结合传统调查。��Strength: detection at very low density and broad water-area coverage. Limits: DNA can drift far via wind/current causing false positives, and it can't distinguish live from residual—best paired with traditional surveys.�ans��src��&《Nature Sustainability》eDNA 综述�!Nature Sustainability eDNA review��id�0b8fcc65b709�body�٫江豚处在食物链上层、对水质和饵料鱼敏感，它的数量回升说明整条江的饵料、水质和连通性都在变好，是生态系统复苏的信号。ٰAs an upper-food-chain animal sensitive to water quality and prey fish, a rising porpoise count signals better prey, water and connectivity—a sign the whole river is healing.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�0dc13c1b478d�body��S农田化肥流失和生活污水把过量的氮、磷带入湖泊，藻类便大量暴发，水面一片绿色。藻类死亡后被细菌分解，耗尽水中氧气，导致鱼虾缺氧死亡、水体发臭，这就是富营养化。治理的关键在源头减磷控氮，比如截污、控制农业面源污染和恢复湿地缓冲带。��Runoff of crop fertilisers and discharge of sewage carry excess nitrogen and phosphorus into lakes, triggering algal blooms that turn the water green. When the algae die, bacteria decompose them and exhaust the oxygen, suffocating fish and making the water smelly — eutrophication. The cure lies at the source: intercepting pollution, limiting agricultural nutrient runoff and restoring wetland buffer strips.�ans��src�ً《Nutrients, eutrophication and harmful algal blooms along the freshwater to marine continuum》,WIREs Water,2020 (DOI: 10.1002/wat2.1453)و'Nutrients, eutrophication and harmful algal blooms along the freshwater to marine continuum', WIREs Water, 2020, DOI: 10.1002/wat2.1453��id�0ddbac34f569�body���它利用曝气池中大量微生物群落分解有机物，微生物聚成絮体（污泥）并沉降分离，清水排出、剩余污泥再处理。核心是利用“生物”吃掉污染物。��It uses dense microbial communities in an aerated tank to break down organics; microbes clump into flocs (sludge) that settle and separate, releasing clean water while excess sludge is treated. The key is biology eating pollutants.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�0e5e39584740�body���它模仿大型火山喷发（如 1991 年皮纳图博火山），向平流层注入硫酸盐等微粒，反射部分阳光使地表降温。问题是它不减少温室气体，海洋酸化照旧。��It mimics big volcanic eruptions (e.g., Pinatubo 1991) by injecting sulfate particles into the stratosphere to reflect sunlight and cool the surface, but it does not cut greenhouse gases, so ocean acidification continues.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0fa36cf11b00�body���食物系统占全球温室气体排放约三分之一，范围涵盖农业、土地利用、运输与食物浪费。与此同时，全球既存在营养不良，也存在严重的食物浪费，两者并存。转型路径包括减少浪费、适度转向植物性饮食、推广再生农业和改善冷链。这些措施既能减排又能提升营养安全，被IPCC视为低成本、高潜力的减碳路径。��Food systems account for roughly one-third of global greenhouse gas emissions, spanning farming, land use, transport, and food waste. At the same time, malnutrition and food waste coexist worldwide. Transformation paths include cutting waste, shifting diets moderately toward plants, scaling regenerative agriculture, and improving cold chains. These measures both cut emissions and improve nutrition security, which is why IPCC treats them as a low-cost, high-potential mitigation path.�ans��src��%《Science》食物系统排放研究�Science food system emissions��id�108e544118fd�body���TOD 围绕轨道交通与公交枢纽进行高密度、混合功能的紧凑开发，缩短出行距离并提升公共交通分担率。这能降低私人小汽车依赖与人均出行碳排放，同时提高土地与基础设施效率。�␀TOD concentrates high-density, mixed-use development around rail and bus hubs, shortening trip distances and raising transit mode share. It cuts reliance on private cars and per-capita transport emissions while improving land and infrastructure efficiency.�ans��src�ٶCervero, Kockelman,《Travel demand and the 3Ds: Density, diversity, and design》,Transportation Research Part D: Transport and Environment,1997 (DOI: 10.1016/s1361-9209(97)00009-6)ٴCervero, Kockelman, 'Travel demand and the 3Ds: Density, diversity, and design', Transportation Research Part D: Transport and Environment, 1997, DOI: 10.1016/s1361-9209(97)00009-6��id�10c56ccc45fb�body���红外相机在动物经过时自动触发拍摄，可全天候、大范围记录物种出现与相对丰度，并减少人为干扰。配合占用模型，能估算物种分布与活动节律，是中大型地栖动物监测的标配工具。�$Camera traps auto-trigger when animals pass, recording species presence and relative abundance across large areas day and night with minimal disturbance. Combined with occupancy models, they estimate distribution and activity patterns and are standard for medium-to-large terrestrial mammals.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�114ff1e92659�body���富营养化是氮、磷等营养盐过量导致藻类暴发性繁殖，消耗溶解氧并造成鱼虾死亡。它常源于化肥流失和生活污水。治理包括控源截污、生态浮岛、人工湿地和适量打捞藻华。�/Eutrophication is the explosive growth of algae caused by excess nitrogen and phosphorus, which depletes dissolved oxygen and kills fish. It usually stems from fertiliser runoff and sewage. Management includes source control, ecological floating islands, constructed wetlands and targeted algae removal.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�128caa448c47�body��活性炭内部有大量微孔，比表面积极大，能通过物理吸附捕获水中的有机物、余氯和异味分子。它常用于自来水深度处理和净水器滤芯。吸附饱和后需要更换或再生，否则会释放已吸附的污染物。�3Activated carbon has a huge internal pore surface area that physically adsorbs organic matter, residual chlorine and odour molecules from water. It is widely used in advanced tap-water treatment and filter cartridges. Once saturated it must be replaced or regenerated, or it can release captured pollutants.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�13935f6f2a22�body���地球碳主要储存在岩石圈（如石灰岩）、海洋、土壤、植被和大气中。大气碳库虽然相对较小，却直接调控气候。人类活动正快速把地下的岩石碳（化石燃料）转移到大气之中。�*Earth's carbon is stored mainly in the lithosphere (e.g., limestone), oceans, soils, vegetation, and the atmosphere. The atmospheric pool is relatively small but directly regulates climate. Human activity is rapidly moving carbon from underground rock reservoirs (fossil fuels) into the atmosphere.�ans��src��"全球碳计划;《自然》综述�$Global Carbon Project;Nature Reviews��id�13b61abe422e�body���EPR要求生产者对产品整个生命周期、尤其废弃后的回收处理负责（常通过缴费给回收基金）。它把末端成本前移，激励企业设计更易回收、更耐用的产品。��EPR makes producers responsible for a product's whole life cycle, especially end-of-life takeback and recycling (often via fees to a fund). It shifts end-of-life costs upstream, incentivizing recyclable, durable design.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�13dc8387b295�body��挥发性有机物是在常温下易挥发的碳氢化合物，参与臭氧和二次气溶胶生成。室外主要来自机动车、溶剂使用和石化工业；室内则来自涂料、胶黏剂、清洁剂和燃烧。通风和源头选低VOC产品是控制关键。�1Volatile organic compounds are carbon compounds that readily evaporate at room temperature and help form ozone and secondary aerosols. Outdoors they come from vehicles, solvents and petrochemicals; indoors from paints, adhesives, cleaners and combustion. Ventilation and low-VOC products are key controls.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�14d7e0bd8a35�body��z垂直农业在室内多层种植，用水雾或滴灌循环供水，单位产量的耗水可比大田减少九成以上；近密闭环境几乎不需要农药，生产贴近城市还能缩短运输。局限是照明与温控耗电高、建设成本大，因此目前适合叶菜等高价值短周期作物，是城市食物系统的一部分，而不是大田农业的替代。��Vertical farming grows crops in stacked indoor layers with mist or drip recirculation, using over 90% less water per unit of produce than open fields; near-closed environments need almost no pesticides, and city-sited farms shorten transport. The limits are high electricity use (lighting and climate control) and capital cost, so it suits high-value short-cycle crops like leafy greens — part of urban food systems, not a replacement for farmland.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�1541bac58aa4�body�ٕ长途迁徙耗能巨大，候鸟需要在湿地补充食物与体力；一旦驿站消失，整条迁徙路线就会"断链"，种群随之崩溃。وLong migrations burn huge energy, so birds must refuel at wetlands; lose a stopover and the whole flyway breaks, collapsing populations.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�15459b43dc9b�body��基于自然的解决方案利用或模仿生态系统来应对环境与社会挑战，如用湿地净化污水、用红树林防灾。它兼顾生态效益和人类福祉，比纯工程手段常更经济且具韧性。实施需尊重生态完整性和当地社区权益。�DNature-based solutions use or mimic ecosystems to meet environmental and social challenges, like wetlands cleaning wastewater or mangroves buffering disasters. They deliver ecology and human wellbeing, often cheaper and more resilient than pure engineering. Implementation must respect ecological integrity and local rights.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�15809fd2df3f�body�٫冰盖陆地冰入海直接增加海水体积；此外质量损失改变重力与地壳回弹，使海平面分布不均。二者是当前海平面上升的主因之一。٫Land ice entering the ocean directly adds volume; mass loss also shifts gravity and crustal rebound, making sea-level rise uneven. Both are leading causes of current rise.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�159f9e185e5d�body�م星载光谱仪可反演 CO2、CH4 和 N2O 等的柱平均浓度，定位超排放点源。例如甲烷热点可指向油气泄漏。٩Spaceborne spectrometers retrieve column-averaged CO2, CH4, and N2O, locating super-emitter point sources. Methane hotspots, for example, can point to oil and gas leaks.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�16b04ab6a4c8�body�ٺ它标出产品从原料、制造、运输到废弃全过程的温室气体排放量（常折算CO2当量）。帮助消费者比较选择，但方法学与边界需透明以防误导。��It states a product's lifecycle GHG emissions (often CO2-equivalent) from material, manufacturing, transport to disposal. It helps consumers compare, but methodology and boundaries must be transparent to avoid misleading claims.�ans��src��国际标准化组织（ISO）,《DIN EN ISO 14067:2019-02, Treibhausgase_- Carbon Footprint von Produkten_- Anforderungen an und Leitlinien für Quantifizierung (ISO_14067:2018); Deutsche und Englische Fassung EN_ISO_14067:2018》,ISO 14067:2018 (DOI: 10.31030/2851769)��ISO, 'DIN EN ISO 14067:2019-02, Treibhausgase_- Carbon Footprint von Produkten_- Anforderungen an und Leitlinien für Quantifizierung (ISO_14067:2018); Deutsche und Englische Fassung EN_ISO_14067:2018', ISO 14067:2018, DOI: 10.31030/2851769��id�16ffe6cb339d�body�٥单一草坪几乎不产花蜜，而野花草甸提供连续的花期和多样花粉，是传粉昆虫的食堂与产房；少割几次还能留住幼虫和草籽。ٺA monoculture lawn gives almost no nectar, while a meadow offers successive blooms and diverse pollen—a cafeteria and nursery for pollinators; mowing less often keeps larvae and seeds.�ans��src��+IPBES《传粉者全球评估报告》,2016�7IPBES, The 2016 Global Assessment Report on Pollinators��id�173c3498d240�body���全球可可很大一部分来自科特迪瓦、加纳，老种植园退化后常向原始森林要新地，推高砍伐。支持可追溯、不毁林的可可，能保护大猩猩等栖息地。��Much cocoa comes from Côte d'Ivoire and Ghana, where aging farms often push into pristine forest for new land, raising deforestation. Traceable, deforestation-free cocoa protects gorilla habitats.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�18c3829f9dee�body��#PET饮料瓶是单一材质、易清洗且回收价值高，可重新造粒做成纤维或新瓶。多数保鲜膜是低密度聚乙烯或聚氯乙烯，常沾油污、与其他塑料混杂，且薄膜分选困难，经济价值低。材质混杂和分选成本是薄膜难回收的关键。�0PET drink bottles are single-material, easy to clean and valuable, so they can be re-pelletised into fibres or new bottles. Most cling films are LDPE or PVC, often greasy, mixed with other plastics and hard to sort as films, with low economic value. Material mixing and sorting cost are the key barriers.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1949eae27b25�body��裂变是重原子核（如铀）分裂释放能量，是现有核电站的原理。聚变则是轻核（如氢同位素）结合成更重核释放能量，是太阳的能量来源。聚变燃料更丰富、几乎无长寿命核废料，但尚需攻克持续点火难题。�#Fission splits heavy nuclei like uranium to release energy and powers today's reactors. Fusion joins light nuclei such as hydrogen isotopes into heavier ones, the process fueling the Sun. Fusion has more abundant fuel and little long-lived waste, but sustaining ignition remains a challenge.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�19ba7af4bc9e�body��h渔业科学家基于种群评估估算可持续产量，政府据此设定总允许捕捞量（TAC），再分配给各渔船的捕捞配额，把“公海悲剧”变成可管理的分配。关键在于配额必须依据最新种群数据动态调整，并配合渔具限制与监测执法；只要科学与执法到位，多数鱼类种群都可以恢复。�Fishery scientists estimate sustainable yield from stock assessments; governments set the Total Allowable Catch (TAC) and allocate quotas to vessels, turning a tragedy of the commons into managed allocation. The key is adjusting quotas dynamically to the latest stock data, alongside gear restrictions and monitoring; with sound science and enforcement, most fish stocks can recover.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�1a4131cb3164�body��碳税由政府设定固定价格、排放量多寡随市场调整；碳交易由政府设定总量、价格由市场决定。前者价格可预期但减排量不确定，后者减排量确定而价格易波动，二者常与免费配额等过渡安排搭配。�-A carbon tax fixes the price and lets emissions vary with the market, whereas cap-and-trade fixes the total and lets the price float. The former gives price certainty but uncertain abatement, the latter guarantees abatement but volatile prices; both are often paired with transitional free allowances.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1a8cb3c71e19�body�ٷ化肥随雨水汇入河口，刺激藻类暴发性繁殖，藻类死亡后被细菌分解耗光底层氧气，形成缺氧水体使鱼虾大量死亡，如墨西哥湾夏季死区。��Fertilizer runoff feeds algal blooms at estuaries; decaying algae are decomposed by bacteria that consume bottom oxygen, creating hypoxic water that kills fish and shrimp, e.g., the Gulf of Mexico dead zone.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1a9bc8fe6022�body���约三分之一的人类食物依赖传粉，苹果、杏仁、咖啡等尤为敏感；传粉者减少将推高这些作物价格、降低产量与营养多样性，威胁脆弱地区营养安全。��About a third of human food relies on pollination, with apples, almonds and coffee especially sensitive; fewer pollinators raise prices, cut yields and shrink dietary diversity, hitting nutrition security in vulnerable regions.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1aed15044e11�body�٫对运输占比高的易腐蔬果、空运进口生鲜，本地化收益明显；而对牛肉等生产端排放极高的食品，改饮食结构比缩短里程更有效。٭For perishables and air-freighted produce where transport dominates, localization helps most; for beef with huge production emissions, dietary change beats shortening miles.�ans��src��PNAS / Our World in Data�PNAS; OWID��id�1c7f6fb12957�body�٬指把一种产品/服务从高碳方案换成同等功能的零碳方案，所需多付的成本比例。溢价越低，清洁技术越容易在没有补贴时也普及。ٽIt is the extra cost percentage of switching a product or service from a high-carbon to a functionally equal zero-carbon option. Lower premiums let clean tech spread even without subsidies.�ans��src��Breakthrough Energy�Breakthrough Energy��id�1d2260811f4c�body�ٙ每调高 1℃ 约可省 7%–10% 的制冷电耗；从 22℃ 提到 26℃ 约省三成电，既舒服又明显减碳，还能缓减电网高峰压力。ٮEach degree higher saves roughly 7%–10% of cooling power; from 22°C to 26°C cuts about a third of the electricity—comfortable, lower carbon and easier on the grid peak.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1e95938eb0d8�body���水泥护岸抹掉了浅滩、水草和泥底这些生境，水流变直变快、失去缓流与荫蔽；修复靠拆硬岸、复曲流、种本土水生植物，让河水重新“有家可归”。��Concrete banks erase shallows, weeds and muddy beds—habitat—and straighten fast flow without refuges; restoration removes hard edges, restores meanders and plants native aquatics so the river has homes again.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1ec40ba7b376�body���一级比三级通常省电 10%–30%，对冰箱、空调这种长年开机的大户，几年累计的电费差额常能抵回稍高的购机价，是全生命周期最划算的“隐性强减排”。��Tier-1 usually saves 10%–30% versus tier-3; for always-on fridges and AC, a few years of saved bills often repay the slightly higher price—a 'hidden, high-value' cut over the product's life.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1eca4cc61cdd�body�١传统上村民视其为"龙脉"而禁止砍伐，于是这片林子被长期留白，成了乡土树种、鸟兽昆虫的避难所，意外保护了多样性。��Traditionally seen as "dragon veins," these woods were taboo to cut, so they were left intact for generations—becoming refuges for native trees, birds and insects and protecting diversity by accident.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1eea7529afdc�body���一棵成熟大树一个夏天可蒸腾数百升水分，蒸发吸热相当于自带几台小空调；同时树荫能把地表温度降低几摄氏度，是城市最便宜的“自然冷气”。��A mature tree can transpire hundreds of liters over a summer; the evaporative cooling rivals small AC units, and its shade can drop surface temperature by a few degrees—the city's cheapest natural cooling.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�20002d32e6e3�body�ٳ北极升温速度约为全球平均的3–4倍。主因是海冰融化后深色海面吸收更多太阳辐射（反照率反馈），加上大气与水汽反馈，形成放大。��The Arctic warms roughly 3–4× the global average. Mainly because melting ice exposes dark ocean that absorbs more solar radiation (albedo feedback), plus atmospheric and water-vapor feedbacks amplify it.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�20b643447b1d�body���二者是赤道中东太平洋海温的周期性振荡。厄尔尼诺时东太平洋增暖，使东南亚干旱、南美西岸多雨、全球均温偏高；拉尼娜则相反，常带来我国南方低温雨雪及大西洋飓风活跃。�3They are periodic oscillations of equatorial Pacific sea-surface temperature. El Niño warms the eastern Pacific, bringing droughts to Southeast Asia, rains to western South America, and a warmer global average; La Niña reverses these and often boosts Atlantic hurricanes and cold spells in southern China.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�22fb6016a5db�body�ٷGPI在GDP基础上扣除环境退化、社会成本（如污染医疗、通勤、不平等），并加上志愿等非市场收益，试图衡量“真实”福祉而非单纯产出。��GPI starts from GDP but subtracts environmental degradation and social costs (pollution health bills, commuting, inequality) and adds non-market benefits like volunteering, aiming to measure real well-being, not just output.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�237192b187b4�body���长期交通和邻里噪声会激活应激系统，升高血压、干扰睡眠并增加心血管疾病风险。即使睡眠中未被吵醒，噪声也可引起生理唤醒。城市绿带和隔音设计是常用缓解手段。�Chronic traffic and neighbourhood noise activates stress responses, raising blood pressure, disrupting sleep and increasing cardiovascular risk. Even without waking, noise can cause physiological arousal during sleep. Urban green belts and acoustic design are common remedies.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�2383f74b5c09�body�� 在多数淡水系统中，磷（尤其是溶解性反应性磷）往往是藻类生长的主要限制因子，因此控磷是治理富营养化的核心。海洋等咸水系统则更多受氮限制。控制外源磷输入（如生活污水、农业径流）能显著减缓水华发生。�tIn most freshwater systems, phosphorus—especially dissolved reactive phosphorus—is typically the primary limiting factor for algal growth, making phosphorus control central to eutrophication management. Marine and other saline systems are more often nitrogen-limited. Reducing external phosphorus inputs from sewage and agricultural runoff markedly slows algal blooms.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�23ed6031bb15�body���估值把防洪、净水和固碳等隐性收益货币化，便于在决策中与开发成本比较；但许多价值无法市场化、估值方法各异，易被误用为“可买卖”的借口。��Valuation monetizes hidden benefits like flood control, water cleaning and carbon storage to weigh against development costs; but many values resist markets, methods vary, and it can be misused to justify selling nature.�ans��src��&TEEB / Millennium Ecosystem Assessment�TEEB; MEA��id�24414f779266�body���飞机在高空燃烧航空煤油，单位里程排放虽不极端，但因航程长、频次高，年排放可观。且高空氮氧化物和凝结尾迹会放大增温效应。替代长途出行困难，使航空成为难减排领域。�␀Aircraft burn jet fuel at altitude; per-mile emissions are not extreme, but long distances and frequency make annual totals large. High-altitude NOx and contrails also amplify warming. Hard-to-replace long-haul travel makes aviation a hard-to-abate sector.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2465aee7f0aa�body��_地球从太阳获得的能量与它向太空散发的能量之间出现差额，就是地球能量不平衡。温室气体增强后，地球现在净吸收的能量超过散失的，相当于全球每平方米多吸收约0.9瓦；其中超过九成的多余热量被海洋吸收，表现为海温升高、海平面上升和更强烈的海洋热浪。�pAn energy imbalance is the gap between the solar energy the Earth absorbs and the heat it radiates to space. With more greenhouse gases, the planet now absorbs more than it loses — roughly 0.9 watts per square metre globally. Over 90 percent of that extra heat goes into the ocean, showing up as rising sea temperatures, sea-level rise and stronger marine heatwaves.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�27c886e898ca�body��三重底线是企业和社会在衡量成功时同时考虑利润、人和地球三种结果，而不只看经济收益。它把社会责任和环境保护纳入决策。许多公司现在发布报告，说明自己在经济、社会和环境影响上的表现。�The triple bottom line means evaluating success by profit, people, and planet together, not just economic gain. It brings social responsibility and environmental care into decision-making. Many companies now report their economic, social, and environmental performance.�ans��src��$联合国可持续发展知识平台�9United Nations Sustainable Development Knowledge Platform��id�2859d9e6b7d4�body�٫它流经六国、滋养着巨大的三角洲与渔场，是数千万人的血脉；同一条河串起多国生态与生计，重要性堪比多瑙河在欧洲的角色。��Flowing through six countries and feeding a vast delta and fisheries, it's the lifeline for tens of millions—one river tying many nations' ecology and livelihoods, like the Danube in Europe.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�290d5b3e8c74�body�٫它用下沉的种植坑和透气土壤，让雨水就地渗入、暂存并慢排，像海绵吸走暴雨；既减轻下水道压力，又补给地下水、养住昆虫。٢A sunken planted bed with porous soil lets rain soak in, store and drain slowly like a sponge, easing sewer load while recharging groundwater and feeding insects.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�29361d5382ee�body��P精准农业用卫星定位、无人机、土壤传感器和作物模型，按地块甚至按植株的差异施肥打药，把投入用在“最需要的地方”。相比整田平均施用，它能显著减少化肥流失和农药用量，从而降低水体富营养化风险和对传粉者的伤害，同时保持甚至提高产量。��Precision agriculture uses GPS, drones, soil sensors, and crop models to apply fertilizer and pesticides according to field-zone or even plant-level differences, directing inputs exactly where needed. Compared with uniform application across a field, it sharply cuts fertilizer runoff and pesticide use, reducing eutrophication risk and pollinator harm while maintaining or raising yields.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�2a2706ade929�body��碳在大气、海洋、陆地生物圈和岩石圈之间流动，通过光合作用、呼吸、溶解和沉积等过程交换。大气中的碳主要以二氧化碳存在，海洋是最大的活跃碳库。人类活动正把岩石圈封存的碳快速释放到大气。�3Carbon moves among the atmosphere, oceans, land biosphere and geosphere through photosynthesis, respiration, dissolution and sedimentation. Atmospheric carbon is mainly CO2, while the ocean is the largest active reservoir. Human activity is rapidly moving carbon locked in the geosphere into the atmosphere.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�2aad9e137f46�body�٧棉花可能在甲国种、布在乙国织、衣在丙国缝、再运到丁国卖；每一段运输与生产都排碳，于是你身上的衣服"走过"半个地球。ٔCotton may grow in A, cloth weave in B, sew in C and sell in D; each leg of transport and production emits, so your clothes "travel" half the globe.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2c22a4b54f8f�body�ٽ根瘤菌把空气中的氮直接变成植物可吸收的形式，减少合成氮肥施用；而化肥过量正是农田氧化亚氮（强温室气体）的主要来源，少施就少排。��Rhizobia convert atmospheric N into plant-usable form, reducing synthetic fertilizer; excess fertilizer is the main farm source of N2O, a potent greenhouse gas, so less application means less emission.�ans��src���Xu 等,《Postponed nitrogen fertilizer topdressing mitigates N2O emissions in legume/cereal intercropping systems through reduced bacteria amoA gene abundance》,European Journal of Agronomy,2026 (DOI: 10.1016/j.eja.2026.128230)��Xu et al., 'Postponed nitrogen fertilizer topdressing mitigates N2O emissions in legume/cereal intercropping systems through reduced bacteria amoA gene abundance', European Journal of Agronomy, 2026, DOI: 10.1016/j.eja.2026.128230��id�2d156159baeb�body���它们用的是非电离的电磁波，只让水分子振动发热，能量远低于打破化学键的门槛；合格电器的泄漏有严格限值，正确使用不伤身，和致癌的核辐射不是一回事。��They use non-ionizing waves that just jiggle water molecules to heat—far below the energy to break chemical bonds. Certified leaks are strictly limited and safe; this is nothing like cancer-causing nuclear radiation.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2e55dae05c37�body�ٷ能源贫困指家庭难以负担或获取充足清洁能源以维持基本生活。它既反映不平等，也常导致依赖高污染薪柴或煤炭，加剧健康与排放问题。��Energy poverty means households cannot afford or access enough clean energy for basic needs. It reflects inequality and often drives reliance on polluting firewood or coal, worsening health and emissions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2e920a7cfb4d�body���海绵城市通过下沉绿地、透水铺装与雨水花园等吸纳、蓄滞和净化雨水，削减峰值流量并补充地下水。它把灰色排水与绿色基础设施结合，提升城市对暴雨的韧性。��Sponge cities use sunken green space, permeable pavement and rain gardens to absorb, store and cleanse stormwater, cutting peak flows and recharging groundwater. Coupling grey drainage with green infrastructure raises resilience to heavy rain.�ans��src���Chan, Griffiths, Higgitt, Xu,《“Sponge City” in China—A breakthrough of planning and flood risk management in the urban context》,Land Use Policy,2018 (DOI: 10.1016/j.landusepol.2018.03.005)��Chan, Griffiths, Higgitt, Xu, '“Sponge City” in China—A breakthrough of planning and flood risk management in the urban context', Land Use Policy, 2018, DOI: 10.1016/j.landusepol.2018.03.005��id�31dd5e913633�body���墙面攀缘植物和绿墙能在夏季为建筑外表面遮阳并蒸腾降温，减少空调负荷。冬季落叶型植被则可能允许阳光透射而利于得热。合理设计可全年改善隔热并改善微气候。��Climbing plants and green walls shade and cool building surfaces by transpiration in summer, cutting air-conditioning load. Deciduous types may let winter sun through and aid heating. Good design improves insulation and microclimate year-round.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�328e7b374078�body�ٞ即便只有池塘、沟渠大小，也能滞蓄雨水、降温、给蛙鸟昆虫留口粮；在城市里它们是容易被忽视却高效的"生态拼图"。ٛEven a pond or ditch stores rain, cools the air and feeds frogs, birds and insects—easily overlooked but efficient pieces of the urban ecological puzzle.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�35aa8c92f8ae�body���绝大多数塑料以石油和天然气为原料，从开采、裂解到加工都消耗化石能源并排放CO2。若塑料废弃后焚烧还会再释放碳。减少一次性塑料既减废又减负碳排放。��Most plastics are made from oil and gas, and extraction, cracking, and processing all consume fossil energy and emit CO2. Burning plastic waste later releases more carbon. Cutting single-use plastic reduces both waste and embedded emissions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�361081e2189c�body�٪天然林保护重在"别再砍、让其自我恢复"，保的是原生结构与生物多样性；人工造林重在快速增绿固碳，两者互补而非互相替代。ٽNatural forest protection stops logging and lets forests heal, preserving native structure and diversity; plantations quickly add green and carbon. They complement, not replace, each other.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�361c9c1fe767�body��h科学评估显示，高影响行动包括减少红肉消费、少乘飞机多乘火车、选择步行骑行公交、住在节能房屋、购买高效率家电并延长物品使用寿命。这些行动比随手关灯这类小事的减排量高出许多。低碳生活不是做苦行僧，而是把有限的精力用在刀刃上，先改掉高排放的习惯。��Research-based rankings show the highest-impact individual actions include eating less red meat, flying less and taking trains more, choosing walking, cycling and transit, living in efficient housing, buying high-efficiency appliances and keeping goods in use longer. These dwarf the savings of small gestures like turning off lights. Low-carbon living is not about austerity — it is focusing effort on the habits that emit most.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�36681432afe3�body��该原则承认所有国家都有应对气候变化的共同义务，但发达国家因历史排放更多、能力更强而应承担更大责任。它体现于《联合国气候变化框架公约》及后续协定。这一原则平衡了公平与全球行动效率。�TThe principle acknowledges all nations share the duty to address climate change, but developed countries, with greater historical emissions and capacity, should bear more responsibility. It is embedded in the UN Framework Convention on Climate Change and later agreements. The principle balances equity with the efficiency of global action.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�36ed3ef01d16�body��A珊瑚移植只是修复的一种工具：被漂白或退化的珊瑚礁，如果水温升高、酸化与污染没有改善，移植的珊瑚仍难以长期存活。近年更强调先培育耐热珊瑚苗圃，再配合海洋保护区的整体管理。修复不是万灵药，预防退化和减少压力源才是根本。��Coral transplantation is only one restoration tool: on bleached or degraded reefs, transplanted corals struggle to survive long-term if warming, acidification, and pollution persist. Recent efforts emphasise heat-tolerant coral nurseries combined with integrated management of marine protected areas. Restoration is not a silver bullet — preventing degradation and reducing stressors is fundamental.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�373a8d3a9465�body��平衡气候敏感度指大气CO2浓度翻倍后长期地表温度的变化幅度，IPCC评估其很可能落在2.5–4°C之间。2°C源自《巴黎协定》设定的控温目标，低于该值可显著减少极端风险，但区域影响仍非线性累积。�8Equilibrium climate sensitivity is the long-term temperature change after a doubling of atmospheric CO2, assessed by the IPCC as likely between 2.5–4°C. The 2°C figure comes from the Paris Agreement's target; staying below it sharply reduces tipping-point risks, though impacts still accumulate non-linearly.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�37f67f217cee�body��厄尔尼诺是赤道东太平洋海温异常偏高的状态，会改变全球大气环流与降水格局。它通常使全球年均气温在随后一年明显抬升，并常促成最热年份的出现。拉尼娜则相反，往往暂时抑制全球升温。�XEl Niño is a state of unusually warm sea surface temperatures in the eastern equatorial Pacific that reshapes global atmospheric circulation and rainfall. It typically raises the global annual average temperature in the following year and often produces record-hot years. La Niña has the opposite effect, temporarily dampening global warming.�ans��src��c世界气象组织《全球气候状况》年度公报（含厄尔尼诺对全球气温的影响）�/WMO, State of the Global Climate annual reports��id�382d3aa487e2�body���GCF是《巴黎协定》下的重要资金机制，协助发展中国家开展减排与适应项目。发达国家承诺出资，基金再支持清洁能源、防灾等行动。它试图弥补气候资金缺口并推动公正转型。�;The GCF is a key financial mechanism under the Paris Agreement that helps developing countries fund mitigation and adaptation projects. Developed nations pledge contributions, and the fund supports clean energy, disaster preparedness, and more. It aims to close the climate finance gap and enable a just transition.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�38498ad50748�body��生态足迹衡量维持消费所需的全部生物生产性土地，包含碳、耕地、林地、渔业和建设用地等分项。碳足迹只聚焦温室气体排放折算的二氧化碳当量，是生态足迹中碳账户的部分。两者口径不同，不宜直接比较大小。�^An ecological footprint measures all biologically productive land needed to sustain consumption, including carbon, cropland, forest, fisheries and built-up areas. A carbon footprint focuses only on greenhouse-gas emissions in CO2 equivalent, the carbon account within the ecological footprint. Their scopes differ and should not be directly compared.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�38585ae186ab�body���DAC 利用风扇将空气通过化学吸附剂，选择性捕获低浓度的二氧化碳，再经加热或降压释放高纯 CO2 用于封存或利用。其优势是不受区位限制，但能耗较高。��DAC uses fans to pass air over chemical sorbents that selectively capture dilute CO2, then releases pure CO2 via heating or pressure swing for storage or use. It is location-flexible but energy-intensive.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�38e66231f50c�body�ٹ降低一度电的需求，就少建相应发电与电网容量、少排CO2；需求侧节能成本常低于新建电源，且即时可用，因此被视为最便宜的'虚拟电厂'。��Cutting one unit of demand avoids building matching generation and grid capacity and emissions; efficiency on the demand side is often cheaper than new supply and available immediately, earning it the label of the cheapest 'virtual power plant.'�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�3b6d8dbd99ed�body��M光污染指人工照明过多或不当造成的夜空辉光、眩光和光线侵入，让城市夜晚不再有真正的黑暗。它会扰乱人体的昼夜节律、影响睡眠，也会让候鸟迷航、干扰昆虫和夜行生物的活动。暗夜保护区、遮光灯具和智慧调光照明正在成为国际上的主流对策。�mLight pollution is the excessive or misdirected artificial light that creates skyglow, glare and intrusive light, robbing cities of true darkness. It disrupts human circadian rhythms and sleep, disorients migrating birds, and disturbs insects and nocturnal animals. Dark-sky reserves, shielded fixtures and smart dimming are becoming mainstream responses worldwide.�ans��src��!Nature（光污染生态影响）�.Nature (ecological effects of light pollution)��id�3c4cd77644dc�body��{内分泌干扰物是能干扰人体激素系统的化学物质，例如双酚A（BPA）、某些塑化剂和农药。它们的特别之处在于作用方式类似激素：极低浓度就可能改变发育、生殖与代谢，剂量与效应的关系并非线性，且在发育关键窗口期的低剂量暴露可能造成不可逆影响，对胎儿和儿童尤其值得警惕。��Endocrine disruptors are chemicals that interfere with the body's hormone system — such as bisphenol A (BPA), certain plasticizers, and pesticides. Their special danger is acting like hormones: even extremely low levels can alter development, reproduction, and metabolism; dose-response is non-linear, and low-dose exposure during critical developmental windows can cause irreversible effects, especially for fetuses and children.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�3e42986d7e45�body���不一定。PLA 需要工业堆肥高温条件才能降解，混入普通回收会污染料流；其原料种植还涉及土地、化肥与水的代价，需全生命周期评估才能下结论。��Not necessarily. PLA needs industrial-compost high temperatures to degrade and contaminates conventional recycling; feedstock farming carries land, fertilizer and water costs, so life-cycle assessment is needed.�ans��src��"Environmental Science & Technology�Environ Sci Technol��id�3ec6e6a74c00�body�٨那是雌蜻蜓在产卵，把卵点进水中或水草上；幼虫在水里长大、吃蚊子幼虫，是池塘里免费的“灭蚊小卫士”和生态健康指示。٘The female is laying eggs into water or plants; the larvae grow underwater eating mosquito larvae—free 'mosquito guards' and a sign of a healthy pond.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�3f49f6653215�body�٢合成纤维衣物机洗时会脱落微纤维进入废水。可用洗衣袋或过滤器拦截、选天然纤维、低温轻柔洗、减少洗涤频次来降低。٩Synthetic garments shed microfibers into wastewater during machine washing. Use a filter bag, choose natural fibers, wash cold and gentle, and wash less often to cut it.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�3fe17b0c49e6�body���“天然”没有法律定义，某些植物提取物照样有毒或难降解；真正要看成分是否可生物降解、包装是否减量、是否过度营销。少用量、选浓缩装往往更实在。��'Natural' has no legal definition, and some plant extracts are still toxic or persistent. Look at biodegradability, reduced packaging and honest claims; using less and buying concentrate often matters more.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3ff594a9efe7�body���指因气候灾害或缓慢事件（海平面上升、干旱）而被迫离开家园的人。现行1951难民公约以“迫害”为准，未涵盖纯气候因素，故尚无专门法律身份，属人道挑战。��People forced to leave by climate disasters or slow-onset events (sea-level rise, drought). The 1951 Refugee Convention is based on 'persecution' and excludes pure climate causes, so no dedicated legal status exists—a humanitarian gap.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4064bb5c4de0�body�١加热水是洗衣耗电大头，用冷水洗可省下约 80% 的洗衣能耗；选高能效机型、攒满再洗、自然晾干，能进一步压低碳足迹。٠Heating water is most of a wash's power; cold washing can cut about 80% of that energy. Efficient models, full loads and air-drying lower the footprint further.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4087268b7884�body�ٜ多制成水产饲料、宠物食品和 Omega-3 补充剂。过度捕捞会动摇南大洋食物链基础，故设有捕捞限额与海洋保护区争议。ٲMostly made into aquaculture feed, pet food and Omega-3 supplements. Overfishing undermines the Southern Ocean food base, so catch limits and marine-protected-area debates apply.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�408e2ab044c7�body��G碳标签在商品上公布产品从原料、生产、运输到使用处置全过程的温室气体排放量，让“低碳”变得看得见、可比较。它既能帮消费者做环保选择，也促使企业改进工艺、降低碳成本。由于各国核算方法还不统一，碳标签的国际互认仍在推进之中。��A carbon label displays the total greenhouse gases emitted across a product's life — from raw materials and production to transport, use and disposal — making low-carbon choices visible and comparable. It helps consumers pick greener options and pushes companies to trim emissions and costs. Because accounting rules still differ between countries, mutual recognition of carbon labels is still being developed.�ans��src��6中国科学院（碳足迹与碳标签研究）；WRI�2CAS (carbon footprint and labelling research); WRI��id�41ec6978cb94�body�٧水生植物和根系上的微生物会吸收氮磷、分解有机物，泥沙还能拦截颗粒；水慢慢流过湿地，就像过了一道免费的"生态滤池"。ٸAquatic plants and their root microbes take up nitrogen and phosphorus and break down organics, while silt traps particles; water creeping through a wetland passes a free "eco-filter".�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�44f5bc0d39f1�body��被丢弃或遗失的幽灵渔网会在海中继续缠绕鱼类、海龟和哺乳动物，造成窒息和受伤。它们多由耐久的合成纤维制成，可存在数百年并碎裂为微塑料。回收再利用这些尼龙网既能救生物也能减少原生塑料。��Abandoned or lost ghost nets keep entangling fish, turtles and mammals, causing suffocation and injury. Made of durable synthetics, they persist for centuries and break into microplastics. Recycling these nylon nets saves wildlife and cuts virgin plastic.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�45690afd675f�body��_蓝碳指红树林、海草床、盐沼等海岸带生态系统固定的碳。它们虽然面积不大，但单位面积的固碳速率可以超过热带雨林，而且碳被储存在缺氧的沉积物中，能保存数百年到上千年。保护蓝碳生态系统既固碳，又能护岸防洪、保育鱼类，是“一石多鸟”的自然方案。��Blue carbon is the carbon captured by coastal ecosystems — mangroves, seagrass beds and salt marshes. Covering little area, they still sequester carbon faster per hectare than many tropical forests, and the carbon is locked in oxygen-poor sediments where it can stay for centuries or millennia. Protecting them stores carbon while also defending coasts, holding back floods and sheltering fish — a multi-benefit natural solution.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�462c48264682�body���浮游植物通过光合作用吸收大量CO2，并把碳随死亡残体沉入深海，构成海洋生物泵。它们还产生二甲基硫等气体，可能影响云的形成。其生产力变化会反馈到全球碳循环与气候。�3Phytoplankton absorb large amounts of CO2 through photosynthesis and sink carbon to the deep sea as they die, forming the ocean's biological pump. They also emit gases like dimethyl sulfide that may influence cloud formation. Changes in their productivity feed back into the global carbon cycle and climate.�ans��src��@联合国教科文组织政府间海洋学委员会;《自然》�IOC-UNESCO;Nature��id�46e137d6ecd6�body�ٙ它们像"水泵+吸管"：叶片光合作用供氧，根系泌氧给微生物，同时把水中的营养盐吸进自己身体，间接带走污染物。ٵThey act like "pumps and straws": leaves photosynthesize and oxygenate, roots leak oxygen to microbes, and they pull nutrients into their own bodies, indirectly removing pollutants.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�47caa082c8b3�body���水电几乎不排CO2，但大坝会淹没植被释放甲烷、阻断鱼类洄游、改变河流沉积与下游生态，水库在热带的温室气体排放尤其不可忽视，因此需个案评估。��Hydropower emits almost no CO2, but dams flood vegetation releasing methane, block fish migration and alter sediment and downstream ecology; tropical reservoirs' GHG emissions are not negligible, so each case needs assessment.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�49a77272df4f�body�٠因为"不动祖林"的观念让大树免遭砍伐，加上林下湿润少干扰，树木得以长成参天古木；它们本身又是许多物种的"公寓"。ٷThe belief in "not disturbing the ancestral grove" spared big trees, and the undisturbed, moist understory let them grow old; such giants are themselves "apartments" for many species.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4a5fd7ee18cd�body���吊兰、绿萝、常春藤等在实验中能吸收少量甲醛等挥发性有机物，但单盆作用有限，真正有效的是源头少买劣质板材、勤通风。绿植是加分项，不是净化主力。��Spider plants, pothos and ivy absorb small amounts of VOCs like formaldehyde in tests, but a single pot does little; the real fix is fewer poor boards and good ventilation. Plants are a bonus, not the main cleaner.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�4a9551f6957c�body�ٱ斑马贻贝滤食浮游生物、水体变清却剥夺鱼类饵料，排泄促进底栖藻华，并附着堵塞管线，引发一连串的级联效应改变整个湖泊生态。٥Zebra mussels filter plankton, clearing water but starving fish fry, fueling benthic algae and fouling pipes, triggering cascading changes across whole-lake ecology.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4b13180e5d2e�body���鸟类处于食物链中上层、移动性强且分类与分布数据丰富，其种群变化能综合反映栖息地破碎化、污染与气候变化。标准化样线调查使鸟类成为监测网络中最具可比性的指标之一。�Birds occupy upper trophic levels, move widely and have rich taxonomic and distribution data, so their population changes integrate habitat fragmentation, pollution and climate signals. Standardized point-count surveys make them among the most comparable monitoring indicators.�ans��src��*《环境科学》生态指示生物研究�7Environmental Science journal — bioindicator research��id�4b8fd5af7ee9�body��M能量在食物链每一级传递时，大约只有10%转化为新的生物量，其余都在呼吸和代谢中散失，所以能量金字塔逐级收窄，顶级捕食者数量最少。这也意味着吃肉比吃素占用更多土地和水，因为粮食要先喂动物。理解这个比例，是选择低碳饮食的科学起点。��Only about 10 percent of energy is converted into new biomass at each step of the food chain; the rest is lost to respiration and metabolism, so the energy pyramid narrows upward and top predators are fewest. This is also why meat demands far more land and water than plants — crops must feed animals first. Understanding that ratio is the scientific starting point for a lower-footprint diet.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4bad2e6e047a�body��/红树林的根系能消减海浪与风暴潮能量、固定沉积物、缓冲海岸侵蚀，同时为鱼类幼苗和鸟类提供育幼栖息地，其碳储存能力也远高于多数陆地森林。保护与修复红树林，是一种同时服务减灾、渔业和气候的基于自然的解决方案。�bMangrove root systems dampen wave and storm-surge energy, trap sediment, and buffer coastal erosion, while doubling as nursery habitat for fish juveniles and birds; their carbon storage far exceeds most terrestrial forests. Protecting and restoring mangroves is a nature-based solution that serves disaster risk reduction, fisheries, and climate at once.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4bed04255759�body���碳汇是净吸收并长期储存碳的系统。森林通过生长把碳固定在木质与土壤，海洋通过物理溶解与生物泵把碳沉入深层，二者每年抵消大量人为排放。��A carbon sink net-absorbs and stores carbon long-term. Forests lock it in wood and soil as they grow; oceans dissolve and sink it via physics and the biological pump, together offsetting much human emission yearly.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�4ccfc1d7976a�body�٧许多竹子按固定周期（有的几十年一次）同步开花后成片枯死，大熊猫主食骤减；这种周期性"断粮"让本就稀疏的种群更脆弱。��Many bamboos flower synchronously on fixed cycles (some every few decades) then die back, suddenly cutting the panda's main food; this periodic "famine" makes an already sparse population more fragile.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4e352c7f0a12�body���核裂变依靠铀等有限矿物燃料，从资源角度通常不归入可再生，但其发电过程几乎不排CO2。在气候减缓中，它常被视作低碳基荷电源。核聚变若实现商用，才可能真正接近取之不竭。�Nuclear fission relies on finite minerals like uranium, so it is usually not classified as renewable, yet its generation emits almost no CO2. In climate mitigation it is often treated as a low-carbon baseload source. Only commercial fusion would approach being truly inexhaustible.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4eadefb72538�body��若生物质来自可持续管理的作物或废料，其燃烧排放的CO2可被新生植物重新吸收，近似碳中性。但若毁林造田或长途运输，则全周期排放可能很高。因此生物质能的低碳性高度依赖原料与土地利用方式。�EIf biomass comes from sustainably managed crops or waste, the CO2 it emits when burned can be reabsorbed by new growth, approximating carbon neutrality. But clearing forests for feedstock or long-distance transport can make lifecycle emissions high. So bioenergy's low-carbon status depends heavily on feedstock and land use.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4edd69cea7c2�body���畜产品的土地、水、甲烷与饲料运输链条长、排放高，膳食微调几乎零成本就能砍掉可观碳排；它还能顺带改善健康，是少数“省钱又减排”的行为。��Livestock carry long chains of land, water, methane and feed transport with high emissions; a small dietary tweak cuts notable carbon at near-zero cost and often improves health—rare 'saves money and emissions' behavior.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�509d8f0bf3f6�body�ٽ暖化使冰雪融化，露出颜色更深的海面和陆地，吸收更多阳光，进一步升温并融化更多冰雪，形成自我强化的回路，使北极增温快于全球平均。��Warming melts bright ice, exposing darker ocean and land that absorb more sunlight, raising temperature and melting more ice—a self-reinforcing loop making the Arctic warm faster than the global mean.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5264a8b51bca�body��光污染是指过度或不当的人工照明干扰自然昼夜节律和天文观测的现象，常见于城市霓虹和路灯。它会扰乱昆虫、鸟类和海龟等动物的行为，也浪费能源。合理设计灯具、减少不必要的照明可有效缓解。�Light pollution is excessive or misdirected artificial lighting that disrupts natural day-night rhythms and astronomy, common in city neon and streetlights. It disturbs insects, birds, and sea turtles and wastes energy. Better lamp design and cutting unnecessary lighting help reduce it.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�5329c062def3�body�ٷ随着森林成熟和氮等养分限制，单位面积年固碳速率会下降，老林趋于碳平衡；此外火灾、虫害与暖干化也会让既有碳汇减弱甚至变碳源。ٷAs forests mature and hit nutrient limits, per-area annual carbon uptake slows and old stands approach equilibrium; fire, pests and warming-drying can also weaken or reverse the sink.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�53d4bc15106f�body���灰工程（堤坝、硬化河道）单一目标、维护耗能；NbS（红树林、湿地、自然岸线）以生态过程缓冲风暴与洪涝，还顺带固碳、育幼和休闲，但效果受空间与时效限制。��Grey works (levees, hardened channels) are single-purpose and energy-intensive; NbS (mangroves, wetlands, natural shores) buffer storms and floods via ecology while also storing carbon and nurturing life, though space- and time-limited.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�54aebfda780e�body��P提高能效就是用更少的能源满足同样的需求，比如LED照明、高效空调、房屋保温、变频电机。这些措施技术成熟、成本往往低于新建清洁电源，却能同时减少电费和碳排放，被国际机构称为“第一燃料”。家家户户的小改进，汇总起来就是巨大的减排量。�oEnergy efficiency means meeting the same needs with less energy — LED lighting, efficient air conditioners, insulated homes and variable-speed motors. Such measures are proven, often cheaper than building new clean capacity, and cut both bills and emissions, which is why agencies call efficiency the first fuel. Small household improvements add up to huge savings.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�55727d4bb4f1�body���细颗粒物可深入肺泡并进入血液循环，诱发氧化应激、炎症与血管内皮损伤，增加心肺疾病与卒中风险。长期暴露与肺癌及儿童呼吸系统发育不良相关。�Fine particles penetrate deep into alveoli and enter the bloodstream, triggering oxidative stress, inflammation and endothelial injury that raise risks of cardiopulmonary disease and stroke. Long-term exposure is linked to lung cancer and impaired child respiratory development.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�55b039f0ea08�body�ٴ甲烷在大气中约 12 年就被分解，远低于 CO2 的百年尺度，因此近期减甲烷能迅速压低升温速率，是给气候“刹车”见效最快的手段之一。٘Methane breaks down in about 12 years versus CO2's centuries, so cutting it now quickly slows warming rate—one of the fastest-acting climate 'brakes'.�ans��src��>国际能源署《World Energy Outlook》(iea.org/reports/weo)�.IEA, World Energy Outlook, iea.org/reports/weo��id�562dc0aaba92�body��\水稻根系可从镉污染稻田土壤吸收镉离子并经木质部转运富集于籽粒，使稻米成为人群镉暴露的主要膳食来源；氧化（落干）条件下土壤镉有效性更高，而长期淹水可降低其有效性。长期摄入损害肾近曲小管并影响骨代谢，Codex 为此设定了稻米镉限量（0.4 mg/kg）。��Rice roots absorb cadmium ions from contaminated paddy soil and translocate them via xylem to the grain, making rice a major dietary cadmium source for humans; Cd bioavailability is higher under aerobic (drained) conditions, while prolonged flooding lowers it. Chronic intake damages renal proximal tubules and bone metabolism, prompting Codex to set a cadmium limit (0.4 mg/kg) for rice.�ans��src��oZhao 等, 2015, Molecular Plant 8:27-39（水稻镉吸收转运综述）及 CODEX STAN 193-1995 稻米镉限量�xZhao et al., 2015, Molecular Plant 8:27-39 (Cd uptake and transport in rice); CODEX STAN 193-1995 cadmium limit for rice��id�575b3b19122b�body���循环经济通过设计让产品可维修、可再利用、可再制造，使材料在使用中循环。它要取代「开采—生产—丢弃」的线性模式，目标是零废弃与资源再生，而非仅靠末端回收。��A circular economy designs products to be repaired, reused, and remanufactured so materials keep cycling. It replaces the 'take-make-waste' linear model, aiming for zero waste and resource renewal rather than end-of-pipe recycling alone.�ans��src��5艾伦·麦克阿瑟基金会《循环经济导论》�9Ellen MacArthur Foundation, Circular Economy Introduction��id�5802ef20d1d6�body��G海气界面的CO2会依据分压差向溶解度更高的海水中扩散，并转化为碳酸、碳酸氢根和碳酸根等溶解无机碳。寒冷的高纬度海域吸收能力更强，且通过生物泵把浮游生物固定的碳带入深海。海洋已吸收了约四分之一的人为CO2排放，但也因此面临酸化。�{At the sea surface, CO2 diffuses into seawater where it is more soluble and is converted into dissolved inorganic carbon such as carbonic acid, bicarbonate, and carbonate ions. Cold high-latitude waters absorb more, and the biological pump carries plankton-fixed carbon to the deep ocean. The ocean has taken up roughly a quarter of human CO2 emissions but is thereby acidifying.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5a34e48ed856�body�ٴ补贴常以低价能源形式惠及民众与产业，取消会推高电价油价、触及既得利益，且缺乏配套的社会缓冲，容易引发分配公平与选票反弹。ٱSubsidies appear as cheap energy for public and industry; removing them raises bills, hits vested interests, and without social buffers triggers fairness and electoral backlash.�ans��src��0国际能源署（IEA）《世界能源展望》�7International Energy Agency (IEA), World Energy Outlook��id�5a787a3f1d9b�body���季风依赖海陆温差驱动，全球变暖改变了这一温差与大气环流，可能使季风更强但更不稳定。极端降水与突发干旱的风险随之上升，影响数十亿依赖季风农业的人口。�Monsoons are driven by land-sea temperature contrasts; warming alters those contrasts and atmospheric circulation, potentially making monsoons stronger but more erratic. Risks of extreme rainfall and sudden droughts rise, affecting billions who depend on monsoon agriculture.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5cfdbda8e9cd�body��2种间关系主要有捕食、竞争、寄生和共生。共生包括互利共生，比如豆科植物与根瘤菌合作固氮、小丑鱼与海葵互保；也包括一方受益、另一方不受影响的共栖。这些关系共同调节种群数量、驱动演化，是生态系统的“隐形骨架”。�Species interact through predation, competition, parasitism and symbiosis. Symbiosis includes mutualism — legume plants and nitrogen-fixing bacteria, or clownfish sheltered by anemones — and commensalism, where one partner benefits and the other is unaffected. Together these relationships regulate populations and drive evolution, forming the hidden skeleton of every ecosystem.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5ebaa4e0b4e9�body�ٮ它是对燃煤电厂等加装高效除尘器、脱硫、脱硝设施，使颗粒物、二氧化硫、氮氧化物排放浓度降至极低水平，显著改善空气质量。ٶIt adds high-efficiency dust collectors, desulfurization and denitrification to plants like coal power, cutting PM, SO2 and NOx to very low levels and markedly improving air quality.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�5fe93ff5bb13�body�ٖ对进口的高碳产品按碳含量征收费用，防止本国碳价导致产业外迁（“碳泄漏”），并倒逼贸易伙伴也为碳定价。ٓIt charges imports by their carbon content to prevent 'carbon leakage' from domestic carbon prices and pushes trading partners to price carbon too.�ans��src�ٜAichele 与 Felbermayr（2015）《Review of Economics and Statistics》京都议定书与碳泄漏研究；经济合作与发展组织碳泄漏文献综述لAichele and Felbermayr (2015), Review of Economics and Statistics, Kyoto and carbon leakage; OECD reviews of carbon leakage evidence��id�6005263a780d�body���生态补偿（PES）让生态服务的受益方向保护者付费：下游城市为上游水源涵养林付费，国家为退耕还林农户提供补贴，碳汇项目向森林所有者支付费用。它把生态保护的外部效益内部化，让“保护者受益、使用者付费”，弥补保护者放弃开发的机会成本，是许多国家协调发展与保护的关键制度。��Payments for ecosystem services make beneficiaries pay stewards: downstream cities pay for upstream watershed-protection forests, national programmes subsidise farmers who reforest cropland, and carbon projects pay forest owners. PES internalises the external benefits of conservation — protectors gain, users pay — offsetting the opportunity cost of forgoing development, and is a key instrument for balancing development and protection in many countries.�ans��src��3中国生态环境部（生态保护补偿条例）�.China MEE (Ecological Compensation Regulation)��id�61f91fa5e4fd�body��h光伏板主体的玻璃、铝框和硅大部分可回收，退役后能拆解提取银、铜等材料；难点在于封装胶膜使层间分离耗能，回收成本一度高于材料本身的价值。风机叶片由玻璃纤维复合材料制成，回收更加困难。欧盟和行业正通过设计标准和押金回收机制推动“为回收而设计”。��Most of a solar panel — glass, aluminum frame, and silicon — is recyclable, yielding silver and copper after decommissioning; the challenge is the energy-intensive separation of encapsulant layers, with recycling historically costing more than the recovered materials. Wind blades, made of glass-fibre composite, are harder still. The EU and industry are driving design-for-recycling through standards and deposit-return schemes.�ans��src��cIRENA与IEA-PVPS《光伏组件退役管理前瞻》(End-of-Life Management: Solar PV Panels), 2016�IIRENA & IEA-PVPS, End-of-Life Management: Solar Photovoltaic Panels, 2016��id�61f9b83b528b�body���EPR 按包装的可回收性、再生料含量等设定差异化费率，难回收者缴费更高。这种经济信号促使企业在源头采用单一材质、易分离的设计以降低合规成本。��EPR sets modulated fees by recyclability and recycled-content, charging more for hard-to-recycle packaging. The economic signal pushes firms toward mono-material, easily separable designs that lower compliance cost.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�61fe25414f73�body��M遗传多样性是物种内部的基因差异，决定了物种适应环境变化的潜力：基因库越丰富，越可能涌现抗病、耐旱的个体。在农业上，现代单一高产品种使许多传统作物品种消失，风险高度集中；挪威斯瓦尔巴全球种子库正是为保存这一层多样性而建立的。�oGenetic diversity is the variation within a species and sets its adaptive potential: richer gene pools make disease-resistant or drought-tolerant individuals more likely to emerge. In agriculture, modern uniform high-yield varieties have displaced many traditional cultivars, concentrating risk; the Svalbard Global Seed Vault exists precisely to preserve this layer.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�62050b7f0401�body���地热能利用地球内部热量，通过钻井抽取地热流体驱动涡轮发电，或直接用于供暖。它稳定可控、几乎不受天气影响，是优秀的低碳基荷能源。限制在于资源地理集中且前期钻探成本高。�Geothermal energy taps Earth's internal heat, using drilled fluids to drive turbines for power or directly for heating. It is stable, weather-independent, and an excellent low-carbon baseload source. Limits include geographically concentrated resources and high upfront drilling costs.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6369b99d923e�body���月球引力把面向它的一侧海水拉高形成涨潮，地球自转约半天转到另一侧再涨一次，所以一天两潮。初一十五日月地近似一线，引潮力叠加，出现最大的“朔望大潮”。��The moon's pull raises seas on the near side; Earth's spin brings the far side around about half a day later for a second high, so two tides a day. At new and full moon the sun and moon align, adding pull for the biggest 'spring' tides.�ans��src��t牛顿《自然哲学的数学原理》的引潮力理论；美国国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 潮汐说明�NNewton's tidal theory in Principia; NOAA Tides and Currents on tide generation��id�63a94cc33dfe�body���公民科学让公众参与记录物种分布和物候，能在广阔时空尺度上积累海量数据。鸟类普查和物种识别App是典型例子，为科研和保护决策提供基础。关键是统一方法和校验数据质量。�Citizen science engages the public in recording species distribution and phenology, accumulating massive data across broad space and time. Bird counts and species-ID apps are typical, feeding research and conservation decisions. The key is standardised methods and data-quality checks.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�63bc072b6429�body��潮汐能利用月球和太阳引力引起的海平面周期性涨落，通过水下涡轮或拦坝捕获水流动能发电。它比风光更可预测，但因流速有限、设备需耐海水腐蚀而发展较慢。适合特定海湾与河口的小型部署。�LTidal energy uses the periodic sea-level rise and fall from lunar and solar gravity, capturing water flow with submerged turbines or barrages. It is more predictable than wind or solar, but develops slowly due to limited flow speeds and corrosion-resistant equipment needs. It suits small deployments in specific bays and estuaries.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�650a7880f2ec�body���漂绿是企业夸大或虚假宣传环保表现，以误导消费者的行为，例如用绿色包装却无实质减排。它削弱真正可持续产品的信誉并扭曲市场。识别漂绿要看具体证据而非笼统的环保口号。�Greenwashing is when a company exaggerates or falsely claims environmental virtue to mislead consumers, such as green packaging with no real emission cuts. It undermines genuinely sustainable products and distorts markets. Spot it by demanding concrete evidence over vague eco-slogans.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�654a0b4a2d28�body���夏末表层热水、底层冷水分层；秋凉后上下温度接近、风一吹整湖混合，底部富含营养的冷水翻到表层，喂饱藻类与鱼，却也可能引发短暂水华。��In late summer warm surface and cold bottom are layered; autumn cooling makes temperatures similar and wind mixes the whole lake, bringing nutrient-rich deep water up to feed algae and fish—though it can trigger a brief bloom.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�65cd13c35b96�body���本土树种是本地气候、土壤和昆虫长期磨合出来的，更耐旱、少病害、给本地鸟虫提供食物；外来名贵树常需更多水肥养护，还可能变成入侵种。ٽNative trees are tuned to local climate, soil and insects—drought-tolerant, pest-resistant and food for local wildlife. Exotic 'show' trees need more water and care and can turn invasive.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6690f5601c93�body�ٮ氮磷等营养盐过量使藻类暴长、耗氧、鱼类死亡。治理从源头控污（截污、脱氮除磷）、清淤、引水增氧到恢复水生植被多管齐下。��Excess nitrogen and phosphorus cause algal blooms, oxygen depletion and fish kills. Management combines source control (intercept pollution, N/P removal), dredging, aeration and restoring aquatic vegetation.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6963b4408ee3�body��e自然恢复利用土壤中残留的种子库和邻近森林的天然扩散，成本低、遗传多样性强，形成的林分结构更复杂，能支撑更完整的食物网。而大规模单一树种人工林在干旱地区可能因缺水而死亡，生态功能也有限。科学实践常把被动恢复与辅助措施结合，而非一刀切地植树。��Natural regeneration relies on the dormant seed bank in soil and seed dispersal from nearby forests — it is cheap, genetically diverse, and produces structurally complex forests that support fuller food webs. Large monoculture plantations can die from water stress in dry regions and provide limited ecological function. Good practice blends passive regeneration with assisted measures rather than one-size-fits-all planting.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�699b877d5467�body���基于自然的解决方案是指通过保护、可持续管理和修复生态系统来应对社会挑战的行动。IPCC 指出，NbS 可在 2030 年前以较低成本贡献可观的减排与碳汇。��Nature-based solutions are actions that protect, sustainably manage, and restore ecosystems to address societal challenges. The IPCC notes that NbS could deliver substantial mitigation and carbon sinks at relatively low cost by 2030.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6a0d1d307f9d�body�٪eDNA 的检出受采集体积、降解速率、引物偏好和背景污染影响，难以定量丰度。距离—衰减关系复杂，需与形态学调查互补校准。��eDNA detection depends on sample volume, degradation, primer bias, and contamination, and poorly quantifies abundance. Distance-decay is complex, so it needs calibration against morphological surveys.�ans��src��&《Nature Sustainability》eDNA 综述�!Nature Sustainability eDNA review��id�6ae7da7fa089�body��新造林固碳速度有限且碳可能随火灾或采伐重新释放，在原生草原或泥炭地造林反而破坏原有碳库。此外树木吸收仅为人为排放的一小部分，无法替代减排。宜林则林、宜草则草才能避免负面效应。�New forests store carbon slowly and it can return via fire or harvest, while planting on native grassland or peat releases stored carbon. Trees absorb only a fraction of human emissions and cannot replace cutting them. Matching vegetation to land avoids harm.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6b757ad8afe3�body�ٺ不会。冰箱频繁开关机后重启要把整箱重新制冷，反而更耗电；长期不用才该断电清空。日常保持合理温度、少开门、后背留散热空间最省。٥No. Restarting cools the whole interior again and uses more; only unplug if unused for long. Keep a sensible temperature, open less and leave rear clearance to save.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6c2caf16cbd6�body���这两类人群体温调节能力弱、常服药影响排汗与心血管代偿，易在热浪下发生中暑、心衰与肾损伤。城市热岛与独居进一步放大风险，提示需有针对性的高温预警与社区照护。�1These groups have weaker thermoregulation and often take medications that impair sweating and cardiovascular compensation, raising risks of heatstroke, heart failure and kidney injury during heatwaves. Urban heat islands and social isolation amplify risk, calling for targeted warnings and community care.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6c9056e446d1�body���土壤是全球最大的陆地碳库，储存的有机碳超过大气与植被之和。植物残体经微生物分解缓慢积累为土壤有机质，形成长期封存。耕作、侵蚀和升温会促使其中碳重新释放。�3Soil is the largest terrestrial carbon pool, holding more organic carbon than the atmosphere and vegetation combined. Plant debris slowly accumulates as soil organic matter through microbial decomposition, forming long-term storage. Tillage, erosion, and warming can prompt that carbon to be released again.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6d006d5f7700�body�٨电视、机顶盒、充电器关机后仍偷偷耗电，叫做“吸血鬼负载”。用带开关的插线板一键断电，长年累月能省下可观的电与碳。٤TVs, set-top boxes and chargers still draw power when off—the 'vampire load'. A switched power strip cuts it all at once, saving real energy and carbon over time.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6d511328342f�body�ٷ人工光会迷惑昆虫的导航与求偶，让它们绕灯乱飞耗尽力气；朝外的灯加装灯罩、调暗、定时关，能留住暗夜，给夜行性动物留一条生路。ٹArtificial light confuses insects' navigation and mating, exhausting them around lamps; shielding, dimming and timing outward lights preserves dark nights and a path for nocturnal life.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6de246f63347�body�ٳ季风把海洋暖湿气流送向大陆，强弱和进退一偏，雨带就南北摆动；偏强可能北涝南旱，偏弱可能南涝北旱，所以"雨下对地方"很关键。��The monsoon carries warm ocean moisture inland; when its strength and timing shift, the rain belt swings north or south—too strong may flood the north and dry the south, too weak the reverse.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6e4fd40d1c6d�body���厨余在填埋场里厌氧分解会大量释放甲烷这种强温室气体；而好氧堆肥让微生物在有氧条件下分解有机物，主要释放二氧化碳，并且把养分留在肥料里。多数研究估计，堆肥较填埋可减少一半以上的温室气体排放，具体幅度取决于填埋场的甲烷收集率与堆肥设施水平。因此堆肥不仅减排，还能把厨余变成改良土壤的肥料，形成“从餐桌到农田”的循环。�Food waste decomposing anaerobically in landfills releases methane, a potent greenhouse gas. Composting, in contrast, lets microbes break down organic matter with oxygen, releasing mostly CO2 and keeping nutrients in the finished fertiliser; most studies estimate composting cuts greenhouse emissions by more than half compared with landfilling, though the exact figure depends on how much methane a landfill captures. So composting both reduces emissions and turns kitchen scraps into soil improvers — a closed loop from table to farmland.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6e7f1abfe700�body���污染物渗入含水层后随缓慢流动扩散，而地下水替换周期长达数十年到上千年。一旦污染，抽水处理或原位修复都极其缓慢昂贵，因此预防远胜于治理。��Once contaminants seep into aquifers they spread with slow flow, and groundwater turnover takes decades to millennia. Cleanup by pumping or in-situ remediation is extremely slow and costly, so prevention far outweighs treatment.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6f3958740cb6�body���牛是反刍动物，消化过程排放大量甲烷，且需要广阔草场或饲料地，常伴随毁林。生产每公斤牛肉的温室气体可达豆类的十倍以上。改以植物蛋白为主可显著降低饮食碳足迹。�$Cattle are ruminants that emit large amounts of methane during digestion and need vast pasture or feed cropland, often linked to deforestation. Per kilogram, beef can emit over ten times the greenhouse gases of beans. Shifting toward plant protein noticeably lowers dietary carbon footprints.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7058deccf31c�body�٪因为地球有"热惯性"：冬至后地表仍在净散热、夏至后仍在净吸热，最冷最热会滞后一两个月，就像锅离火后还会继续烫一会儿。ٱEarth has thermal inertia: after the solstice the surface keeps losing (or gaining) net heat, so extremes lag by a month or two—like a pot staying hot after leaving the flame.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�723e7a537500�body��研究表明以植物为主的饮食可比高肉类饮食减少约两到四成的食物相关碳排放，牛肉和羊肉的排放尤其高。减少食物浪费和本地采购可进一步降低影响。饮食结构调整是个人减排最有力的手段之一。� Studies show plant-forward diets can cut food-related emissions by roughly 20 to 40 percent versus meat-heavy ones, since beef and lamb are especially high. Reducing food waste and buying local lowers impact further. Dietary shifts are among the most powerful personal mitigation actions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�758b938da7ce�body���儿童血脑屏障未完善且单位体重摄入更高，铅可干扰神经发育导致认知与行为损伤，且损害多不可逆。即使低血铅水平也与智商下降相关，因而许多国家持续下调行动阈值。�(Children have an immature blood–brain barrier and higher intake per body weight, so lead disrupts neurodevelopment causing cognitive and behavioral deficits that are largely irreversible. Even low blood-lead levels correlate with reduced IQ, prompting many countries to lower action thresholds.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�771b60259ec5�body�ٛPHA 可在海洋、土壤等自然环境中被微生物降解；PLA 通常需要工业堆肥的高温高湿条件，在常温自然环境下降解极慢。٩PHA biodegrades in marine and soil environments via microbes; PLA usually needs industrial composting's high heat and humidity, degrading very slowly in ordinary nature.�ans��src��Polymer Degradation 研究�polym degrad studies��id�78bf1f67ed06�body��>二氧化碳并非有一个单一的寿命，它在大气、海洋和陆地之间被复杂分配。约一半的人为排放会在几年到几十年内被海洋和生物圈吸收，但仍有相当部分存留数百年，少量甚至超过千年。这意味着今天排放的CO2将在很长时期内持续影响气候。�cCarbon dioxide does not have a single lifetime; it is cycled among the atmosphere, oceans, and land. About half of human emissions is taken up by oceans and the biosphere within years to decades, but a substantial fraction persists for centuries and some for over a millennium. This means today's CO2 emissions will influence climate for a very long time.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7911b0439ed9�body���树轮宽度与同位素反映温度、降水和干旱；珊瑚年层记录海温与盐度；冰芯封存气泡的 CO2/甲烷与同位素示踪古气温，三者相互交叉验证过去气候。��Tree-ring width and isotopes track temperature, precipitation and drought; coral bands record sea temperature and salinity; ice-core bubbles preserve CO2/methane and isotope paleo-temperature—cross-validating past climate.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7b8fde2d4b93�body�ٳ对应"顺应自然、因地制宜"：在合适的时间、合适的土地做合适的事，而不是一刀切地改造；这正和今天的适应性管理、生态农业相通。ٵIt matches "work with nature, fit the place": doing the right thing at the right time and land rather than forcing uniformity—close to today's adaptive management and agroecology.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7d0418d843e2�body���指少数族裔、低收入社区不成比例地承受垃圾场、工厂、污染设施等环境危害，源自规划、政策与历史歧视的叠加，是环境正义关注的核心问题。��It means minority and low-income communities disproportionately bear hazards like dumps, plants and pollution from planning, policy and historical discrimination combined—a core environmental-justice issue.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7d3b08cac5a2�body���速生但木质脆的树易在台风中断枝伤车伤人；雌株飞絮引发过敏与火灾隐患；引进树种还可能水土不服。选树要把“好看”和“好养、安全”一起算。ٻFast but brittle wood snaps in storms, injuring cars and people; female fluff triggers allergies and fire risk; imported species may struggle. Choose for safety and care, not looks alone.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�7d5f3c7c3ec8�body���风光与储能的制造、安装和维护创造了大量新增就业，且多数为本地岗位。能源转型会使部分化石行业岗位减少，需要再培训与公正转型政策衔接。整体看，清洁能源就业增长已快于传统能源。�Manufacturing, installing, and maintaining wind, solar, and storage creates many new jobs, mostly local. The transition reduces some fossil-sector jobs, requiring retraining and just-transition policies. Overall, clean-energy employment is growing faster than traditional energy.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7db85b34d701�body���三角数字1–7标明了树脂类型，如PET(1)、HDPE(2)易回收，而PS(6)、PVC(3)难回收且含增塑剂。混收会降低再生料品质，因此分类投放直接影响回收可行性与安全性。��The 1–7 resin codes identify polymer type: PET(1) and HDPE(2) recycle easily, while PS(6) and PVC(3) are hard to recycle and may carry plasticizers. Mixing lowers recyclate quality, so sorting directly determines feasibility and safety.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�7f66345247f0�body��海洋热浪是某海域海温异常持续偏高的事件，频率与强度随变暖上升。它引发珊瑚白化、海藻林退化和鱼类群落改变，扰乱渔业与食物链。海洋热浪常在不知不觉中发生，却对生态系统冲击猛烈。�PA marine heatwave is an event where sea temperature in a region stays abnormally high for an extended period, growing more frequent and intense with warming. It triggers coral bleaching, kelp forest loss, and shifts in fish communities, disrupting fisheries and food webs. Marine heatwaves often occur unnoticed yet hit ecosystems hard.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�801cb170d5e5�body���共享模式让一件商品被多人轮流使用，提高资产利用率并减少每人拥有的总量。典型如共享单车、租车和工具租赁，降低制造和更新需求。其净效益取决于是否替代了原有购买而非刺激新消费。�*Sharing lets one item be used in turns by many, raising asset utilisation and cutting total ownership. Examples like bike-sharing, car rental and tool libraries lower manufacturing and replacement demand. Net benefit depends on whether it replaces ownership rather than stimulating new consumption.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�80f0a4c3f408�body�٭常遵循GHG Protocol：先确定组织边界与核算范围（1/2/3），再收集活动数据、乘以排放因子计算，最后核查与披露。数据质量是难点。ٳUsually GHG Protocol: set organizational boundary and scopes (1/2/3), collect activity data, multiply by emission factors, then verify and disclose. Data quality is the hard part.�ans��src��GHG Protocol�GHG Protocol��id�81f0bf1f7508�body�� “减缓”是指减少温室气体排放或增加碳汇，从根源上放慢气候变化的速度，如改用清洁能源。“适应”则是面对已经或不可避免的变暖，调整社会与自然系统以减少损害，如修建海堤、改良耐旱作物。两者缺一不可。�0Mitigation means reducing greenhouse gas emissions or increasing sinks to slow climate change at its source, such as switching to clean energy. Adaptation means adjusting societies and ecosystems to unavoidable warming to limit harm, like building seawalls or drought-resistant crops. Both are essential.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�829b30e29fa3�body���如恢复红树林与珊瑚礁作风暴缓冲、城市树木与湿地降温、农业农林复合系统保水。NbS兼具适应、减缓与生物多样性收益，但需避免“绿化洗白”。��Examples: restoring mangroves and reefs as storm buffers, urban trees and wetlands for cooling, agroforestry for water retention. NbS yields co-benefits for adaptation, mitigation and biodiversity, but beware 'greenwashing'.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�830b681ce91f�body��;栖息地破碎化是指连片的栖息地被道路、农田或城市分割成许多小块，使野生动物活动范围受限、种群被隔离。破碎的栖息地更难维持物种生存，并增加近亲繁殖和局部灭绝的风险。修建生态廊道可以帮助动物在被分割的栖息地之间移动。�SHabitat fragmentation is the breaking of continuous habitat into smaller isolated patches by roads, farms, or cities, limiting wildlife movement and isolating populations. Fragmented habitat makes species survival harder and raises risks of inbreeding and local extinction. Ecological corridors help animals move between separated patches.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�833aa69e3e10�body���CADR 是洁净空气输出速率，数值越高净化越快；CCM 是滤网累计可净化量，越高越耐用。挑与房间面积匹配、滤网可换且标注真实的机型，比追“负离子”“除醛率99%”的噱头更靠谱。��CADR is clean-air delivery rate—higher cleans faster; CCM is cumulative filter capacity—higher lasts longer. Match the unit to room size with real, replaceable filters rather than chasing 'ions' or '99%' gimmicks.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�8396f608c141�body��食物里程指食物从生产地到消费地所运输的距离，常用来衡量流通环节的碳排放。但里程并非全部，生产方式的排放往往远大于运输，例如本地反季节温室菜可能高于外地应季菜。评估应结合全生命周期。�4Food miles measure the distance food travels from production to consumption, often used as a proxy for transport emissions. But miles are not the whole story; production emissions usually dominate, so local off-season greenhouse produce can exceed seasonal imports. Assessment should use the full life cycle.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�839f205ae281�body���日常雨水本身挺干净，适合浇花；但城市累积在屋顶路面的灰尘、尾气颗粒和油污，会在“初雨”被一并冲下，所以头几分钟的雨水最好弃去再接。پRain itself is fairly clean and fine for plants; but dust, exhaust particles and oil built up on roofs and roads wash off in the 'first flush', so skip the opening minutes before collecting.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�83d68d708725�body���人造板材、胶黏剂、部分布艺是主要来源，且会持续释放数年。通风是把已释放的甲醛排走最有效的方法；活性炭只是吸附一小部分、还会饱和，治标不治本。��Composite boards, glues and some fabrics are the main sources and keep emitting for years. Ventilation is the most effective way to remove released formaldehyde; activated carbon only adsorbs a bit and saturates—symptomatic, not fundamental.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�83ea1d0b0bb8�body��:海洋吸收的二氧化碳约占人类排放的四分之一，大大减缓了大气升温，但二氧化碳溶于海水会生成碳酸、降低海水pH值，这就是海洋酸化。酸化会削弱贝类、珊瑚等生物形成碳酸钙外壳的能力。保护海洋健康，同样要从减排二氧化碳做起。�fThe ocean absorbs about a quarter of human CO2 emissions, greatly slowing atmospheric warming. But CO2 dissolving in seawater forms carbonic acid and lowers the pH — ocean acidification. Acidified water makes it harder for shellfish, corals and other creatures to build calcium-carbonate shells. Protecting the ocean therefore also starts with cutting CO2.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8471b848bfcc�body��8环评要求项目公开信息、听取居民和专家意见，让受影响的社区有机会表达关切、提出替代方案，也促使建设单位修正设计、完善环保措施。有效的公众参与是项目环境风险的社会把关，符合“谁受影响、谁有发言权”的环境治理原则。�xEIA requires publishing project information and hearing residents and experts, giving affected communities the chance to voice concerns and propose alternatives and pushing developers to revise designs and strengthen safeguards. Genuine public participation is a social gatekeeper for environmental risk, honouring the governance principle that those affected deserve a voice.�ans��src��9中国生态环境部（环境影响评价公众参与）�$China MEE (EIA public participation)��id�864a3fe20ef3�body��《京都议定书》以自上而下方式给少数发达国家设定强制减排目标，而《巴黎协定》采用各国自主贡献的普惠模式。巴黎协定覆盖范围更广，并把适应与资金纳入核心。它标志着气候治理从强制分配转向集体自主。�JThe Kyoto Protocol set binding targets for a limited group of developed countries in a top-down way, while the Paris Agreement uses nationally determined contributions for nearly all. Paris has broader coverage and puts adaptation and finance at its core. It marks a shift from imposed allocation to collective self-determination.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�868b0d4a1dfa�body�٪“双碳”指力争 2030 年前碳达峰、2060 年前碳中和。这是国家层面的长期承诺，驱动能源、产业、交通和城市的系统性低碳转型。��'Dual carbon' means striving to peak emissions before 2030 and reach carbon neutrality before 2060. It is a national pledge driving systemic low-carbon shifts in energy, industry, transport and cities.�ans��src��0国际能源署（IEA）《世界能源展望》�7International Energy Agency (IEA), World Energy Outlook��id�8732d6d18105�body�٢园区内企业彼此交换余热、副产品和废水，形成类似自然食物网的资源循环，降低总成本与排放，是产业共生的空间载体。ٻFirms in the park exchange waste heat, by-products and water, forming a resource loop like a natural food web, cutting total cost and emissions—the spatial form of industrial symbiosis.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8a694107f737�body�ٳ许多鱼类的性成熟和种群恢复需要多个繁殖周期，十年约等于覆盖几代鱼的生命史，让种群有足够时间回弹，短了往往"刚恢复又被捕"。ٱMany fish need several spawning cycles to recover; ten years spans a few fish generations, giving stocks time to rebound—shorter bans often cut recovery off just as it begins.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�8dd4e55c6fac�body���生态效率指在提供同等产品或服务的条件下，尽可能减少对资源和能源的消耗以及污染的排放。提高生态效率意味着“用更少做更多”。它鼓励企业改进工艺、设计节能产品。��Eco-efficiency means delivering the same product or service while using fewer resources and energy and producing less pollution. Improving it means doing more with less. It encourages firms to upgrade processes and design energy-saving products.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8dd6ec4b2a6d�body��h一次性塑料杯、吸管、餐具和塑料袋的使用时间常常只有几分钟，却可能在环境中存留数百年，还特别容易泄漏到河流海洋。限制它们的替代方案成熟、成本低、容易执行，能快速见效。同时政策强调：替代品也要做全生命周期评估，不能简单用可降解名义掩盖掩埋问题。��Single-use cups, straws, cutlery and bags are used for minutes yet can persist in the environment for centuries, and they leak into rivers and oceans particularly easily. Alternatives are mature, cheap and easy to enforce, so restricting these items brings fast results. Policies also insist that substitutes be assessed over their full life cycle — a biodegradable label is not a licence to bury plastic in landfill.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8de81da0f2ce�body�٫厨余单独堆肥可避免进入填埋场产生甲烷，制成有机肥替代化肥、改善土壤结构并固碳；若混入其他垃圾焚烧则浪费了这份资源。��Composting food waste avoids landfill methane, yields organic fertilizer that substitutes for chemical fertilizer, improves soil and stores carbon; mixing it into incineration wastes that resource.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8e056903ff6b�body���物种多样的生态系统通常功能更冗余、恢复力更强，更能承受干旱、高温等扰动。不同物种对环境变化的响应各异，可避免系统整体崩溃。保护生物多样性因此也是增强气候适应能力的策略。�Species-rich ecosystems tend to have redundant functions and greater resilience, better withstanding disturbances like drought and heat. Different species respond differently to change, preventing whole-system collapse. Protecting biodiversity is thus also a climate-adaptation strategy.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8e3c143c4a52�body�ٓ未被消费的食物其生产排放被白白浪费，且厨余在填埋场释放甲烷。减少损耗可避免相应土地、水与排放投入。٭Food never eaten wastes the emissions of its production, and discarded scraps emit methane in landfill. Reducing loss avoids the associated land, water, and emission inputs.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8ed2c3a5e8ee�body���就地保护在物种原生境中保护种群和生态过程（保护区、国家公园），是最根本的方式；迁地保护（动物园、植物园、种子库）在野外濒临灭绝时兜底，例如华南虎和苏铁。迁地种群小、遗传多样性低、缺少自然选择压力，最终目标是放归并恢复野生种群，所以它只能补充而不能替代就地保护。�
In-situ conservation protects populations and ecological processes in their native habitats through reserves and national parks and is fundamental. Ex-situ conservation — zoos, botanic gardens, and seed banks — is a safety net when species near extinction in the wild, e.g., the South China tiger and cycads. Ex-situ populations are small, genetically poorer, and lose natural selection pressure; the ultimate goal is reintroduction to restore wild populations, so it complements but never replaces in-situ protection.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�8ed9d62a3b57�body�٫能，但前提是“真的反复用”。一次性的布包或竹筷若只用几次就丢，反而因生产耗能更高而不划算；持续使用才是减塑的关键。٢Yes, but only if you actually reuse them. A cloth bag or bamboo fork used a few times then tossed can cost more than plastic; consistent reuse is what cuts waste.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�91a2246644c8�body��a3R指减量化（Reduce）、再利用（Reuse）和再循环（Recycle）。顺序很重要：首先是少用少买，其次是让物品重复使用，最后才把材料回收再造。近年还扩展出拒绝（Refuse）和修复（Repair），因为回收本身也消耗能源。遵循这个顺序，资源才能留在循环里而不是变成垃圾。�[The 3Rs are Reduce, Reuse and Recycle — and the order matters. First buy and consume less, then keep things in use longer, and only as a last step turn materials back into new products. Recent versions add Refuse and Repair, because recycling itself consumes energy. Following this sequence keeps resources circulating instead of becoming waste.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�91fc9d37de6c�body���它不是"种一棵活一棵"的奇迹，而是几代人用耐寒树种、机械整地和科学管护，先把土壤保住再逐步恢复植被；说明生态修复需要长期主义和适配物种。��It wasn't a one-shot miracle but generations using cold-hardy species, mechanized land prep and scientific management—stabilizing soil first, then restoring vegetation. It shows restoration needs the long term and the right species.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�9203a4f70835�body���能拦下大部分（常>90%），主要靠初级沉淀和活性污泥的絮体吸附，但最终有少量随出水或污泥进入环境。污泥农用可能成为微塑料回归土壤的渠道。��They capture most (often >90%), mainly via primary settling and floc adsorption in activated sludge, but a fraction escapes in effluent or sludge. Sludge used as fertilizer can return microplastics to soil.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�93a7a8006ff6�body�ٌ鸭子吃虫吃草，排泄的粪便直接肥田，踩水还能抑制杂草；一只鸭子集"除草机、施肥器、除虫员"于一身。ٟDucks eat insects and weeds while their droppings fertilize the field, and paddling suppresses weeds—one duck is weeder, fertilizer and pest-control at once.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�93f821cb7f1b�body�ٱ它们直接从空气吸收水分和养分、没有真正根系保护，对二氧化硫、重金属和氮沉降极敏感，种类和盖度的变化能反映当地污染水平。��They absorb water and nutrients straight from air without root protection, so they are very sensitive to SO2, heavy metals and N deposition; shifts in species and cover reveal local pollution.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�945614ace6a0�body���研究显示，纯素食饮食的温室气体足迹可比高肉饮食低约一半甚至更多。即使只是减少红肉、增加蔬果，也能带来可观减排。饮食转型因此被视为低成本、高收益的气候策略。�Studies show plant-based diets can have greenhouse gas footprints about half or less of heavy-meat diets. Even simply reducing red meat and eating more produce yields substantial savings. Dietary shifts are thus seen as low-cost, high-benefit climate strategy.�ans��src��+联合国粮食及农业组织;《科学》�FAO;Science��id�9468bcc88e15�body��A洁白的海冰能把大部分太阳光反射回太空，而深色的海水则会吸收更多阳光。当海冰融化、海面扩大，地球吸收的太阳能增多，海水升温又进一步加速融冰，形成“冰—反照率正反馈”。这也是北极变暖速度比全球平均快两到四倍的原因之一。�gBright sea ice reflects most sunlight back to space, while dark open ocean absorbs much more of it. As ice melts and open water expands, the planet absorbs more solar energy, the water warms further and melts even more ice — a self-reinforcing ice–albedo feedback. This is one reason the Arctic is warming two to four times faster than the global average.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9536a4864057�body���碳税直接规定每吨CO2的价格，排放成本可预测但总量不确定。碳交易固定总排放上限，总量可控但价格随市场波动。两者都是碳定价工具，常按国情组合使用。�A carbon tax directly sets a price per ton of CO2, giving predictable costs but uncertain total emissions. Carbon trading fixes the total cap, controlling volume but letting the price fluctuate. Both are carbon-pricing tools, often combined by countries as suited.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�95494ad03473�body�ٱ指系统（社区、生态、基础设施）在气候冲击下吸收、恢复并调适的能力。提升韧性包括冗余设计、早期预警、生态缓冲与社会保障。��It is the ability of a system (community, ecosystem, infrastructure) to absorb, recover from and adapt to climate shocks. Building it includes redundancy, early warning, ecological buffers and social protection.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�955ad9dea426�body��,预防原则主张：即使科学上尚未完全证明某种活动会造成严重危害，只要存在合理怀疑，就应采取预防措施避免潜在的环境或健康风险。它常用于化学品管理、转基因和气候变化等领域。这一原则强调“宁可谨慎，不可后悔”。�The precautionary principle holds that when an activity raises plausible threats of serious harm, lack of full scientific certainty should not delay preventive measures. It is used in chemicals management, GMOs, and climate policy. It emphasizes better safe than sorry.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�95f9ea4f07e1�body���韧性城市强调在灾前提升冗余与多样性、灾中维持关键功能、灾后快速恢复，把风险管理从被动防御转为主动适应。其核心是降低暴露与脆弱性并保障生命线系统的连续性。�'Resilient cities build redundancy and diversity before disasters, maintain critical functions during them and recover quickly after, shifting risk management from passive defense to active adaptation. The core is lowering exposure and vulnerability while ensuring continuity of lifeline systems.�ans��src��FUNDRR 2017《如何让城市更有韧性：地方政府领导手册》�WUNDRR (2017) How to Make Cities More Resilient: A Handbook for Local Government Leaders��id�965c93d00d48�body���通常步行、骑行最低（近乎零），公共交通次之，电动车取决于电网清洁度，私家车（尤其单人燃油车）最高。短途优先“腿和轮”，中长途选公交地铁最划算。ٳWalking and cycling are near-zero, public transit next, EVs depend on grid cleanliness, and a solo gasoline car is highest. Walk or bike short trips; take transit for medium ones.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9702f08626fb�body���一部手机含金、银、铜、稀土等，从电子垃圾里提炼比开矿更省能耗与水源，还能少排污染；正规回收既护环境也守住资源，别让旧机躺在抽屉里成为“城市矿山”的浪费。��A phone holds gold, silver, copper and rare earths; recovering them beats mining in energy and water and cuts pollution. Proper recycling protects the environment and resources—don't let old phones waste a 'urban mine' in a drawer.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9a1b5c5ea748�body�ِ指单位经济活动（如每度电、每元GDP）的CO2排放量。降低碳强度是实现减排而不必立刻停止增长的一条路径。ّIt is CO2 emissions per unit of economic activity (per kWh, per yuan of GDP). Lowering it lets emissions fall without immediately halting growth.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9a5a9d2537a7�body��8城市降温靠“降温基础设施”：增加公园和行道树提供树荫，用浅色和反光屋顶减少吸热，建设绿地和蓝空间（水体）促进蒸发冷却，并设计通风廊道引导凉风。这些基于自然的降温措施比空调更节能，还能同时吸收雨水、提升宜居性。�hCities cool down through infrastructure: parks and street trees for shade, light-coloured and reflective roofs to cut heat absorption, green and blue spaces (water bodies) for evaporative cooling, and ventilation corridors that channel breezes. These nature-based measures use less energy than air conditioning and also absorb rainwater and improve livability.�ans��src�ٲAkbari、Pomerantz 与 Taha,《Cool surfaces and shade trees to reduce energy use and improve air quality in urban areas》,Solar Energy,2001 (DOI: 10.1016/s0038-092x(00)00089-x)ٶH. Akbari, M. Pomerantz & H. Taha, 'Cool surfaces and shade trees to reduce energy use and improve air quality in urban areas', Solar Energy, 2001, DOI: 10.1016/s0038-092x(00)00089-x��id�9a633246bfcd�body���生物基指原料来自生物质（如玉米淀粉），不等于能降解；可降解指在特定条件下被微生物分解，但不一定生物基，也不一定在自然海洋中快速分解。两者常被混淆。��Bio-based means feedstock from biomass (e.g., corn starch), not necessarily degradable; biodegradable means broken down by microbes under conditions, not necessarily bio-based or fast in the open ocean. They are often confused.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�9ae62130a04c�body���生态流量指为维持河流生态系统结构与功能所需保留的流量及其时空变化过程。保障生态流量可维持河道形态、连通性与生物栖息地，防止河流断流与湿地萎缩。��Environmental flow is the quantity, timing and variability of water flow required to sustain a river's ecosystem structure and functions. Securing it maintains channel form, connectivity and habitats, preventing channel drying and wetland loss.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9b8ac404d31b�body���牛要养数年、反刍产甲烷、吃大量饲料与饮水，单位蛋白的碳与水足迹常是豆制品的数倍到数十倍；适度用豆类、禽蛋替代红肉，是家庭最易行的减碳减水吃法。��Cattle take years, emit ruminant methane and eat lots of feed and water, so per-protein carbon and water footprints are often several to tens of times soy's. Swapping some red meat for beans or eggs is an easy home cut.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9bd297ca1298�body��建筑运行消耗大量电力与供暖能源，可通过保温改造、高效电器和可再生能源并网来降耗。新建建筑采用被动式设计与电气化也能大幅减排。建筑存量庞大，改造周期长，是减排的慢变量但潜力巨大。�JBuildings use large amounts of electricity and heating energy, which can drop via insulation retrofits, efficient appliances, and on-site renewables. New builds using passive design and electrification also cut emissions sharply. The stock is huge and retrofits slow, making buildings a slow but high-potential abatement variable.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�9d07070979c4�body�ٖ它们像“海绵”吸收降雨、延缓径流与内涝，植物蒸腾降温，并给城市生物提供生境，减轻热岛与排水系统压力。٨They act like sponges soaking up rain, delaying runoff and flooding, cooling via transpiration and giving urban wildlife habitat, easing heat islands and drainage load.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�9db614f67d44�body�ٮ把电池、屏幕、芯片等做成可单独更换的模块，便于维修、升级与回收，延长产品寿命并提高稀有金属的回收效率，减少整机废弃。ٵMaking batteries, screens and chips individually replaceable eases repair, upgrades and recovery, extends product life and improves rare-metal recycling, cutting whole-device waste.�ans��src��Right to Repair 运动�Right to Repair��id�9de4dd7b3f72�body���海平面上升主要有两大原因：海水受热膨胀，以及陆地冰川和冰盖融化向海洋注入水量。此外，地下水抽取后排入海洋也有贡献。过去一个世纪全球海平面已上升约20厘米，且速度在加快。�QSea level rise is driven mainly by two factors: thermal expansion of warming seawater and the addition of water from melting land ice such as glaciers and ice sheets. Groundwater extraction that eventually reaches the ocean also contributes. Global mean sea level has risen about 20 centimeters over the last century and is accelerating.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9e7ccf9d1557�body���绿氢是用可再生能源电解水制取的氢，全程几乎零碳排放。它可作为难减排行业（如钢铁、航运、化工）的清洁燃料或原料。挑战在于当前成本偏高且需要大量清洁电力。�#Green hydrogen is produced by electrolyzing water with renewable electricity, with near-zero emissions throughout. It can serve as clean fuel or feedstock for hard-to-abate sectors like steel, shipping, and chemicals. The challenge is its still-high cost and demand for abundant clean power.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9f869e4d031e�body�ٹ不是。变暖是CO2导致热量滞留，酸化是CO2直接溶海改变化学；二者同源但机制不同，且酸化不受短期气温波动影响，是更'确定性'的CO2信号。��No. Warming is heat trapped by CO2; acidification is CO2 dissolving and changing seawater chemistry. Same source, different mechanics, and acidification is unaffected by short-term temperature swings—a more 'certain' CO2 signal.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a0ecb6b4e929�body���一起翻土、轮值浇水、分享收成，创造了自然的交谈与互助场景；研究显示参与社区园艺的人邻里信任更高、孤独感更低，绿地去中心化也更易到达。��Shared digging, watering shifts and harvests create natural talk and mutual aid; studies link community gardening to higher neighbor trust and less loneliness, with green space that's easy to reach.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a16f5dc88807�body���冰芯记录过去 CO2 与温度变化、年轮等代用指标给出“已发生”的强迫-响应关系，用来检验模型在古今不同气候态下的表现，从而收紧敏感度估计范围。ٷIce cores record past CO2 and temperature; proxies like tree rings give observed forcing-response, testing models across climate states and tightening the estimated sensitivity range.�ans��src��Paleoclimate 研究�paleoclimate��id�a28889dbfbe1�body�ٮ油棕单产高但多植于热带泥炭与雨林带，为种植园清空林地与排干泥炭会释放巨量碳并消灭红猩猩等栖息地，故成为毁林热点商品。��Oil palm yields highly but is planted in tropical peat and rainforest zones; clearing forest and draining peat for plantations releases massive carbon and destroys orangutan habitat, making it a deforestation hotspot commodity.�ans��src��WWF;Roundtable RSPO�WWF;RSPO��id�a37727cfcde0�body���海冰减少削弱反照率并加热北极，可能扰动急流使中纬度天气更易卡住，导致持续高温、寒潮或干旱。这种遥相关机制仍有研究争议，但观测与模拟都提示联系在增强。�Less sea ice lowers albedo and warms the Arctic, potentially disturbing the jet stream so mid-latitude weather gets stuck, causing persistent heat, cold snaps, or drought. This teleconnection is debated, but observations and models both suggest the link is strengthening.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a428deaa13e7�body���生态系统服务是自然系统为人类提供的各种惠益：供给服务如粮食和淡水，调节服务如气候、洪水与传粉，支持服务如养分循环，文化服务如美景与游憩。把森林、湿地、珊瑚礁的服务折算成经济价值，可以让保护决策进入算账体系，例如一片湿地净化污水的价值，往往高于把它填平开发。��Ecosystem services are the benefits nature provides: provisioning (food, freshwater), regulating (climate, flood control, pollination), supporting (nutrient cycling) and cultural (scenery, recreation). Putting a monetary value on the services of forests, wetlands and reefs brings conservation into cost–benefit decisions — a wetland's water-purifying value often outweighs the profit from draining and developing it.�ans��src��"WRI（自然资本核算）；UNEP�&WRI (natural capital accounting); UNEP��id�a52526dfecab�body���碳标签把产品从原料到废弃的温室气体排放量标注在包装上，以二氧化碳当量表示。它让消费者直观比较同类产品的气候影响，引导低碳购买。标签的公信力依赖统一的核算标准和第三方核查。�(A carbon label shows a product's greenhouse-gas emissions from raw material to disposal, expressed in CO2 equivalent. It lets consumers compare climate impact across similar products and choose lower-carbon options. Credibility relies on uniform accounting standards and third-party verification.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a5273df152ef�body���海洋吸收约四分之一人为二氧化碳，溶解后生成碳酸使海水pH下降，即海洋酸化。酸度升高削弱珊瑚和贝类构建碳酸钙外壳的能力。这反过来影响海洋碳泵和生物固碳。�(The ocean absorbs about a quarter of anthropogenic CO2; dissolved, it forms carbonic acid and lowers seawater pH, i.e. ocean acidification. Higher acidity weakens corals' and shellfish's ability to build calcium-carbonate shells. This in turn affects the ocean carbon pump and biological storage.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a5a6148dccad�body���可堆肥通常指符合标准（如EN13432）在工业堆肥条件下降解且不留毒残；生物降解则模糊，可能只需“最终”分解，未必在特定环境快速完成，易被用作营销。��'Compostable' usually meets a standard (e.g., EN13432) degrading in industrial compost without toxic residue; 'biodegradable' is vague—may only mean eventual breakdown, not fast in a given setting, and is often used in marketing.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a7bb012c93ad�body��2常用方法有三种：地面样地测量树木直径与高度推算生物量；激光雷达或卫星遥感估算冠层和面积变化；碳通量塔直接测定二氧化碳交换。把样地调查与遥感结合，就能追踪森林碳储量的变化，这些数据也支撑着各国的碳清单报告。�XThree methods are common: field plots measuring trunk diameter and height to estimate biomass; LiDAR or satellite remote sensing of canopy and area change; and eddy-covariance flux towers directly measuring CO2 exchange. Combining plots with remote sensing tracks changes in forest carbon stocks, data that underpin national carbon inventories.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ac4e33b27020�body�ٱ模型与观测提示，当毁林与干旱叠加使雨林失去自身造雨能力，可能越过临界点退化为更干旱的稀树草原，碳储与区域气候都将改变。ٿModels and observations suggest deforestation plus drought can strip the forest of its rain-making ability, crossing a threshold to drier savanna, altering carbon stores and regional climate.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�aec237435df8�body��气候行动（SDG 13）与其他目标如清洁能源、减少贫困、保护海洋和陆地生命紧密交织。减缓气候变化有助于实现多数目标，但片面追求增长也可能与之冲突。协同推进可带来健康、就业和生态多赢。�-Climate action (SDG 13) is intertwined with goals like clean energy, poverty reduction, and life below water and on land. Mitigating climate change helps achieve most goals, though single-minded growth can conflict with them. Pursuing them together yields co-benefits for health, jobs, and ecosystems.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�aed7c7f7ddc2�body��气候变化并未制造天气，但通过改变大气能量与水汽抬高了某些极端事件的概率和强度。例如热浪更频繁、强降水更集中、沿海风暴潮叠加更高海平面。归因科学已能对单个事件量化其人为贡献。�LClimate change does not create weather, but by shifting atmospheric energy and moisture it raises the likelihood and intensity of some extremes. Examples are more frequent heatwaves, concentrated heavy rainfall, and coastal storms riding higher seas. Attribution science can now quantify the human contribution to individual events.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�af94b34402c8�body�ٷ净零侧重CO2或所有温室气体的排放—移除平衡；气候中和有时还纳入非气候环境影响（如本地空气污染）的抵消，口径更宽，定义需看清。��Net zero emphasizes balancing CO2 or all GHG emissions with removals; climate neutrality sometimes also offsets non-climate impacts (e.g., local air pollution), a broader scope—read the definition carefully.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�af9ecbffa97c�body���难点包括：非正规回收渠道分流、进口二手设备界定、中小企业合规成本、回收率核算造假，以及基金费率难反映真实回收成本。需要透明的溯源与审计。��Challenges: informal channels diverting waste, defining imported used devices, SME compliance costs, fake recycling-rate reporting, and fees not reflecting true costs. Transparent tracking and auditing are needed.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b0be9904c1a1�body��#生物质能是利用植物、农业废弃物、木屑甚至生活垃圾中的有机物燃烧或发酵来产生热能、电力或生物燃料的能源。它来源于近期生长的植物，理论上碳排放可接近中性。但若大规模毁林种能源作物，反而可能破坏生态。�6Biomass energy comes from burning or fermenting organic matter—plants, crop residues, wood, even some waste—to yield heat, power, or biofuel. Because it derives from recently grown plants, its carbon emissions can be near neutral. But large-scale energy-crop planting on cleared forest can harm ecosystems.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b28e966c484b�body���碳税由政府定“每吨价格”、排放量随经济浮动；碳交易（总量管制与交易）先定“排放总量上限”、让企业买卖配额，价格由市场决定、排放总量更可控。ٴA carbon tax sets the price per tonne and lets emissions vary; cap-and-trade sets a total emissions cap and lets firms trade allowances, so the price floats but the total is fixed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b35a4db9cc25�body�ٕ桑叶养蚕、蚕粪喂鱼、塘泥回田肥桑，几乎不浪费；物质在"桑—蚕—鱼—泥"之间转圈，是古人设计的闭环系统。ٶMulberry leaves feed silkworms, their waste feeds fish, and pond mud fertilizes the mulberries—matter cycles through mulberry-silkworm-fish-mud, a closed loop designed by ancients.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b3f49ec486ae�body���混凝土和沥青使雨水无法下渗，地表径流迅速汇集成洪峰，超过排水管网能力。不透水率越高，洪峰来得更早更猛。增加透水铺装和绿地可延缓并削减径流。��Concrete and asphalt stop rainwater from soaking in, so runoff quickly peaks beyond drainage capacity. Higher imperviousness brings earlier, sharper flood peaks. Permeable paving and green space delay and reduce runoff.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b548c5c557b2�body���蓝碳核算需区分总固碳与净固碳，并考虑甲烷释放、沉积速率和可逆性。红树林与海草的碳大多存于土壤，扰动后易重新释放，因此持久性是核算核心。��Blue carbon accounting must separate gross from net sequestration and account for methane release, sedimentation, and reversibility. Most carbon sits in soils that re-emit when disturbed, making permanence central to accounting.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�b8b9f4a102ae�body��;不是。温室效应是二氧化碳等气体让热量困在大气中导致地球变暖的自然过程，而臭氧层空洞是氟利昂等物质破坏平流层臭氧、削弱阻挡紫外线的能力。两者成因和影响都不同，但都是重要的全球环境问题。应对它们需要不同的政策措施。�[No. The greenhouse effect is the natural warming process in which gases like CO2 trap heat in the atmosphere, whereas the ozone hole is the thinning of stratospheric ozone caused by substances like CFCs that weakens UV protection. Their causes and impacts differ, yet both are major global environmental issues requiring distinct policy responses.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b8fb616744f8�body�٫土壤和植物层像隔热毯，夏天挡热、冬天保温，能明显降低顶层室内温差，减少空调与取暖能耗；还能截留雨水、延长屋顶寿命。��Soil and plants act like insulation—blocking heat in summer and retaining it in winter—cutting top-floor temperature swings and AC or heating use, while catching rain and extending roof life.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b964bcc5d81e�body���变暖加剧蒸发并使某些地区降水减少、土壤变干，导致气象与农业干旱更频繁。同时干旱区扩张可能使副热带陆地更干燥。这会威胁粮食安全与水供应。��Warming boosts evaporation and reduces rainfall in some regions, drying soils and making meteorological and agricultural droughts more frequent. Dryland expansion may also parch subtropical lands further. This threatens food security and water supply.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b9f943c82c56�body�ٺ电池制造与电网来源很关键：在煤电占比高的地区，电动车全生命周期排放优势会缩水；但如果用清洁电并高里程行驶，长期仍明显更低碳。٪Battery making and grid source matter: on a coal-heavy grid an EV's life-cycle edge shrinks; but on clean power with high mileage it stays clearly lower-carbon over time.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�bb9e7a9662d6�body�ٽ快时尚靠低价高频上新，刺激过度购买与丢弃，带来巨量水耗、染整污染和填埋焚烧。慢时尚是买得少而精、保养久、支持可循环品牌与二手。��Fast fashion pushes cheap, frequent drops that drive overbuying and dumping, with huge water, dye pollution and landfill. Slow fashion is fewer, better pieces, cared for longer, plus circular and secondhand choices.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�bc15f09e25d6�body�ٴ它低温保存大量作物种子及其野生近缘种的遗传多样，未来育种可能从中找到抗病、耐旱基因，应对气候变化与新病害带来的粮食威胁。٩It cryo-preserves crop seeds and wild relatives' genetic diversity; future breeding can tap disease-resistance or drought genes to meet climate and pest threats to food.�ans��src��Crop Trust / Svalbard�Crop Trust; Svalbard��id�be2b53932fea�body��甲烷分子吸收红外辐射的效率远高于CO2，因此在分子层面增温能力极强。但它的寿命只有约12年，远短于CO2的百年以上，所以长期累积效应较小。在100年尺度上，甲烷的增温潜势约为CO2的28到36倍。�ZMethane absorbs infrared radiation far more efficiently per molecule than CO2, making it extremely potent at the molecular level. But it lasts only about 12 years in the atmosphere, much shorter than CO2's centuries, so its cumulative long-term effect is smaller. Over 100 years, methane's warming potential is roughly 28 to 36 times that of CO2.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�bed7a3fb2966�body���食物损失发生在供应链前端（收获、储存、运输中的损耗）；浪费发生在后端（零售、餐饮、家庭丢弃可食部分）。两者都意味着已投入的资源被白费。ٶLoss occurs upstream (harvest, storage, transport); waste occurs downstream (retail, food service, household discarding edible food). Both mean already-invested resources are wasted.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c06adc1fbda8�body���各国在《巴黎协定》下提交的NDC，列明本国减排、适应等气候行动计划。它们是自下而上、自愿但需定期更新的承诺。NDC的集体力度决定了全球能否达成温控目标。�Under the Paris Agreement, each country submits an NDC listing its climate actions such as emissions cuts and adaptation. These are bottom-up, voluntary commitments that must be updated periodically. Their collective ambition determines whether the temperature goal can be met.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c2c5fd13d0b9�body�ٲ多数“可堆肥”塑料按工业堆肥标准认证，需要 50°C 以上与特定微生物环境；冰冷缺菌的海洋中往往长期不降解，仍会造成塑料污染。ٵMost 'compostable' plastics are certified for industrial composting—over 50°C with specific microbes; cold, microbe-poor oceans often fail to degrade them, so pollution persists.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c3253415c897�body�ٷ不一定。若共享提高了使用率、替代了私人购买或开车，则减排；但若制造维护成本过高、或刺激更多出行，反而可能增排。要看净效应。��Not always. It cuts emissions if utilization rises and replaces private ownership or car trips; but high manufacturing/maintenance cost or induced travel can increase them. Net effect matters.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c3627968b978�body���间歇性是风光发电随日照和风速时有时无、难以按需稳定的特性。它给电网平衡带来挑战，需要储能、备用电源和灵活调度来弥补。解决间歇性是实现高比例可再生能源的关键。� Intermittency is the fact that wind and solar output appears and disappears with sunlight and wind, making steady supply difficult. It challenges grid balancing and requires storage, backup power, and flexible dispatch to compensate. Solving intermittency is key to high renewable shares.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�c398dd048f4c�body���关键是“透气、控湿、盖土”：菜叶果核与干叶/纸屑分层、保持湿润但不积水、每次加料盖一层土，并用带盖容器。做好的腐殖土是盆栽最好的肥料。��The keys are air, moisture and cover: layer greens with dry leaves or paper, keep damp not soggy, cover each addition with soil, and use a lidded bin. The finished humus is great potting fertilizer.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c40f2761b61d�body�٣如 OCO-2、GOSAT 等用光谱反演大气柱平均 CO2，叠加风场可定位羽流并估算电厂、城市等点源的排放量，弥补地面监测的空白。��Satellites like OCO-2 and GOSAT retrieve column-average CO2 from spectra; with wind data they pinpoint plumes and estimate emissions from power plants or cities, filling ground-monitoring gaps.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c6546c1bef1e�body�ٶ因为历史累计排放主要来自发达国家、而脆弱国家受害最深且减排能力弱，CBDR 主张各国共担目标但按历史责任与发展阶段承担不同义务。��Because historical cumulative emissions came mainly from developed nations while vulnerable states suffer most with less capacity, CBDR says all share the goal but duties differ by historical responsibility and development stage.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c70f4c3f6b7a�body��k城市绿地、屋顶花园、社区菜园以及传粉者友好的种植（蜜源植物、减少农药）能为蜜蜂、蝴蝶和鸟类提供碎片化但可用的栖息地，一些城市物种甚至比乡村适应得更好。通过本土植物种植和生态化养护等社区行动，居民与自然重新连接，城市也能成为物种扩散的“跳板”。��Urban green spaces, rooftop gardens, community gardens, and pollinator-friendly planting (nectar plants, less pesticide) provide fragmented but usable habitat for bees, butterflies, and birds — some species even thrive better in cities. Through community actions like native planting and ecological gardening, residents reconnect with nature, and cities become stepping stones for species dispersal.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�c7a188be17f0�body�ٽ免费让人随手拿、随手扔；收一点点钱就把“看不见的环境成本”提醒给你，行为经济学证明小额收费能大幅减少使用量，比单纯倡导更有效。ٴFree means grab-and-toss; a small charge reminds you of the hidden environmental cost, and behavioral economics shows tiny fees sharply cut use—more effective than appeals alone.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c7bae9f4f70f�body���海上风通常更强更稳，单机容量可做得更大，发电效率更高。且不占用陆地、视觉与噪声争议较小。挑战在于建设和维护成本更高、技术更复杂。�Offshore winds are generally stronger and steadier, allowing larger turbines and higher efficiency. They also avoid land use and have fewer visual and noise conflicts. The trade-off is higher construction and maintenance cost and greater technical complexity.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c8d46a0498dc�body��6“欧洲绿色新政”是欧盟提出的一揽子行动计划，目标是到2050年使欧洲成为首个“气候中和”大陆，并推动经济增长与资源使用脱钩。它包括提高能效、扩大可再生能源、改革交通等多领域措施。它是欧盟未来数十年的核心政策框架。�The European Green Deal is the EU's package of actions to make Europe the first climate-neutral continent by 2050 and decouple growth from resource use. It spans energy efficiency, renewables, transport reform, and more. It is the EU's core policy framework for coming decades.�ans��src��'欧盟委员会《欧洲绿色新政》�(European Commission, European Green Deal��id�cc65f198abbd�body��G初级生产力是指绿色植物和藻类通过光合作用把太阳能转化为有机物质的速率，是生态系统能量的最初来源。其中“净初级生产力”是总生产力减去植物自身呼吸消耗后剩下的部分。热带雨林和珊瑚礁往往是地球上初级生产力最高的生态系统之一。�sPrimary productivity is the rate at which green plants and algae convert solar energy into organic matter through photosynthesis, providing the original energy source for the ecosystem. Net primary productivity is the gross productivity minus what plants respire for their own needs. Tropical rainforests and coral reefs are among the most productive ecosystems on Earth.�ans��src��%Odum 与 Barrett《生态学基础》�3Odum, E.P. & Barrett, G.W., Fundamentals of Ecology��id�cc809439534d�body�ٷ生物脱落的皮屑、黏液、排泄物中含DNA，从水、土、空气中提取并测序，可无创地识别物种有无与多样性，特别适合隐秘或稀有物种调查。ټOrganisms shed DNA in skin, mucus and waste; extracting and sequencing it from water, soil or air reveals species presence and diversity non-invasively—ideal for elusive or rare species.�ans��src��《Science》eDNA 方法学�Science eDNA methods��id�cccf64393c55�body���生产核算只计境内排放（含出口制造）；消费核算把进口商品隐含排放算给消费国，更反映最终责任。两者差额即贸易隐含碳转移，常由发展中国家流向发达国家。�Production accounting counts only domestic emissions (including export manufacturing); consumption accounting assigns embodied emissions of imports to the consumer, better reflecting final responsibility. Their gap is traded embodied carbon, often from developing to developed nations.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ccd257151a95�body��D滴灌通过管网把水一滴一滴送到作物根部附近，只湿润根系区，大大减少蒸发、渗漏和地表径流，比漫灌节水约30%到60%，还能减少盐分在表土积累。配合覆膜和土壤湿度传感器，实现按需供水。在干旱地区，滴灌是让农业活下去的关键技术之一。��Drip irrigation delivers water drop by drop to the root zone through a pipe network, wetting only where roots grow and slashing evaporation, seepage and runoff — saving roughly 30 to 60 percent compared with flood irrigation, while also reducing salt build-up. Paired with mulching and soil-moisture sensors, it waters crops on demand. In arid regions, drip irrigation is one of the technologies that keep agriculture alive.�ans��src��-中国科学院（节水农业研究）；WRI�#CAS (water-saving agriculture); WRI��id�cd53d00b4da8�body���节水马桶通过双档冲水、小容量水箱和虹吸优化，把单次冲水量从旧式的十几升降到六升以下。部分产品还采用真空或泡沫密封进一步省水。配合中水回用可再降市政供水压力。��Water-saving toilets use dual flush, smaller cisterns and improved siphon design to cut a flush from over ten litres to under six. Some add vacuum or foam seal to save more. Combined with greywater reuse they further ease municipal supply pressure.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cdd6319ac7da�body���旗舰物种能吸引资金与公众关注，其保护地往往覆盖大片栖息地，顺带庇护同域的动植物；但也可能挤占对其他物种的投入，需与系统保护规划结合。ټFlagships draw funds and attention; their reserves often span large habitats, sheltering co-occurring species—but can crowd out other taxa, so pair with systematic conservation planning.�ans��src��Conservation Biology�Conserv Biol��id�cf1a42e5ea49�body���研究把靠近绿地的居民与更低的压力激素、更好的睡眠和更多步行运动相关联；哪怕一小块绿地，也能成为日常放松和邻里见面的“城市充电桩”。ٲStudies link nearby green space to lower stress hormones, better sleep and more walking; even a small patch acts as a daily 'city charging point' for rest and neighborly contact.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�cf2eef5016e1�body�ٴ原因往往是栖息地碎片化、食物季节变化与种群恢复后的扩散需求叠加；象群在寻找更合适的资源和通道，提醒我们生态廊道的重要性。پIt's usually habitat fragmentation plus seasonal food shifts and post-recovery dispersal—elephants seeking better resources and corridors, a reminder of how vital ecological corridors are.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�cf836d9c3b37�body���青、草、鲢、鳙是长江流域的旗舰经济鱼，也是很多水鸟的饵料基础；它们产卵依赖特定流水环境，过度捕捞让种群难以补充，禁渔给它们喘息空间。��The black, grass, silver and bighead carps are key economic fish and prey base; they need specific flowing-water spawning grounds, and overfishing left no replenishment—the ban gives them room to recover.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�d11f7a567cd2�body��QPM2.5指直径不超过2.5微米的细颗粒物，比头发丝直径的约三十分之一还小，能绕过呼吸道防线直达肺泡、进入血液，与心血管和呼吸系统疾病相关。它主要来自燃烧、工业排放和汽车尾气等。控制PM2.5需要从源头减排，这也是空气质量优良天数增加的关键。��PM2.5 is fine particulate matter no wider than 2.5 micrometres — smaller than about one-thirtieth of a hair's diameter — so it slips past the respiratory defences into the deep lungs and bloodstream, and is linked to cardiovascular and respiratory illness. It comes mainly from burning, industry and vehicle exhaust. Cutting PM2.5 at source is the key to more days of good air quality.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�d12986cb08f2�body�ٛ坡地上庄稼收割后地表裸露，雨一冲土就跑；恢复林木草被后，根系抓土、落叶护表、减缓径流，土壤就被"留"住了。ٸOn slopes, harvested crops leave bare soil that rain washes away; restored trees and grass use roots to hold soil, litter to shield the surface and slower runoff to keep soil in place.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�d5b5b4c7098e�body���策略包括建设海堤与潮汐闸的硬防护、恢复滩涂与珊瑚礁的软防护，以及退缩线与综合管理。荷兰通过须德海工程与「与海共存」政策提供了典型范例。�	Strategies combine hard protection such as seawalls and tidal barriers, soft protection via restored mudflats and reefs, and retreat zones with integrated management. The Netherlands offers a classic example through its Zuiderzee works and living-with-water policy.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d62a68c50fba�body��D生物基塑料由玉米、甘蔗等生物质原料制成，如聚乳酸PLA，其原料端可减少化石依赖。但它并不等于可降解，许多生物基塑料仍需工业堆肥条件才能分解，且种植原料会占用土地和水。是否更环保取决于全生命周期的能耗、土地利用和回收体系。�gBio-based plastics are made from biomass feedstocks like corn or sugarcane, such as PLA, which can reduce fossil dependence at the raw-material stage. But they are not automatically biodegradable; many need industrial composting and their crops use land and water. Whether they are greener depends on the full life-cycle energy, land use and recycling system.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d64a2c428c9d�body�ٴ免耕减少土壤翻动导致的碳暴露与侵蚀，覆盖作物在休耕期持续给土壤输入根系与残体有机质，二者共同增加土壤碳储并改善团粒结构。ٮNo-till limits carbon exposure and erosion from turning soil; cover crops keep feeding roots and residues into soil during fallow, together raising soil carbon and structure.�ans��src�١Nascente 等,《Cover crops and no-till effects on physical fractions of soil organic matter》,Soil and Tillage Research,2013 (DOI: 10.1016/j.still.2013.02.008)٢Nascente et al., 'Cover crops and no-till effects on physical fractions of soil organic matter', Soil and Tillage Research, 2013, DOI: 10.1016/j.still.2013.02.008��id�d6b045fa1af4�body��《蒙特利尔议定书》是1987年签署的国际条约，目标是逐步淘汰消耗臭氧层的氟氯烃（CFCs）等化学物质。它被公认为最成功的国际环境协议，使臭氧层空洞开始修复。它的成功也为应对气候变化提供了合作范本。��The Montreal Protocol, signed in 1987, aims to phase out ozone-depleting substances like CFCs. Widely seen as the most successful environmental treaty, it has allowed the ozone hole to begin recovering. Its success offers a model for climate cooperation.�ans��src��'《蒙特利尔议定书》公开文本�Montreal Protocol public text��id�d707b2a03537�body���风、光发电随天气波动，储能可在富余时充电、短缺时放电，平抑供需。电池还能提供调频等电网服务，提升稳定性。成本快速下降使锂电储能在全球加速部署。�%Wind and solar output fluctuates with weather, so storage charges when surplus and discharges when short, balancing supply and demand. Batteries also provide grid services like frequency regulation, improving stability. Falling costs are driving rapid global deployment of lithium-ion storage.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d8f5637ba7de�body���过去厂家用专用件、加密芯片和禁修条款逼你换新，制造大量电子垃圾；保障用户和第三方维修，能延长产品寿命、减少废弃与碳排，是循环经济的制度支点。��Makers once used proprietary parts, crypto-chips and no-repair clauses to force replacements, making e-waste; guaranteeing user and third-party repair extends life and cuts waste and carbon—a pillar of circularity.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d918404ee483�body���慢生活主张减少冲动消费、重视物品耐用与体验而非数量，从而降低资源和能源的过度使用。它和极简、本地化、手工修复等实践相契合。本质上是通过改变需求侧来减轻环境压力。��Slow living favours fewer impulse buys and values durability and experience over quantity, lowering excessive resource and energy use. It fits minimalism, localism and repair culture. In essence it eases environmental pressure by changing demand.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d940982d1202�body�ٸ海水 pH 下降、碳酸根浓度降低，使碳酸钙（特别是霰石）更易溶解，翼足类外壳出现腐蚀孔洞，幼体存活与食物链底层的能量传递受影响。��Lower pH and carbonate ion scarcity make calcium carbonate (especially aragonite) dissolve more easily; pteropod shells develop corrosive pits, hurting larvae and energy flow at the food-web base.�ans��src��cFeely 等,《Impact of anthropogenic CO2 on the CaCO3 system in the oceans»,Science 第305卷,2004�dR. A. Feely et al., Impact of anthropogenic CO2 on the CaCO3 system in the oceans, Science 305, 2004��id�d9a2d01bef8f�body��)红色名录按灭绝风险从低到高划分为：无危、近危、易危、濒危、极危、野外灭绝、灭绝。评估依据包括种群数量与趋势、分布范围及所受威胁。极危的风险高于濒危，濒危又高于易危；等级越高，保护投入的优先级也越高。��The Red List ranks extinction risk from lowest to highest: Least Concern, Near Threatened, Vulnerable, Endangered, Critically Endangered, Extinct in the Wild, and Extinct. Assessments use population size and trend, geographic range, and threats. Critically Endangered is riskier than Endangered, which is riskier than Vulnerable; higher categories receive higher conservation priority.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�db0686df957a�body��J全球变暖特指地球平均气温持续上升这一现象，而气候变化是更宽泛的概念，包含气温升高以及由此引发的海平面上升、降水格局改变、极端天气频发等一系列变化。可以说全球变暖是气候变化的核心表现之一。两者常被一起讨论，但范围并不相同。�TGlobal warming specifically refers to the ongoing rise in Earth's average temperature, while climate change is the broader concept covering warming plus resulting shifts like sea-level rise, altered rainfall, and more extreme weather. Global warming is thus one core aspect of climate change. The two are related but not identical in scope.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�db4a9130461a�body�٨早期主要靠被动躲避，后来转向主动固定流沙、恢复植被、发展沙产业，让人能在修复中获益，从而把对抗变为可持续的共处。��Early efforts only retreated; later ones actively fixed moving sand, restored vegetation and built a sand economy, letting people benefit from restoration and turning conflict into coexistence.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�dbf46fa5a9fa�body���AMOC 把热带暖水向北输送，其减弱可能让西北欧相对变冷、大西洋飓风与西非季风异常、海平面在北美东岸抬升，是全球气候的“关键开关”之一。��The AMOC carries tropical warm water north; its weakening could cool NW Europe, shift Atlantic hurricanes and West African rains, and raise sea level on the US East Coast—a climate 'switch'.�ans��src��Nature / Science 研究�Nature; Science��id�dec0cf847b81�body�٘一级级田埂像台阶把坡面"打断"，减缓水流、留住泥土；水慢慢下渗而不是一路冲走表土，坡就成了能耕能保的田。٣Each riser breaks the slope like stairs, slowing flow and holding soil; water seeps in instead of washing topsoil away, turning a slope into farmable, stable land.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�df136327bbc7�body���一副望远镜、一本图鉴、一个笔记本就够了。记下时间地点和行为，长期积累就成了本地鸟类日历，既能帮自己也能帮科研，比只求一张清晰照片更有价值。ٽBinoculars, a field guide and a notebook are enough. Logging time, place and behavior builds a local bird calendar that helps both you and science—more valuable than just one sharp photo.�ans��src��eBird;Cornell Lab�eBird;Cornell��id�df572ef4da8f�body��%水受热后密度下降、体积增大，即使总水量不变，海洋也会因变暖而膨胀抬高海平面。由于海洋极深且储热巨大，热膨胀是20世纪海平面上升的最大单一贡献者。它的影响还会在热量向深海传播的过程中持续数十到上百年。�CWhen water warms it becomes less dense and expands in volume, so the ocean rises even without added water. Because the ocean is deep and stores enormous heat, thermal expansion was the largest single contributor to 20th-century sea level rise. Its effect persists for decades to centuries as heat penetrates the deep ocean.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�df6bf3755233�body���光合作用是绿色植物和藻类利用阳光把二氧化碳和水转化为有机物并释放氧气的过程。它像“碳的搬运工”，把空气中的碳固定到植物体内。没有光合作用，碳循环和地球上的生命都难以维持。�Photosynthesis is how green plants and algae use sunlight to turn CO2 and water into organic matter while releasing oxygen. It acts like a carbon mover, fixing atmospheric carbon into living tissue. Without it, the carbon cycle and life on Earth would struggle to persist.�ans��src��/Miller, G.T. 与 Spoolman, S.《环境科学》�2Miller, G.T. & Spoolman, S., Environmental Science��id�e1880b04d9b4�body�ٜ林木常年有叶有根，蒸腾与截留有节律，枯落物像海绵一样蓄水保土；而粮田翻耕频繁、裸露期长，更容易跑水跑土。ٰTrees keep leaves and roots year-round, transpiring and intercepting water while litter sponges up soil moisture; cropland is often tilled and bare, losing both water and soil.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e28f88527f2d�body�ٟ森林被公路、农田切割，象群取食作物与人相遇机会变多；保护成效让象多了，但栖息地没同步扩大，矛盾就浮上来了。٣Roads and farms fragment forests, raising encounters as elephants eat crops; conservation raised elephant numbers but habitats didn't expand, so tensions surfaced.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e301c32c96d8�body���剩余碳预算是指在将全球升温控制在某一阈值（如1.5°C）以内、以一定概率（如50%）为前提下，人类还能排放的二氧化碳总量。它是一个随时间递减的“配额”，每排放一吨就在减少。��The remaining carbon budget is the total amount of CO2 humanity can still emit while keeping global warming below a chosen threshold (e.g., 1.5°C) with a given probability (e.g., 50%). It is a shrinking quota—every ton emitted reduces it.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e34c7551d727�body�ٽ产品在生产地消耗的水叫虚拟水，水足迹衡量总量；缺水国进口高耗水农产品等于“进口水”，把本地水压力转嫁给出口国，重塑全球水账本。��Water consumed where a product is made is 'virtual water'; the water footprint measures the total. Water-scarce importers of thirsty crops 'import water', shifting local stress to exporters and reshaping the global water ledger.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e391d16af60a�body��4会的。长期暴露在交通、施工等噪声中，不仅损伤听力，还与高血压、心脏病、睡眠障碍和儿童学习困难相关。声音以分贝计量，长期超过70分贝即有健康风险。城市里的隔声屏障、建筑隔音和“安静时段”管理都是有效的缓解措施。��Yes. Chronic exposure to traffic and construction noise does more than irritate — it can damage hearing and is linked to high blood pressure, heart disease, disturbed sleep and learning difficulties in children. Sound is measured in decibels; sustained levels above about 70 dB carry health risks. Noise barriers, soundproofed buildings and quiet-hour management are effective countermeasures.�ans��src��0中国生态环境部（声环境质量标准）� MEE (noise environment standard)��id�e42d5da0352e�body�ٴ虫黄藻在珊瑚组织内进行光合作用，为宿主提供糖分等有机物；珊瑚则提供保护、营养盐和光照环境。这种互利是造礁珊瑚生长的基础。��Zooxanthellae photosynthesize within coral tissue, supplying the host with sugars and other organics, while the coral offers protection, nutrients, and light. This mutualism underpins reef-building coral growth.�ans��src��$《环境科学》海洋生态综述�*Environmental Science China marine ecology��id�e469e512ddeb�body�ٴ各模式对云、海洋混合、碳循环等过程的参数化不同，导致“气候敏感度”有差异；把多模式集合平均可缩小但无法消除这种不确定性。ٵModels differ in how they parameterize clouds, ocean mixing and carbon cycle, giving a spread in 'climate sensitivity'; multi-model ensembles narrow but don't erase the uncertainty.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e6342c05ae13�body���这些国家地势低平、国土狭小，海平面上升直接威胁国土淹没与淡水盐化。更强热带气旋与珊瑚退化还打击渔业与旅游业。它们排放极少却首当其冲，成为气候谈判中呼吁行动最有力的声音。�$These nations are low-lying and small, so sea level rise directly threatens inundation and saltwater intrusion into freshwater. Stronger cyclones and coral decline also hit fisheries and tourism. They emit little yet are hit first, making them the most vocal calls for action in negotiations.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e63adbb2ddb7�body���初生微塑料是出厂即为小颗粒（如磨砂 microbeads、塑料颗粒）；次生微塑料是大塑料在光照、机械、生物作用下破碎降解形成的碎片。后者占环境中微塑料主体。��Primary microplastics are tiny from manufacture (exfoliating beads, pellets); secondary ones form when larger plastics fragment under UV, mechanical and biological forces. The latter dominate environmental microplastics.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�e9013c0c2302�body�ٍ绿色屋顶通过植被与基质滞蓄雨水、隔热降温并改善局部空气质量。它还能为昆虫提供栖息地，缓解热岛。٨Green roofs retain stormwater, insulate and cool, and improve local air quality via vegetation and substrate. They also provide insect habitat and ease the heat island.�ans��src��9中国科学院生态环境研究中心城市生态研究�@Research Center for Eco-Environmental Sciences CAS urban ecology��id�eb637f2c6e5d�body�ٵ它系统比较了 1.5°C 与 2°C 升温下的风险差异，指出每多 0.5°C 都会显著增加极端事件与生态损失，为更激进的减排目标提供了科学杠杆。٤It compared risks at 1.5°C vs 2°C, showing each extra 0.5°C markedly raises extremes and ecological loss, giving scientific leverage for more aggressive targets.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�edcaa2a50b47�body���分布式能源指靠近用户侧的小型发电与储能系统，如屋顶光伏、社区微电网和家用电池。它可减少输电损耗、提升供电韧性，并便于公众参与能源生产。其普及正重塑传统集中式电网结构。�!Distributed energy means small-scale generation and storage near users, such as rooftop solar, community microgrids, and home batteries. It cuts transmission losses, boosts resilience, and lets the public participate in production. Its spread is reshaping the traditional centralized grid.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ee08e1cd46f9�body�ٽ工厂排污的成本由社会（健康、气候）承担而非生产者，私人成本低于真实社会成本，市场因此过度生产污染品，需要征税或管制来内化成本。ٿPollution's cost falls on society (health, climate), not the producer, so private cost is below true social cost and markets overproduce dirty goods—taxes or regulation must internalize it.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ee53d9c7e368�body���湿地原本在水下缺氧环境中把碳长期封存，排干后土壤接触氧气，微生物迅速分解有机物释放CO2和甲烷。泥炭地排干尤其严重，可从碳汇变碳源。保护湿地的固碳价值常被低估。�4Wetlands store carbon long-term in waterlogged, oxygen-poor soils; once drained, the soil meets oxygen and microbes rapidly decompose organic matter, releasing CO2 and methane. Drained peatlands are especially severe, flipping from sink to source. The carbon value of protecting wetlands is often underrated.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ee6b62e910c3�body�ٱ蓝光和夜灯会抑制褪黑素分泌，打乱昼夜节律，让人更难入睡、睡眠变浅。睡前少看屏幕、用暖光小夜灯、拉好遮光帘，能护住睡眠。ٶBlue light and night lamps suppress melatonin, disturbing the circadian rhythm and making sleep shallower. Less screen time, warm dim nightlights and blackout curtains protect sleep.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�eec8ea492a16�body���风力发电机的叶片在风吹动下旋转，带动内部的发电机把机械能转化为电能。风越大、风机越高（风速更稳），发电效率通常越高。海上风电场因为风更强劲稳定，近年发展很快。��Wind turbines spin their blades in the wind, driving a generator that converts mechanical energy into electricity. Stronger, steadier winds at greater heights usually mean higher output. Offshore wind farms, with steadier winds, have expanded rapidly.�ans��src��0国际能源署（IEA）《世界能源展望》�7International Energy Agency (IEA), World Energy Outlook��id�efd7db78b1c6�body�ٴ暖化使冻土融化、封存的有机碳被微生物分解放出温室气体，进一步加剧暖化，形成“正反馈”；这种释放大多未被现有排放清单计入。ٳWarming thaws permafrost, microbes decompose stored organic carbon into greenhouse gases that warm further—a positive feedback largely uncounted in current emission inventories.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�env_19_002�body���固化稳定化向土壤施加石灰、羟基磷灰石类钝化剂,数月内即可压低镉铅的生物有效性,投入低,但金属总量不变,地块只能转入安全利用类别。植物修复依托蜈蚣草、伴矿景天等超积累植物逐年带出金属,周期动辄五到十年,却能实际削减存量并保住耕作能力。风险分级管理通常把前者安排给重污染点位,后者用于大面积轻中度超标区。�pStabilization blends lime or hydroxyapatite-type amendments into the soil, cutting cadmium and lead bioavailability within months at modest cost, yet total metal stocks remain untouched and the parcel can only move into safe-utilization categories. Phytoextraction relies on hyperaccumulators such as Pteris vittata and Sedum plumbizincicola to strip metals year after year, taking five to ten years or longer but genuinely depleting the stock while preserving cropping capacity. Risk-tiered programs typically assign the former to heavily polluted hotspots and the latter to broad fields with light-to-moderate exceedances.�ans��src��p生态环境部《农用地土壤环境管理办法(试行)》;2014年《全国土壤污染状况调查公报》ٞMinistry of Ecology and Environment, Measures for Environmental Management of Agricultural Land Soil (Trial); National Survey Bulletin on Soil Pollution, 2014��id�env_19_005�body��x连续廊道把公园内部生成的冷空气沿主导风向向下游输送,形成越出自身边界的冷岛扩展区,并为郊区来风深入建成区提供通道。孤立斑块的冷空气无处汇集,影响半径通常止于边缘数十米。廊道还兼作物种迁移的踏脚石与雨洪滞蓄空间,这正是绿地系统规划将连通度设为刚性指标的原因。�A continuous corridor carries the cool air generated inside parks downwind beyond their own boundaries and gives rural-fringe winds a passage deep into the built fabric. Air chilled by isolated patches has nowhere to pool, and their cooling reach typically fades within tens of meters of the edge. Corridors also serve as stepping stones for species dispersal and as flood detention space, which is why green-system planning treats connectivity as a mandatory metric rather than counting only total green coverage.�ans��src��~美国长期生态研究网络巴尔的摩城市生态系统研究(BES)系列成果;T. R. Oke的城市热量平衡经典框架�}Baltimore Ecosystem Study of the US Long-Term Ecological Research network; T. R. Oke's classic urban energy balance framework��id�env_19_008�body���黑碳是含碳燃料不完全燃烧产生的强吸光颗粒,沉降到雪冰表面即把高反射界面改造成吸热界面,融雪提前又裸露出颜色更深的海冰与冻土,正反馈逐级放大。北极监测与评估计划的量化结果显示,其对春季增暖的辐射强迫贡献可与甲烷比肩,而黑碳在大气中仅存留数天到数周,削减排放后几年内便能转化为降温收益,因而成为北极理事会的优先管控行动。�$Black carbon, born of incomplete combustion, converts highly reflective snow and ice surfaces into heat absorbers upon deposition; accelerated melt then exposes darker sea ice and tundra, compounding the feedback level by level. Quantifications by the Arctic Monitoring and Assessment Programme place its radiative forcing on springtime warming on par with methane, and because the aerosol persists only days to weeks aloft, emission curbs convert into cooling benefits within several years, making it a priority action item for the Arctic Council.�ans��src���北极监测与评估计划(AMAP)关于黑碳与臭氧作为北极气候强迫因子的评估报告 ; 另见: Arctic Monitoring and Assessment Programme, AMAP Assessment 2015: Black Carbon and Ozone as Arctic Climate Forcers��Arctic Monitoring and Assessment Programme, AMAP Assessment 2015: Black Carbon and Ozone as Arctic Climate Forcers ; see also: 北极监测与评估计划(AMAP)关于黑碳与臭氧作为北极气候强迫因子的评估报告��id�env_19_012�body��|水文学法如Tennant法只刻画历史径流的统计特征,并不能保证目标物种在产卵越冬等关键阶段所需的水深、流速与水温得到满足。PHABSIM一类栖息地模拟把流量与可用生境面积直接关联,能揭示同一流量下生境响应的巨大差异。两类方法结合,才能给出兼顾调度可行性与生态有效性的下泄流量。��Hydrological methods such as the Tennant approach only summarize statistical properties of past runoff and cannot guarantee the depth, velocity or thermal conditions that target species need at spawning or overwintering stages. Habitat simulation tools like PHABSIM link discharge directly to usable habitat area, exposing how habitat response varies sharply under the same flow figure. Only combining the two produces release schedules that are both operable and ecologically effective.�ans��src�ٗR.E. Tharme, River Research and Applications, 2003(全球环境流量方法系统评述);D.L. Tennant, Fisheries, 1976(蒙大拿Tennant法原始文献)٩R.E. Tharme, River Research and Applications, 2003, global review of environmental flow assessment methods; D.L. Tennant, Fisheries, 1976, original Montana method paper.��id�env_19_015�body���固定税率之下,若成本估计偏差过大,实际排放总量可能偏离政策目标,而总量交易先把环境结果锁定在上限之内,让配额价格去消化成本的不确定性。企业间的配额买卖使各方边际减排成本趋于一致,实现给定总量下的费用有效配置。其代价是配额价格波动剧烈,通常需辅以价格区间等稳定机制。��Under a fixed tax rate a misjudged cost curve can push actual aggregate emissions well away from the policy target, whereas cap-and-trade locks the environmental outcome within the cap first and lets the allowance price absorb cost uncertainty. Buying and selling permits drives every firm toward the same marginal abatement cost, delivering a cost-effective allocation for the chosen total. The price paid is volatile allowance markets, which normally call for stabilizers such as price corridors.�ans��src�� M.L. Weitzman,《Prices vs. Quantities》,The Review of Economic Studies,1974 (DOI: 10.2307/2296698)；Ellerman & Buchner,《The European Union Emissions Trading Scheme: Origins, Allocation, and Early Results》,Review of Environmental Economics and Policy,2007 (DOI: 10.1093/reep/rem003)�M.L. Weitzman, 'Prices vs. Quantities', The Review of Economic Studies, 1974, DOI: 10.2307/2296698; Ellerman & Buchner, 'The European Union Emissions Trading Scheme: Origins, Allocation, and Early Results', Review of Environmental Economics and Policy, 2007, DOI: 10.1093/reep/rem003��id�env_19_018�body���石灰与硅钙材料抬升pH,促使镉向碳酸盐结合态与铁锰氧化物结合态转化,生物有效性下降,糙米含镉量随之降低。但pH上调过快会连带压制磷素与部分微量元素的有效性,而且停止施用后存在镉活度反弹的风险。只有把pH、DTPA可提取态镉与糙米镉三项指标放在一起跟踪,才能动态校准投加量并防止仅凭全量作出的误判。��Raising pH shifts cadmium into carbonate-bound and Fe-Mn oxide-bound fractions, cutting its bioavailability and with it the Cd load in brown rice. Yet too rapid a pH climb also suppresses phosphorus and several micronutrients, and activity can rebound once applications cease. Tracking pH, DTPA-extractable Cd and brown-rice Cd together is what allows dosage to be recalibrated dynamically and guards against verdicts based on total concentration alone.�ans��src���《土壤环境质量 农用地土壤污染风险管控标准(试行)》(GB 15618-2018,以DTPA提取态镉判定风险);Bolan N.S.等,《污染土壤重金属(类金属)修复——活化还是钝化?》��GB 15618-2018 (agricultural land soil pollution risk control standard, DTPA-extractable Cd criterion); Bolan N.S. et al., Remediation of heavy metal(loid)s contaminated soils - to mobilize or to immobilize?��id�env_19_020�body���承压含水层抽水使孔隙水压力下降,上覆荷载转由黏土颗粒骨架承担,弱透水黏土层被压密释水,其中绝大部分骨架变形不可逆,地表因此累积下沉。相邻砂层的弹性形变虽可随水位回升部分回弹,黏土的非弹性压密却滞后数年乃至数十年。InSAR观测到的沉降漏斗与地下水位降落漏斗空间高度吻合,表明控沉的根本在于严格压采并实施有计划的回灌。�2Pumping a confined aquifer drops pore-water pressure, transferring overburden load onto the clay-grain skeleton, so poorly permeable clay interbeds compact and release water with largely irreversible deformation that accumulates at the surface. Elastic deformation of adjacent sand layers rebounds partially as heads recover, but inelastic clay compaction trails behind by years to decades. Subsidence funnels mapped by InSAR align closely with groundwater depression cones, showing that containment hinges on strict extraction limits backed by planned recharge.�ans��src���J.F. Poland 主编,UNESCO《地下水开采引发的地面沉降研究指南》,1984;朱琳、宫辉力等,International Journal of Applied Earth Observation and Geoinformation, 2015(华北/北京平原InSAR沉降监测)�J.F. Poland ed., Guidebook to Studies of Land Subsidence due to Ground-Water Withdrawal, UNESCO, 1984; L. Zhu and H. Gong et al., International Journal of Applied Earth Observation and Geoinformation, 2015, InSAR monitoring of subsidence on the North China Plain.��id�env_20_002�body��X这类传感器靠激光散射推算质量浓度,而散射信号受粒径谱、相对湿度和气溶胶成分影响很大,高湿时吸湿性颗粒物可被高估数倍。通行做法是与 TEOM 或 β 射线法等参比仪器做回归,并按季节或站点重新拟合。校正之后,密集组网才能提供城市尺度的空间差异信息。��These sensors infer mass concentration from laser light scattering, a signal strongly affected by the particle size distribution, relative humidity, and aerosol composition; hygroscopic particles can be overestimated several-fold when the air is humid. Standard practice is a regression against reference instruments such as TEOM or beta-attenuation monitors, refitted by season or site. Only after calibration can a dense sensor network resolve real urban-scale spatial contrasts.�ans��src���Barkjohn, Gantt & Clements,《Development and application of a United States-wide correction for PM 2.5 data collected with the PurpleAir sensor》,Atmospheric Measurement Techniques,2021 (DOI: 10.5194/amt-14-4617-2021)��Barkjohn, Gantt & Clements, 'Development and application of a United States-wide correction for PM 2.5 data collected with the PurpleAir sensor', Atmospheric Measurement Techniques, 2021, DOI: 10.5194/amt-14-4617-2021��id�env_20_008�body��W该工程自1978年启动,通过营造带状防护林、封沙育林育草与农田草场防护网相结合的方式固定流动沙丘、降低风速。近年在水资源约束下转向以灌木和乡土树种为主的低耗水配置,并配合草方格沙障与飞播造林,强调成活率与区域水量平衡而非单纯扩大林地面积。�Launched in 1978, the program stabilizes shifting dunes and lowers wind speed by combining linear shelterbelts, enclosure for natural regeneration of trees and grasses, and protective networks around farmland and rangeland. In recent years it has shifted toward low-water-use configurations dominated by shrubs and native species under water-resource constraints, supplemented by straw checkerboard barriers and aerial seeding, prioritizing survival rates and regional water balance over simply expanding forested area.�ans��src��o国家林业和草原局三北工程建设公报;Wang et al., Land Degradation & Development 相关评估论文ّNational Forestry and Grassland Administration bulletins on the Three-North Program; assessments by Wang et al. in Land Degradation & Development��id�env_20_012�body���再野化追求让营养级联、自然扰动和扩散等过程重新运转,使生态系统恢复自我调节能力;常规重引入通常只关注单一濒危物种种群的回升。海狸重返河道后自发筑坝蓄水、大型食草动物自由游荡塑造出斑块镶嵌般的生境,这类案例说明关键种一旦归位,生境异质性会自行增长,效果往往比持续人工维护更稳固。因此衡量成败要看捕食、筑坝、践踏等过程是否重现,而非放归个体的数量。�\Rewilding seeks to get trophic cascades, natural disturbance and dispersal running again so ecosystems regain self-regulation, while conventional reintroduction usually targets the rebound of a single threatened population. Beavers returning and damming streams again, or large herbivores roaming freely and carving mosaic landscapes, show that once key species are back, habitat heterogeneity grows on its own and often proves sturdier than constant human maintenance. Projects succeed when processes such as predation, dam-building and trampling reappear, not when a quota of animals has been released.�ans��src�ٌSvenning et al. 2016, Science for a wilder Anthropocene, PNAS 113(4); Perino et al. 2019, Rewilding complex ecosystems, Science 364:eaav5570ٌSvenning et al. 2016, Science for a wilder Anthropocene, PNAS 113(4); Perino et al. 2019, Rewilding complex ecosystems, Science 364:eaav5570��id�env_20_015�body���该公约在联合国欧洲经济委员会框架下签署,首次把越境大气污染确立为有约束力的国际法律义务,并配套EMEP联合监测与模拟计划,使各国排放清单和沉降数据能够互相校核。1994年奥斯陆议定书引入“临界负荷”,按生态系统对酸沉降的真实敏感度分配削减义务,取代了过去一刀切的百分比减排。这种把联合科学与条约谈判绑定的模式,后来被汞问题谈判以及东亚酸沉降监测合作所借鉴。��Signed under the UN Economic Commission for Europe, the convention first made transboundary air pollution a binding international legal obligation and attached the EMEP programme, whose joint monitoring and modeling let national emission inventories and deposition data be checked against each other. The 1994 Oslo Protocol then brought in critical loads, assigning reduction duties according to how sensitive each ecosystem actually is to acid deposition instead of uniform percentage cuts. Binding joint science to treaty negotiation in this way later informed the mercury negotiations and cooperative acid-deposition monitoring in East Asia.�ans��src�٢Sliggers & Kakebeeke (eds.) 2004, Clearing the Air: 25 Years of the Convention on Long-Range Transboundary Air Pollution, UNECE, Geneva; EMEP Status Report 1/2004�pSliggers & Kakebeeke (eds.) 2004, Clearing the Air: 25 Years of CLRTAP, UNECE, Geneva; EMEP Status Report 1/2004��id�env_21_005�body��.短轮伐期使林分长期处于速生阶段，单位面积年净固碳量较高，但蓄积量与土壤碳库难以充分积累；长轮伐期能提高生态系统总碳储量，却降低采伐收益并随林分老化出现增速放缓。当木材进入建筑、家具等耐用领域时，碳被长期封存，同时替代钢材、水泥等高耗能材料，产生额外减排。规范核算需同时列明森林生态系统碳库、耐用木制品碳库与替代减排量，并交代系统边界和时间尺度，否则不同研究的结论无法比较。��Short rotations keep stands in their fast-growing phase, lifting mean annual carbon uptake per hectare, but leave little time for growing stock and soil carbon pools to accumulate; long rotations raise total ecosystem carbon storage while depressing harvest revenues and slowing growth as stands age. When wood enters durable uses such as construction and furniture, its carbon stays locked away and displaces energy-intensive materials like steel and cement, yielding additional avoided emissions. Sound accounting lists forest ecosystem pools, durable wood-product pools, and substitution credits side by side, stating explicit system boundaries and time horizons, because results cannot be compared without them.�ans��src�ٜ政府间气候变化专门委员会《土地利用、土地利用变化和林业良好做法指南》；联合国粮农组织《全球森林资源评估》�nIPCC Good Practice Guidance for Land Use, Land-Use Change and Forestry; FAO Global Forest Resources Assessment��id�env_21_008�body���完整链条包括源头分类投放、密闭收运、转运压缩、分选与资源化(厨余厌氧产沼、可回收物再生)、焚烧发电与卫生填埋等末端处置,以及飞灰和渗滤液处理等二次污染控制。分类的价值在于把高热值的干垃圾送往焚烧、把湿垃圾转入生化处理,使整体回收率和能量利用效率同时提升。德国、日本等国的经验表明,末端能力规划必须与收费制度和监管数据公开配套,否则分类难以持续。��The chain runs from source-separated collection and sealed haulage through transfer stations to sorting and valorization (anaerobic digestion of organics, recycling of dry recyclables), energy-from-waste incineration and sanitary landfill as final sinks, plus secondary-pollution control for fly ash and leachate. Separation pays off because high-calorie dry fractions feed efficient incineration while wet organics go to biological treatment, lifting overall recovery and energy yields simultaneously. German and Japanese practice shows terminal capacity planning only works when paired with fee schemes and open monitoring data, otherwise separation programs stall.�ans��src��,世界银行《城市固体废物简报》(What a Waste 2.0);国家发展改革委、住建部生活垃圾分类制度实施方案 ; 另见: World Bank, What a Waste 2.0: A Global Snapshot of Solid Waste Management to 2050; NDRC & MOHURD, Implementation Plan on Household Waste Sorting System (China)�.World Bank, What a Waste 2.0: A Global Snapshot of Solid Waste Management to 2050; NDRC & MOHURD, Implementation Plan on Household Waste Sorting System (China) ; see also: 世界银行《城市固体废物简报》(What a Waste 2.0);国家发展改革委、住建部生活垃圾分类制度实施方案��id�env_21_020�body���剂量-效应关系描述暴露量与生物反应强度之间的联系，是毒理学确定安全阈值的基础。传统方法假设存在无效应剂量且遵循单调剂量曲线，但内分泌干扰物如双酚A可在低于常规阈值的浓度下通过受体介导机制产生非单调响应。OECD因此发展了专门的筛查试验（如子宫增重试验），欧盟在REACH下将部分物质按内分泌干扰特性单独鉴定与管理。�6The dose-response relationship links exposure magnitude to the intensity of biological response and underpins threshold-setting in toxicology. Classical methods assume a no-observed-effect level and monotonic dose curves, yet endocrine disruptors such as bisphenol A can trigger non-monotonic responses below routine thresholds via receptor-mediated mechanisms. OECD therefore developed dedicated screening assays such as the uterotrophic assay, and under REACH the EU identifies and manages certain substances specifically for their endocrine-disrupting properties.�ans��src�ٌ欧盟委员会《化学品风险评估技术导则》（TGD）第二部分；欧洲化学品管理局环境剂量-反应表征指南R.10章٠European Commission Technical Guidance Document on Risk Assessment (TGD), Part II; ECHA Guidance Chapter R.10, Characterisation of Dose-Response for Environment��id�env_22_002�body���垃圾带并非漂浮的固体“塑料岛”，而是被副热带环流长期汇聚成的弥散羽流。塑料在紫外线照射与机械磨损下碎裂成毫米级微塑料，又被波浪混合进入不同水层，浓度低且分布极不均匀，通常以每平方公里碎片数计。拖网作业捞到的塑料有限，还会连带捕走浮游生物与鱼类幼体，因此治理重点正转向源头减量和拦截入海河流的塑料输入。�Garbage patches are not solid floating islands but diffuse plumes that subtropical gyres have concentrated over decades. Sunlight and mechanical abrasion shatter the debris into millimetre-scale microplastics, and waves mix fragments through the water column, so concentrations stay low and patchy, usually counted as pieces per square kilometre. Trawling recovers little plastic while also removing plankton and fish larvae, which is why attention is shifting to source reduction and intercepting plastic in rivers before it reaches the sea.�ans��src�ٚEriksen等，《世界海洋中的塑料污染：海上漂浮的逾5万亿件塑料碎片》，《PLoS ONE》，2014年，DOI:10.1371/journal.pone.0111913ٺEriksen et al., 'Plastic Pollution in the World's Oceans: More than 5 Trillion Plastic Pieces Weighing over 250,000 Tons Afloat at Sea', PLoS ONE, 2014, DOI: 10.1371/journal.pone.0111913��id�env_22_008�body���大豆、苜蓿等豆科作物与根瘤菌共生：根瘤中的固氮酶以光合产物为能源，把空气中的氮气还原为铵供植物利用。轮作或间作豆科后，残茬和根系分解释放的氮素可明显降低下季作物对合成氮肥的需求。由于哈伯法合成氨耗能巨大，且部分氮肥会转化成强效温室气体氧化亚氮，生物固氮既节省成本，也有助于减缓气候变化。�XSoybean, alfalfa, and other legumes live in symbiosis with rhizobial bacteria: inside root nodules, nitrogenase enzymes powered by photosynthetic sugars convert atmospheric nitrogen into ammonium the plant can use. After a legume rotation or intercrop, nitrogen released from decomposing residues and roots noticeably cuts the next season's demand for synthetic nitrogen fertilizer. Because Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis is highly energy-intensive and part of fertilizer nitrogen turns into nitrous oxide, a potent greenhouse gas, biological fixation saves costs while also mitigating climate change.�ans��src�ٛHerridge, Peoples & Boddey,《Global inputs of biological nitrogen fixation in agricultural systems》,Plant and Soil,2008 (DOI: 10.1007/s11104-008-9668-3)ٙHerridge, Peoples & Boddey, 'Global inputs of biological nitrogen fixation in agricultural systems', Plant and Soil, 2008, DOI: 10.1007/s11104-008-9668-3��id�env_22_012�body���穿山甲鳞片由角蛋白构成，与人指甲同质，并无严格临床证据支持其药效，但传统需求持续推高价格，使八种穿山甲全部沦为重点盗猎目标。2016年CITES第17届缔约方大会把它们整体升入附录I，商业性国际贸易自此禁止；然而禁令没有消解需求，黑市价格上涨反而放大盗猎激励，治理重心因此转向削减消费需求与摧毁走私网络。�'Pangolin scales are pure keratin, the same protein as human fingernails, and no rigorous clinical evidence backs their claimed medicinal effects—yet entrenched demand keeps prices high, making all eight species prime poaching targets. At CITES CoP17 in 2016 they were collectively uplisted to Appendix I, banning commercial international trade from 2017. Bans suppress rather than erase demand, though: rising black-market prices sharpen poaching incentives, so strategy has shifted toward cutting consumer demand and dismantling smuggling networks.�ans��src��jChallender等《理解市场以保护受贸易威胁的物种》，Biological Conservation第187卷，2015ُChallender, Harrop & MacMillan, Understanding markets to conserve trade-threatened species in CITES, Biological Conservation 187: 249-259, 2015��id�env_22_018�body���紫外线切断塑料的聚合物链并引发光氧化反应，使其变脆开裂；风浪搅动与泥沙磨损又把它磨成毫米级直至微米级的碎屑。但聚乙烯、聚丙烯等常见塑料的主链是稳定的碳—碳骨架，海水中几乎没有微生物能快速分泌酶将其分解，因此碎片只会变小并向水体和沉积物扩散，总质量在可预见的时间尺度内几乎不会减少。��Ultraviolet radiation severs polymer chains and drives photo-oxidation, making plastic brittle and cracked; wave agitation and abrasion grind items into millimetre- and micron-scale debris. Yet common plastics such as polyethylene and polypropylene have stable carbon-carbon backbones that almost no marine microbe can digest quickly with enzymes, so fragments only get smaller and spread through seawater and sediments, with their total mass barely declining on human timescales.�ans��src�ٚA. L. Andrady，《海洋环境中的微塑料》，《Marine Pollution Bulletin》第62卷（2011）：1596–1605，DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030َA. L. Andrady, 'Microplastics in the marine environment', Marine Pollution Bulletin 62 (2011): 1596-1605, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030��id�env_22_020�body���鳗鲡在大洋深处产卵，幼体要经历叶状的柳叶鳗等变态阶段，所需的环境条件至今无法在养殖中复现，因此各地鳗鱼养殖场的苗种仍依赖捕捞野生玻璃鳗。欧洲鳗鲡资源持续衰退且被限制出口后，亚洲市场高价与合法供应短缺形成巨大利差，走私者将玻璃鳗偷运出境牟利，又反过来加重野生种群承受的捕捞压力。��Eels spawn in remote ocean depths, and their larvae pass through leaf-shaped leptocephalus stages whose conditions have never been reproduced in captivity, so eel farms worldwide still depend on wild-caught glass eels. After European eel stocks kept declining and exports were restricted, high Asian prices met scarce legal supply, opening a wide margin that smugglers capture by trafficking glass eels abroad, which in turn adds pressure on wild populations.�ans��src��=ICES/GFCM/EIFAAC 联合鳗鲡工作组（WGEEL）年度报告�HJoint EIFAAC/ICES/GFCM Working Group on Eel (WGEEL), annual report, ICES��id�env_23_002�body���核心是从分散设立、多头管理转为统一分类分级管控：国家公园保护国家代表性的自然生态系统，实行最严格保护、统一事权；自然保护区守护珍稀濒危物种及栖息地；自然公园在保护前提下允许适度利用。三类保护地整合归并、边界清晰，按生态价值和保护强度分区施策，避免交叉重叠与重复建设。�The core change replaces scattered designation and multi-agency management with unified, classified, tiered control: national parks protect nationally representative ecosystems under the strictest rules and unified authority; nature reserves safeguard rare and endangered species and their habitats; natural parks permit moderate use consistent with conservation. Consolidating the three categories with clear boundaries allows zoning by ecological value and protection strength, ending overlaps and duplicated designations.�ans��src�ّ中共中央办公厅、国务院办公厅：《关于建立以国家公园为主体的自然保护地体系的指导意见》，2019年印发。ٷGeneral Office of the CPC Central Committee & General Office of the State Council (2019): Guiding Opinions on Establishing a Protected Area System with National Parks as the Mainstay.��id�env_23_005�body���生态补偿让受益者为其享用的生态系统服务付费，把原本无人支付的外部收益内部化。以新安江试点为例，中央与皖浙两省共同出资，水质达标则下游向上游兑付补偿，不达标则上游赔偿，考核结果直接决定资金流向。这重塑了地方的成本收益结构，使护水由财政负担变为收入来源，推动保护与发展相协调。�
Eco-compensation makes service beneficiaries pay for what they receive, internalizing otherwise unpaid external benefits. In the Xin'anjiang pilot, the central government together with Anhui and Zhejiang co-funds a scheme tied to water quality: when monitored quality meets the standard the downstream province pays compensation, otherwise the upstream pays damages—the assessment directly steers the funds. This reshapes local cost-benefit structure, turning water protection from a fiscal burden into a revenue source.�ans��src�ق财政部、原环境保护部：《新安江流域水环境补偿试点实施方案》（2011年启动，皖浙两省实施）。ٯMinistry of Finance & Ministry of Environmental Protection (China), Pilot Implementation Plan for Water Environment Compensation in the Xin'anjiang River Basin, launched 2011.��id�env_23_008�body���基于投入产出模型的全供应链核算显示，旅游业含间接排放约占全球温室气体排放的8%，其中航空等交通占最大份额，其次为餐饮购物与住宿。可持续旅游据此抓住三环节：以铁路替代短途航班并延长单次停留时间；推进住宿节能改造与本地化采购；并以游客限额、预约分时等需求管理把客流引向淡季和周边社区，使旅游收入更多留存地方。�Full supply-chain input-output accounting puts global tourism at roughly 8% of worldwide greenhouse gas emissions, dominated by transport — especially flying — followed by food, shopping and accommodation. Sustainable tourism therefore works three levers: replacing short-haul flights with rail and extending length of stay; energy retrofits and local sourcing at lodgings; and demand management such as visitor caps and timed booking that spreads tourists into shoulder seasons and neighbouring communities, keeping revenue local.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�env_23_015�body���燃料电池把氢的化学能经电化学反应直接变成电能：阳极处氢被氧化为质子和电子，质子穿过质子交换膜抵达阴极，电子经外电路输出电流做功，最后与氧气结合，产物只有水。由于全程不经历燃烧，也不存在高温热源驱动热机的环节，转换效率不受卡诺定理限制，实际可达约60%，并在变负荷工况下保持较高水平，运行噪音也低。�GA fuel cell turns hydrogen's chemical energy directly into electricity through electrochemical reactions: hydrogen is oxidised at the anode into protons and electrons, protons migrate through the proton-exchange membrane to the cathode, electrons deliver current through the external circuit, and oxygen finally combines with them, yielding nothing but water. Because there is no combustion and no high-temperature source driving a heat engine, the conversion is not bound by the Carnot limit: practical efficiencies reach about 60% and stay high under varying loads, with low noise.�ans��src�مSharaf O.Z.、Orhan M.F.《燃料电池技术概览：原理与应用》，Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews，2014年第32卷ٗSharaf O.Z. & Orhan M.F., 'An Overview of Fuel Cell Technology: Fundamentals and Applications', Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews, Vol. 32, 2014��id�env_23_018�body���“纸面公园”指仅完成挂牌划界、却缺少人员经费与执法能力的保护地，盗猎毁林照常发生。全球评估显示许多保护地存在管理与监测缺口，管理有效性工具（如 METT）通过核查投入、过程与产出来定位薄弱环节。衡量保护成效因此要把面积与管理质量、实际生态结果结合起来，而不能只数数字。��A 'paper park' exists only on the map: boundaries are drawn but staff, budgets and enforcement are missing, so poaching and clearing continue. Global reviews find many protected areas have serious management and monitoring gaps; effectiveness tools such as METT inspect inputs, processes and outputs to locate weak points. Judging conservation therefore requires combining area figures with management quality and real ecological outcomes.�ans��src��\Leverington 等，《PLOS ONE》5(11): e15110，2010 年，doi: 10.1371/journal.pone.0015110�RLeverington et al., PLOS ONE 5(11): e15110, 2010, doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0015110��id�env_23_020�body���隐含碳来自水泥、钢材等建材的生产运输和现场施工，发生在建筑投用之前；运行碳是供暖、制冷、照明等用能逐年累积的排放。当电力脱碳与节能设计压低运行排放后，隐含碳在全生命周期中的占比持续上升。改用低碳混凝土与木结构、复用构件并开展全生命周期核算，才能堵住这部分前期排放。��Embodied carbon comes from producing and transporting materials such as cement and steel plus on-site construction, all before a building opens; operational carbon accumulates year by year from heating, cooling and lighting. As cleaner electricity and efficient design shrink operational emissions, the embodied share of whole-life carbon keeps rising. Switching to low-carbon concrete and timber, reusing components and running full life-cycle accounting are needed to close this upfront gap.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f318fe5445bc�body��	微塑料通过地表径流、污水处理厂出水以及自来水管道和滤膜的磨损进入供水网络。由于粒径常小于5毫米，常规砂滤难以完全拦截。虽然目前饮用水中的微塑料浓度极低，其长期健康影响仍在研究中。�WMicroplastics enter the water supply through surface runoff, treated wastewater effluent, and wear from pipes and filter membranes. Because they are often under 5 millimetres, conventional sand filtration cannot fully intercept them. Concentrations in tap water are currently very low, and their long-term health effects are still under study.�ans��src��b中国科学院生态环境研究中心；Environmental Science & Technology (ACS) 微塑料专刊�]Environmental Science & Technology (ACS), microplastics special issues; Nature Sustainability��id�f4ed0eead1d2�body���不透水面阻断雨水下渗、加快地表汇流并抬高洪峰流量与速率，使相同降雨下排水系统更易超负荷。结合湿地与农田的丧失，城市洪涝频率与强度显著上升。��Impervious surfaces block infiltration, speed up runoff concentration and raise flood-peak flow and rate, overloading drainage under the same rainfall. Together with lost wetlands and farmland, urban flood frequency and intensity rise markedly.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f54e4454446c�body�ٺ秸秆还田本是保墒沃土、固碳的重要环节；大量取用作材料可能削弱土壤有机质、增加化肥需求。还需比较种植与加工的全周期能耗与排放。��Returning straw to soil preserves moisture, fertility and carbon; harvesting it heavily for materials can deplete soil organic matter and raise fertilizer demand. Full life-cycle energy and emissions must be compared.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f60b9388c111�body�ٽ一个区域触发可能通过大气环流、洋流或碳释放影响另一区域，形成连锁反应。例如南极冰损失削弱洋流，进而改变热带降雨，放大全局风险。��One region tipping can affect another via atmospheric circulation, ocean currents or carbon release, creating chains. E.g., Antarctic ice loss weakens currents, altering tropical rainfall and amplifying global risk.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f71cbdf15ea2�body�ٷ湿地通过植物与微生物吸附、沉降和分解污染物、截留洪水、补充地下水并固碳，像肾脏过滤血液一样净化水质，故得名且极具保护价值。��Wetlands trap, filter and break down pollutants via plants and microbes, buffer floods, recharge groundwater and store carbon—purifying water much like kidneys filter blood, giving them high conservation value.�ans��src��Ramsar Convention�Ramsar Convention��id�f73fadeb70a9�body���在缺铁的海区撒入铁，刺激浮游植物大量繁殖，借光合作用固定 CO2，死亡后部分沉入深海，试图强化“生物泵”把碳带到海底。实际封存量与生态副作用争议很大。��Adding iron to iron-limited waters blooms phytoplankton, fixing CO2 via photosynthesis; some sink to the deep sea, aiming to strengthen the biological pump. Real sequestration and ecological side effects are heavily disputed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f7940ce9827f�body���地面臭氧由氮氧化物与挥发性有机物在阳光照射下经光化学反应生成，属二次污染物。它刺激呼吸道、降低肺功能并加重哮喘，高浓度时增加急诊与死亡风险。�Ground-level ozone forms when nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds react photochemically in sunlight—a secondary pollutant. It irritates airways, lowers lung function and worsens asthma, raising emergency visits and mortality at high concentrations.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�f83a121f6ef1�body�ٽ光学与雷达卫星定期成像，通过植被指数（如NDVI）、雷达穿透云层，结合AI比对前后影像，识别砍伐、恢复与火灾范围，实现近实时全球覆盖。��Optical and radar satellites image regularly; vegetation indices (e.g., NDVI) and cloud-penetrating radar, combined with AI change detection, identify deforestation, regrowth and fires at near-real-time global coverage.�ans��src��Global Forest Watch�Global Forest Watch��id�f92ce49357f6�body���气候韧性指社会—生态系统在气候冲击下吸收扰动、维持功能并重组复原的能力。适应是提升韧性的具体行动集合，韧性则衡量系统经适应后所能承受的扰动阈值。�Climate resilience is the capacity of a social-ecological system to absorb shocks, maintain function and reorganize after climate disruptions. Adaptation is the set of actions that build resilience, while resilience measures the disturbance threshold the system can withstand.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f98c3f70df2e�body�ٓ北方许多房屋、管道、道路、铁路建在冻土上；融化使地基下沉、开裂，维修昂贵，还释放温室气体加剧变暖。ټMany northern buildings, pipelines, roads and railways sit on permafrost; thawing sinks and cracks foundations, costing heavy repairs, while releasing greenhouse gases that worsen warming.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f9adf2d016c9�body��Z微塑料是直径小于5毫米的塑料碎片，来自塑料瓶袋的磨损、化纤衣物洗涤时脱落的纤维，以及大块塑料在环境中缓慢碎裂。它们已广泛存在于海洋、河流、土壤乃至人体组织和血液样本中，并能沿着食物链逐级累积。最有效的应对是减少一次性塑料、完善回收。��Microplastics are plastic fragments under 5 mm, shed from worn bottles and bags, fibres released when washing synthetic clothes, and the slow crumbling of larger plastic litter. They are now widespread in oceans, rivers, soils and even human tissue and blood samples, and can accumulate up the food chain. The most effective response is using less single-use plastic and improving recycling.�ans��src�ٚA. L. Andrady，《海洋环境中的微塑料》，《Marine Pollution Bulletin》第62卷（2011）：1596–1605，DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030َA. L. Andrady, 'Microplastics in the marine environment', Marine Pollution Bulletin 62 (2011): 1596-1605, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030��id�f9ea9d7610eb�body��顶端捕食者通过控制食草动物数量维持生态平衡，其消失会导致下级物种暴增、植被被过度啃食。这种现象称为营养级联效应，会改变整个群落结构。狼群回归使黄石公园河流形态恢复的著名案例即属此类。��Apex predators maintain balance by controlling herbivore numbers; their loss lets lower species boom and overgraze vegetation. This trophic cascade reshapes the whole community. The return of wolves reshaping Yellowstone's rivers is a famous example.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�faad5c7eebe2�body���绿色屋顶用植被和基质覆盖屋面，能隔热降温、滞留雨水并减轻城市热岛。它也为鸟类和传粉昆虫提供小块栖息地，并延长防水层寿命。前提是做好防水和荷载设计。�Green roofs cover rooftops with vegetation and substrate, insulating and cooling buildings, retaining stormwater and easing heat islands. They also offer small habitats for birds and pollinators and extend waterproofing life. Proper waterproofing and load design are essential.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�fb605f4bccf0�body���入侵种常因缺少天敌而快速繁殖，并抢夺食物、光照与栖息地，或带来新病害；本地种适应原有平衡，难以竞争，最终导致群落单一化与生态功能受损。��Invaders often multiply fast without natural enemies and seize food, light and habitat or introduce novel diseases; natives adapted to the old balance cannot compete, driving homogenization and functional loss.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�fbc72beaed87�body�ٟ北极与赤道温差减小会削弱急流，使其更蜿蜒，导致寒潮南侵、热浪与干旱停留更久。该“遥相关”机制仍有研究分歧。ٵReduced pole-equator temperature contrast weakens the jet stream, making it wavier, so cold outbreaks push south and heatwaves/droughts linger. This teleconnection is still debated.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�fcbaea9c148c�body�٧说明栖息地保护、人工繁育和生态廊道建设起了作用，种群止跌回升；但它仍受威胁，降级不等于"安全毕业"，保护不能松劲。ٰIt shows habitat protection, captive breeding and corridors worked and populations rebounded; but threats remain, so downlisting is not "graduation"—protection must continue.�ans��src�ٹMa, Lei, Qing, Wen,《Should the Endangered Status of the Giant Panda Really Be Reduced? The Case of Giant Panda Conservation in Sichuan, China》,Animals,2018 (DOI: 10.3390/ani8050069)ٷMa, Lei, Qing, Wen, 'Should the Endangered Status of the Giant Panda Really Be Reduced? The Case of Giant Panda Conservation in Sichuan, China', Animals, 2018, DOI: 10.3390/ani8050069��id�fdac354b6c74�body���适应指调整自然或人类系统以应对实际或预期气候影响、降低脆弱性。例子包括加固堤坝、培育耐旱作物和改进城市排水。与减排互补，适应在升温已无法避免时尤为关键。�9Adaptation means adjusting natural or human systems to cope with actual or expected climate impacts and reduce vulnerability. Examples include strengthening dikes, breeding drought-resistant crops, and improving urban drainage. Complementing mitigation, adaptation is crucial where warming is already unavoidable.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�fe09945e1a65�body���燃煤与工业排放的SO2、NOx在大气中氧化成硫酸与硝酸，随雨降落使水体与土壤酸化，导致湖泊鱼群死亡、森林衰退、石材建筑腐蚀。我国经脱硫脱硝后酸雨频率已明显下降。�	SO2 and NOx from coal and industry oxidize into sulfuric and nitric acid that fall as rain, acidifying lakes and soils and killing fish, damaging forests, and corroding stone buildings. China's desulfurization and denitrification have greatly reduced its frequency.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�fe31a640ba01�body���生态廊道是连接破碎栖息地的带状通道，让动物迁徙、扩散和交配，维持基因交流。它可降低局部种群灭绝后无法恢复的风险。道路涵洞和沿河林带都是常见形式。�An ecological corridor is a strip linking fragmented habitats so animals can migrate, disperse and breed, maintaining gene flow. It lowers the risk that isolated populations cannot recover after local extinction. Road underpasses and riverside woodlands are common forms.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�fef50eecfb4c�body���从生产、运输到丢弃腐烂，浪费食物等于白白排放其全链条温室气体；全球约三分之一食物被浪费，减排它不需新技术，是性价比最高的气候行动之一。��From farm to rot, wasted food means its whole-chain GHG was emitted for nothing; roughly a third of global food is lost or wasted, so cutting it—needing no new tech—is among the highest-leverage climate actions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ffe7207d697b�body�ٟ买多存坏、看错保质期、剩菜没人吃是三大漏洞。按清单采购、先吃快坏的、剩菜变下一餐，能把家庭浪费砍掉一大半。پBuying too much, misreading dates and uneaten leftovers are the three big leaks. Shop from a list, eat the soon-to-spoil first and repurpose leftovers to cut household waste by half or more.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�03728e8a009c�body��可持续发展目标是联合国在2015年通过的17项全球目标，涵盖消除贫困、清洁饮水、气候行动、负责任消费等，计划到2030年实现。它们为各国提供了统一的发展蓝图。其中第13项目标专门应对气候变化。�The Sustainable Development Goals are 17 global targets adopted by the UN in 2015 covering poverty eradication, clean water, climate action, and responsible consumption, aimed for 2030. They provide a shared blueprint for all countries. Goal 13 specifically addresses climate change.�ans��src��*联合国可持续发展目标官方文件�UN SDGs official documents��id�081d65c74aac�body���当海水温度过高或光照过强时，珊瑚会排出共生的虫黄藻，露出白色骨骼。若压力持续，珊瑚将饥饿死亡；若环境恢复，部分珊瑚可重新获得虫黄藻。��Under high temperature or excess light, corals expel their symbiotic zooxanthellae and reveal white skeletons. Prolonged stress starves the coral, but if conditions recover some corals can regain symbionts.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1344284bdac5�body���海带森林是温带近岸的基石生境，为鱼类和无脊椎动物提供食物与庇护并吸收碳。海胆暴发和海水变暖导致其退化，需通过捕食者恢复等手段修复。��Kelp forests are temperate nearshore foundation habitats feeding and sheltering fish and invertebrates while absorbing carbon. Urchin outbreaks and warming drive decline, so restoration often rebuilds predator control.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1424b02efe89�body���「双绿色革命」指在提高单产的同时大幅减少环境足迹的农业转型。它通过间作、减少农药与保护田边生境，使集约化农田也能维持传粉昆虫与土壤生物多样性。�The 'doubly green revolution' is an agricultural transformation that raises yields while sharply cutting environmental footprint. Through intercropping, reduced pesticides, and field-margin habitats, even intensive farms can sustain pollinators and soil biodiversity.�ans��src��K联合国粮农组织《世界粮食与农业生物多样性状况》(2019)�IFAO The State of the World's Biodiversity for Food and Agriculture (2019)��id�1b2b59fc3e64�body���双酚A 可模拟雌激素与雌激素受体结合，干扰激素信号通路，动物实验提示其与生殖发育与代谢异常相关。其广泛存在于塑料食品容器与热敏纸，经饮食与皮肤接触进入人体。�BPA mimics estrogen and binds estrogen receptors, disturbing hormonal signaling; animal studies link it to reproductive-developmental and metabolic disruption. It is widespread in plastic food containers and thermal paper and enters the body via diet and skin contact.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�26acb31ef32f�body��生态修复是帮助已退化、受损或被破坏的生态系统恢复其结构、功能和生物多样性的过程。方法包括植树造林、退耕还湿、清理污染土壤等。成功的修复不仅要种植物，还要重建完整的食物网和自然过程。�6Ecological restoration is the process of assisting degraded, damaged, or destroyed ecosystems to recover their structure, function, and biodiversity. Methods include reforestation, wetland restoration, and soil cleanup. Successful restoration rebuilds not just plants but whole food webs and natural processes.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�32c03315ef5c�body���泥炭地虽仅占陆地面积约 3%，却储存了约三分之一的土壤碳；退化泥炭地因排水氧化而大量排碳。复湿修复可停止排放并开始重新固碳，单位成本远低于多数工程减排。��Peatlands cover about 3% of land but store roughly a third of soil carbon; degraded ones emit heavily when drained and oxidized. Rewetting stops emissions and resumes sequestration at far lower cost than most engineered mitigation.�ans��src��$拉姆萨尔公约（湿地公约）�Ramsar Convention��id�3b175754cd11�body�ٮ它们用植物—微生物—基质协同去污，能耗低、运维便宜，适合农村或小社区；但对高浓度污水要先预处理，不能完全取代大型厂。��They clean via plant-microbe-substrate synergy with low energy and cost, suiting villages or small communities; but strong wastewater needs pre-treatment, so they can't fully replace big plants.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�3ee8534c28f0�body�� 生态系统恢复力指系统在遭受干扰后恢复到原有状态或功能的能力。高恢复力的生态系统能承受较大的扰动而不发生不可逆的转变。恢复力与生物多样性、功能冗余等因素密切相关，是评估生态系统稳定性的重要指标。�?Ecosystem resilience is the capacity of a system to recover its original state or function after disturbance. Highly resilient ecosystems can absorb large shocks without undergoing irreversible change. Resilience is closely linked to biodiversity and functional redundancy and is a key indicator of ecosystem stability.�ans��src��/Miller, G.T. 与 Spoolman, S.《环境科学》�2Miller, G.T. & Spoolman, S., Environmental Science��id�41aa9b1c3c81�body��"碳排放权交易是政府先设定一个排放总量上限（cap），然后把排放配额分配给企业，允许排放少的企业把多余配额卖给超标的企业（trade）。它用市场机制以最低成本实现减排。欧盟碳排放交易体系是全球最大的碳市场。�
Cap-and-trade sets an overall emission cap, allocates allowances to firms, and lets those under the limit sell surplus permits to those over it. It uses the market to cut emissions at lowest cost. The EU Emissions Trading System is the world's largest carbon market.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�43d1793bec08�body���辅助迁徙指人为把物种迁移到原分布区之外更适宜的气候区以避免灭绝。风险包括成为入侵种、携带病害，以及破坏目的地原有群落结构，因此需严格评估。��Assisted migration moves species beyond their native range to climatically suitable areas to avoid extinction. Risks include becoming invasive, carrying disease, and disrupting recipient communities, so rigorous assessment is required.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5646f39c7377�body�ٽ社区花园在闲置地生产新鲜蔬果，缩短食物里程并降低低收入社区获取健康食物的门槛。它们还在灾害时提供本地补给，并增强邻里社会联结。��Community gardens grow fresh produce on vacant land, shortening food miles and lowering barriers for low-income neighborhoods to access healthy food. They also supply local food during disruptions and strengthen social ties.�ans��src��-《Nature Sustainability》城市农业研究�'Nature Sustainability urban agriculture��id�5ae9ad77665b�body�ٶ丹江口等水源区水位、流速与湿地随之改变，岸线生态和下游用水节律都受影响；调水不是"免费的水"，需要把调出区的代价也算进账本。ٹSource areas like Danjiangkou see changed levels, flow and wetlands, affecting shoreline ecology and downstream use; transferred water isn't free—the donor's cost must be counted too.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6462b526c809�body���河岸植被与根系土壤形成过滤带，通过物理截留、反硝化和植物吸收削减随径流进入水体的氮磷。它是控制农业面源污染、保护下游水质的基于自然的方案。�Riparian vegetation and root-zone soils form a filter strip that cuts nitrogen and phosphorus in runoff via physical trapping, denitrification, and plant uptake. It is a nature-based way to control agricultural non-point pollution and protect downstream water quality.�ans��src��K中国科学院生态环境研究中心《环境科学》面源污染研究�\Research Center for Eco-Environmental Sciences CAS Environmental Science non-point pollution��id�6c0761120c87�body�٨无人机搭载多光谱与热成像传感器，可用于植被健康、水体污染与野生动物普查。其高分辨率与灵活起降适合小尺度精细调查。ٵDrones carrying multispectral and thermal sensors survey vegetation health, water pollution, and wildlife. Their resolution and flexible launch suit fine-scale local investigations.�ans��src��'《环境科学》无人机遥感应用�.Environmental Science China UAV remote sensing��id�6c632a205fe2�body�٫填海抹平了红树林、滩涂这些天然缓冲带，波浪和风暴直接拍打硬化岸线；同时湿地丧失削弱了净化与碳汇功能，代价常被低估。��Reclamation erases mangroves and mudflats—natural buffers—so waves and storms hit hardened shores directly, while lost wetlands cut purification and carbon storage, a cost often undercounted.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6c870cb724cb�body��华莱士线是东南亚一条划分动物区系的界线，线两侧即使距离很近，哺乳类与鸟类组成却截然不同（如婆罗洲有猩猩、苏拉威西没有）。它反映了更新世海平面变化与大陆架隔离造成的长期生物地理分异。�)The Wallace Line is a faunal boundary in Southeast Asia where, despite close proximity, mammal and bird assemblages differ sharply (e.g., orangutans in Borneo but not Sulawesi). It reflects long-term biogeographic separation shaped by Pleistocene sea-level changes and continental-shelf isolation.�ans��src��.A. R. Wallace《动物的地理分布》(1876)�>A. R. Wallace, The Geographical Distribution of Animals (1876)��id�76135da5439e�body�٭根本是海陆热力差异：夏天陆地比海洋升温快、空气上升形成低压，把海洋湿空气"吸"过来；这种季节性的气压差像钟摆一样规律。ٵIt's the land-sea thermal contrast: in summer land heats faster, air rises and forms low pressure that pulls in moist ocean air—a seasonal pressure swing as regular as a pendulum.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�81f6fa98ccf9�body�٨城市树木通过生物量生长固碳，并可通过遮荫降低建筑制冷能耗而间接减排。虽然单株碳汇有限，但规模化绿化仍有可观贡献。ٲUrban trees sequester carbon in biomass and indirectly cut emissions by shading buildings and reducing cooling energy. Per-tree sinks are modest, but city-scale greening adds up.�ans��src�ٲAkbari、Pomerantz 与 Taha,《Cool surfaces and shade trees to reduce energy use and improve air quality in urban areas》,Solar Energy,2001 (DOI: 10.1016/s0038-092x(00)00089-x)ٶH. Akbari, M. Pomerantz & H. Taha, 'Cool surfaces and shade trees to reduce energy use and improve air quality in urban areas', Solar Energy, 2001, DOI: 10.1016/s0038-092x(00)00089-x��id�85449663430c�body�ٜ微塑料来自大塑料的破碎，以及合成纤维洗涤、轮胎磨损、化妆品微珠等初级来源。它们已进入土壤、水体和食物链。ٷMicroplastics arise from fragmentation of larger plastic and primary sources like synthetic-fiber washing, tire wear, and microbeads. They have entered soils, waters, and food chains.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8800e8256e2e�body�ٹ将粉碎的硅酸盐岩（如玄武岩）撒布于土壤或海岸，加速其与 CO2 反应生成碳酸盐并长期稳定。它是低成本、可规模化的矿化固碳路径之一。٨Spreading crushed silicate rock such as basalt on land or coasts speeds reactions with CO2 to form stable carbonates. It is a low-cost, scalable mineralization pathway.�ans��src��-《Nature Sustainability》增强风化研究�)Nature Sustainability enhanced weathering��id�8c143719b20c�body���EU ETS 通过「上限与交易」给排放设总量上限并拍卖配额，市场供需决定碳价。市场稳定储备（MSR，2019 年启动）会吸收过剩配额或注入配额，以平抑价格的剧烈波动。��The EU ETS caps total emissions and auctions allowances, letting supply and demand set the carbon price under a cap-and-trade design. The Market Stability Reserve (launched 2019) absorbs surplus or injects allowances to dampen sharp price swings.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8d835c4e7d3a�body�٧上游泥沙减少、河水更清，下游河道淤积放缓、洪峰被植被"削平"；但短期内坡面产流可能改变，需要配套管护避免新的滑坡。ٶUpstream sediment drops and water clears, downstream aggradation slows and floods are "flattened" by vegetation—though short-term runoff shifts need management to avoid new slides.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�8f905d8a3b85�body��流域（集水区）是指地面上所有雨水沿地势汇流入同一条河流及其支流所覆盖的区域。流域内的森林、农田和城市活动都会相互影响水质和水量。以流域为单元进行整体管理，是保护水资源的科学方法。��A watershed is the area where all rainfall drains through the landscape into one river and its tributaries. Forests, farms, and cities within it all affect water quality and quantity. Managing by watershed is a scientific way to protect water resources.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�906f3f9c81e0�body���地热能是利用地球内部的热量来发电或供暖的技术，常见于火山和板块交界等地下温度高的地区。它几乎不受天气影响，可以稳定连续地供电。冰岛等国就大量使用地热满足能源需求。�Geothermal energy taps Earth's internal heat for power or heating, common where underground temperatures are high, such as volcanic and tectonic regions. It is largely weather-independent and can supply steady baseload power. Countries like Iceland rely on it heavily.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�92b3ecaa44d3�body��特有物种是指只在世界某一特定地区自然分布、别处找不到的物种，如澳大利亚的考拉、中国的大熊猫。由于分布范围狭小，它们对环境变化和栖息地破坏格外脆弱。保护特有物种往往也是保护当地独特生态的标志。�4An endemic species occurs naturally only in one specific region and nowhere else, such as the koala in Australia or the giant panda in China. Because their ranges are narrow, they are especially vulnerable to environmental change and habitat loss. Protecting endemics also protects a region's unique ecology.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�98722c7a8be7�body��G营养级是食物链中生物按摄食关系划分的层次，生产者为第一营养级，草食动物为第二营养级，肉食动物依次向上。能量在营养级之间传递时通常只有约10%被下一层级利用，这就是“十分之一定律”。因此食物链越长，顶端生物能获得的能量越少。�=A trophic level is a position in the food chain defined by feeding relationships: producers form the first level, herbivores the second, and carnivores follow above. Only about 10% of energy typically passes to the next level, known as the ten percent law. Thus longer food chains leave less energy for top predators.�ans��src��%Odum 与 Barrett《生态学基础》�3Odum, E.P. & Barrett, G.W., Fundamentals of Ecology��id�9994c3790b84�body���碳税对每单位排放直接定价，收入可归入财政；总量管制交易设定排放上限并交易配额，价格由市场决定。目前全球已有数十个国家开征碳税，而 ETS 体系相对集中在欧盟、中国与少数地区。�&A carbon tax directly prices each unit of emissions, with revenue returned to the budget; cap-and-trade sets a ceiling and trades allowances, letting the market set the price. Dozens of countries have adopted carbon taxes, while ETS systems are concentrated in the EU, China, and a few regions.�ans��src��0世界银行《碳定价现状与趋势》(2023)�4World Bank State and Trends of Carbon Pricing (2023)��id�9ea5b37f823b�body��遗传多样性指同一物种内部不同个体之间基因的差异，是物种适应环境变化和抵御疾病的根本。遗传单一的作物品种一旦遭遇新病害就可能大面积绝收。保护遗传多样性对农业和野生种群的长期生存都至关重要。�3Genetic diversity is the variation in genes among individuals of the same species, the basis for adapting to change and resisting disease. A genetically uniform crop can be wiped out by a new disease. Preserving genetic diversity is vital for both agriculture and the long-term survival of wild populations.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a72dfc72d3cf�body��L《联合国气候变化框架公约》是1992年通过、1994年生效的国际公约，确立了各国合作应对气候变化的基本框架与“共同但有区别的责任”原则。它下设的缔约方大会（COP）每年召开，催生了《京都议定书》和《巴黎协定》。几乎所有国家都是其缔约方。�4The UNFCCC, adopted in 1992 and effective in 1994, sets the basic framework for international climate cooperation under the principle of common but differentiated responsibilities. Its annual Conference of the Parties (COP) produced the Kyoto Protocol and the Paris Agreement. Nearly all nations are parties.�ans��src��3《联合国气候变化框架公约》公开文本�UNFCCC public text��id�b1fd2cbba40d�body�٥一旦扎根并扩散，靠人工捕捞或农药往往只能压住、难以根除；它们繁殖快、藏得深，治理要长期投入且常要多种手段并用。ٙOnce established and spread, manual capture or pesticides only suppress, rarely eradicate; they breed fast and hide well, needing long, combined efforts.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�b3cb88ffc8d0�body�ٳ关键看全链条：本地大棚冬天靠加热种菜，碳可能高于南方田间直运；运输只占部分排放，生产方式往往更重要，"本地"不是万能标签。ٿIt depends on the whole chain: local winter greenhouse heating can emit more than field-to-shelf transport from the south; transport is only part of emissions, so "local" isn't a magic label.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�babfc936d155�body���淡水湖泊的初级生产往往受磷限制，因为许多蓝藻能固定空气中的氮气，却无法自己制造磷。加拿大实验湖区的著名分区加富实验直接演示了这一点：只加氮和碳的一侧没有明显变化，加了磷的一侧迅速出现浓绿水华。因此控制生活污水、洗涤剂和农田径流中的磷输入，是减轻富营养化的关键，但在河口等咸淡水环境中氮往往成为限制因子，策略需要调整。�iPrimary production in fresh water is often phosphorus-limited because many cyanobacteria can fix atmospheric nitrogen but cannot manufacture phosphorus for themselves. The famous divided-lake fertilisation experiment at Canada's Experimental Lakes Area demonstrated it directly: the basin receiving only nitrogen and carbon changed little while the phosphorus-fed side turned bright green with bloom. Cutting phosphorus inputs from sewage, detergents, and farm runoff is therefore central to easing eutrophication, though in estuaries and coastal waters nitrogen usually becomes limiting and the strategy must change.�ans��src��pSchindler（1974）《Science》湖泊富营养化全湖实验；加拿大实验湖区（IISD-ELA）长期研究ـSchindler (1974), Science, whole-lake eutrophication experiments; Canada's Experimental Lakes Area (IISD-ELA) long-term research��id�bac7c2d12cdc�body��微囊藻毒素主要经饮用水和食用受污染的水产品进入人体，可抑制蛋白磷酸酶并具肝毒性，长期暴露与肝损伤甚至肝癌风险相关。常规自来水氯化消毒不能有效去除该毒素，需结合活性炭吸附或膜处理。�]Microcystins mainly enter the human body through drinking water and contaminated aquatic foods; they inhibit protein phosphatases and are hepatotoxic, with chronic exposure linked to liver damage and elevated liver cancer risk. Conventional chlorination cannot remove them effectively, so activated-carbon adsorption or membrane treatment is needed.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�bb54bc320c38�body�٪大坝阻断了鱼类洄游通道，并改变了天然的洪枯节律；下游依赖涨水繁殖的鱼类少了"信号"，渔获随之下降，影响千万人的餐桌。٠Dams block migration and flatten the natural flood-pulse; fish that breed on rising water lose their cue, so catches fall—affecting millions of dinner tables.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c0fbd3925290�body��;碳封存指把二氧化碳从大气中捕获并长期存放的过程，分为自然封存（如森林和土壤固碳）与人工封存（如把工业排放的CO2注入地下岩层）。人工碳捕集与封存（CCS）技术被视为减排的补充手段。但它成本高，不能替代减少化石燃料使用。�6Carbon sequestration is capturing CO2 from the atmosphere and storing it long term, either naturally (forests, soils) or artificially (injecting industrial CO2 into underground rock). Carbon capture and storage (CCS) is seen as a supplementary tool. But it is costly and cannot replace cutting fossil fuel use.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c21d76eb3741�body���亲生物设计把自然元素（绿廊、屋顶花园、湿地）嵌入城市肌理，以恢复降温、雨水滞蓄、空气净化与心理健康等效益。它把生物多样性保护融入建成环境，而非仅留在郊区公园。�Biophilic design weaves nature—green corridors, rooftop gardens, wetlands—into the urban fabric to restore cooling, stormwater retention, air purification, and mental-health benefits. It embeds biodiversity into the built environment rather than confining it to suburban parks.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c3d6d0e6f929�body�� 碳足迹是指一个人、产品或活动在整个生命周期中直接或间接排放的温室气体总量，通常用二氧化碳当量表示。乘坐飞机、用电和吃肉都会留下碳足迹。减少碳足迹可以通过节电、使用公共交通和选择本地食物来实现。�[A carbon footprint is the total greenhouse gas emissions, directly and indirectly, caused by a person, product, or activity over its life cycle, usually expressed in carbon dioxide equivalents. Flying, using electricity, and eating meat all leave a footprint. Reducing it can involve saving energy, using public transport, and choosing local food.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c61db14be78c�body���光伏直接用半导体把阳光转为电；聚光太阳能用镜面把阳光汇聚加热工质，驱动汽轮机发电，并可配储热。CSP 适合带可调度的日间基荷，PV 更便宜且更易分布式部署。�Photovoltaics convert sunlight directly to electricity in semiconductors; concentrated solar power uses mirrors to heat a fluid that drives a turbine and can store heat. CSP suits dispatchable daytime baseload, while PV is cheaper and easier to deploy distributed.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�df26f457352f�body���TSI 由卫星辐射计（如 SORCE、TIM）连续监测，近几十年变化不足 0.1%。而同期地表升温约 1.1°C，且夜间与高纬增温更明显，这与太阳驱动的模式不符，指向温室气体的作用。�TSI is monitored continuously by satellite radiometers such as SORCE/TIM, varying by less than 0.1% over recent decades. Meanwhile surface warming of about 1.1°C, stronger at night and high latitudes, contradicts a solar-driven pattern and points to greenhouse gases.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e64d9c75f51d�body�٬工业可堆肥要求约 58℃ 与高湿的集中堆肥设施，家庭可堆肥则在较低常温条件下完成。两者误用会直接导致末端处理失效与污染。��Industrial compostable requires centralized facilities near 58°C and high humidity, whereas home compostable breaks down at lower ambient temperatures. Mislabeling leads to failed end-of-life treatment and contamination.�ans��src��%欧盟 EN 13432 与家庭堆肥标准�&EU EN 13432 and home compost standards��id�e81ca202271e�body���向海洋添加碱性物质（如橄榄石粉）提升碱度，促使更多 CO2 转化为碳酸氢根长期储存。风险在于局部 pH 扰动可能影响浮游生物与碳循环，需严格监测。��Adding alkaline material such as olivine raises ocean alkalinity, converting more CO2 into bicarbonate for long-term storage. Risks include local pH disturbance affecting plankton and carbon cycling, requiring strict monitoring.�ans��src��%《Science》海洋地球工程研究�Science marine geoengineering��id�ecb792022354�body��社区参与式保护强调让当地居民成为保护的主体，把保护目标与他们的生计和发展结合起来。当居民从保护中获益（如生态旅游收入），就更有动力守护自然资源。它在许多发展中国家的保护区管理中效果显著。�%Community-based conservation makes local residents the main actors, linking conservation goals with their livelihoods and development. When people benefit—say from ecotourism income—they are motivated to safeguard nature. It has worked well in many protected areas of developing countries.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�env_24_002�body��2公平的算法是从原料开采到报废全程记账。电动车在制造端确实吃亏:生产锂电池组额外排放约5–10吨二氧化碳,出厂时碳账户为负。但行驶阶段拉开差距——欧洲电网下,行驶约6万至9万公里后累计排放即低于燃油车并不断扩大;中国电网下约8–12万公里打平;若用风电充电,优势从小里程就确立。结论取决于电网清洁度、电池大小与车辆寿命三变量。随着电网脱碳与电池回收成熟,电动车的账只会越算越划算,而油车的账是死的。�LFair accounting books both cars from mining to scrapping. EVs start in the red: making the lithium-ion pack emits roughly five to ten tonnes of CO2. But driving opens the gap — on the European grid, breakeven against combustion comes around sixty to ninety thousand kilometers and widens thereafter; on China's current mix near eighty to one hundred twenty thousand; with wind power the lead exists from day one. Three variables decide: grid cleanliness, battery size, vehicle life. As grids decarbonize and recycling matures, the EV ledger only improves — the petrol car's is frozen.�ans��src�ٓHawkins 等,《Comparative Environmental Life Cycle Assessment of Conventional and Electric Vehicles》,Journal of Industrial Ecology 第17卷,2013ٓT. R. Hawkins et al., Comparative Environmental Life Cycle Assessment of Conventional and Electric Vehicles, Journal of Industrial Ecology 17, 2013��id�env_24_005�body��机制清晰:深色屋顶反照率提高0.25,屋面吸收的太阳辐射约减三成。实测显示白色涂层可使顶层室内降温1至2摄氏度、屋面表面温度下降可达15度;气候模拟表明,中纬度大城市普遍采用冷屋顶与冷路面后,夏季午后气温可整体回落约1度,空调高峰负荷削减逾百分之十。绿色屋顶降温略逊但增加雨水滞蓄与生物多样性。边界条件:湿润多云地区收益缩水,冬季采暖或微增——它是因地制宜的组合拳之一,而非全球通用解。��The mechanism is clear: raising a dark roof's albedo by 0.25 cuts its absorbed sunlight by roughly thirty percent. Measurements show white coatings lower top-floor indoor temperatures by one to two degrees Celsius and roof surface temperatures by up to fifteen degrees; city-scale simulations find widespread cool roofs and pavements shave summer afternoon air temperatures by about one degree while trimming peak air-conditioning load over ten percent. Green roofs cool slightly less but add stormwater retention and biodiversity. Caveats apply: benefits shrink in cloudy humid climates and winter heating may rise slightly — a context-dependent tool, not a universal fix.�ans��src�ٲAkbari、Pomerantz 与 Taha,《Cool surfaces and shade trees to reduce energy use and improve air quality in urban areas》,Solar Energy,2001 (DOI: 10.1016/s0038-092x(00)00089-x)ٶH. Akbari, M. Pomerantz & H. Taha, 'Cool surfaces and shade trees to reduce energy use and improve air quality in urban areas', Solar Energy, 2001, DOI: 10.1016/s0038-092x(00)00089-x��id�env_24_010�body��3燃煤与金矿冶炼把汞蒸气排入大气,沉降后被水中微生物甲基化成甲基汞——真正的主角。它易溶于脂肪且与蛋白质巯基紧密结合,浮游生物摄入后难以排出,沿食物链每上一级浓度放大约十倍,金枪鱼、鲨鱼这类长寿顶级捕食者因此富集最高。日本水俣病的神经毒性惨案促成2013年《水俣公约》,全球逐步淘汰添汞产品与新矿开采。实用建议遵循剂量逻辑:避免大型掠食鱼类,选择寿命短的小鱼(沙丁鱼、三文鱼),孕妇儿童尤其如此。�kCoal burning and gold smelting release mercury vapor; once deposited, microbes methylate it into methylmercury — the real villain. Fat-soluble and bound tightly to protein thiols, it resists excretion, multiplying roughly tenfold per trophic level, so long-lived apex predators like tuna and shark carry the heaviest loads. Human neurotoxicity at Minamata, Japan drove the 2013 Minamata Convention phasing out mercury-added products and new mines. Practical advice follows dose logic: avoid large predatory fish, favor short-lived small ones such as sardines and salmon — especially for pregnant women and children.�ans��src�٦Driscoll、Mason、Chan 与 Jacob,《Mercury as a Global Pollutant: Sources, Pathways, and Effects》,Environmental Science & Technology,2013 (DOI: 10.1021/es305071v)٠Driscoll, Mason, Chan & Jacob, 'Mercury as a Global Pollutant: Sources, Pathways, and Effects', Environmental Science & Technology, 2013, DOI: 10.1021/es305071v��id�env_24_019�body��u合成雌激素(如避孕药中的乙炔雌二醇)随尿液进入污水,常规处理难以完全去除。英国实验把雄性虹鳟养在污水处理厂排口下游,检出了卵黄蛋白原——本该只在雌鱼产卵期出现的蛋白;高浓度下雄鱼甚至长出卵巢组织。人体影响更难断言:干扰甲状腺与性激素通路的物质(邻苯二甲酸酯、双酚A等)暴露普遍,观察研究提示与生殖指标相关,但剂量-反应关系与因果链仍有争议。监管思路因此转向混合物整体评估与源头减量——药房回收过期药、无双酚A收据纸,都是这条链上的小闸门。��Synthetic estrogens like ethinyl estradiol slip through conventional sewage treatment. British experiments caging male rainbow trout below treatment works found vitellogenin — an egg-yolk protein females produce — in male blood; at high exposures males even grew ovarian tissue. Human effects are harder to assert: endocrine-active chemicals (phthalates, bisphenol A) are ubiquitous, observational studies hint at reproductive endpoints, but dose-response and causation remain contested. Regulation shifts toward mixture-level assessment plus source control — pharmacy take-backs and BPA-free receipt paper are small valves on this pipe.�ans��src��fKidd 等,《Collapse of a fish population after exposure to a synthetic estrogen»,PNAS 第104卷,2007�gK. A. Kidd et al., Collapse of a fish population after exposure to a synthetic estrogen, PNAS 104, 2007��id�env_26_005�body��.依次为避免、最小化、恢复、补偿四个层级。项目应先在选址设计阶段避开敏感栖息地,再压缩影响的范围与强度,对受损地实施原位生态恢复,最后才用保护或重建等效生境抵消剩余损失,力求开发后生物多样性「无净损失」乃至净增益。质疑集中在三点:物种组成与生态功能难以一对一等价替换,生态恢复常有数十年滞后且可能失败,基线与折算方法易被高估操纵,故学界坚持补偿只能是最后手段,不应沦为付费破坏的许可证。��Avoid, minimise, restore, offset - strictly in that order. A project should first be sited away from sensitive habitat, then shrink the scale and intensity of remaining impacts, repair damaged areas in place, and only at the end compensate residual losses by protecting or recreating equivalent habitat, aiming for no net loss - ideally net gain - of biodiversity. The scepticism rests on three points: species composition and ecological function rarely substitute one-for-one, restoration often lags for decades and can fail outright, and baselines and exchange ratios invite optimistic accounting, so researchers insist offsets remain a last resort, not a licence to pay and destroy.�ans��src��xBull, Suttle, Gordon, Singh,《Biodiversity offsets in theory and practice》,Oryx,2013 (DOI: 10.1017/s003060531200172x)�vBull, Suttle, Gordon, Singh, 'Biodiversity offsets in theory and practice', Oryx, 2013, DOI: 10.1017/s003060531200172x��id�env_26_017�body���目的在堵住「碳泄漏」。若碳价只压在欧盟境内产业头上,钢铁、水泥、铝、化肥等高排放生产便会迁往气候政策宽松的国家,产品再返销欧洲,减排沦为纸面转移。为此进口商须申报钢、铝、水泥、化肥、氢与电力等产品的隐含碳排放,2023年10月先进入过渡申报期,2026年起购买价格挂钩碳配额拍卖均价的CBAM证书,同时境内免费配额逐年退坡,使内外碳成本对等。�{Its purpose is to plug carbon leakage. If carbon prices press only on producers inside the EU, emission-intensive making of steel, cement, aluminium and fertilisers simply migrates to lenient jurisdictions and the products flow back, shifting pollution rather than cutting it. Importers must therefore declare the embedded emissions of covered goods - iron, steel, cement, fertilisers, hydrogen and electricity. A transitional reporting phase opened in October 2023; from 2026 they buy CBAM certificates priced off the average ETS auction while free allowances for domestic plants taper away, levelling carbon costs inside and outside.�ans��src��j欧洲议会与理事会条例《Regulation (EU) 2023/956》建立碳边境调节机制(2023年5月通过)�~European Parliament and Council, Regulation (EU) 2023/956 establishing a Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism (adopted May 2023)��id�f8a2ecb4abcc�body�٦卫星夜间灯光强度与 GDP、人口和能源消耗高度相关，可用于缺失统计地区的发展估算。结合电力消耗还可识别工业排放热点。��Satellite night-light intensity correlates strongly with GDP, population, and energy use, enabling development estimates where statistics are missing. Combined with power data it can flag industrial emission hotspots.�ans��src�٨Zhou, Ma, Zhou, Xu,《Nighttime Light Derived Assessment of Regional Inequality of Socioeconomic Development in China》, Remote Sensing, 2015 (DOI: 10.3390/rs70201242)٤Zhou, Ma, Zhou, Xu, 'Nighttime Light Derived Assessment of Regional Inequality of Socioeconomic Development in China', Remote Sensing, 2015, DOI: 10.3390/rs70201242��id�fbebf717384e�body�ٰ上游水坝拦截泥沙、三角洲过度抽取地下水，地面沉降速度超过海平面上升；原本靠泥沙补给的平原失去"进补"，海水倒灌随之加剧。ٲUpstream dams trap sediment while excessive groundwater pumping causes subsidence faster than sea-level rise; the plain loses its sediment "top-up," worsening seawater intrusion.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�004ed498fef4�body���氢氟碳化物是为替代破坏臭氧层的氟氯烃而推广的制冷剂，本身几乎不损耗臭氧，但增温潜势可达二氧化碳的数百到上万倍。2016 年通过的基加利修正案把这类物质纳入议定书管制，要求各国按分组时间表逐步削减生产与消费。联合国环境规划署估计，全面履约可在本世纪末避免最多约 0.4℃ 的升温，因此这项修正案实质上是用臭氧公约的成熟履约机制来完成气候减排任务。�SHydrofluorocarbons were adopted as refrigerants to replace ozone-depleting chlorofluorocarbons; they barely touch the ozone layer but have global warming potentials hundreds to tens of thousands of times that of carbon dioxide. The Kigali Amendment, adopted in 2016, brought them under the Protocol with staged phase-down schedules for production and consumption by country group. UNEP estimates full compliance could avoid up to about 0.4°C of warming by the end of the century, so the amendment effectively borrows the ozone treaty's proven compliance machinery to deliver climate mitigation.�ans��src��'《蒙特利尔议定书》公开文本�Montreal Protocol public text��id�024140baba05�body��l甲烷在20年尺度上的增温潜势约为二氧化碳的80多倍，但它在大气中只能存留约十年，远短于二氧化碳的数百年。因此削减甲烷、黑碳等短寿命气候污染物，能在几年内看到明显效果，被联合国环境规划署称为实现1.5°C目标“最快最有力”的措施之一，同时还能改善空气质量。��Methane warms about 80 times more than CO2 over a 20-year horizon, yet it survives in the atmosphere only about a decade, versus centuries for CO2. Cutting methane, black carbon and other short-lived climate pollutants therefore slows warming within a few years — UNEP calls methane cuts among the fastest and strongest levers for the 1.5°C goal — while also improving air quality.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�025ed64f6b01�body��/厄尔尼诺与拉尼娜是赤道太平洋海温异常波动的两种相位：厄尔尼诺时东太平洋异常偏暖，拉尼娜时异常偏冷。它们会改变全球大气环流，引发不同地区干旱、洪涝、台风强度等极端事件，是年际气候变率最重要的自然信号之一。��El Niño and La Niña are opposite phases of anomalous sea-surface temperature in the equatorial Pacific—El Niño is unusually warm in the eastern Pacific, La Niña unusually cool. They shift global atmospheric circulation, triggering droughts, floods, and changes in storm intensity across regions, making them among the most important natural signals of year-to-year climate variability.�ans��src�٨美国国家海洋和大气管理局（NOAA）气候预测中心（CPC）ENSO 监测与“ENSO 博客”；世界气象组织（WMO）《厄尔尼诺/拉尼娜通报》�iU.S. NOAA Climate Prediction Center (CPC) ENSO monitoring and 'ENSO Blog'; WMO 'El Niño/La Niña Update'��id�03cf804f8e5f�body�٢海绵城市通过透水铺装、雨水花园和下沉绿地等自然滞蓄设施，减少径流峰值并补充地下水。它降低内涝风险并改善水质。٦Sponge cities use permeable pavement, rain gardens, and sunken green spaces to detain runoff and recharge groundwater. They cut flood peaks and improve water quality.�ans��src��$《环境科学》海绵城市研究�'Environmental Science China sponge city��id�03f2c4359efc�body���利用超富集植物吸收、转化或固定土壤中的重金属与有机污染物，之后收割处理植物体，逐步降低污染。成本低但对深层或高浓度污染效果有限。��Hyperaccumulator plants take up, transform or immobilize heavy metals and organics in soil; the plants are then harvested and disposed, gradually reducing contamination. Low cost but limited for deep or highly concentrated pollution.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�044fc2552c00�body��伞护种是需要大面积栖息地的大型物种，保护它就能顺带庇护同区域内的许多其他物种，如东北虎和灰熊。它不像关键种那样靠生态功能，而靠空间需求发挥保护作用。选定伞护种可简化保护区的规划。�␀An umbrella species needs large habitat and protecting it shelters many co-occurring species, such as the Amur tiger or grizzly bear. Unlike keystones, it protects via spatial needs rather than ecological function. Choosing one simplifies reserve planning.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�0454a9b2125b�body��3湿地像海绵一样蓄水，减缓洪峰下泄。�6Wetlands store water like sponges, easing flood peaks.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�046d14c9e886�body�ٺ极地涡旋是环绕极地、把冷空气锁在高纬度的强风环流。当它减弱或变形，寒冷的极地空气就会大范围向南溢出，导致中纬度地区突发严寒。��The polar vortex is a band of strong winds circling the pole that traps cold air at high latitudes. When it weakens or deforms, frigid polar air spills far southward, causing sudden cold outbreaks in mid-latitudes.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�04b8d2524dec�body��世界银行的年度评估显示，全球已运行数十项碳税与排放交易体系，合计覆盖约四分之一的温室气体排放，年度收入超过千亿美元。价格差异巨大：欧盟排放交易体系的配额价格长期在每吨数十欧元甚至接近百欧元，而一些以增加财政收入为主的碳税仅为每吨数美元。差异来自减排目标的严格程度、配额总量与免费分配比例、行业竞争力顾虑以及政治可接受度，因此覆盖率高并不等于约束力强。�QThe World Bank's annual review counts dozens of operating carbon taxes and emissions trading systems covering roughly a quarter of global greenhouse gas emissions and raising over a hundred billion dollars a year. Prices vary enormously: EU allowances have traded in the tens of euros and at times near a hundred, while some carbon taxes designed mainly to raise revenue sit at a few dollars per tonne. The spread reflects target stringency, cap levels and free allocation, competitiveness concerns, and political acceptability, so wide coverage does not automatically mean binding constraint.�ans��src��b世界银行《碳定价发展现状与未来趋势 2024》；欧盟排放交易体系市场报告�_World Bank, State and Trends of Carbon Pricing 2024; EU Emissions Trading System market reports��id�05f5284d1230�body���不是。生产环节的排放常远大于运输：牛肉、乳制品的温室气体强度远高于多数本地蔬果，远程海运的蔬果有时比本地大棚反季菜更低碳，因此应综合生产方式而非只看里程。��No. Production emissions usually dwarf transport: beef and dairy far exceed most local produce, and shipped vegetables can beat local heated off-season crops, so judge by production method, not miles alone.�ans��src��Our World in Data;Nature Food�OWID;Nature Food��id�07706816f040�body��环境影响评价制度要求重大开发项目在动工前，系统预测、分析和公开其可能造成的环境后果，并提出减缓措施。许多国家以法律形式将EIA作为项目审批的前置条件，是世界银行等多边机构贷款项目的标准流程。�uAn Environmental Impact Assessment system requires major development projects, before construction, to systematically predict, analyze, and disclose their likely environmental consequences and propose mitigation measures. Many countries legally require EIA as a precondition for approval, and it is standard practice for World Bank and other multilateral project financing.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0a8954827a37�body�ٺ人工鱼礁通过提供硬质附着基与三维结构增加栖息地复杂度和庇护所。但若布局不当可能吸引过度捕捞或改变物种组成，需科学选址与监测。��Artificial reefs add habitat complexity and shelter by providing hard substrate and three-dimensional structure. Poor siting can attract overfishing or shift species composition, so scientific placement and monitoring are required.�ans��src��*《环境科学》人工鱼礁生态研究�+Environmental Science China artificial reef��id�0a8efa098059�body��NCBAM（俗称碳关税）要求进口商为钢铁、水泥、铝、电力等高碳产品购买碳凭证，使其碳成本与欧盟内部碳价相当。它针对的是“碳泄漏”——企业把生产转移到碳约束宽松的国家，从而抵消欧盟内部的减排努力，同时也推动贸易伙伴建立自己的碳定价。��CBAM (commonly called a carbon tariff) requires importers to buy certificates for high-carbon goods such as steel, cement, aluminum, and electricity, aligning their carbon cost with the EU's internal carbon price. It targets carbon leakage — firms relocating production to jurisdictions with lax carbon constraints, which would offset EU domestic reductions — while also nudging trading partners to adopt carbon pricing of their own.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0a9586e516b3�body���二者资源稳定可预报，但装置面临高盐腐蚀、生物附着与极端海况冲击，可靠性与运维成本仍是瓶颈，且近岸生态影响评估不足，目前多为示范阶段。��Both are predictable and steady, but devices face salt corrosion, biofouling and storm loads; reliability and O&M cost remain bottlenecks, and nearshore ecological impacts are understudied, keeping most projects at pilot scale.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�0c10ed85ae2a�body��8生物多样性补偿指开发活动不可避免造成生境破坏时，通过在其他地方实施保护或修复项目来补偿等效的生物多样性损失，遵循“避免—减缓—补偿”的层级。它试图在发展与保护间取得平衡，但因“等效性”难以准确衡量而受到批评。�XA biodiversity offset is when unavoidable habitat damage from development is compensated by conservation or restoration elsewhere to achieve equivalent biodiversity gains, following an 'avoid–reduce–offset' hierarchy. It tries to balance development with protection, but is criticized because true ecological equivalence is hard to measure.�ans��src��V《生物多样性公约》（CBD）及 世界银行 生物多样性补偿操作指南�SConvention on Biological Diversity (CBD); World Bank biodiversity offset guidelines��id�0cadd57f9b18�body��六价铬（Cr(VI)）可透过细胞膜并在体内被还原产生活性氧，具强氧化性与致癌性；三价铬（Cr(III)）是人和动物必需的微量元素且难被吸收。治理上常通过还原把 Cr(VI) 转化为低毒的 Cr(III) 再沉淀去除。�<Hexavalent chromium (Cr(VI)) crosses cell membranes and generates reactive oxygen species upon reduction, making it strongly oxidizing and carcinogenic, whereas trivalent chromium (Cr(III)) is an essential trace element and poorly absorbed. Remediation often reduces Cr(VI) to low-toxic Cr(III) before precipitation.�ans��src��'《环境科学》铬污染修复论文�>Environmental Science journal — chromium remediation article��id�10fffa115329�body���指示物种对环境因子的变化反应灵敏且可预测，其种群或生理状态可反映栖息地质量与污染程度。例如地衣对二氧化硫敏感，常被用于大气酸沉降监测。�An indicator species responds sensitively and predictably to environmental change, so its population or physiology can reflect habitat quality and pollution levels. Lichens, for example, are sensitive to sulfur dioxide and are used to monitor acid deposition.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�12372932db23�body���这两类工业除燃料燃烧外，还因化学反应（如水泥煅烧石灰石）产生大量“过程排放”，电和氢难以完全替代，因此 CCS 被视为必须的非电减排手段。��Beyond fuel combustion, both emit large 'process emissions' from reactions (e.g., calcining limestone), which electricity or hydrogen cannot fully replace, making CCS a necessary non-electric abatement.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�127acd2b48f1�body��t鲑鱼、鳗鲡等鱼类需要在上游产卵与下游育肥之间往返洄游，而大坝和堰让它们无法通过，全球淡水鱼类种群因此大幅下降。鱼道、鱼梯和过鱼设施能让鱼类绕过大坝，拆除废弃低坝则能恢复自然水流与栖息地；河流连通性还保障沉积物与养分的输运，是淡水生态系统健康的标志。��Salmon, eels, and other fish migrate between upstream spawning grounds and downstream feeding areas; dams and weirs block them, and freshwater fish populations have plunged worldwide. Fishways, fish ladders, and bypass channels let fish pass dams, while removing obsolete low dams restores natural flow and habitat. Connectivity also drives sediment and nutrient transport — a hallmark of healthy freshwater ecosystems.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�13150fe44899�body�ٺ"四横"是长江、黄河、淮河、海河四大水系，"三纵"是东、中、西三条调水线；用南北通道把丰水的南方水引向缺水的北方，像给水系"织网"。��The "four horizontals" are the Yangtze, Yellow, Huai and Hai river systems; the "three verticals" are east, middle and west routes—north-south channels moving water from wet south to dry north, weaving the basins into a network.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1470cb89e450�body��q有机农业不用合成农药化肥，靠轮作、绿肥和生物防治维持地力、控制病虫害，土壤有机质和田间生物多样性往往更高，也能减少化肥流失造成的水污染。但有机作物的单位面积产量通常低于常规农业，需要更多土地，因此评价它的整体环境效益时，要把产量也算进来综合比较。��Organic farming forgoes synthetic pesticides and fertilisers, relying on crop rotation, green manures and biological control to maintain fertility and manage pests, so its soils usually hold more organic matter and its fields more biodiversity, while nutrient runoff pollution drops. But yields per hectare are generally lower than in conventional farming, needing more land — so judging its overall environmental impact requires comparing on a per-tonne basis.�ans��src��$Nature（农业生态研究）；WRI�"Nature (agroecology research); WRI��id�14c90dab967a�body���持续噪声即使在睡眠中也会触发交感神经与内分泌应激反应，导致皮质醇升高、睡眠结构碎片化，长期暴露与高血压、缺血性心脏病和认知功能下降相关。世界卫生组织欧洲区办公室 2018 年的环境噪声指南据此建议道路交通噪声的昼夜等效声级不超过 53 分贝、夜间不超过 45 分贝。因为噪声影响的是整座城市的人口基数，其疾病负担折算成健康寿命损失年在欧洲仅次于空气污染。�/Sustained noise triggers sympathetic and endocrine stress responses even during sleep, raising cortisol and fragmenting sleep architecture, and chronic exposure is associated with hypertension, ischaemic heart disease, and cognitive impairment. On that basis the WHO Regional Office for Europe recommended in 2018 that road traffic noise stay below 53 decibels day-evening-night and 45 decibels at night. Because exposure covers whole urban populations, the resulting disease burden measured in healthy life years lost ranks second to air pollution in Europe.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�157c454d1333�body���它通过环境税、排污费、押金退还与损害赔偿等工具，把外部成本内部化，让排放者承担治理代价，从而改变行为；但费率设定与监管能力决定其真实效力。��Through environmental taxes, effluent fees, deposits and damages liability, it internalizes external costs so emitters bear cleanup bills and change behavior; but fee levels and enforcement decide its real bite.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�173d7cc439c0�body���地热能利用地球内部放射性衰变和原始余热产生的热量，可通过地热井抽取热水或蒸汽来发电或供暖。在板块边界和火山活动区资源最丰富，而且几乎不受天气和昼夜影响，可稳定供电。�Geothermal energy taps heat from Earth's interior, produced by radioactive decay and leftover primordial heat, drawn up through wells as hot water or steam for power and heating. It is richest at plate boundaries and volcanoes, and can supply steady power regardless of weather.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�176f3b47e0eb�body���光伏遵循经验学习曲线：累计出货量每翻一番，组件价格大约下降两成，这一规律有时被称为斯旺森定律。降本来自硅片切得更薄、电池转换效率提升、生产规模化与自动化，以及供应链的标准化竞争。国际可再生能源署统计，2010 至 2022 年全球公用规模光伏的平准化发电成本下降了约九成，使其在多数市场成为最便宜的新增电源。��Photovoltaics follow an experience curve in which module prices fall roughly 20% for every doubling of cumulative shipments, a pattern sometimes called Swanson's law. The savings come from thinner wafers, higher cell efficiency, larger and more automated factories, and fierce standardised supply-chain competition. IRENA data show the levelised cost of utility-scale solar fell about 90% between 2010 and 2022, making it the cheapest source of new generation in most markets.�ans��src��h国际可再生能源署《可再生能源发电成本 2023》；国际能源署《世界能源展望》�IIRENA, Renewable Power Generation Costs in 2023; IEA World Energy Outlook��id�1869eb0a80f8�body��KPOPs 是能在环境中存留数十年、随食物链富集并损害健康的人工化学品，例如DDT、多氯联苯（PCBs）和二噁英。2001年通过的《斯德哥尔摩公约》要求全球淘汰或限制其生产与使用，并清理历史存量，目前已管控数十种物质，是国际化学品治理的里程碑。��POPs are synthetic chemicals that persist in the environment for decades, bioaccumulate up food chains, and harm health — such as DDT, polychlorinated biphenyls (PCBs), and dioxins. The 2001 Stockholm Convention requires the global phase-out or restriction of their production and use and the cleanup of stockpiles; dozens of substances are now controlled, making it a milestone of international chemical governance.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1892da04af0c�body��关键种是对生态系统结构和稳定影响远大于其数量比例的物种，移除后群落会剧烈变化。典型例子是海獭，它捕食海胆从而保护海带森林；还有非洲象通过取食塑造稀树草原。保护关键种能撬动整个生态网络的存续。�gA keystone species has an impact on ecosystem structure and stability far greater than its abundance; removing it triggers dramatic community change. A classic example is the sea otter, which eats sea urchins and protects kelp forests, and the African elephant, which shapes savanna through feeding. Protecting keystones sustains the whole ecological network.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�18c40539e69e�body��9IUCN 红色名录将物种按灭绝风险分为多个等级：无危（LC）、近危（NT）、易危（VU）、濒危（EN）、极危（CR）、野外灭绝（EW）和灭绝（EX）。其中易危、濒危、极危被统称为“受威胁”物种，是全球最权威的物种保护状况评估工具之一。�}The IUCN Red List classifies species by extinction risk into categories: Least Concern (LC), Near Threatened (NT), Vulnerable (VU), Endangered (EN), Critically Endangered (CR), Extinct in the Wild (EW), and Extinct (EX). Vulnerable, Endangered, and Critically Endangered together are termed 'threatened' and form one of the world's most authoritative assessments of species status.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�18f6104ec3fd�body���AMOC 把温暖的表层海水从热带输送到北大西洋，使西欧冬季比同纬度地区温和。观测显示其强度已降至千年来的低位，若进一步减弱可能导致欧洲变冷、沿海海平面上升与季风紊乱。�.The AMOC carries warm surface water from the tropics to the North Atlantic, keeping Western Europe milder in winter than other regions at similar latitudes. Observations show its strength is near a millennium low, and further weakening could cool Europe, raise coastal sea levels, and disrupt monsoons.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�19231ae72fd2�body���模型把大气、海洋、陆面、海冰等分成三维网格，用物理方程（流体运动、辐射、相变等）在超级计算机上逐步积分。给定排放情景，它们模拟能量与物质输送，得出温度、降水等的长期变化。�Models divide the atmosphere, ocean, land and sea ice into a 3D grid and solve physical equations (fluid motion, radiation, phase changes) step by step on supercomputers. Given an emissions scenario, they simulate energy and mass transport to project temperature, precipitation and more.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�19612cd608ce�body��6酸性降水淋失土壤养分并直接腐蚀叶片。�-Acid rain leaches nutrients and burns leaves.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�197cb5a1073a�body��J关键种对生态系统有不成比例的巨大影响，移除它会引起连锁崩溃，例如海獭消失导致海藻林被海胆啃光；伞护种则需要大面积完整栖息地，保护它便顺带保护了同区域的其他物种。规划中，关键种用于维持生态过程，伞护种用于划定保护区的范围。��A keystone species exerts a disproportionately large influence — removing it triggers cascading collapse, as when sea otters vanish and urchins devour kelp forests. An umbrella species needs large intact habitat, so protecting it incidentally protects co-occurring species. In planning, keystone species guide maintaining ecological processes, while umbrella species guide reserve sizing.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1b33197848d0�body��~太阳能板里的硅半导体吸收阳光后释放电子，形成直流电，再经逆变器变成家庭可用的交流电。وSilicon semiconductors in panels free electrons when hit by sunlight, producing DC current that an inverter converts to usable AC power.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�1d8e68fbbff9�body��:丰富度只统计物种数目，而香农指数还考虑各物种个体数的均匀度：一个“1种占90%”的群落，信息量和稳定性都低于“10种各占10%”的群落。香农指数 H'=-Σpi·ln(pi)，个体分布越均匀数值越大，因此它是比单纯物种数更完整的多样性度量。�oRichness only counts species; the Shannon index also accounts for the evenness of individuals: a community with one species holding 90% of individuals carries less information and stability than one with ten species at 10% each. Shannon H'=-Σ pi·ln(pi) grows as individuals are more evenly spread, making it a fuller measure of diversity than a plain species count.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1ee946620db8�body��5综合采矿、建设、运行到退役的全生命周期评估，核能发电的温室气体排放与风电、太阳能同属最低梯队（通常在每千瓦时十几克二氧化碳当量以下）。因此许多气候研究将其视为低碳基荷电源，但其推广也面临核废料和安全的争议。�sAcross the full lifecycle—mining, construction, operation, and decommissioning—nuclear power's greenhouse gas emissions rank among the lowest, comparable to wind and solar (typically well under a few tens of grams of CO2-equivalent per kWh). Many climate studies therefore treat it as a low-carbon baseload source, though waste and safety concerns remain contentious.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�1f142e81b106�body�ٖ富营养化是过多的氮、磷等营养物流入湖泊河流，使藻类疯狂生长、耗光水中氧气，导致鱼和其他水生生物死亡。ٗEutrophication happens when excess nitrogen and phosphorus enter waters, fueling algal blooms that consume oxygen and kill fish and other aquatic life.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�1fff36bd38bb�body��循环经济以“减量化、再利用、再循环”为原则，通过设计使产品、材料和资源在使用后不断回到生产系统，最大限度减少废弃物。它不同于“开采—制造—丢弃”的线性经济，更强调资源闭环和价值留存。�A circular economy follows reduce, reuse, and recycle principles, designing products and materials so they re-enter the production system after use and waste is minimized. Unlike the linear 'take–make–dispose' model, it emphasizes closed loops and retained value.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�21af15c922ea�body���平流层里的臭氧层像保护伞挡住紫外线的伤害，需要保护；而地面臭氧是氮氧化物和挥发性有机物在阳光照射下生成的二次污染物，会刺激呼吸道、损害健康。��Stratospheric ozone forms a protective layer that blocks harmful ultraviolet rays and must be preserved. Ground-level ozone is a secondary pollutant made when nitrogen oxides and volatile organics react in sunlight, and it irritates the lungs.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�23217e1d6c74�body��&放射性污染来自不稳定核素释放电离辐射，危害随半衰期衰减且无法通过化学手段中和。化学污染则由有毒物质引起，可借化学反应或吸附去除但可能长期残留。两者防护思路不同：前者讲屏蔽与距离，后者讲隔离与降解。�XRadioactive contamination comes from unstable nuclides emitting ionising radiation; harm decays with half-life and cannot be neutralised chemically. Chemical pollution is from toxic substances removable by reaction or adsorption but may persist. Protection differs: shielding and distance for radiation, isolation and degradation for chemicals.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�23493a1af5e7�body�٨将污染土壤堆成垛并强制通风、补菌补营养，促进好氧微生物降解石油等有机物，常用于加油站、油库场地，可控且周期较短。��Contaminated soil is piled with forced aeration and added microbes/nutrients to boost aerobic degradation of oils and organics—common at fuel stations and depots; controllable with shorter duration.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�23f5ce356f38�body���化石燃料不完全燃烧、机动车尾气、焦化与冶炼等工业活动是土壤 PAHs 的主要来源，常以高低环混合物形式沉降累积。PAHs 具有致癌性且难降解，是优先控制的有毒污染物。�Incomplete fossil-fuel combustion, vehicle exhaust and industrial activities such as coking and smelting are the main soil PAHs sources, depositing as mixtures of low- and high-ring compounds. PAHs are carcinogenic, persistent and listed as priority toxic pollutants.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�249c4f5f93a3�body���IPBES估计当前物种灭绝速率约为背景值的数十到上百倍，两栖类、珊瑚、哺乳动物受胁最重，且驱动以人类活动（生境丧失、气候变化、过度开发）为主，因而被称为第六次大灭绝。��IPBES estimates current extinction rates at tens to over a hundred times the background level, hitting amphibians, corals and mammals hardest, driven mainly by human activity—hence the term 'sixth mass extinction.'�ans��src��GIPBES《全球生物多样性与生态系统服务评估报告》(2019)�%IPBES Global Assessment Report (2019)��id�25fcfffdcc64�body���大坝、涵闸等阻水构筑物切断了鱼类在繁殖场、索饵场和越冬场之间的洄游通道，导致产卵成功率下降和基因交流受阻。恢复季节性生态放水与建设鱼道是常用的连通性修复手段。�"Barrages, sluices and dams sever the migration corridors that fish use between spawning, feeding and overwintering habitats, lowering reproductive success and blocking gene flow. Restoring seasonal environmental flows and building fish passages are common connectivity-restoration measures.�ans��src��\Nilsson 等, 2005, Science 308:405-408（全球大河流系统的破碎化与流量调节）لNilsson, Reidy, Dynesius & Revenga, 2005, Science 308:405-408 (Fragmentation and flow regulation of the world's large river systems)��id�26332c11edeb�body�٧它们推倒小树、踩出水池、传播种子，把密林"修剪"成更开阔多样的生境，惠及许多其他物种；它们的存在本身就在塑造景观。ٳThey knock down saplings, trample water holes and disperse seeds, opening dense forest into varied habitat that helps many species—their presence literally shapes the landscape.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�266bb53a2e05�body���政府设定排放总量并发放或拍卖配额，超排需购买配额，减排多余则可出售；稀缺性使碳排放产生成本，激励企业以最低成本减排，典型如EU ETS。��The government caps total emissions and issues or auctions allowances; over-emitters must buy, savers can sell. Scarcity prices carbon and pushes firms to cut where cheapest—as in the EU ETS.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�27442825446e�body��k环境正义关注环境负担与收益的分配是否公平：现实中，工业区、垃圾场和污染设施常选址在低收入和少数族裔社区，而绿地与洁净水又更集中在富裕社区，形成“环境不平等”。环境正义主张受影响社区参与决策、获得同等保护与合理补偿，如今已被写入多国的环境政策。��Environmental justice asks whether environmental burdens and benefits are fairly distributed: in practice, industrial zones, landfills, and polluting facilities often locate in low-income and minority communities while green space and clean water concentrate in wealthier ones — environmental inequality. It demands that affected communities take part in decisions and receive equal protection and fair compensation, and it is now embedded in many national policies.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�27538e6040a9�body���成土作用受气候、生物、母岩、地形和时间五大因素共同塑造：岩石经风化破碎，加上枯枝落叶和微生物变成腐殖质，慢慢积累成有结构的土壤。形成几厘米可耕土往往要数百年。�	Pedogenesis is shaped by five factors—climate, organisms, parent material, topography and time: rock weathers into fragments, and litter and microbes turn into humus, gradually building structured soil. Forming a few centimetres of arable soil can take centuries.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2a59ba6c2d16�body�� 生物多样性热点指物种极为丰富且特有种多、但同时受人类威胁严重的区域，全球约有三十六个。它们虽只占陆地一小部分，却承载了大部分维管植物和脊椎动物特有种。优先保护热点能以有限资源挽救最多特有物种。�;Biodiversity hotspots are regions with exceptional species richness and many endemics that are also severely threatened by humans; about 36 are recognised globally. Though a small share of land, they hold most vascular-plant and vertebrate endemic species. Prioritising them saves the most endemics per unit effort.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�2a9da22bc149�body���城市生态足迹估算维持一个城市消费所需的生物生产性土地与海域面积，常远大于其行政边界。它揭示城市对外部资源和碳吸收空间的依赖。降低足迹需提高能效、本地化和循环经济。�2An urban ecological footprint estimates the biologically productive land and sea area needed to sustain a city's consumption, often far exceeding its administrative boundary. It reveals dependence on outside resources and carbon-absorption space. Lowering it needs efficiency, localisation and circularity.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�2b34a1d90c9d�body��z全球每年产生数千万吨电子废弃物，且增速快于回收。一部分进入正规回收链，另一部分被非法出口到发展中国家，由非正规工场露天拆解，在回收价值金属的同时释放铅、汞等毒素。回收率低的原因包括收集体系不完善、产品设计难以拆解，以及消费者把旧设备积存在家里不愿交投。��The world generates tens of millions of tonnes of e-waste every year, growing faster than recycling. Some enters formal recycling chains; another share is illegally exported to developing countries, where informal workshops strip it in the open, recovering valuable metals while releasing lead and mercury. Low recycling rates stem from incomplete collection systems, designs that resist dismantling, and consumers hoarding old devices at home.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�2c53cacfe308�body��e海绵城市让城市像海绵一样“吸水、蓄水、渗水、净水”：透水铺装让雨水就地入渗，雨水花园和绿色屋顶蓄存径流，湿地与蓄水池调蓄暴雨，再把净化后的水回用或补充地下水。通过把硬化地面恢复成可渗透的绿色设施，城市能削峰错峰、缓解内涝，同时改善水环境。��A sponge city lets urban areas absorb, store, infiltrate and purify rainwater like a sponge: permeable pavements let rain soak in where it falls, rain gardens and green roofs hold runoff, and wetlands and reservoirs regulate storms, while treated water is reused or recharges groundwater. By restoring hard surfaces to permeable, green infrastructure, cities flatten flood peaks, ease waterlogging and improve water quality.�ans��src��-中国生态环境部（海绵城市建设）�MEE (sponge city construction)��id�2d5c42f83ddf�body���原生演替发生在完全没有土壤的地方，如裸岩或新火山岩，要从岩石风化、地衣苔藓开始慢慢积土。次生演替发生在原有土壤尚存之处，如森林砍伐或火灾后，恢复起来快得多。��Primary succession starts where no soil exists, such as bare rock or new lava, and must build soil slowly from lichens and mosses. Secondary succession follows disturbance like logging or fire where soil remains, so recovery is much faster.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�2ddc71fe0412�body���厄尔尼诺期间赤道中东太平洋表层暖水扩张，抑制了冷水上涌，海洋把此前储存的热量大量释放给大气，全球平均气温因此在长期变暖趋势之上叠加约 0.1–0.2℃ 的短期抬升。世界气象组织指出，2023 年全球平均温度已比工业化前高约 1.45℃，正处在强厄尔尼诺发展期。反之，拉尼娜年会短暂压低数值，使一些人误判变暖已经停止。�During El Niño the warm surface layer of the central and eastern equatorial Pacific expands and cold upwelling weakens, so the ocean releases stored heat to the atmosphere and adds a short-term boost of roughly 0.1–0.2°C on top of the underlying warming trend. The World Meteorological Organization reported that 2023 ran about 1.45°C above pre-industrial levels while a strong El Niño was developing. La Niña years pull the figure down temporarily, which sometimes leads people to claim warming has paused.�ans��src��q世界气象组织《2023 年全球气候状况》报告；美国国家海洋和大气管理局气候预测中心�DWMO State of the Global Climate 2023; NOAA Climate Prediction Center��id�30a5b06a1039�body��~潮汐能利用海水涨落的水位差驱动水轮发电，可预测性强、稳定，但适合建设的海湾地点有限。قTidal energy uses the rise and fall of seawater to drive turbines; it is highly predictable but limited to suitable coastal sites.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�30aa22ee150b�body��荒漠化指干旱、半干旱和亚湿润干旱区的土地因气候变化和人为压力（如过度放牧、滥垦）而退化为类似荒漠的过程。它主要发生在非洲萨赫勒、中亚和中东等地，威胁数亿人的粮食与生计安全。�]Desertification is the degradation of land in arid, semi-arid, and dry sub-humid areas into desert-like conditions, driven by climate variability and human pressures such as overgrazing and unsustainable farming. It occurs mainly across Africa's Sahel, Central Asia, and the Middle East, threatening the food and livelihoods of hundreds of millions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�31bac6e9fb72�body���抽水蓄能靠两座高差水库搬运水体储能，往返效率约七至八成，单站容量可达数吉瓦、连续放电时间数小时到数十小时，寿命长达半个世纪以上。锂电池优势在于响应毫秒级、选址灵活，适合调频与两到四小时的削峰，但按能量计的成本和寿命在长时储能上仍不划算。因此两者是互补关系：电池负责短时高频调节，抽蓄承担日内乃至跨日的能量搬移。�kPumped hydro stores energy by moving water between reservoirs at different elevations, with round-trip efficiency around 70–80%, single-site capacity in the gigawatt range, discharge durations from hours to tens of hours, and service lives beyond fifty years. Lithium batteries respond in milliseconds and can be sited almost anywhere, which suits frequency regulation and two-to-four-hour peak shaving, but their cost per unit of energy and cycle life remain unattractive for long-duration storage. The two are complements: batteries handle fast, short bursts while pumped hydro shifts energy across a day or longer.�ans��src��Y国际水电协会《世界水电展望 2023》；国际能源署《储能追踪报告》�hInternational Hydropower Association, World Hydropower Outlook 2023; IEA energy storage tracking reports��id�3414e274f3cf�body�ي土壤侵蚀是表土被风或水冲走的现象，滥伐、过度放牧、陡坡开垦会加剧它，使土地变贫瘠、河流淤积。ٛSoil erosion is topsoil carried away by wind or water; deforestation, overgrazing and steep-slope farming worsen it, impoverishing land and silting rivers.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�35486bef9800�body��#20 世纪 60 年代起，阿姆河与锡尔河的水被大规模引去灌溉棉花，入湖径流锐减，咸海体积萎缩到原有的一小部分，湖面分裂并留下遍布盐与农药残留的干涸湖底，扬起的盐尘影响周边居民健康与农田。渔业城镇失去生计，局地气候的调节作用消失，夏冬温差扩大。教训在于流域水量分配必须为生态基流留出份额，跨界河流需要有约束力的协调机制，而工程性节水若不同时约束灌溉面积，只会诱发新的用水扩张。�~From the 1960s the Amu Darya and Syr Darya were diverted at scale to irrigate cotton, inflow collapsed, and the Aral Sea shrank to a fraction of its volume, splitting apart and exposing a dry bed laden with salt and pesticide residues whose windblown dust harms nearby health and farmland. Fishing towns lost their livelihoods and the lake's moderating effect on local climate vanished, widening summer-winter extremes. The lesson is that basin allocation must reserve a share for environmental flows, transboundary rivers need binding coordination, and efficiency projects that do not cap irrigated area simply invite expanded water use.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�36e14426a6e9�body���《全球甲烷承诺》在 2021 年格拉斯哥气候大会上发起，签署方承诺到 2030 年把全球人为甲烷排放相对 2020 年水平至少削减 30%，已有一百五十多个国家加入。油气行业之所以被看作突破口，是因为大量排放来自可修补的阀门泄漏、放空与不完全火炬燃烧，减排措施往往能靠回收的天然气收回成本。国际能源署估算，该行业约四成甲烷排放可以零净成本消除。�0Launched at the Glasgow climate conference in 2021, the Global Methane Pledge commits signatories to cut collective anthropogenic methane emissions at least 30% below 2020 levels by 2030, and more than 150 countries have joined. Oil and gas is treated as the low-hanging fruit because much of its output comes from repairable valve leaks, venting, and incomplete flaring, where abatement often pays for itself through the recovered gas. The International Energy Agency estimates roughly 40% of the sector's methane emissions could be eliminated at no net cost.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�39a47acbb1b9�body��碳泄露指一个地区因严格气候政策提高排放成本，导致高碳产业转移到管制较松的地区，全球排放并未减少。它也可能表现为本地减产而改从外地高碳进口。边境碳调节机制正是为缓解这一问题而设计。�-Carbon leakage occurs when strict climate policy raises local emission costs and pushes carbon-intensive industry to looser jurisdictions, so global emissions do not fall. It can also appear as local output dropping while high-carbon imports rise. Border carbon adjustment is designed to address this.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�3b8dd5eac4af�body��{洋流像巨大的传送带把热量从赤道送往高纬，例如北大西洋暖流让欧洲比同纬度更温暖湿润。٠Currents act like a conveyor moving heat from the equator toward high latitudes; the North Atlantic Current keeps Europe milder than its latitude would suggest.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�3c02c8ae4f45�body��Y焚烧炉在高温下把垃圾烧掉，用余热产生蒸汽推动汽轮机发电，垃圾体积可减少约九成，还能大幅降低填埋场的甲烷排放。不过焚烧需要严格的烟气净化来控制二噁英等污染物，而且能回收的应先回收。在做好分类的前提下，焚烧是比简单填埋更优的处置手段。��An incinerator burns waste at high temperature, using the heat to generate steam that drives a turbine and produces electricity, shrinking waste volume by about 90 percent and avoiding the methane a landfill would emit. But flue-gas cleaning is essential to control pollutants such as dioxins, and recyclables should always be recovered first. With good sorting, incineration beats simple landfilling.�ans��src�ٺCherubini, Bargigli, Ulgiati,《Life cycle assessment (LCA) of waste management strategies: Landfilling, sorting plant and incineration》,Energy,2009 (DOI: 10.1016/j.energy.2008.08.023)ٸCherubini, Bargigli, Ulgiati, 'Life cycle assessment (LCA) of waste management strategies: Landfilling, sorting plant and incineration', Energy, 2009, DOI: 10.1016/j.energy.2008.08.023��id�416a80ba5900�body��BOD（生化需氧量）是微生物分解水中有机物所消耗的溶解氧，反映可被生物降解的污染程度。COD（化学需氧量）是用化学氧化剂测出的总耗氧量，包含难生物降解的部分，二者都用来判断水质污染程度。�BOD (biochemical oxygen demand) is the dissolved oxygen microbes use to break down organic matter, showing how much biodegradable pollution is present. COD (chemical oxygen demand) measures total oxidizable matter including harder-to-degrade substances; both indicate water pollution.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�436c1f84a0b6�body��[维修权立法把可维修性变成产品设计的法律义务：要求厂商在合理期限内供应备件与维修手册、允许独立维修商获得诊断工具与固件、限制以序列号绑定阻止更换零件，并在标签上公示可维修性评分。欧盟通过生态设计法规为多类家电设定备件供应年限，随后又出台促进维修的专门指令，法国则强制标注维修指数。制度约束之所以必要，是因为单靠市场竞争，厂商更倾向以更短的更新周期获利，而维修的环境收益体现在避免新产品制造带来的隐含排放。��Right-to-repair rules turn repairability into a legal design obligation: manufacturers must supply spare parts and service manuals for a defined period, independent repairers must be able to obtain diagnostic tools and firmware, serial-number pairing that blocks part replacement is restricted, and repairability scores appear on labels. The EU set minimum spare-part availability periods for several appliance categories through its ecodesign framework and later adopted a directive promoting repair, while France requires a repairability index. Regulation is needed because competition alone rewards shorter replacement cycles, whereas the environmental benefit of repair lies in avoiding the embodied emissions of manufacturing a new unit.�ans��src�ٙ欧盟生态设计框架法规及促进商品维修的指令（Directive (EU) 2024/1799）；法国维修指数（indice de réparabilité）政策文件ٯEU ecodesign framework regulations and Directive (EU) 2024/1799 on the promotion of the repair of goods; France's repairability index (indice de reparabilite) policy documents��id�4624a67a4821�body���联合国粮农组织评估显示，全球约三分之一的海洋鱼类种群已被捕捞到生物量低于能持续高产的水平，即“过度捕捞”。过度捕捞会破坏食物链、减少渔获并危及沿海社区生计。��FAO assessments indicate roughly one third of global marine fish stocks are harvested beyond levels that sustain maximum yield—'overfished'. Overfishing breaks food chains, shrinks catches and threatens coastal livelihoods.�ans��src�ِ联合国粮农组织《负责任渔业技术准则第4号：渔业管理》；粮农组织渔业技术论文404/2《渔业中产权的使用》٤FAO, Technical Guidelines for Responsible Fisheries No. 4: Fisheries Management; FAO Fisheries Technical Paper 404/2, Use of Property Rights in Fisheries Management��id�46782501d6d0�body��+大坝阻断洄游鱼类的通道，同时把泥沙拦在库内，使下游河床粗化、河口与海滩因缺沙而侵蚀，水温和水文节律也被改变。美国埃尔瓦河两座百年老坝在 2011 至 2014 年间被拆除，是当时规模最大的拆坝工程，释放的数千万立方米泥沙重新塑造了河口沙洲与海滩。监测显示鲑鱼在数年内自行重新占据上游河段，说明只要种源尚存，恢复连通性本身就能触发生态恢复；但拆坝需要妥善处理沉积物中的污染与短期浊度冲击。��Dams block migratory fish and trap sediment, coarsening downstream beds, starving estuaries and beaches so they erode, and altering water temperature and flow rhythms. Two century-old dams on the Elwha River in Washington State were removed between 2011 and 2014 in what was then the largest such project, releasing tens of millions of cubic metres of sediment that rebuilt the river mouth and adjacent beaches. Monitoring found salmon recolonising upstream reaches within a few years, showing that restoring connectivity can itself trigger recovery where source populations survive — provided contaminated sediment and short-term turbidity are managed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�46effb756f33�body���蜈蚣草可将土壤中的砷大量吸收并积累于地上部而不表现毒害，收获地上部分即移除污染物。相比客土法，植物修复成本低、扰动小，但周期长且需妥善处理富集后的植物残体。�-Pteris vittata takes up large amounts of arsenic and stores it in its shoots without toxicity, so harvesting the aerial biomass removes the contaminant. Compared with soil replacement, phytoremediation is cheaper and less disruptive but slower, and the arsenic-rich biomass must be disposed of safely.�ans��src��*《环境科学》植物修复技术论文�:Environmental Science journal — phytoremediation article��id�4731fe066a84�body�ٴ它们靠碳酸根构建碳酸钙外壳与骨骼，而酸化降低海水中碳酸根浓度、提高溶解风险，使幼体生长与壳形成变难，进而影响整条食物链。��Calcifiers build shells and skeletons from carbonate; acidification lowers available carbonate and raises dissolution risk, hindering larval growth and shell formation and rippling up the food web.�ans��src��JOrr 等，《Nature》437: 681–686，2005 年，doi: 10.1038/nature04095�?Orr et al., Nature 437, 681-686 (2005), doi:10.1038/nature04095��id�48f4ab15a418�body��光化学烟雾是氮氧化物和挥发性有机物在阳光照射下发生光化学反应，生成臭氧和过氧乙酰硝酸酯等二次污染物。它多见于高温、强日照且汽车密集的城市。这种烟雾会刺激呼吸道并损害植物叶片。�8Photochemical smog forms when nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds undergo sunlight-driven reactions that produce secondary pollutants such as ozone and peroxyacetyl nitrate. It is common in hot, sunny, traffic-dense cities. The resulting haze irritates the respiratory tract and damages plant foliage.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�4ed9ca22c3ef�body���2022 年《生物多样性公约》第十五次缔约方大会通过的框架，其目标三要求到 2030 年有效保护和管理全球至少 30% 的陆地、内陆水域以及海洋与沿海区域。文本强调保护地网络应具有生态代表性、连通性和公平治理，并首次明确承认原住民与地方社区的传统领地和权利。与此前的爱知目标相比，30x30 更强调质量而非单纯面积，因为纸上公园式的保护地无法阻止实际的栖息地丧失。�rTarget 3 of the framework adopted at the fifteenth Conference of the Parties to the Convention on Biological Diversity in 2022 calls for effective conservation and management of at least 30% of terrestrial, inland water, coastal, and marine areas by 2030. The text stresses that protected area networks be ecologically representative, well connected, and equitably governed, and it explicitly recognises the territories and rights of Indigenous peoples and local communities for the first time. Compared with the earlier Aichi targets, 30x30 emphasises quality over raw area, since paper parks do not stop actual habitat loss.�ans��src��[《生物多样性公约》昆明-蒙特利尔全球生物多样性框架（COP15，2022）�`Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework, Convention on Biological Diversity (COP15, 2022)��id�4f0905f18835�body�٤捕集的 CO2 经压缩后注入深部咸水层、枯竭油气藏等地质构造中，以超临界态长期封存。选址需评估盖层密封性与泄漏风险。��Captured CO2 is compressed and injected into deep saline aquifers or depleted oil and gas fields, stored as a supercritical fluid long term. Site selection must assess caprock sealing and leakage risk.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�50eba46bfbb2�body��b绿色建筑在设计和运营中降低全生命周期环境影响：高性能围护结构减少冷暖能耗，高效暖通和LED降低用电，屋顶光伏和雨水收集就地利用资源，绿色建材减少隐含碳。绿色建筑评价体系把这些表现量化打分。建筑约占全球终端能耗三成，改造存量建筑同样潜力巨大。��Green buildings minimise environmental impact over their whole life: high-performance envelopes cut heating and cooling loads, efficient HVAC and LED lighting reduce electricity use, rooftop solar and rainwater harvesting tap local resources, and green materials lower embodied carbon. Rating systems such as green-building certification score these achievements. Buildings use roughly 30 percent of global final energy, so upgrading existing stock matters as much as new builds.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5112fc1635ed�body�ًPM10是直径小于10微米的颗粒物，PM2.5小于2.5微米；PM2.5更细，能深入肺部甚至进入血液，对健康危害更大。ٕPM10 particles are under 10 microns, PM2.5 under 2.5 microns; the finer PM2.5 penetrates deep into lungs and bloodstream, posing greater health risk.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�511c7bcdd732�body�ي大致相反：拉尼娜时赤道东太平洋异常偏冷，常使西太平洋台风更多、美洲西部更干旱、东南亚更湿润。٦Roughly yes: during La Niña the eastern equatorial Pacific is unusually cool, often bringing more western-Pacific typhoons, drier Americas and wetter Southeast Asia.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�516bf38b1fba�body���多灾种系统共享观测、通信与指挥平台，能识别灾害链（如暴雨引发山洪与滑坡）并统一发布，降低重复建设与漏警。联合国倡导的「全民预警」目标正是推动此类系统在脆弱地区全覆盖。�?Multi-hazard systems share observation, communication and command platforms, recognizing hazard chains—such as rainfall triggering flash floods and landslides—and issuing unified alerts, cutting duplication and missed warnings. The UN Early Warnings for All initiative promotes their coverage in vulnerable regions.�ans��src��?WMO 2022《全民早期预警：2023-2027 执行行动计划》�DWMO (2022) Early Warnings for All: Executive Action Plan 2023–2027��id�51ad3ccb6345�body�٫碳达峰指二氧化碳年排放量达到历史最高后开始下降；碳中和指排放量与移除量相抵、净排放为零，是中国“双碳”目标的核心。ٺCarbon peaking is when annual CO₂ emissions stop rising and start falling; carbon neutrality is balancing emissions with removals to net zero—the core of China's 'dual carbon' goals.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�523f35e836a4�body��树木通过树冠遮阳减少地表吸热，通过蒸腾作用把水分转化为水汽带走热量，还能吸附颗粒物并吸收二氧化碳。研究表明，成片城市林地的降温幅度可达数摄氏度，能明显缓解热浪影响，堪称廉价的“自然空调”。�OTrees shade surfaces to reduce heat absorption and cool air through transpiration, converting water into vapour and carrying heat away; they also trap particulate matter and absorb CO2. Studies show mature urban forest patches can cool cities by several degrees Celsius, noticeably easing heatwaves — a cheap natural air conditioner.�ans��src��'中国科学院（城市森林研究）�3Chinese Academy of Sciences (urban forest research)��id�53653443dc18�body�ٖ土壤有机质是腐烂的动植物和微生物残体，能保水保肥、改善结构；含量越高土壤越肥沃，过度耕作会使其下降。ٯSoil organic matter is decayed plant, animal and microbial residue that holds water and nutrients and improves structure; more of it means richer soil, and tillage reduces it.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�53b9a1178aae�body�ٖ城市动物通过调整活动时间、食性与耐受噪声来利用人工生境。部分鸟类叫声频率变化以避开交通噪声即为一例。ٟUrban animals adjust activity timing, diet, and noise tolerance to exploit built habitats. Some birds shift song frequency to avoid traffic noise, for example.�ans��src��$《环境科学》城市生态研究�)Environmental Science China urban ecology��id�54b257102bc3�body�ٙ生态廊道是连接破碎栖息地的绿色通道（如植树带、河流），让动物安全迁徙、交流基因，避免种群被隔离而衰退。٨An ecological corridor is a green link (e.g., tree belts, rivers) between fragmented habitats, letting animals migrate and exchange genes, preventing isolation decline.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�54e1630bb265�body��化石燃料燃烧排放的硫酸盐等气溶胶能反射阳光、形成云凝结核，短期掩盖了部分升温。若快速减排，气溶胶寿命仅数天到数周，其冷却效应会迅速消失，可能使短期升温暂时加速，即'减排骤冷反弹'风险。�Sulfate aerosols from fossil-fuel burning reflect sunlight and seed clouds, masking some warming in the short term. Because aerosols last only days to weeks, rapid cuts would swiftly remove that cooling and could temporarily accelerate warming—a 'aerosol-unmasking' rebound risk.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5a7e2469bc43�body���内分泌干扰物是一类能模仿或干扰激素正常作用的化学物质，如某些农药、双酚 A 和邻苯二甲酸酯。即使浓度很低，也可能影响发育、生殖和免疫系统，是环境与公共健康关注的重点。��Endocrine disruptors are chemicals that mimic or interfere with hormones, such as some pesticides, BPA and phthalates. Even at low doses they can affect development, reproduction and immunity, making them a key environmental and public-health concern.�ans��src��lRachel Carson,《Silent Spring》Houghton Mifflin,1962;中译《寂静的春天》上海译文出版社,2011�iR. Carson, Silent Spring, Houghton Mifflin, 1962; Chinese ed. Shanghai Translation Publishing House, 2011��id�5ae1ecbff81e�body�٤树上果、林下禽、地里粮多层利用，一种受灾还有别的兜底；多样结构像"不把鸡蛋放一个篮子"，抗虫、抗旱、保肥都更稳。ٴTrees, understory fowl and crops use multiple layers, so one failure leaves others—like not putting eggs in one basket; the diversity steadies pest, drought and fertility shocks.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5b4a25b7d6bd�body���地质记录中最大规模的五次灭绝发生在奥陶纪、泥盆纪、二叠纪、三叠纪和白垩纪末期，其中二叠纪末灭绝抹去了约九成海洋物种。它们多由火山、陨石撞击或大气剧变等极端事件引发。�The five largest extinction pulses occurred at the ends of the Ordovician, Devonian, Permian, Triassic and Cretaceous periods; the Permian event wiped out about 90% of marine species. They were driven by extremes like volcanism, asteroid impacts or atmospheric upheaval.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5bb846445f67�body�ِ海水淡化是用反渗透或蒸馏把海水变淡水，能缓解缺水，但耗电高、成本高，并会产生浓盐水排放影响海洋。٪Desalination removes salt from seawater via reverse osmosis or distillation; it eases shortages but is energy-intensive, costly and produces brine harmful to marine life.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5d570a8957dc�body�ّ海草覆盖不到0.2%海床，却储存了约10%的海洋沉积物碳，且根状茎固沙护岸、为鱼类育幼。退化后碳库易释放。٨Seagrass covers <0.2% of seafloor yet stores ~10% of ocean sediment carbon; its rhizomes stabilize sediment and shelter fish nurseries. Degradation releases that stock.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5e7c835ae2af�body��j生态设计（Design for the Environment）在产品研发阶段就把环境因素纳入考量：减少材料用量、采用易拆解结构、方便维修升级、优先可再生材料。研究表明产品约八成的环境影响在设计阶段就被锁定，后续很难改变。所以循环经济强调“从源头设计”，而非等废弃后再想办法。��Ecological design (Design for the Environment) builds environmental thinking into the R&D stage: less material, easily disassembled structures, repairable and upgradeable designs, and renewable materials. Research suggests roughly 80 percent of a product's environmental impact is locked in at the design phase and hard to change later. That is why the circular economy insists on designing at the source rather than fixing problems after disposal.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�61169161cb48�body���塑料垃圾在环境中破碎成小于5毫米的碎片，经河流汇入海洋，被贝类、鱼类摄入后进入食物链；海盐由海水蒸发制得，自然富集微塑料，自来水则来自受污染的江河湖泊，故二者均可检出。�Plastic waste fragments below 5 mm, flows to the sea via rivers, and enters the food chain through shellfish and fish; sea salt is made by evaporating seawater that concentrates microplastics, and tap water draws from contaminated lakes and rivers—so both can contain them.�ans��src�ٚA. L. Andrady，《海洋环境中的微塑料》，《Marine Pollution Bulletin》第62卷（2011）：1596–1605，DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030َA. L. Andrady, 'Microplastics in the marine environment', Marine Pollution Bulletin 62 (2011): 1596-1605, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030��id�613b2ef93ffe�body���2005 年版指导值之后积累的大规模队列研究显示，即使在低浓度区间，细颗粒物暴露与心血管疾病、肺癌和全因死亡率之间仍存在显著且近乎无阈值的剂量反应关系。综合北美、欧洲与亚洲的证据后，世卫组织把年均指导值下调到 5 微克每立方米，24 小时值定为 15。该值是健康基准而非法定标准，各国需据此制定分阶段的过渡目标。�Large cohort studies published after the 2005 guidelines showed a strong, essentially threshold-free exposure-response relationship between fine particulate matter and cardiovascular disease, lung cancer, and all-cause mortality, even at low concentrations. Weighing evidence from North America, Europe, and Asia, WHO lowered the annual guideline to 5 micrograms per cubic metre with a 24-hour level of 15. The figure is a health benchmark rather than a legal limit, so countries are expected to set staged interim targets toward it.�ans��src�ل世界卫生组织《全球空气质量准则》（WHO Global Air Quality Guidelines, 日内瓦, 2021, 含PM2.5健康效应章节）٠World Health Organization. WHO Global Air Quality Guidelines: Particulate Matter (PM2.5 and PM10), Ozone, Nitrogen Dioxide and Sulfur Dioxide. Geneva: WHO, 2021��id�617dc1088598�body��_虚拟水指生产一件商品（如粮食、衣服）所消耗的隐含用水量，由托尼·艾伦于1990年代提出；水足迹则衡量个人、产品或国家在整个供应链中直接和间接用掉的水量。它们揭示了贸易背后隐藏的水资源转移，有助于理解缺水地区通过进口“虚拟水”缓解本地水压力。��Virtual water is the hidden volume of water used to produce a good—such as food or clothing—a concept introduced by Tony Allan in the 1990s; a water footprint measures the direct and indirect water consumed across a supply chain by an individual, product, or country. They reveal water transfers embedded in trade and help explain how water-scarce regions ease local pressure by importing virtual water.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�61a06c60709e�body���多数'可降解'塑料需特定工业堆肥的高温高湿条件才能分解，在自然海洋或土壤环境下降解极慢，且与传统塑料混收会污染回收流。它只是补充而非替代减塑。��Most 'biodegradable' plastics need industrial-compost heat and humidity to break down, degrading slowly in open oceans or soil, and they contaminate recycling streams if mixed with conventional plastic. They supplement, not replace, reduction.�ans��src��Science;EU Plastics Strategy�Science;EU��id�61af5024590a�body���《巴塞尔公约》管控有害废物的跨境转移，要求出口危险废料必须事先获得进口国同意，防止发达国家把污染转嫁到管理能力较弱的国家。它还推动废物减量和就近妥善处理。��The Basel Convention controls transboundary movements of hazardous waste, requiring prior consent from the importing country so wealthy nations cannot dump pollution on less-capable ones. It also promotes waste reduction and sound local treatment.�ans��src��《巴塞尔公约》秘书处�Basel Convention��id�621e25f8ddff�body��Y可持续渔业要求捕捞量不超过鱼类种群自然再生的速度，通常用最大可持续产量作参考。过度捕捞会让种群崩溃，全球有相当比例的鱼类资源已处于过度开发或枯竭状态。配额管理、禁渔期和海洋保护区让鱼群有时间恢复，长期看反而能让渔民捕得更多、更稳。��A sustainable fishery harvests no faster than the fish population can naturally replenish, typically guided by the Maximum Sustainable Yield. Overfishing pushes stocks to collapse — a large share of the world's fish stocks are already overexploited or depleted. Quotas, closed seasons and marine protected areas give stocks time to rebuild, which in the long run lets fishers catch more, more reliably.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�62d8d7fb4bb6�body��8风推动叶片旋转，通过齿轮箱或直驱结构带动发电机转子转动而发电。风机的发电功率与风速的立方成正比，所以风速翻倍、出力可达八倍；叶片很长，叶尖转速其实很高。海上风电场风力更稳定、资源更好，但建设与维护成本也更高。�vWind turns the blades, which spin a generator rotor via a gearbox or direct drive to make electricity. Power output grows with the cube of wind speed, so doubling the wind can raise output eightfold; the blades are huge, so their tips move surprisingly fast even when the hub seems to turn slowly. Offshore wind is steadier and stronger but costs more to build and maintain.�ans��src��!中国科学院（风能研究）�CAS (wind energy research)��id�638547a1730e�body���传统 GDP 不计入自然资源的消耗与生态系统退化，可能把资源枯竭误记为收入。自然资本核算把森林、湿地等视作资产并量化其存量与服务流量，使决策能看到环境与经济的真实权衡。�0Traditional GDP ignores natural resource depletion and ecosystem degradation, potentially counting resource exhaustion as income. Natural capital accounting treats forests and wetlands as assets and quantifies stocks and service flows, revealing true environment–economy trade-offs for decision-makers.�ans��src��L联合国等, 2014,《环境经济核算体系（SEEA 2012）中心框架》�cUnited Nations et al. (2014) System of Environmental-Economic Accounting 2012 — Central Framework��id�6512a462f19a�body�٥植物性食物的生产通常比畜禽产品耗用更少土地、水和温室气体排放。转向植物基膳食是减缓食物系统排放的高性价比途径。ٷPlant foods generally need less land, water, and greenhouse gas per calorie than animal products. Shifting to plant-forward diets is a cost-effective way to cut food-system emissions.�ans��src��%《Science》食物系统排放研究�Science food system emissions��id�652d7bfb6338�body��沥青、混凝土等城市材料热容量大、导热性好，白天把大量太阳辐射储存在结构体内，入夜后缓慢释放，而密集建筑又限制了长波辐射向天空散失，因此城乡温差通常在日落后数小时达到峰值。植被稀少削弱了蒸腾降温，空调与交通的废热进一步叠加。提高屋顶与路面反射率可以减少白天的储热，美国环保署指出高反射屋顶表面温度可比传统深色屋顶低数十摄氏度，并降低建筑制冷负荷。�vAsphalt and concrete have high heat capacity and conductivity, storing solar energy in the urban fabric by day and releasing it slowly after sunset, while dense street canyons trap outgoing longwave radiation, so the urban-rural temperature gap usually peaks a few hours after dusk. Sparse vegetation weakens evaporative cooling, and waste heat from air conditioning and traffic adds more. Raising the reflectance of roofs and pavements cuts daytime heat storage; the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency notes that high-reflectance roof surfaces can run tens of degrees Celsius cooler than dark ones while trimming cooling loads.�ans��src��\美国环境保护署《减缓城市热岛效应指南》；Oke《Boundary Layer Climates》�MU.S. EPA Reducing Urban Heat Islands Compendium; Oke, Boundary Layer Climates��id�65e176d3581a�body��z太阳能电池利用半导体材料（主要是硅）的光伏效应：阳光光子把硅中电子激发到更高能级，电子定向流动便形成电流。单晶硅电池的实验室效率已超过26%，实际组件一般在20%上下。光伏发电没有转动部件、运行时不排放污染物，成本过去十年大幅下降，已成为最便宜的新增电源之一。��Solar cells rely on the photovoltaic effect in semiconductors, mostly silicon: photons of sunlight boost electrons to higher energy levels, and the directed flow of those electrons produces an electric current. Lab cells exceed 26 percent efficiency and commercial modules sit near 20 percent. Photovoltaics have no moving parts and emit nothing during operation, and their cost has fallen so steeply that solar is now among the cheapest new power sources.�ans��src��!中国科学院（光伏研究）�CAS (photovoltaics research)��id�66783b8a07c9�body���IPBES（2019）综合了数百项研究，估计全球约 100 万种动植物正面临灭绝威胁，其中许多可能在数十年内消失。它比单纯依赖 IUCN 红色名录覆盖更广，纳入了区域与本土评估。�The 2019 IPBES Global Assessment synthesized hundreds of studies, estimating about one million plant and animal species are threatened with extinction, many within decades. It broadens beyond the IUCN Red List by incorporating regional and indigenous assessments.�ans��src��GIPBES《全球生物多样性与生态系统服务评估报告》(2019)�%IPBES Global Assessment Report (2019)��id�68cab42f2a99�body���就地保护在物种原生栖息地保护（如保护区），维持其自然生态关系；迁地保护把物种移到动物园、种子库或繁育中心，作为最后保险，但成本高且难以复原生态功能。��In-situ conservation protects species in their native habitat, keeping natural ecological relationships; ex-situ moves them to zoos, seed banks or breeding centers as a last insurance, but at high cost and with limited ecological function.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�69b1860c0688�body�ٓ承载能力是某地资源（食物、水、空间）在长期内能稳定供养的最大种群数量，超过它种群就会因短缺而下降。ْCarrying capacity is the maximum population a place's resources (food, water, space) can sustain long-term; exceed it and the population declines.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6a697f7a49e9�body�٪IUCN 红色名录是全球最权威的物种受威胁等级清单，用“无危、近危、易危、濒危、极危、野外灭绝”等标准评估物种生存风险。ٟThe IUCN Red List is the world's authoritative assessment of species threat, ranking them as Least Concern, Vulnerable, Endangered, Critically Endangered, etc.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6bbda304a9db�body��%《蒙特利尔议定书》（1987）旨在逐步淘汰消耗臭氧层的物质，如氯氟烃（CFCs）和哈龙。得益于全球履约，平流层臭氧层空洞已停止扩大并缓慢恢复，预计中纬度地区臭氧可在2040年代、南极在2060年代前后恢复到1980年水平。�QThe Montreal Protocol (1987) aims to phase out ozone-depleting substances such as chlorofluorocarbons (CFCs) and halons. Thanks to global compliance, the stratospheric ozone hole has stopped growing and is slowly recovering; ozone over mid-latitudes is expected to return to 1980 levels in the 2040s and over Antarctica around the 2060s.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�6c3e07b4a35e�body��2保护区内禁渔或限制捕捞，让鱼类得以生长繁殖，种群数量增加；由于鱼类会向保护区外迁移，成鱼不断“溢出”到邻近渔场，反而可能补充周边渔业。研究表明，设计良好、执法有效的保护区能够同时提升生物多样性和渔业产量。�SInside protected areas fishing is banned or limited, so fish grow and reproduce and populations swell; because fish move outward across the borders, adults spill over into adjacent grounds, potentially replenishing nearby fisheries. Studies show that well-designed, effectively enforced MPAs can raise both biodiversity and fishery yields.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6e17bccc462c�body���NbS 通过保护和恢复生态系统（如红树林、湿地、城市绿地）来缓冲极端事件并提供调节服务。相比灰色基础设施，NbS 通常成本更低且附带生物多样性与碳汇效益，但需保障其持久性与公平性。�2NbS buffer extreme events and deliver regulating services by protecting and restoring ecosystems such as mangroves, wetlands and urban green space. Compared with grey infrastructure they are often cheaper and bring co-benefits for biodiversity and carbon storage, but durability and equity must be ensured.�ans��src��KIPBES《生物多样性和生态系统服务全球评估报告》（2019）�LIPBES Global Assessment Report on Biodiversity and Ecosystem Services (2019)��id�701cb99a2c29�body���PM2.5 指空气动力学直径 ≤2.5 微米的细颗粒物，可深入肺泡并进入血液。它常携带重金属与多环芳烃等毒物，与心肺疾病、中风和过早死亡显著相关。��PM2.5 refers to fine particles ≤2.5 µm that penetrate deep into alveoli and enter the bloodstream. Carrying toxins like heavy metals and PAHs, it is strongly linked to heart and lung disease, stroke, and premature death.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�70dec7e7909d�body��#生物修复利用微生物、植物或真菌降解或固定环境中的污染物，使其毒性降低。常见应用包括用石油降解菌清理溢油、用超富集植物提取土壤重金属。它通常成本低、扰动小，但受场地温度和污染物的可生物降解性限制。�MBioremediation uses microbes, plants or fungi to degrade or immobilise contaminants and reduce their toxicity. Examples include oil-spill cleanup with degrading bacteria and metal extraction by hyperaccumulator plants. It is usually low-cost and low-disturbance but limited by site temperature and the contaminants' biodegradability.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�7171f44e7188�body���主要来源包括采矿冶炼废渣、工业废水灌溉、含重金属的农药化肥以及大气沉降。镉、铅、砷等可在土壤中长期残留并进入农作物。治理常采用客土、钝化剂和植物修复等手段。�1Major sources include mining and smelting waste, irrigation with industrial wastewater, metal-containing pesticides and fertilisers, and atmospheric deposition. Cadmium, lead and arsenic can persist in soil and enter crops. Remediation often uses soil replacement, stabilising agents and phytoremediation.�ans��src��E联合国粮食及农业组织（FAO）《世界土壤资源状况》�(FAO, State of the World's Soil Resources��id�7215139c577f�body���超出作物吸收能力的化肥氮经土壤淋溶以硝酸根形式下渗至浅层地下水，超过自净能力后累积。长期饮用高硝酸盐地下水可导致婴幼儿高铁血红蛋白血症（蓝婴综合征）。�Nitrogen fertilizer beyond crop uptake leaches as nitrate through the soil profile into shallow groundwater, accumulating once it exceeds natural attenuation capacity. Long-term consumption of high-nitrate groundwater can cause infant methemoglobinemia (blue baby syndrome).�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7263db97832f�body�ٍ火山喷出的二氧化硫进入平流层形成硫酸盐气溶胶，像一层薄纱反射阳光，使地表在喷发后一两年内降温。ىSulfur dioxide from eruptions forms sulfate aerosols in the stratosphere that reflect sunlight, cooling the surface for one to two years.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�739f51cfd354�body���它是北太平洋环流中因洋流汇聚而堆积大量塑料垃圾的区域，主要由破碎的塑料碎片组成，而非可见的“岛屿”。它说明塑料污染会随洋流长距离迁移并在海洋中累积。��It is a zone in the North Pacific gyre where currents concentrate vast amounts of plastic debris, made mostly of broken fragments rather than a visible 'island'. It shows how plastic pollution travels far by currents and accumulates in the ocean.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�755f8134f974�body��e人服用的抗生素、止痛药等并未被身体完全吸收，相当一部分经尿液进入下水道，而常规污水处理厂并非为去除这些微量物质而设计，于是药物及其代谢物进入河流。微量药物可能影响水生生物的行为和繁殖，并推动耐药菌扩散，是正在兴起的“新型污染物”治理课题。��A large share of antibiotics and painkillers taken by people is not absorbed and leaves the body in urine, reaching sewers; conventional treatment plants are not designed to remove such trace compounds, so drugs and their metabolites enter rivers. Trace pharmaceuticals can affect aquatic behaviour and reproduction and spread antibiotic-resistant bacteria — a growing concern in the governance of emerging contaminants.�ans��src��*中国科学院（新型污染物研究）�3Chinese Academy of Sciences (emerging contaminants)��id�76d79b0ff864�body��}简单粉碎回收只能回收部分金属，稀有材料和价值高的部件会被混料破坏；规范拆解则先分离电路板、电池、屏幕和塑料，再对功能完好的模块检测、修复并再制造，进入二手或翻新市场，可比原生制造减少八成以上的原材料和能源投入。再制造既保留了产品蕴含的价值，也创造了就业。��Simple shredding recovers only part of the metals and destroys rare materials and valuable components in the mix. Standardised dismantling first separates boards, batteries, screens, and plastics, then tests and refurbishes working modules for resale or remanufacturing, cutting raw-material and energy inputs by over 80% versus virgin production. Remanufacturing preserves embedded value and creates jobs.�ans��src��HStahel W R，《绩效经济》（第2版），Palgrave Macmillan，2010�IStahel, W. R., The Performance Economy, 2nd ed., Palgrave Macmillan, 2010��id�77d18b435ae0�body��多数统计只记录看得见的直接支出，例如清除斑马贻贝堵塞的取水管道、修复电站冷却系统或扑灭疫情，而生态系统服务退化、渔业与农业长期减产、以及本地物种灭绝造成的不可逆损失很难货币化。数据缺口也偏向富裕国家和已引起关注的物种，热带地区与土壤生物群的成本几乎空白。基于全球数据库的综合研究估算 1970 至 2017 年累计成本已超过一万亿美元，且报告值随年份快速上升。�eMost tallies capture only visible direct spending — clearing zebra mussels from intake pipes, repairing power-plant cooling systems, or eradicating outbreaks — while degraded ecosystem services, sustained losses in fisheries and agriculture, and irreversible native extinctions resist monetisation. Reporting gaps also skew toward wealthy countries and charismatic or notorious species, leaving tropical regions and soil biota nearly unquantified. A synthesis built on a global cost database put cumulative costs from 1970 to 2017 above one trillion US dollars, with reported figures rising steeply over time.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�78f93509b565�body�� 净零排放指在一定时期内，人为排放的温室气体通过自然或技术手段（如造林、碳捕集）被等量清除，使净增加为零。碳中和常作为净零的同义或近似表述，但严格说前者多强调全部温室气体，后者有时仅指二氧化碳。�nNet zero means that, over a period, human-caused greenhouse gas emissions are balanced by removals through natural or technological means—such as afforestation or carbon capture—so the net addition is zero. Carbon neutrality is often used synonymously, though strictly the former usually covers all greenhouse gases while the latter sometimes refers only to CO2.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7abc0099f5df�body���连续安全的步行与自行车网络替代短途机动车出行，直接减少尾气与碳排放，并增加居民体力活动从而降低慢性病风险。其效益发挥依赖路权隔离、接驳便利与治安等配套条件。�Continuous, safe walking and cycling networks replace short car trips, directly cutting exhaust and carbon emissions while increasing physical activity and lowering chronic-disease risk. Benefits depend on separated right-of-way, easy connections and perceived safety.�ans��src��-《环境科学》城市交通碳排放研究�AEnvironmental Science journal — urban transport emissions study��id�7ca05d3fc2e9�body��e碳汇是能把大气中的二氧化碳吸收并长期储存的自然或人工系统。森林、海洋、土壤是三大天然碳汇，海洋吸收了人类活动排放二氧化碳的约四分之一；红树林、海草床和盐沼等“蓝碳”系统单位面积固碳能力突出。保护、恢复并扩展碳汇，是减缓气候变暖的重要途径。��A carbon sink is a natural or artificial system that removes CO2 from the atmosphere and stores it over the long term. Forests, the ocean and soils are the three great natural sinks; the ocean absorbs roughly a quarter of human CO2 emissions, while blue carbon systems such as mangroves, seagrass beds and salt marshes sequester carbon at unusually high rates per hectare. Protecting and restoring these sinks is a key strategy for slowing climate change.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7ebdd85ae3e7�body��海水淡化主要有反渗透（用半透膜在高压下滤去盐分）和多级闪蒸（加热使水蒸发再冷凝）两种技术。其最大代价是高能耗与成本，以及浓盐水排放对近海生态的影响，因此多用于缺水且能源充裕的地区。��Desalination mainly uses reverse osmosis (forcing water through a semi-permeable membrane under high pressure to remove salt) and multi-stage flash distillation (heating seawater to evaporate then condense it). Its chief costs are high energy use and expense, plus ecological impacts from discharging concentrated brine, so it is mostly used where water is scarce and energy is abundant.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7f60c4dd6b60�body���用含少量盐分的水长期灌溉，水分蒸发后盐分留在表层，若排水不良就会越积越多。盐渍化会抑制作物根系吸水、降低产量，是许多古老灌溉区（如两河平原）面临的难题。�Irrigating long-term with slightly salty water leaves salts behind as water evaporates, and without good drainage they build up. Salinization hinders crop roots from taking up water and cuts yields, a challenge in many old irrigated regions like the Mesopotamian plain.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8020596b44de�body�ٟ生物质能来自燃烧或发酵植物秸秆、林木废弃物、厨余等有机物质来发电或产沼气，理论上碳可循环但需防止滥砍滥烧。٠Biomass energy comes from burning or fermenting crop residues, wood waste and food scraps for power or biogas; carbon is recyclable but overuse must be avoided.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�814cfd3991a7�body��电路板中含有金、银、铜和少量钯，回收先经拆解和破碎，再用火法或湿法冶金提取。湿法用化学溶液选择性溶解金属，再电解或沉淀回收。规范回收既能减少原生矿开采，也能避免铅和溴化阻燃剂污染。�tCircuit boards contain gold, silver, copper and small amounts of palladium; recovery starts with dismantling and crushing, then pyrometallurgy or hydrometallurgy. Hydrometallurgy uses chemical solutions to selectively dissolve metals, followed by electrolysis or precipitation. Proper recycling cuts primary mining and avoids lead and brominated flame-retardant pollution.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�81d17318c990�body��1995 年狼群回归后，研究者观察到马鹿数量下降并改变觅食行为，河谷柳树和白杨恢复，河岸稳定、河狸与鸣禽增多，被称为营养级级联乃至景观尺度的营养级级联。争论在于这些变化难以与同期的干旱波动、灰熊与美洲狮压力、麋鹿管理政策和河流地貌自然演替区分开来，长期样地数据显示柳树恢复在不同河段差异很大。这个案例提醒人们，自然实验缺少对照，因果归属需要谨慎的统计设计。�pAfter wolves returned in 1995, researchers recorded declining elk numbers and altered browsing, recovering willow and aspen in valley bottoms, more stable banks, and increases in beaver and songbirds — described as a trophic cascade of landscape scale. The dispute is that these shifts are hard to separate from concurrent drought variability, predation by bears and cougars, elk harvest policy, and natural channel evolution, and long-term plots show willow recovery varying strongly between reaches. The case is a reminder that natural experiments lack controls, so causal attribution demands careful statistical design.�ans��src��uRipple 与 Beschta（2012）《Biological Conservation》；美国国家公园管理局黄石公园狼群监测年报�rRipple and Beschta (2012), Biological Conservation; U.S. National Park Service Yellowstone wolf monitoring reports��id�83ab6616fe9a�body���碳储是生态系统当前持有的碳总量（如森林生物量），碳汇是单位时间内净吸收并固定的量；一片成熟林储量大但年汇量可能很小，而幼林汇量高，二者在气候核算中角色不同。��A carbon stock is the total carbon held (e.g., forest biomass); a sink is the net amount absorbed per unit time. An old forest has a big stock but small annual sink, while a young forest sinks fast—they play different roles in climate accounting.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�848d7edb127e�body���毁林是树木覆盖彻底转为非林用地（如农田），碳与栖息地近乎永久丧失；退化是林相变疏、选择性采伐，覆盖仍在但碳密度与生物多样性下降，二者排放核算方式不同。��Deforestation converts forest to non-forest land (e.g., farmland), near-permanently losing carbon and habitat; degradation is selective logging or opening that keeps cover but lowers carbon density and biodiversity—and they're accounted differently.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�870baa1e7c4d�body���NbS 常同时影响碳、生物多样性、水资源和生计，需借助多指标评估框架识别协同与冲突。例如造林可能减少径流而加剧缺水，应在规划阶段进行空间权衡分析。�NbS simultaneously affect carbon, biodiversity, water, and livelihoods, requiring multi-indicator frameworks to map synergies and conflicts. Afforestation, for instance, may reduce streamflow and worsen water scarcity, so spatial trade-off analysis is needed at planning stage.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8741fc75266b�body���某些难降解的农药（如有机氯）在生物体内不易排出，会随着捕食被一层层积累、浓度逐级升高，即生物放大。顶级捕食者体内的含量往往比环境高出成千上万倍，威胁鹰、鱼鹰等物种。��Some persistent pesticides (e.g. organochlorines) are not easily excreted and accumulate level by level as predators eat prey—biomagnification. Top predators can carry thousands of times the environmental concentration, threatening eagles and ospreys.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�88752a2ecee1�body��氮氧化物主要由高温燃烧过程产生，尤其来自机动车、电厂和工业锅炉的化石燃料燃烧。它们会参与形成地面臭氧和细颗粒物（PM2.5），也是酸雨和富营养化的前体物，并可刺激呼吸道、加重哮喘等呼吸系统疾病。�dNitrogen oxides are produced mainly by high-temperature combustion, especially from vehicles, power plants, and industrial boilers burning fossil fuels. They contribute to ground-level ozone and fine particulate (PM2.5) formation, act as precursors to acid rain and eutrophication, and can irritate airways and worsen respiratory conditions such as asthma.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�8956f578d462�body��T这份2022年通过的框架被称为“自然版巴黎协定”。它的核心是“3030目标”：到2030年保护全球30%的陆地和海洋；还要求到2030年恢复至少30%的退化生态系统、减少污染、逐步取消危害自然的补贴。它把生物多样性保护与气候、粮食安全放在同一个盘子里统筹。�Adopted in 2022, this framework is often called the Paris Agreement for nature. Its centrepiece is the 30x30 target: protecting 30 percent of the world's land and ocean by 2030. It also commits to restoring at least 30 percent of degraded ecosystems, cutting pollution and phasing out subsidies harmful to nature by 2030 — tackling biodiversity, climate and food security together.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8abdb168cae7�body��T平流层的臭氧吸收紫外线，是地球的天然屏障；而近地面的臭氧属于二次污染物，由氮氧化物和挥发性有机物在强阳光下经光化学反应生成，夏季午后浓度最高。它会刺激眼睛和呼吸道，还会伤害农作物。控制氮氧化物和VOCs排放是治理地面臭氧的根本办法。�ZStratospheric ozone shields us from ultraviolet rays, but ground-level ozone is a secondary pollutant formed when nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds react in strong sunlight, peaking on summer afternoons. It irritates the eyes and airways and damages crops. Cutting NOx and VOC emissions is the fundamental fix for ground-level ozone.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�8c082b4cf39a�body���红树林根系消减波浪与风暴潮，显著降低海岸侵蚀与洪灾损失，其防护效益折算成人工海堤造价极为昂贵；但因属'非市场'服务，传统GDP核算中常被忽略。��Mangrove roots dampen waves and storm surge, sharply cutting erosion and flood damage whose replacement by seawalls would cost a fortune; as a 'non-market' service it is usually omitted from GDP accounting.�ans��src�ٟMaza 等,《Predicting the evolution of coastal protection service with mangrove forest age》,Coastal Engineering,2021 (DOI: 10.1016/j.coastaleng.2021.103922)٠Maza et al., 'Predicting the evolution of coastal protection service with mangrove forest age', Coastal Engineering, 2021, DOI: 10.1016/j.coastaleng.2021.103922��id�8c8227202fc6�body��&碳汇是能从大气中净移除并长期储存碳的自然或人工系统，全球约有一半人为排放被陆地与海洋碳汇吸收。陆地碳汇主要靠植被光合作用和土壤固碳，海洋碳汇则依靠物理溶解、生物泵以及碳酸盐化学平衡来吸收二氧化碳。�rA carbon sink is a natural or artificial reservoir that removes and stores carbon from the atmosphere; land and ocean sinks together absorb roughly half of human-caused CO2 emissions. Land sinks rely mainly on photosynthesis by vegetation and soil carbon storage, while ocean sinks depend on physical dissolution, the biological pump, and carbonate chemistry equilibria.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8fce62bbc09b�body�٣通过卫星传感器测量气溶胶对光的散射与吸收造成的辐射衰减，结合算法反演光学厚度。该数据用于评估 PM2.5 与气候强迫。ٴSatellite sensors measure radiative attenuation from aerosol scattering and absorption, then algorithms retrieve optical depth. The data inform PM2.5 estimates and climate forcing.�ans��src��sSeinfeld 与 Pandis《Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics》；美国环境保护署臭氧生成敏感性技术文件�sSeinfeld and Pandis, Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics; U.S. EPA technical documents on ozone formation sensitivity��id�9006c6feb801�body�ٖ水华是水体中藻类在温暖、富营养条件下暴发性繁殖，常使水面变绿或发臭，有些还会释放毒素危害鱼虾和人畜。ٰAn algal bloom is the explosive growth of algae in warm, nutrient-rich water, often turning surfaces green and sometimes releasing toxins harmful to fish, livestock and people.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�93623f8904a4�body���IWRM 以流域为单元，统筹地表水与地下水、水量与水质、供给与生态需求，并协调上下游与部门利益冲突。它强调利益相关方参与和适应性治理，避免割裂式治水带来的次生风险。�9IWRM treats the river basin as the unit, integrating surface and groundwater, quantity and quality, and supply with ecological needs, while reconciling upstream–downstream and sectoral conflicts. It stresses stakeholder participation and adaptive governance to avoid unintended risks from fragmented management.�ans��src��H全球水伙伴（GWP）IWRM ToolBox（水资源综合管理工具包）�+Global Water Partnership (GWP) IWRM ToolBox��id�938c3f3db788�body���《全球电子废物监测》报告显示，2022 年全球产生约 6200 万吨电子废物，而有据可查的正规回收率仅约两成二。增长动力来自设备保有量上升、更新周期缩短与可维修性下降，胶粘封装和一体化电池让拆解变得费时；同时正规回收厂需要处理数十种混合材料，经济性依赖金、钯等少量贵金属。大量废物因此流入非正规拆解渠道，用露天焚烧和酸浸提取金属，造成二噁英与重金属污染。�ZThe Global E-waste Monitor reports about 62 million tonnes generated in 2022 while only roughly 22% was documented as formally collected and recycled. Growth is driven by rising device ownership, shorter replacement cycles, and declining repairability, as glued enclosures and embedded batteries make disassembly slow; formal recyclers meanwhile must separate dozens of mixed materials and depend economically on small amounts of gold and palladium. Much of the stream therefore reaches informal dismantling, where open burning and acid leaching recover metals while releasing dioxins and heavy metals.�ans��src��w《全球电子废物监测报告 2024》（联合国训练研究所与国际电信联盟）；巴塞尔公约秘书处�QGlobal E-waste Monitor 2024 (UNITAR and ITU); Secretariat of the Basel Convention��id�941e5fa02d4c�body�ٮ它建在北极冻土深处的地下仓库，免费替世界各国保存作物种子的备份，万一某地种子丢失可作恢复之用，被称为“末日种子库”。٘Buried in Arctic permafrost, it stores backup copies of crop seeds from around the world, so lost collections can be restored—a 'doomsday' seed vault.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9523dc56beeb�body�ٮ不是。生物基塑料指原料来自生物质，不一定可降解；可降解塑料强调在环境中能分解，可为化石基。两者需分别评估来源与末端。ٹNo. Bio-based means feedstock from biomass and need not be degradable; biodegradable means it can break down and may be fossil-based. Source and end-of-life must be assessed separately.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�95333b9597b7�body���由于海水热容量巨大，海洋吸收了气候系统中超过 90% 的多余热量。正是这个缓冲作用，使地表升温比单纯算大气时慢，但也导致海平面上升和海洋热浪。��Because of its enormous heat capacity, the ocean has absorbed more than 90% of the excess heat in the climate system. This buffer slows surface warming but also drives sea-level rise and marine heatwaves.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�953fb11869dc�body�ٓ植被通过蒸腾作用和遮荫减少地表吸热，缓解城市热岛。研究表明合理布局的绿地可使周边气温下降数摄氏度。ٷVegetation reduces heat absorption via transpiration and shading, mitigating the urban heat island. Well-placed green spaces can lower nearby air temperature by a few degrees Celsius.�ans��src���Bowler, Buyung-Ali, Knight & Pullin,《Urban greening to cool towns and cities: A systematic review of the empirical evidence》,Landscape and Urban Planning,2010 (DOI: 10.1016/j.landurbplan.2010.05.006)；Potchter, Cohen & Bitan,《Climatic behavior of various urban parks during hot and humid summer in the mediterranean city of Tel Aviv, Israel》,International Journal of Climatology,2006 (DOI: 10.1002/joc.1330)��Bowler, Buyung-Ali, Knight & Pullin, 'Urban greening to cool towns and cities: A systematic review of the empirical evidence', Landscape and Urban Planning, 2010, DOI: 10.1016/j.landurbplan.2010.05.006; Potchter, Cohen & Bitan, 'Climatic behavior of various urban parks during hot and humid summer in the mediterranean city of Tel Aviv, Israel', International Journal of Climatology, 2006, DOI: 10.1002/joc.1330��id�954411a64d20�body�ٙ能源转型指从依赖煤、石油等化石燃料，逐步转向太阳能、风能等清洁能源，并配合节能与电气化，以降低碳排放。ِThe energy transition is shifting from coal and oil to clean sources like solar and wind, plus efficiency and electrification, to cut emissions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�95935a20bb49�body��w入侵物种被有意或无意带入缺乏天敌的新环境后，可能快速繁殖、抢占食物和空间、改变生境结构，甚至直接导致本地物种减少或灭绝，还带来农业和健康损害。水葫芦、红火蚁等都是著名案例。防控的最佳时机是入侵早期，靠检疫和快速清除；一旦站稳脚跟，清除代价将成倍上升。��Invasive species, carried deliberately or by accident into places with no natural enemies, can breed explosively, monopolise food and space, restructure habitats and drive local species down or out — while damaging farming and health. Water hyacinth and red imported fire ants are famous examples. The best window for control is early invasion, through quarantine and rapid removal; once established, eradication becomes vastly costlier.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�95da0d5ab68f�body���元素汞在常温下即可挥发，能在大气中停留数月并随环流跨洲输送，沉降入水体后经微生物转化为甲基汞，在食物链中生物放大数万倍，最终集中在金枪鱼等高营养级鱼类体内。这意味着任何单一国家的减排都无法保护本国居民，跨境属性要求集体行动。《水俣公约》2013 年通过、2017 年生效，管制汞的开采、贸易、添汞产品与手工小规模采金等主要排放源。�>Elemental mercury volatilises at ambient temperature, persists in the atmosphere for months, and travels between continents, then deposits into water where microbes convert it to methylmercury that biomagnifies tens of thousands of times up the food chain into predators such as tuna. No country can protect its own population by acting alone, so the transboundary nature of the problem forces collective action. The Minamata Convention, adopted in 2013 and in force since 2017, regulates mercury mining, trade, added-mercury products, and artisanal small-scale gold mining.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�96717e578016�body���完全不同。平流层臭氧层吸收紫外线的'好臭氧'因氟利昂等被破坏；地面臭氧是NOx与挥发性有机物在阳光下二次生成的'坏臭氧'，刺激呼吸道、损伤作物，属于光化学烟雾的核心成分。��They are unrelated. Stratospheric ozone shields UV and is depleted by CFCs—the 'good' ozone. Ground-level ozone is formed by sunlight reacting NOx with VOCs—a 'bad' ozone that irritates lungs and harms crops, central to photochemical smog.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�98b5a2edaeb2�body��J食物里程指食物从产地到餐桌的运输距离，它直观易懂，却不能代表全部排放：生产环节（化肥、能源、甲烷）往往占比更高。例如本地温室生产的番茄，因供暖可能比长途运输的露天番茄排放更高。完整的评估应看生命周期排放，而不是只看距离。�SFood miles measure transport distance from farm to table — intuitive, but not the whole story: production stages (fertilizers, energy, methane) often dominate. Locally grown hothouse tomatoes, for instance, can out-emit far-travelled field tomatoes because of heating. A complete assessment uses life-cycle emissions, not distance alone.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�996474890c09�body�٨岛屿面积小、种群数量有限，且许多物种在隔离环境中进化、缺乏天敌防御，外来物种或环境变化很容易把它们推到灭绝边缘。ٻIslands have small areas and limited populations, and many species evolved in isolation without defenses against predators, so introduced species or change can quickly drive them extinct.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9ae84e3a76ce�body�ٳ该公约旨在建立具法律约束力的框架，统筹塑料全生命周期以减少泄漏与污染。核心争议包括是否限制原生塑料产量和 EPR 的全球落地。ٵThe treaty seeks a legally binding framework covering the plastic life cycle to cut leakage and pollution. Key disputes include caps on virgin plastic and global EPR implementation.�ans��src��U联合国环境大会第5/14号决议(2022)及UNEP塑料公约谈判(INC)官方文件�UUNEA Resolution 5/14 (2022) and UNEP Global Plastics Treaty INC negotiation documents��id�9bd2e5e68739�body�ٷ两者兼有：注入CO2提高采收率并部分永久封存于储层，但增产的石油燃烧又会排放CO2。净气候效益取决于封存比例与替代效应，争议较大。��Both: injecting CO2 boosts recovery and permanently stores some in the reservoir, but the extra oil burned emits CO2. Net climate benefit depends on storage fraction and displacement effects—contested.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9d5e7173cbad�body��e生态系统服务是自然生态系统为人类提供的惠益，千年生态系统评估将其分为供给服务（食物、水、木材）、调节服务（气候、洪水、授粉）、文化服务（休闲、精神）和支持服务（土壤形成、养分循环）。它强调保护自然不仅是伦理需要，也具有实际经济与生存价值。��Ecosystem services are the benefits nature provides to people; the Millennium Ecosystem Assessment groups them into provisioning (food, water, timber), regulating (climate, floods, pollination), cultural (recreation, spiritual), and supporting services (soil formation, nutrient cycling). It frames nature protection as not only ethical but also of practical economic and survival value.�ans��src��1联合国《千年生态系统评估》（2005）�)UN Millennium Ecosystem Assessment (2005)��id�9e0afe3be9ff�body���城市矿产指废弃电子产品、家电和建筑中蕴含的可回收金属资源，其单位含量有时高于天然矿石。把它们当作矿山开采，可减少采矿破坏并保障关键金属供应。挑战在于收集体系和高效分选。�Urban mines are recyclable metals embedded in discarded electronics, appliances and buildings, whose concentrations sometimes exceed natural ore. Treating them as mines cuts mining damage and secures critical metals. Challenges are collection systems and efficient sorting.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�9e5b502678ed�body��z策略沿“防护—适应—迁移”梯度展开：建设软硬结合的海岸（海堤加红树林或盐沼缓冲带）、抬升建筑和关键设施标高、划定撤退线并规划有序搬迁，同时恢复湿地作为天然缓冲。风险地图和预警系统帮助社区提前应对，许多城市把适应纳入土地利用规划，避免在高风险区继续扩张。��Strategies span a protect–adapt–retreat spectrum: hybrid coasts (seawalls plus mangrove or saltmarsh buffers), elevating buildings and critical infrastructure, zoning retreat lines with planned relocation, and restoring wetlands as natural buffers. Risk maps and early-warning systems prepare communities, and many cities embed adaptation into land-use planning to avoid expanding in high-risk zones.�ans��src��FUNDRR 2017《如何让城市更有韧性：地方政府领导手册》�WUNDRR (2017) How to Make Cities More Resilient: A Handbook for Local Government Leaders��id�9f38457fbbb9�body��>关键种是对生态系统结构和稳定性影响远超其数量占比的物种，移除它会导致群落发生剧烈变化甚至崩溃。与普通物种相比，关键种的作用不取决于生物量多少，而在于它所处的生态功能位置，如海獭维持海带森林、传粉昆虫维系植物繁殖。�]A keystone species has an influence on ecosystem structure and stability disproportionate to its abundance; removing it can trigger dramatic community change or collapse. Unlike ordinary species, its importance lies not in biomass but in its functional role—such as sea otters maintaining kelp forests or pollinators sustaining plant reproduction.�ans��src��M美国自然历史博物馆（AMNH）及 Paine（1969）关键种经典研究�UAmerican Museum of Natural History; R. T. Paine (1969) keystone species classic study��id�a00eee14bef8�body���普通 CCS 只捕获工业排放源的碳；BECCS（生物能源碳捕集与封存）先用作物/林木等吸收大气 CO2，燃烧产能后再把碳封存到地下，整条链路从大气净移除碳，因此是负数排放。��Plain CCS only captures emissions at a source. BECCS grows biomass that already pulled CO2 from the air, burns it for energy, then stores the carbon underground, so the whole chain removes CO2 net from the atmosphere.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a13487ab8ab7�body���微塑料经受污染的食物（尤其是海鲜与瓶装水）、饮水以及吸入大气沉降颗粒进入人体，粒径越小越易穿越生物膜。目前对人体健康的具体剂量—效应关系仍缺乏充分证据。�Microplastics enter the body via contaminated food—especially seafood and bottled water—drinking water and inhaled atmospheric particles, with smaller sizes crossing biological membranes more easily. Concrete dose–response relationships for human health remain poorly evidenced.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a1dc57d2d808�body��z生物质燃烧释放的二氧化碳，正是这些植物生长时通过光合作用从大气中固定的碳，因此理论上循环闭合、实现“碳中性”。但运输、加工和土地利用变化会带来额外排放，所以实际收益要按全生命周期计算。把农林废弃物和垃圾中的生物质转化为电和热，仍是资源化利用的重要途径。��Burning crop residues or wood releases the very carbon those plants pulled from the air while growing, so the cycle is theoretically closed — carbon neutral. But transport, processing and land-use change add real emissions, so net benefits must be assessed over the full life cycle. Converting the biomass in agricultural and forestry waste into electricity and heat remains a valuable route to resource recovery.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a1e4d553a909�body�٨海带森林是冷水沿岸大片快速生长的大型褐藻，像水下森林为鱼类、海獭等提供食物和庇护，却易受水温升高和海胆暴发破坏。ْKelp forests are vast fast-growing brown algae in cold coasts, sheltering fish and sea otters, but vulnerable to warming and sea-urchin outbreaks.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a2cd6643baa1�body�ٟ生态位是物种在环境中扮演的角色，包括它吃什么、被谁吃、何时活动、占据哪类栖息地，决定它如何与其他物种共存。نA niche is a species' role—what it eats, what eats it, when it is active and where it lives—governing how it coexists with others.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a2fdcae6e570�body���共享出行未必减排：若它诱发了原本步行、骑行或公交的出行需求（诱导出行），或增加空驶里程，净排放可能上升。只有在替代私人购车并提升车辆载客率时，才更可能带来减排。�Shared mobility does not necessarily cut emissions: if it induces trips that would otherwise be walked, cycled or taken by transit, or adds deadhead mileage, net emissions may rise. It is more likely to help only when it replaces car ownership and raises vehicle occupancy.�ans��src�هLi 等,《Do shared E-bikes reduce urban carbon emissions?》,Journal of Transport Geography,2023 (DOI: 10.1016/j.jtrangeo.2023.103697)وLi et al., 'Do shared E-bikes reduce urban carbon emissions?', Journal of Transport Geography, 2023, DOI: 10.1016/j.jtrangeo.2023.103697��id�a38d2a091382�body�٢采矿、污水灌溉和工业排放把铅、镉、砷等重金属带入土壤，它们不被降解、长期积累，并通过作物进入食物链危害人体。ٚMining, sewage irrigation and industry add lead, cadmium and arsenic to soil; they persist, accumulate and enter the food chain via crops, harming health.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a3addb96f28f�body��+珊瑚组织内共生着虫黄藻，为宿主提供大部分光合产物并赋予颜色。水温异常升高时，藻类光系统受损产生活性氧，珊瑚为避免氧化损伤将共生藻排出体外，组织随之透出碳酸钙骨骼的白色，这就是白化。此时珊瑚仍然活着，若热应力在数周内缓解，可以重新获取共生藻并恢复，但长时间高温会导致饥饿死亡与藻类覆盖。美国国家海洋和大气管理局的珊瑚礁观察项目在 2024 年确认了有记录以来的第四次全球白化事件。�wCoral tissue hosts symbiotic zooxanthellae that supply most of the host's photosynthetic energy and give the colony its colour. When water warms abnormally, the algal photosystem is damaged and generates reactive oxygen species, so the coral expels its symbionts to limit oxidative injury and the white calcium carbonate skeleton shows through — that is bleaching. The animal is still alive, and if heat stress eases within weeks it can reacquire symbionts and recover, but prolonged heat leads to starvation, mortality, and algal overgrowth. NOAA's Coral Reef Watch confirmed the fourth global bleaching event on record in 2024.�ans��src��nV. M. Weis：《实验生物学杂志》（Journal of Experimental Biology）第211卷（2008）：3059–3066�AV. M. Weis, Journal of Experimental Biology 211 (2008): 3059-3066��id�a4cbba6121c0�body��《巴黎协定》于2015年通过，核心目标是将全球平均升温控制在较工业化前水平“远低于2℃”，并努力限制在1.5℃以内。各国通过提交并定期更新“国家自主贡献（NDC）”来逐步实现这一目标，协定于2016年生效。�TAdopted in 2015, the Paris Agreement aims to hold the global average temperature rise well below 2°C above pre-industrial levels and to pursue efforts to limit it to 1.5°C. Countries work toward this through nationally determined contributions (NDCs) that they submit and periodically strengthen; the agreement entered into force in 2016.�ans��src��O《联合国气候变化框架公约》（UNFCCC）《巴黎协定》（2015）�VUnited Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC), Paris Agreement (2015)��id�a539433e927a�body��富营养化是水体因氮、磷等营养盐过量而藻类大量繁殖、随后耗氧分解导致水质恶化的过程。主要人为来源包括农业化肥径流、畜禽养殖废水和城市生活污水，它会使水体变绿、发臭并威胁水生生物。�VEutrophication is the degradation of water quality when excess nutrients—mainly nitrogen and phosphorus—trigger algal blooms that later decompose and consume oxygen. Major human sources include agricultural fertilizer runoff, livestock wastewater, and municipal sewage, which turn waters green, foul-smelling, and hostile to aquatic life.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a736961d5653�body���PET 广泛用于饮料瓶，熔点高、易分选且可熔融再造粒，因此回收体系成熟。但多次热加工会降解聚合物链、需掺入新料，且标签与有色瓶降低再生质量，限制闭环循环。�)PET is common in bottles, has a high melting point, sorts easily, and can be remelted into pellets, so its recycling infrastructure is mature. Yet repeated heating degrades polymer chains, requiring virgin feedstock, and labels or colored bottles lower recyclate quality, limiting closed-loop use.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�a77fc55e6b64�body�ٓ海洋保护区限制捕捞和开发，让鱼群和珊瑚休养生息，保护区内生物量和多样性常明显回升，并惠及周边渔场。يMPAs restrict fishing and development so fish and corals recover; biomass and diversity inside often rebound and benefit nearby fisheries.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�a7cf9cdee766�body�ه净零排放指人类活动排放的温室气体，通过造林、碳捕集等方式被等量移除，使大气中净增加量为零。٢Net-zero means human-caused greenhouse gas emissions are balanced by removals such as reforestation and carbon capture, leaving no net addition to the atmosphere.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a7ee62ac5632�body��一次污染物直接排放到大气中，如二氧化硫（SO₂）和一氧化碳（CO）；二次污染物由一次污染物在阳光或水汽中发生化学反应生成，如地面臭氧（O₃）和硫酸盐气溶胶。许多雾霾中的细颗粒正是二次形成的。�Primary pollutants are emitted directly, such as sulfur dioxide (SO₂) and carbon monoxide (CO); secondary pollutants form when primaries react in sunlight or moisture, such as ground-level ozone (O₃) and sulfate aerosols. Much fine-particle haze is secondary in origin.�ans��src��H美国环保署（EPA）《空气污染物分类与臭氧成因说明》�>US EPA, Air Pollutant Categories and Ground-Level Ozone Basics��id�aa97ce3ed69a�body��z垃圾在填埋场厌氧分解会产生两类风险：一是渗滤液，也就是高浓度的污染液体，需要底部防渗膜收集处理后达标排放，防止污染地下水；二是填埋气，以甲烷为主，既易燃也属强温室气体，可抽气收集用于发电。现代卫生填埋场通过防渗层、气体收集井和封场覆盖把这些风险管起来。��Waste decomposing anaerobically in a landfill creates two hazards. Leachate — a highly polluted liquid — must be intercepted by an impermeable liner and treated before release so it cannot contaminate groundwater. Landfill gas, mostly methane, is flammable and a potent greenhouse gas; wells collect it for flaring or power generation. Modern sanitary landfills manage both through liners, gas wells and final covers.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�aae74c64a9c4�body��营养级联指食物链中顶级捕食者的增减沿食物链向下传递，引发下层物种乃至整个生态系统结构的连锁变化。经典例子是美国黄石公园重新引入灰狼后，鹿群数量和行为改变，河岸植被恢复、河流形态也随之改善。�gA trophic cascade is when changes in the abundance of top predators ripple down the food chain, causing cascading changes in lower-level species and ecosystem structure. A classic example is Yellowstone National Park, where reintroducing gray wolves altered elk numbers and behavior, allowing riparian vegetation to recover and even changing river morphology.�ans��src��V《科学》（Science）关于黄石狼群恢复的生态学研究；Ripple & Beschta�?Science studies on Yellowstone wolf recovery (Ripple & Beschta)��id�ab7cb1fdc405�body���风电、光伏和电动汽车所需的锂、钴、稀土、铜等矿产需求将激增数倍，且资源分布高度集中，因此被称为“新石油”。但开采会产生尾矿、水耗和生态破坏，所以转型路径强调：提高回收率、发展少钴电池技术、多元化供应，以及推行负责任的采矿标准（如IRMA），让绿色转型真正可持续。��Wind, solar, and electric vehicles will multiply demand for lithium, cobalt, rare earths, and copper, and the resources are highly concentrated — hence the term new oil. But mining brings tailings, water use, and ecological damage, so transition paths emphasise higher recycling, cobalt-reducing battery chemistry, diversified supply, and responsible mining standards such as IRMA, to keep the green transition genuinely sustainable.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�abb9c33d2994�body��/道路把连续生境切成孤立斑块，小种群难以迁移和基因交流，近亲繁殖与局部灭绝风险随之上升。生态廊道（绿桥、涵洞、河岸带）把破碎斑块重新连接起来，让动物安全穿越道路、基因得以流动，也帮助物种随气候变化而迁移。�`Roads cut continuous habitat into isolated patches, so small populations struggle to move and exchange genes, raising inbreeding and local extinction risk. Ecological corridors — green bridges, culverts, and riparian strips — reconnect the fragments so wildlife can cross safely and gene flow resumes, and also help species track shifting climates.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ac3d4c0ef19e�body�پ二者同属厄尔尼诺—南方涛动（ENSO）。厄尔尼诺时赤道东太平洋异常偏暖，拉尼娜则异常偏冷，两者对全球降雨、台风和气温的影响几乎相反。��Both are phases of the El Niño–Southern Oscillation (ENSO). El Niño brings unusual warming of the eastern equatorial Pacific, while La Niña brings unusual cooling, and their effects on global rainfall, storms, and temperature are nearly opposite.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�adf281363c93�body��b污水直排、雨污混流让河涌积聚大量有机物，缺氧条件下厌氧菌分解产生硫化氢等臭味气体，水体就变黑变臭。治理遵循“控源截污、内源治理、生态修复”：先堵住排口、清理淤泥，再用曝气和水生植物恢复自净能力。实践经验表明，切断污染源头是最关键的一步。��Sewage discharged straight into urban streams supplies so much organic matter that oxygen is depleted; anaerobic bacteria then produce hydrogen sulphide and other smelly gases, and the water turns black and odorous. Restoration follows three steps: intercepting pollution sources, dredging accumulated sediment, and rebuilding self-purification with aeration and aquatic plants. Experience shows source control is the decisive step.�ans��src��3中国生态环境部（城市黑臭水体整治）�+MEE (urban black-odorous water remediation)��id�ae4919ab6061�body���PES 是下游受益者（如城市、水厂）向上游保护森林、净化水源的土地所有者付费的机制，把无形的生态贡献变成可交易的经济激励。它让保护者有动力继续提供“免费”的环境服务。�PES lets downstream beneficiaries—cities, water utilities—pay upstream landowners who protect forests and clean water, turning invisible ecological work into a tradable incentive. It gives stewards reason to keep providing 'free' environmental services.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ae5c53b151cf�body��b全球大约三分之一的粮食被损失或浪费，而生产这些粮食占用了巨量的土地、水和能源。如果把食物浪费算作一个国家，它的温室气体排放仅次于中国和美国。减少损失浪费，相当于同时缓解气候变化、水资源压力和粮食安全风险，被视为性价比最高的“三赢”行动。��Roughly one-third of all food produced is lost or wasted, and making it consumed vast amounts of land, water and energy. If food waste were a country, its greenhouse emissions would rank behind only those of China and the United States. Cutting loss and waste relieves climate pressure, water stress and food insecurity at once — widely seen as one of the highest-value win-win-win actions.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b10ef8c99352�body��DAC 用固体吸附剂或液态胺溶剂选择性结合空气中约 0.04% 的 CO2，再用高温（化学溶剂路线）或低压/升温（固体吸附路线）把它脱附、提纯。难点在于空气中 CO2 浓度极低，捕集每吨能耗与成本都很高。��DAC uses solid sorbents or liquid amine solvents that selectively bind CO2 (about 0.04% of air), then releases and purifies it via heat or pressure swing. The challenge is the tiny concentration, making energy use and cost per ton high.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b237fbce5088�body���树木通过蒸腾把热量带走、遮阴降低路面温度，树冠还能拦截雨水、减缓径流并过滤部分污染物。成片的城市林冠因此同时缓解热岛和合流制溢流污染。��Trees carry away heat by transpiration and shade hot surfaces, while canopies intercept rain, slow runoff and filter some pollutants. A connected urban canopy thus eases both heat islands and combined-sewer overflow pollution.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b357d66409e6�body���不是。温室效应是大气中的温室气体让地球保持适宜温度的天然过程；全球变暖指由于人类排放增多，温室效应增强导致地表平均气温持续上升的现象。��No. The greenhouse effect is the natural process by which atmospheric gases keep Earth warm enough for life; global warming refers to the sustained rise in average surface temperature caused by the strengthened greenhouse effect from human emissions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b4befb7b6645�body�ِ轮作是不同季节轮流种不同作物（如豆科后种谷物），可均衡养分、打断病虫害循环、减少化肥，保持地力。ٚCrop rotation alternates different crops (e.g., legumes then grains) to balance nutrients, break pest cycles and cut fertilizer use, sustaining fertility.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b7409153b9ba�body��4鸭子曲线描述扣除风光出力后的净负荷曲线：正午光伏大发使净负荷塌陷成鸭腹，日落时光伏骤降而居民用电攀升，净负荷在两三小时内急剧抬升成鸭颈。加州独立系统运营商 2013 年首次公开这条曲线，此后腹部越来越深。当正午净负荷低于必须保持在线的机组最小出力，且输电通道与储能不足时，调度只能削减光伏出力，形成弃电。缓解手段包括电池储能、需求侧转移、跨州输电以及把电动车充电和抽水灌溉安排到中午。��The duck curve plots net load after subtracting wind and solar: midday solar output hollows out the belly, then at sunset solar collapses while household demand climbs, so net load ramps steeply within two or three hours to form the neck. The California Independent System Operator first published the shape in 2013 and the belly has deepened since. When midday net load falls below the minimum output of units that must stay online and transmission or storage is insufficient, operators curtail solar. Mitigations include battery storage, shifting demand, interstate transmission, and moving electric-vehicle charging and irrigation pumping to midday.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b8d5cbb5ef7c�body�ٖ流域是分水岭以内所有雨水汇聚到同一条河流及其支流的完整区域，上游污染会顺流影响下游，因此要整体保护。ٗA basin is the whole area where rainwater drains into one river system; upstream pollution flows downstream, so the basin must be protected as a whole.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b9006d711838�body�ٓ迁地保护是把濒危物种移到原栖息地之外人工照管，如动物园、植物园和种子库，作为野外灭绝时的“备份”。٣Ex-situ conservation moves endangered species to safe human care outside their habitat—zoos, botanical gardens, seed banks—as a backup against wild extinction.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�bbbabb2357e1�body���现代垃圾焚烧厂把分类后的不可回收废物高温燃烧，用产生的热量发电或供暖，同时配备尾气净化减少二噁英等污染物。它可大幅缩减垃圾体积，但前提是对有害物质严格管控。��Modern plants burn sorted non-recyclable waste at high temperature, using the heat to make electricity or heat, with flue-gas cleaning to cut dioxins and other pollutants. It greatly shrinks waste volume but demands strict control of hazardous emissions.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c1b3c62ee10b�body�ٙ室内空气污染来自装修甲醛、燃气做饭、吸烟、霉菌和室外传入的颗粒物，人在室内时间长，其健康影响常被低估。ٻIndoor air pollution comes from formaldehyde in furnishings, gas cooking, smoking, mold and outdoor particles; since we spend most time indoors, its health impact is often underestimated.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�c27bb4dcfe4a�body��传统强光灯会干扰昆虫、鸟类和两栖动物的活动节律，友好型照明采用低色温、屏蔽式和感应控制以减少光污染。它保留必要安全照明的同时降低对野生动物的吸引和干扰。暗天空理念也利于人类健康。�JConventional bright lights disrupt the activity rhythms of insects, birds and amphibians; friendly lighting uses low colour temperature, shielded fixtures and motion control to cut light pollution. It keeps needed safety lighting while reducing attraction and disturbance to wildlife. Dark-sky thinking also benefits human health.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c30f94621156�body���把粉碎的玄武岩、橄榄石等硅酸盐矿物撒在土壤或海岸，它们与雨水和溶解的 CO2 发生化学反应生成碳酸氢根，最终在海洋以碳酸盐形式稳定沉积，把碳封存成千上万年。��Crushed silicate minerals like basalt or olivine react with rainwater and dissolved CO2 to form bicarbonates, which eventually precipitate as stable carbonate in the ocean, locking carbon away for millennia.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c40f6506145a�body�ِ抽走地下含水层的水后，砂土孔隙失去支撑被压密，地面就会缓慢下沉，且往往不可逆，还会加重沿海洪涝。ِRemoving aquifer water compacts the soil as pore spaces collapse, slowly and often irreversibly sinking the land and worsening coastal flooding.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c488cfcaaaca�body���推广耐旱与短生育期品种、改进灌溉效率（如滴灌）以及调整播期与种植结构都能提升抗旱能力。配合保险与气象预警，可在不显著增加用水的前提下稳定产量。� Adopting drought-tolerant and short-season varieties, improving irrigation efficiency such as drip systems, and adjusting sowing dates and cropping patterns raise drought resilience. Combined with insurance and weather early warning, yields can be stabilized without much extra water use.�ans��src��$中国气象局《农业气象学》�:China Meteorological Administration (CMA), Agrometeorology��id�c4a0c6d6a2db�body��盐渍化是土壤中可溶性盐分累积到损害作物生长水平的过程。在灌溉农业中，若排水不畅且蒸发强烈，灌溉水中的盐分便在表层富集，长期会板结土壤、降低产量，是许多古老灌区（如中东、澳洲）面临的老问题。�TSalinization is the buildup of soluble salts in soil to levels that harm crop growth. In irrigated agriculture, poor drainage combined with high evaporation concentrates salts at the surface, gradually hardening the soil and lowering yields—a long-standing problem in many ancient irrigation regions such as the Middle East and Australia.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c6f71254874e�body��t损失与损害指气候变化造成的、即使适应也无法避免或弥补的损失，例如海平面上升使家园永久淹没、冰川消融导致水源减少。它与适应不同：适应是降低未来风险，损失与损害关注已经发生或不可避免的损害，并涉及为其提供资金支持，比如国际社会设立的“损失与损害基金”。�tLoss and damage refers to climate harms that adaptation cannot avoid or offset, such as homes permanently submerged by sea-level rise or water supply reduced by melting glaciers. Unlike adaptation, which reduces future risk, loss and damage addresses harm already occurring or unavoidable, and involves financial support — such as the international Loss and Damage Fund.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c867a7099b96�body���绿证代表一度可再生能源电力的环境属性，用户购买相当于为电网中的绿电付费、抵消自身用电的化石排放，但它不改变你实际用的电流混合并非'专属绿电'。�A green certificate represents the environmental attribute of one renewable kWh; buying it pays for renewable generation and offsets your fossil footprint, but it doesn't change that your socket still draws the mixed grid current—not 'exclusive' green power.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c8f419c7876a�body�ٙ重新引入是在物种已局部灭绝的地区，把人工繁育或异地种群放归野外，并恢复其栖息地与食物，以重建野生种群。ٛReintroduction releases captive-bred or translocated individuals back to where a species vanished, restoring habitat and food to rebuild a wild population.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�c95643f086ea�body���风和阳光时有时无，发电出力与用电高峰常常错开，所以需要电池、抽水蓄能等方式把多余电力存起来、在缺电时放出。储能是让高比例风光电网稳定可靠的关键。��Wind and sunlight come and go, so generation often misses peaks in demand; storage like batteries or pumped hydro saves surplus power for when it is needed. Storage is key to keeping a grid with high shares of wind and solar stable and reliable.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cb9c68284b8b�body���脱钩指经济增长与资源消耗或环境污染不再同步上升，分为资源使用、碳排放等与 GDP 增长“相对脱钩”或“绝对脱钩”。许多国家已实现部分相对脱钩，但全球绝对脱钩仍很艰难。��Decoupling means economic growth no longer rises hand in hand with resource use or pollution, either relatively or absolutely versus GDP. Many countries show partial relative decoupling, but global absolute decoupling remains hard.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cc17a6d6c5d3�body��/农业适应包括选育耐热耐旱品种、调整播种期、节水灌溉、间作与覆盖作物保墒，以及改良土壤以增强保水性。这些措施能提高产量稳定性、降低极端天气损失，而且许多措施同时具有减排和固碳效果，属于“适应与减缓协同”。�oAgricultural adaptation includes heat- and drought-tolerant varieties, adjusted planting dates, water-saving irrigation, intercropping and cover crops for moisture, and soil improvement for better water retention. These measures stabilise yields and cut losses from extreme weather, and many also reduce emissions and store carbon — adaptation-mitigation synergies.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�cc5708cfdfcc�body���关键指标是年度质量平衡：把冬季积累的雪冰量减去夏季消融量，正值代表增长，负值代表亏损。观测者还会追踪平衡线高度，即积累区与消融区的分界；这条线持续上移意味着可供补给的高海拔区域在缩小。世界冰川监测服务处的参照冰川序列显示，全球冰川已连续三十多年出现负质量平衡。��The key measure is annual mass balance: winter snow and ice accumulation minus summer melt, positive for growth and negative for loss. Observers also track the equilibrium line altitude, the boundary between accumulation and ablation zones; a line that keeps rising means the high-elevation area able to feed the glacier is shrinking. The reference-glacier series maintained by the World Glacier Monitoring Service shows more than three consecutive decades of negative balance worldwide.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�cecb27b19f70�body���容量系数等于实际发电量除以满负荷理论发电量。太阳能只在白天发电、风电依赖风速，因此典型容量系数约 15–35%；核电可稳定满发，容量系数常达 90% 左右。��Capacity factor is actual output divided by maximum possible output. Solar works only by day and wind depends on wind speed, giving typical factors of about 15–35%, while nuclear runs steadily near 90%.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�ced146e8a7cc�body���有效的 PES 需明确生态系统服务供给方与受益方、设定可验证的管护条件并支付对价，使保护行为的边际成本得到补偿。关键挑战在于条件性、额外性与交易成本的平衡。�
An effective PES clearly defines service providers and beneficiaries, sets verifiable stewardship conditions and pays for them so that the marginal cost of conservation is compensated. Key challenges are balancing conditionality, additionality and transaction costs.�ans��src��*《环境科学》生态补偿机制研究�5Environmental Science journal — PES mechanism study��id�ced70044e5d3�body���全球约有 300 个跨国流域，覆盖大量人口和土地，一条河往往流经好几个国家。共享水源既能促成合作，也可能因分配不均引发紧张，因此需要流域层面的国际协定。��There are roughly 300 international river basins covering vast populations and lands, with a single river often crossing several countries. Shared water can foster cooperation but also tensions over uneven allocation, so basin-level agreements are needed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d052f3652f99�body���食物里程只算运输距离，并不能完整反映环境影响。全生命周期来看，牛肉、乳制品的生产排放往往远高于其运输排放，所以“本地食物”未必总是更低碳，还要看生产方式。��Food miles count only transport distance and miss the bigger picture. Over a full life cycle, beef and dairy production emissions often dwarf those from transport, so 'local' food is not always lower-carbon; how it is produced matters more.�ans��src��xFAO《畜牧业的全面份额：环境议题与选项》(Livestock's Full Share: Environmental Issues and Options),2013�CFAO, Livestock's Full Share: Environmental Issues and Options, 2013��id�d0558a90a8e9�body��人工夜间照明改变了生物赖以定时的昼夜与月相信号：候鸟被城市光柱吸引偏离迁徙路线并撞击建筑，刚孵化的海龟幼体朝内陆灯光而非海面爬行，夜行昆虫聚集在灯下耗尽体力并被捕食，形成生态陷阱。植物的开花与落叶节律、鱼类的洄游与哺乳动物的觅食时段也随之扰乱。夜空亮度地图显示全球超过八成人口生活在光污染天空下，减缓办法包括限制向上溢光、降低色温和采用定时调光。��Artificial light at night rewrites the day-night and lunar cues organisms use for timing: migrating birds are drawn off course by city light domes and collide with buildings, hatchling sea turtles crawl toward inland lamps instead of the surf, and nocturnal insects exhaust themselves circling fixtures where predators wait, creating ecological traps. Plant flowering and leaf-fall schedules, fish migration, and mammal foraging windows are disrupted as well. Night-sky brightness atlases show over 80% of the world's population lives under light-polluted skies; mitigation includes shielding upward spill, lowering colour temperature, and timed dimming.�ans��src�فFalchi 等（2016）《Science Advances》夜空亮度新世界地图；国际暗天协会（DarkSky International）技术指南لFalchi et al. (2016), Science Advances, New world atlas of artificial night sky brightness; DarkSky International technical guidance��id�d108194020f6�body��_本土水生植物长期适应当地水文与气候，能固定底泥、净化水质，并为鸟类和鱼类提供食物与繁殖生境；外来观赏植物则可能疯长扩散、挤压本地物种。修复的目标是重建能自我维持的湿地生态系统，而非单纯追求景观效果，因此本土植物成活率高、生态收益更大。��Native aquatic plants are adapted to local hydrology and climate; they stabilise sediment, purify water, and provide food and breeding habitat for birds and fish. Introduced ornamentals can spread aggressively and displace natives. Because restoration aims to rebuild self-sustaining wetland ecosystems rather than scenery, native species give higher survival and greater ecological returns.�ans��src��*中国科学院（湿地保护与修复）�BChinese Academy of Sciences (wetland conservation and restoration)��id�d25c5123bf31�body��Z再生PET（rPET）饮料瓶和再生纤维已很常见，与原生料相比可显著减少碳排放。但回收塑料面临分拣困难、性能波动和杂质污染等问题，食品级再生还需严格认证。提升回收率要靠更精细的分拣体系和生产者责任延伸制度，让再生材料在成本和质量上更有竞争力。��Recycled PET bottles and recycled fibres are now common and cut carbon significantly versus virgin materials. But recycled plastics face difficult sorting, variable quality and contamination, and food-grade recycling needs strict certification. Higher recycling rates depend on finer sorting systems and Extended Producer Responsibility, so recycled content becomes competitive on both cost and quality.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d6a71cc2ca09�body��	《京都议定书》给少数发达国家设定了有约束力的绝对减排指标；而《巴黎协定》让几乎所有国家都提交自己的 NDC，强调共同但有区别的责任和自愿进阶。前者是“自上而下”，后者是“自下而上”。�The Kyoto Protocol set binding absolute targets for a few developed countries, while the Paris Agreement has nearly all nations submit their own NDCs, emphasizing common but differentiated responsibility and voluntary escalation. One is top-down, the other bottom-up.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d6bbb07c84f6�body���风险地图叠加历史洪水频率、地形高程与土地利用等图层，借助水力学模型模拟不同重现期下的淹没范围，再结合资产与人口暴露给出风险等级。其精度受地形数据与模型参数不确定性影响。�Risk maps overlay historical flood frequency, elevation and land use, use hydraulic models to simulate inundation at various return periods, then assign risk levels by combining asset and population exposure. Accuracy is limited by terrain data and model-parameter uncertainty.�ans��src��<UNDRR 2022《Words into Action：洪水风险管理》指南�5UNDRR (2022) Words into Action: Flood Risk Management��id�d8aae0c2a462�body���边缘效应指生态系统交界处的环境与小气候不同于内部，例如林地边缘光照更强、风更大、更干燥。它既会增加某些物种的多样性，也容易让外来物种和干扰侵入。�An edge effect means the boundary between habitats has a different microclimate than the interior, such as brighter light, stronger wind and drier air at a forest edge. It can raise diversity of some species but also lets invaders and disturbances penetrate.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�d926e276409a�body�ٍ能量金字塔表示营养级间能量的递减：每往上一级，只有约10%能量被转化利用，所以顶级捕食者数量最少。�yAn energy pyramid shows energy decreasing by trophic level; only about 10% transfers upward, so top predators are fewest.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�db498e49e437�body��m辐射强迫指相对于工业化前，某种因素导致地球能量收支在大气层顶净改变的功率密度，单位为瓦/平方米（W/m²），正值表示使地球增暖。IPCC 用它量化不同驱动因子（如温室气体、气溶胶、太阳活动）的贡献，指出人类活动造成的净正辐射强迫是近百年全球变暖的主要成因。��Radiative forcing is the change in net energy flux at the top of the atmosphere caused by some factor relative to pre-industrial conditions, expressed in watts per square meter (W/m²); positive values warm the planet. The IPCC uses it to quantify the contributions of different drivers—such as greenhouse gases, aerosols, and solar activity—and attributes the net positive forcing from human activity as the main cause of recent global warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ddb5e90fa4eb�body��RPFAS（全氟和多氟烷基物质）用于不粘锅、防水服和消防泡沫等产品，其碳—氟键极强，在环境和人体中几乎不降解，因此被称为“永久化学品”。部分PFAS会在血液和器官中蓄积，与免疫功能、甲状腺和生育问题相关联，正推动全球限控和替代材料的研发。��PFAS (per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances), used in non-stick cookware, waterproof clothing, and firefighting foam, have extremely strong carbon-fluorine bonds and barely degrade in the environment or the body — hence the name forever chemicals. Some PFAS accumulate in blood and organs and are linked to immune, thyroid, and fertility effects, driving global restrictions and the development of alternatives.�ans��src��"《Science》全氟化合物综述�Science PFAS review��id�e0c3c8d7cc8f�body�٭再生铝能耗仅为原铝的约5%，且可无限次重熔而不显著降级，减排与节能效益巨大；其高回收价值也支撑了完善的分拣与再利用链。��Recycling aluminum uses only about 5% of primary smelting energy and can be remelted indefinitely without significant downgrading, giving huge emission and energy savings; its high scrap value also sustains a strong collection chain.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�e215025dcce8�body���二者都是给碳排放定价的工具。碳税直接规定每吨 CO₂ 的价格，成本可预期但减排量不确定；碳交易是先定总量上限再让企业买卖配额，减排量确定但价格会波动。��Both put a price on carbon emissions. A carbon tax sets a fixed price per tonne of CO₂, giving predictable cost but uncertain cuts; cap-and-trade fixes the total allowance then lets firms trade permits, guaranteeing cuts but with a floating price.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e36c635477e0�body���业余观察者借助手机应用提交物种照片与位置，可在时空上极大扩展采样覆盖，并提升公众生态意识。数据需经专家校验以控制鉴定误差，方可纳入科研数据库。�Amateur observers submit species photos and locations via apps, vastly expanding spatial–temporal sampling coverage and raising public ecological awareness. Records need expert verification to control identification error before entering research databases.�ans��src�ٰChandler, See, Copas, Bonde,《Contribution of citizen science towards international biodiversity monitoring》,Biological Conservation,2017 (DOI: 10.1016/j.biocon.2016.09.004)ٮChandler, See, Copas, Bonde, 'Contribution of citizen science towards international biodiversity monitoring', Biological Conservation, 2017, DOI: 10.1016/j.biocon.2016.09.004��id�e4661a0cdd19�body�ي地热能利用地球内部的热量，通过抽取地下热水或蒸汽来发电或供暖，几乎不受天气影响、可稳定供应。ٌGeothermal energy taps Earth's internal heat via underground hot water or steam for power and heating; it is weather-independent and steady.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e47dba5b18cc�body���购买碳信用，相当于出资支持一个经认证的减排或固碳项目（如保护森林、推广清洁炉灶），换取等量的“抵消”额度。但碳信用面临“额外性”和“永久性”问题——如果项目本就会发生，或者碳之后又被释放，抵消就会失真。因此碳信用只是补充，真正的减排必须发生在自身价值链内。��Buying a carbon credit funds a certified emission-reduction or carbon-removal project (e.g., forest protection, clean cookstoves) in exchange for offsetting an equal amount of your own emissions. But credits face additionality and permanence problems — if the project would have happened anyway or the carbon is later released, the offset is hollow. Credits are therefore a supplement; real reductions must happen inside your own value chain.�ans��src��GHG Protocol�GHG Protocol��id�e58a4e6aa075�body���浮游植物通过光合作用吸收表层 CO₂，死后遗体下沉，把碳带到深海长期封存，称为生物泵。它每年向深海输送数十亿吨碳，是地球碳循环的关键环节。�Phytoplankton photosynthesize and absorb surface CO₂; when they die, their remains sink, carrying carbon to the deep sea for long-term storage—the biological pump. It delivers billions of tonnes of carbon to the deep ocean each year, a key part of the carbon cycle.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e634c6d1259d�body���电子废物增长极快，既有金、铜等可回收的宝贵材料，也含铅、汞、阻燃剂等有毒成分。若随意拆解或焚烧，会污染土壤水源并危害工人健康，因此被《巴塞尔公约》列为需妥善管理的废物。�(E-waste is the fastest-growing waste stream, holding both valuable materials like gold and copper and toxic ones like lead, mercury and flame retardants. Crude dismantling or burning pollutes soil and water and harms workers, so the Basel Convention treats it as waste needing careful management.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�e654206cee21�body��\全球约四分之三的作物依赖动物传粉，苹果、草莓、咖啡、坚果都离不开蜜蜂、蝴蝶等传粉者。它们正面临栖息地减少、农药暴露、病害和气候变化的多重压力。保护传粉者可以从保留野花带、减少花期用药、建立生态廊道做起，这既保护生态，也守住农业产量。��About three-quarters of crop species depend on animal pollination — apples, strawberries, coffee and nuts all rely on bees, butterflies and other pollinators. These insects face habitat loss, pesticide exposure, disease and climate change all at once. Protecting them can start with wildflower strips, avoiding sprays during bloom, and ecological corridors — safeguarding both nature and harvests.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e68c53e9eae4�body��T这就是回弹效应：设备更省能意味着单位服务的成本下降，人们会用得更多，比如换装 LED 后延长照明时间，买了省油车后行驶里程增加，这是直接回弹；省下的钱转而消费其他能源密集商品，构成间接回弹。若整个经济的生产率因此提升、能源服务价格全面走低，宏观层面还可能出现更大规模的反弹，这一命题源自杰文斯对煤炭的观察。多数实证研究认为家用设备的直接回弹约在一到三成，因此能效政策依然有效，但需要与碳价或总量控制配合。��This is the rebound effect: more efficient equipment lowers the cost per unit of service, so people consume more of it — leaving LED lights on longer, or driving further in a fuel-sipping car — which is direct rebound, while money saved is spent on other energy-intensive goods, producing indirect rebound. If economy-wide productivity rises and energy service prices fall broadly, macro-level rebound can be larger still, a proposition traceable to Jevons's observations about coal. Most empirical studies place direct rebound for household devices at roughly 10–30%, so efficiency policy remains effective but works best paired with carbon pricing or a binding cap.�ans��src��`Jevons《The Coal Question》（1865）；Gillingham 等（2016）《Nature》评论回弹效应�aJevons, The Coal Question (1865); Gillingham et al. (2016), Nature, comment on the rebound effect��id�e6f1a3fe420e�body���容量因子是实际发电量占满负荷理论值的比例。风电受风速波动影响，陆上约30–45%、海上更高，而煤电可稳定在80%以上，因此风电需要更多装机与储能来匹配同等稳定出力。��Capacity factor is actual output divided by theoretical maximum. Wind varies with weather—roughly 30–45% onshore, higher offshore—while coal runs above 80%, so wind needs more capacity and storage to match steady output.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�ea51023a02d8�body���公正转型指在向低碳经济转变时，保护受影响的工人与社区，通过再培训、社会保障和替代就业减少阵痛。它强调转型不能牺牲弱势群体的生计。��Just transition protects workers and communities affected by the shift to a low-carbon economy via retraining, social protection, and alternative employment. It insists the shift must not sacrifice vulnerable livelihoods.�ans��src��JILO 2015《公正转型指南：迈向环境可持续的经济与社会》�mILO 2015 Guidelines for a just transition towards environmentally sustainable economies and societies for all��id�eb2f1be2751b�body�� 联合国主导的塑料公约旨在达成一项具有法律约束力的文件，覆盖塑料全生命周期，从生产限制到末端治理。它强调减少原生塑料产量、杜绝塑料污染泄漏并促进公平转型。谈判焦点包括是否设定产量上限和资金机制。�BThe UN-led plastics treaty aims for a legally binding instrument covering the full plastic life cycle, from production limits to end-of-life management. It stresses cutting virgin plastic output, stopping leakage and enabling a just transition. Key debates include whether to cap production and how to fund implementation.�ans��src��U联合国环境大会第5/14号决议(2022)及UNEP塑料公约谈判(INC)官方文件�UUNEA Resolution 5/14 (2022) and UNEP Global Plastics Treaty INC negotiation documents��id�ec6078f593b5�body��N生物多样性热点地区指同时满足“拥有大量特有维管植物物种”和“已丧失至少70%原始原生植被”两个条件的区域，强调在物种独特且受威胁处优先保护。保护国际（Conservation International）目前认定了36个这样的热点，覆盖了地球大部分陆地生物多样性。�qA biodiversity hotspot is a region that both harbors a large number of endemic vascular plant species and has already lost at least 70% of its original native vegetation, emphasizing priority conservation where uniqueness and threat coincide. Conservation International currently recognizes 36 such hotspots that together hold a large share of terrestrial biodiversity.�ans��src��G保护国际（Conservation International）生物多样性热点计划�9Conservation International, Biodiversity Hotspots program��id�eca729bcd68b�body���关键种对群落结构的控制远超其生物量，如海獭抑制海胆、保护海带林。一旦移除，下级物种爆发或上级失衡会沿食物链层层放大，重塑整个生态系统。��Keystone species wield influence disproportionate to their biomass—sea otters suppress urchins and protect kelp forests. Remove them and trophic cascades amplify down and up the food web, reshaping the whole system.�ans��src��Science;Paine 1969�Science;Paine 1969��id�ed649a54aa44�body���人类年排放约一半被陆地与海洋吸收，但剩余的一半仍净增大气碳库；且吸收份额随排放总量上升而相对下降，因此浓度持续走高，目前约420 ppm以上。ٿNature absorbs about half of annual emissions, but the other half still nets into the atmosphere; and that share slips as emissions grow, so concentration keeps climbing—now above ~420 ppm.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ed64c8efae15�body�ٖ电子垃圾含铅、汞、镉等有毒物质，若随意焚烧或填埋会污染土壤水源；同时其中大量可回收的稀有金属被浪费。لE-waste contains lead, mercury and cadmium; crude burning or dumping pollutes soil and water, while valuable rare metals are wasted.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�ef9b911227ba�body���CCUS 是碳捕集、利用与封存：先捕集工业或电厂CO2，再将其封存到地下（驱油、咸水层）或转化为化学品、建材等利用。多了“利用U”和“封存S”环节。��CCUS is Carbon Capture, Utilization and Storage: capture CO2 from industry or power, then store it underground (EOR, saline aquifers) or convert it to chemicals, building materials, etc. It adds utilization and storage to capture alone.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_19_001�body���多数夜行性昆虫与鸟类的视觉受体对400至500纳米波段最敏感,而短波蓝光在大气中的散射距离更长,趋光聚集、迷航和昼夜节律紊乱都会随色温升高而放大。野外对比记录显示,换用2700K以下的暖白光源后灯具附近的昆虫捕获量显著回落。柏林等欧洲城市已据此把市政照明的色温上限收紧到3000K。��Visual receptors of most nocturnal insects and birds peak between 400 and 500 nanometers, and shortwave blue scatters farther through the atmosphere, so phototactic attraction, disorientation, and circadian disruption all scale up with color temperature. Comparative field counts show insect captures near lamps fall sharply once fixtures switch to warm white below 2700 K. European cities such as Berlin have since capped municipal street lighting at 3000 K on this basis.�ans��src��oFalchi等《新世界人工夜天光亮度图集》,Science Advances, 2016;国际暗夜协会室外照明规范ٗFalchi et al., New World Atlas of Artificial Night Sky Brightness, Science Advances, 2016; International Dark-Sky Association outdoor lighting criteria��id�env_19_004�body���传统设计追求把暴雨尽快送入管网排走,峰值流量原封不动地转嫁给下游河道,内涝与面源污染随之叠加。六字方针要求场地先用透水铺装、绿色屋顶和雨水花园完成入渗滞蓄,再经植草沟等介质净化回用于绿化浇洒,剩余径流才允许接入市政管网。排水由此从末端工程问题转变为贯穿产流全过程的水量水质统筹课题。�JConventional design races stormwater into pipes as fast as possible, handing raw peak flows to downstream rivers and stacking urban flooding onto diffuse pollution. The sponge sequence requires permeable pavement, green roofs, and rain gardens to absorb and detain runoff on site first, then pass it through bioswales for treatment and reuse in irrigation or washing, releasing only the remainder to the municipal network. Drainage thereby shifts from an end-of-pipe engineering task into coordinated management of water quantity and quality across the entire runoff-generation process.�ans��src��p住房和城乡建设部《海绵城市建设技术指南——低影响开发雨水系统构建(试行)》,2014ٕMinistry of Housing and Urban-Rural Development, Technical Guide for Sponge City Construction: Low-Impact Development Stormwater System (Trial), 2014��id�env_19_007�body���配额交易允许边际减排成本低的企业超额减排并出售盈余,成本偏高的主体改为购买配额,全社会自动收敛到总费用最小的减排组合,这是统一标准在静态效率上无法企及的。代价在于配额价格波动放大企业长期投资的不确定性,且监测核证失守或配额超发会让市场信号即刻失真,欧盟碳市场第一阶段便因各国普遍超发而令碳价一度跌近零。�FTrading lets firms with cheap abatement options overshoot their obligations and sell surplus allowances while high-cost emitters purchase permits instead of retrofitting, so the economy converges automatically on the least-cost reduction mix, an outcome uniform standards can never reach statically. The price of that efficiency is allowance-price volatility that clouds long-term investment decisions, and the mechanism collapses if verification slips or caps are set loosely: widespread over-allocation during Phase I of the EU carbon market pushed the permit price close to zero.�ans��src��u欧洲议会及理事会第2003/87/EC号指令(欧盟碳排放交易体系)及欧委会第一阶段运行评估报告٨Directive 2003/87/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council establishing the EU Emissions Trading System, with European Commission reviews of Phase I performance��id�env_19_010�body���把每个地块都清挖到背景值在经济与技术上近乎不可行,多种元素的天然本底本身就随地域剧烈波动,大规模开挖还会带来扬尘与地下水扰动等二次影响。基于风险的路线先界定未来暴露情景,居住用地标准远严于仓储用地,再倒推出可接受的残留浓度,允许以防渗阻隔、制度约束和长期监测替代彻底清除。我国土壤污染防治法与美国超级基金风险评估导则均采纳了这一逻辑。��Excavating every parcel back to background values proves nearly unworkable economically and technically, since natural background itself swings sharply across regions and wholesale digging adds secondary impacts like dust plumes and groundwater disturbance. The risk-based route first pins down the future exposure scenario, residential standards running far tighter than warehouse ones, then works backward to acceptable residual concentrations, allowing impermeable caps, institutional controls, and long-term monitoring in place of total removal. Both China's Soil Pollution Prevention and Control Law and the US EPA's Superfund risk assessment guidance embrace this logic.�ans��src��l《中华人民共和国土壤污染防治法》,2019年施行;美国EPA超级基金风险评估导则(RAGS)ّSoil Pollution Prevention and Control Law of the People's Republic of China, effective 2019; US EPA Risk Assessment Guidance for Superfund (RAGS)��id�env_19_011�body��0静稳天气压缩了边界层并抬高湿度,SO2与NOx在颗粒物表面的多相化学反应随之加快。高湿还促进硝酸盐经液相途径生成并抑制其挥发,使二次无机盐成为PM2.5的主要增量来源。弱通风条件则让已生成的二次气溶胶持续累积而难以清除。��Stagnant winter conditions compress the boundary layer and raise humidity, accelerating multiphase conversion of SO2 and NOx on particle surfaces. High humidity also favours aqueous-phase nitrate formation and suppresses its volatilization, making secondary inorganic salts the dominant increment in PM2.5. Weak ventilation lets the accumulated secondary aerosol build up faster than it can be removed.�ans��src�ٯCheng, Zheng, Wei, Mu,《Reactive nitrogen chemistry in aerosol water as a source of sulfate during haze events in China》,Science Advances,2016 (DOI: 10.1126/sciadv.1601530)٭Cheng, Zheng, Wei, Mu, 'Reactive nitrogen chemistry in aerosol water as a source of sulfate during haze events in China', Science Advances, 2016, DOI: 10.1126/sciadv.1601530��id�env_19_014�body��]互花米草兼具耐盐、耐淹能力并拥有泌盐组织,可在从光滩到高潮缘的宽潮位带上定居,这是本土芦苇难以企及的低潮带生态位。其根状茎克隆生长能快速锁定新淤裸滩,大量种子又借涨落潮流远距离播种。繁殖与生理优势叠加,使其在苏闽等地形成排他性的单优群落。��The cordgrass combines salinity and submergence tolerance with salt-excreting glands, letting it settle across a tidal range from open mudflat to high-marsh margins, a niche the native reed cannot occupy on lower flats. Rhizomatous clonal growth quickly locks onto newly formed bare flats, while abundant seeds are broadcast long distances by tidal currents. These physiological and reproductive advantages stack up into exclusive monodominant stands along the Jiangsu and Fujian coasts.�ans��src�نStrong DR, Ayres MR, Ecological and Evolutionary Misadventures of Spartina, Annual Review of Ecology, Evolution, and Systematics, 2013هStrong DR & Ayres MR, Ecological and Evolutionary Misadventures of Spartina, Annual Review of Ecology, Evolution, and Systematics, 2013��id�env_19_017�body���许多夜间迁徙鸟依靠星空方位与地磁线索定向,而白光LED等宽谱光源的蓝绿成分在大气中散射强烈,形成的天光掩盖了自然参照系。靠近强光源后鸟的瞳孔收缩、暗视敏度骤降,个体开始绕灯盘旋,体能耗竭并撞上建筑物。削减灯具上射光通并在迁徙高峰调暗照明,已被证明能大幅减少这类致扰与死亡。��Many night migrants steer by stellar cues and the geomagnetic field, but the blue-green component of broad-spectrum white LEDs scatters strongly in air, producing skyglow that masks those natural references. Close to a bright source a bird's pupils constrict and scotopic sensitivity collapses, so individuals circle the light until exhausted and strike buildings. Trimming upward light flux and dimming installations during migration peaks has been shown to cut both disturbance and mortality sharply.�ans��src�ٱB.M. Van Doren 等,PNAS, 2017(高强度城市照明改变夜间鸟类迁徙);T. Longcore 与 C. Rich, Frontiers in Ecology and the Environment, 2004(生态光污染概念框架)��B.M. Van Doren et al., PNAS, 2017, high-intensity urban light installation dramatically alters nighttime bird migration; T. Longcore and C. Rich, Frontiers in Ecology and the Environment, 2004, framework of ecological light pollution.��id�env_20_001�body��7厌氧氨氧化菌以亚硝酸盐为电子受体,把铵根直接氧化成氮气,全程不需要外加有机碳源。相比传统硝化—反硝化路线,它省去约六成曝气量,剩余污泥产量也明显更低。鹿特丹等地的全尺寸污水厂已用它处理污泥消化液,验证了工程可行性。��Anammox bacteria use nitrite as the electron acceptor to oxidize ammonium straight to nitrogen gas, with no external organic carbon needed. Compared with conventional nitrification–denitrification, this shortcut saves roughly 60% of the aeration and yields far less excess sludge. Full-scale plants in Rotterdam and elsewhere already treat digester sidestreams this way, confirming the process works at engineering scale.�ans��src��\van der Star et al., Water Research 41 (2007): 首座全尺寸 Anammox 反应器启动研究٦van der Star et al., 'Startup of reactors for anoxic ammonium oxidation: experiences from the first full-scale anammox reactor in Rotterdam', Water Research 41 (2007)��id�env_20_004�body��R狼群让马鹿不敢久留在河谷等易遭伏击的取食地,柳树和杨树的萌条得以存活长高。柳带为河狸提供食物与筑坝材料,坝体抬高地下水位又反过来滋养更多柳树并改善水禽与鱼类生境。这条狼—鹿—柳—河狸食物链说明顶级捕食者能间接重塑植被与水文格局。��Wolves made elk avoid lingering in river valleys where ambush risk was high, so willow and aspen sprouts finally survived to grow tall. Those willow stands gave beavers food and dam-building material, and the raised water tables behind their dams fed back into more willows plus better waterfowl and fish habitat. This wolf-elk-willow-beaver chain shows how an apex predator can indirectly reshape vegetation and hydrology.�ans��src��ORipple & Beschta, BioScience 54 (2004): 狼的风险效应与黄石植被结构�rRipple & Beschta, 'Wolves and the ecology of fear: can predation risk structure ecosystems?', BioScience 54 (2004)��id�env_20_014�body���高压反气旋形成的逆温层使燃煤烟气在城市上空滞留数日,事后流行病学回溯估算超额死亡约一万两千人,远超当时的官方统计。事件直接促成1956年《清洁空气法》,家庭取暖逐步告别烟煤、转向无烟燃料和天然气,并开创了“烟雾本身即立法对象”的治理先例。公共卫生监测自此与大气化学研究深度结合,为后来酸雨与光化学烟雾的治理提供了方法范本。�]A temperature inversion under a stagnant anticyclone held coal smoke over the city for days; retrospective epidemiology estimates some twelve thousand excess deaths, far beyond contemporary official counts. The catastrophe produced Britain's Clean Air Act of 1956, pushed domestic heating off raw coal onto smokeless fuels and gas, and established the precedent that visible smog itself can be made a statutory target. Public-health surveillance and atmospheric chemistry have been intertwined ever since, supplying the methodological template for later campaigns against acid rain and photochemical smog.�ans��src�ٶBell, Davis & Fletcher 2004, A retrospective assessment of mortality from the London smog episode, Environmental Health Perspectives 112(1); Brimblecombe 1987, The Big Smoke, MethuenٮBell, Davis & Fletcher 2004, A retrospective assessment of mortality from the London smog episode, Environ. Health Perspect. 112(1); Brimblecombe 1987, The Big Smoke, Methuen��id�env_20_017�body���生物强化是向受污染环境接种具有特定降解能力的外源微生物或菌群,以加速目标污染物的分解,例如投加Dehalococcoides菌株促进氯代溶剂的还原脱氯。自然衰减则依赖场地内已有的土著微生物群落和物理化学过程,在不加干预的情况下逐步降低污染物浓度。前者见效快但需要维持接种菌的存活与竞争能力,后者成本低却受限于土著菌群的代谢潜力和现场水文条件。��Bioaugmentation introduces exogenous microorganisms or consortia with specific degradative capabilities into a contaminated environment to accelerate breakdown of target pollutants — for example, adding Dehalococcoides strains to drive reductive dechlorination of chlorinated solvents. Natural attenuation instead relies on indigenous microbial communities plus physical and chemical processes at the site, lowering contaminant concentrations without intervention. The former acts faster but requires sustaining survival and competitiveness of the inoculated strains; the latter costs less yet is constrained by the metabolic potential of native flora and site hydrogeology.�ans��src��^Major等在Current Opinion in Biotechnology上关于生物强化与生物刺激的综述(2015)�cMajor et al., review on bioaugmentation and biostimulation, Current Opinion in Biotechnology (2015)��id�env_21_001�body��z湿地修复、绿色屋顶、透水铺装等措施在削减洪峰和缓解热岛的同时，还能提供栖息地与休闲空间，带来多重协同效益。灰色工程虽然见效快，但通常只针对单一灾害，且造价与维护成本高、寿命有限。因此不少城市将两者组合布局，用较小的增量成本换取更高的整体韧性和长期收益。��Measures such as wetland restoration, green roofs, and permeable paving curb flood peaks and ease urban heat while also providing habitat and recreation space, so their benefits compound across sectors. Gray engineering works quickly but usually targets a single hazard and carries high construction and maintenance costs over a limited lifespan. Many cities therefore combine both approaches, buying greater overall resilience at modest incremental cost.�ans��src���Chan, Griffiths, Higgitt, Xu,《“Sponge City” in China—A breakthrough of planning and flood risk management in the urban context》,Land Use Policy,2018 (DOI: 10.1016/j.landusepol.2018.03.005)��Chan, Griffiths, Higgitt, Xu, '“Sponge City” in China—A breakthrough of planning and flood risk management in the urban context', Land Use Policy, 2018, DOI: 10.1016/j.landusepol.2018.03.005��id�env_21_004�body�� 急性试验记录短期暴露下的死亡或活动抑制等终点，慢性试验考察生长、繁殖乃至种群水平的长期响应，这类效应可在远低于致死浓度的暴露下出现。由于可测试的水生物种有限，从实验室单一物种外推到整个生态系统必然引入不确定性，监管上便用评价因子对最敏感物种的NOEC或EC10折减得到PNEC。可用数据越丰富——物种覆盖越广或包含微宇宙和中宇宙研究——所需评价因子越小，PNEC也越贴近真实安全阈值。��Acute assays record endpoints such as mortality or immobilization under short exposure, whereas chronic assays track growth, reproduction, and population-level responses over time, and these effects emerge at exposures far below lethal levels. Because only a handful of species can be tested, extrapolating from single laboratory species to whole ecosystems injects uncertainty, so regulators apply an assessment factor to the most sensitive species NOEC or EC10 to obtain the PNEC. The richer the dataset—broader species coverage or the inclusion of microcosm and mesocosm studies—the smaller the factor needed and the closer the PNEC sits to the true safe threshold.�ans��src�ٌ欧盟委员会《化学品风险评估技术导则》（TGD）第二部分；欧洲化学品管理局环境剂量-反应表征指南R.10章٠European Commission Technical Guidance Document on Risk Assessment (TGD), Part II; ECHA Guidance Chapter R.10, Characterisation of Dose-Response for Environment��id�env_21_007�body���生命周期评价(LCA)从矿石开采、制造、运输、运行到退役回收,折算出每度电的碳强度与土地占用,光伏约为煤电的二十分之一以下,但并非零足迹。降低足迹的路径包括在退化土地、屋顶和水面上布置组件,采用高回收率的风机叶片拆解工艺,以及用硅料提纯的绿电替代火电制造环节。选址评估还需叠加鸟类迁徙走廊、农田土壤功能等生态约束。�-Life-cycle assessment tracks mining, manufacturing, transport, operation and decommissioning to express each kilowatt-hour in carbon intensity and land use; solar PV is roughly one-twentieth of coal or lower, yet not footprint-free. Footprints shrink by siting panels on degraded land, rooftops and water surfaces, adopting high-recycling wind-blade dismantling routes, and powering silicon purification itself with low-carbon electricity. Site screening must also overlay ecological constraints such as bird migration corridors and farmland soil functions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_21_010�body���食物损失发生在生产、采后处理、储存和运输环节,多因技术与基础设施不足;食物浪费发生在零售、餐饮和家庭消费端,属于行为与制度问题。FAO估算全球约三分之一的食用产量被损耗或浪费,对应约8–10%的人为温室气体排放和巨大的蓝水与耕地占用。干预优先级因此不同:欠发达地区应投资冷链与仓储,发达地区则需改进日期标签规则、分餐设计与剩余食物再分配渠道。�~Food loss occurs on-farm and along post-harvest handling, storage and transport, driven mainly by technical and infrastructure gaps; food waste arises at retail, food service and household stages, rooted in behavior and institutions. FAO estimates roughly one-third of edible output is lost or wasted, linked to about 8-10 percent of anthropogenic greenhouse-gas emissions plus large blue-water and cropland footprints. Priorities diverge accordingly: less-developed regions need cold chains and storage investment, while developed regions gain most from smarter date labeling, portion design and redistribution channels for surplus food.�ans��src��nFAO《世界粮食与农业状况2019:粮食损失与浪费的进展》;UNEP《食物浪费指数报告2021》�FAO, The State of Food and Agriculture 2019: Moving Forward on Food Loss and Waste Reduction; UNEP Food Waste Index Report 2021��id�env_21_011�body��&净零排放允许存在残余排放,前提是通过森林碳汇、碳捕集与封存等清除手段将其等量抵消。这意味着能源系统仍在排放,只是排放量与清除量在核算层面达到平衡。因此净零强调的是可核查的碳平衡,而不是字面上的零排放。�8Net zero tolerates residual emissions provided they are offset by equivalent removals such as forest carbon sinks or carbon capture and storage. The energy system still emits, but emissions and removals balance in the accounting. Net zero is therefore a verifiable carbon balance rather than literal zero output.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_21_014�body��cMSY 假设种群增长仅取决于资源量,忽略了种群自然波动、生态系统相互作用与捕捞的经济成本。把捕捞强度推到生物极限会使种群长期处于较低水平,一旦遭遇环境突变便容易崩溃。因此许多渔业转向最大经济产量或基于生态系统的管理,把风险预防与生态目标纳入决策。��MSY assumes stock growth depends only on abundance, ignoring natural variability, ecosystem interactions, and the economic cost of fishing. Harvesting at the biological maximum keeps stocks persistently low and leaves them prone to collapse when conditions shift abruptly. Many fisheries therefore move toward maximum economic yield or ecosystem-based management that embeds precaution and ecological objectives.�ans��src�ٷMace,《A new role for MSY in single‐species and ecosystem approaches to fisheries stock assessment and management》,Fish and Fisheries,2001 (DOI: 10.1046/j.1467-2979.2001.00033.x)ٵMace, 'A new role for MSY in single‐species and ecosystem approaches to fisheries stock assessment and management', Fish and Fisheries, 2001, DOI: 10.1046/j.1467-2979.2001.00033.x��id�env_22_001�body���超临界二氧化碳（温度高于31.1℃、压力高于7.38兆帕）密度接近液体而黏度接近气体，能以远高于气态的体积效率充填深部咸水层孔隙，大幅提高单位储层的封存量，并降低井筒内的注入压力损耗。入层之后，它经盖层构造圈闭、孔隙残余捕获、溶解与矿化等机制被逐步固定，封存安全性随时间推移而提高。��Supercritical CO₂ (above 31.1 °C and 7.38 MPa) is nearly as dense as a liquid but flows almost like a gas, so it fills deep saline-aquifer pore space with far greater volumetric efficiency than gaseous CO₂, raising storage capacity per reservoir and cutting pressure losses in the well. Underground, it is progressively immobilized by structural trapping beneath the caprock, then by residual, solubility, and mineral trapping, so containment generally improves with time.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_22_004�body���附录Ⅰ收录面临灭绝威胁的物种，其国际商业贸易原则上被全面禁止，仅科研、保育等特殊用途经进出口国双重许可后放行；附录Ⅱ物种虽未必然濒危，但贸易须受管控，出口国须签发许可证并完成“非致危性判定”，确认出口不会损害该物种野生种群的存续。这种分级把管制强度与物种受威胁程度和贸易压力直接挂钩。�5Appendix I lists species threatened with extinction; their commercial international trade is essentially banned, with narrow exemptions for scientific or conservation purposes granted only under permits from both the importing and exporting countries. Appendix II species are not necessarily threatened, but trade is controlled: the exporting country must issue a permit backed by a non-detriment finding confirming that the offtake will not harm the species' wild populations. This tiering ties regulatory stringency directly to extinction risk and trade pressure.�ans��src��cCITES秘书处，《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》文本与附录（1975年生效）هCITES Secretariat, Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora, text and Appendices (in force 1975)��id�env_22_007�body���循环经济按“内环优先”排序价值保留策略：维护修理、再使用、再制造等内层循环保留产品的结构与加工中蕴含的能耗，只需少量投入即可恢复功能；而回收把产品打回材料形态，常伴随品质降级——例如混合塑料只能降级利用——并损失大部分隐含能源。循环离原始用户越近，节材、节能与减排的效果就越好。�GCircular-economy strategy ranks value-retention options by how much embedded value they keep. Inner loops such as maintenance and repair, direct reuse, and remanufacturing preserve a product's structure and the energy invested in shaping its parts, so little input restores full function. Recycling, by contrast, reduces products back to materials, usually with quality loss—mixed plastics, for instance, can only be downcycled—and forfeits most embodied processing energy. The closer a loop stays to the original user, the greater the savings in material, energy, and emissions.�ans��src��HStahel W R，《绩效经济》（第2版），Palgrave Macmillan，2010�IStahel, W. R., The Performance Economy, 2nd ed., Palgrave Macmillan, 2010��id�env_22_010�body���北太平洋副热带环流的中心位于信风与西风带之间，风生埃克曼输送使表层海水向环流中部辐合下沉，漂浮碎屑随之被“兜”在高气压式的环流中心，逐渐积累成所谓的大太平洋垃圾带。它并非连片的“垃圾岛”，而是上层水体中弥散分布的塑料云，按件数计以碎裂的微塑料为主；塑料密度小、降解又慢，一旦进入辐合区便可能滞留多年。�NThe center of the North Pacific subtropical gyre lies between the trade winds and the westerlies; wind-driven Ekman transport pushes surface water toward the gyre's middle, where it converges and sinks, trapping buoyant debris in a high-pressure-like vortex that gradually builds the so-called Great Pacific Garbage Patch. It is not a solid floating island but a diffuse cloud of plastic through the upper water column, dominated by fragmented microplastics when counted by item; because plastic is light and degrades slowly, debris entering the convergence zone can stay trapped for years.�ans��src��VLebreton L C M 等，《Scientific Reports》，2018，DOI: 10.1038/s41598-018-22939-w�TLebreton, L. C. M. et al., Scientific Reports, 2018, DOI: 10.1038/s41598-018-22939-w��id�env_22_011�body���研究发现种族是最强预测因子——社区中少数族裔比例越高，危险废物设施越集中，其解释力超过收入、房产价值等经济变量。隔离性住房政策压低了土地价格，弱势社区的行政申诉与政治抵制能力也更弱。报告首次用全国数据把污染负担与种族不平等系统性挂钩，促使环境正义从社区抗争成长为学术领域和政策议程。�Race proved the strongest single predictor: the higher a community's share of minority residents, the more concentrated its hazardous-waste facilities—an effect stronger than income, home values, or land costs. Segregated housing policies depressed land prices, and weaker communities had little administrative or political capacity to resist sitings. By tying pollution burdens systematically to racial inequality with national data, the report carried environmental justice from grassroots protest into scholarship and policy.�ans��src��j美国联合基督教会种族正义委员会：《美国的毒物与种族》全国调查报告（1987）�hUnited Church of Christ Commission for Racial Justice, Toxic Wastes and Race in the United States (1987)��id�env_22_017�body���注入初期，超临界态二氧化碳被低渗透盖层的构造圈闭拦在上覆地层之下；随后毛管力把它分割成滞留在孔隙中的残余气滴；一部分气体溶入地层水使卤水密度增大而下沉，削弱向上逃逸的浮力驱动；更缓慢的矿物反应还会将少量碳固定为固态碳酸盐。四类机制随时间接力生效，整体泄漏风险逐步下降。��At first, supercritical CO2 is held underground by structural trapping beneath low-permeability caprock. Capillary forces then snap it off into residual droplets stuck within pores. Dissolved CO2 makes brine denser so it sinks, weakening the buoyant drive to escape, and slow geochemical reactions fix a small share of carbon into solid carbonate minerals. These four mechanisms take over in succession, so overall leakage risk declines.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_23_007�body���电解槽通入直流电后，水在阴极还原析出氢气、在阳极氧化放出氧气，电能以化学键形式直接储入氢分子，过程不排二氧化碳。但每公斤氢约需耗电50–55千瓦时：电力来自风、光、水即近乎零碳的绿氢，若取自高煤电占比电网，其全生命周期排放可能不低于甚至超过天然气重整制灰氢，故“氢的颜色”实质是电的颜色。��In an electrolyser, direct current splits water: hydrogen evolves at the cathode and oxygen at the anode, storing electricity directly as chemical energy with no on-site CO2. Yet each kilogram of hydrogen costs roughly 50-55 kWh of power — supplied by wind, solar or hydro the product is near-zero-carbon green hydrogen, whereas coal-heavy grid power can give a lifecycle footprint comparable to or worse than unabated gas reforming. The colour of hydrogen is essentially the colour of its electricity.�ans��src��S国际能源署（IEA）《氢能的未来》（The Future of Hydrogen），2019年�!IEA, The Future of Hydrogen, 2019��id�env_23_010�body���目标3要求到2030年至少30%的陆地、内陆水域与海洋，通过保护地和其他有效的基于区域的保护措施（OECM）得到有效保护与管理，并强调生态代表性、连通性、公平治理与有效管理。OECM指本身并非保护地、但长期管理结果确实能够就地维持生物多样性的区域，如部分社区林、水源涵养林或军事用地，从而把保护成效拓展到正式保护地网络之外。�8Target 3 requires that by 2030 at least 30% of land, inland waters and coastal-marine areas be effectively conserved and managed through protected areas and other effective area-based conservation measures (OECMs), stressing ecological representativeness, connectivity, equitable governance and effective management. OECMs are areas managed for other ends whose long-term outcomes nonetheless maintain biodiversity in situ — certain community forests, watershed protection forests or military lands — extending conservation gains beyond the formal reserve network.�ans��src��vCBD第十五次缔约方大会第15/4号决定附《昆明-蒙特利尔全球生物多样性框架》目标3，2022年�pConvention on Biological Diversity Decision 15/4, Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework, Target 3, 2022��id�env_23_014�body���减缓层级按“避免—减量—修复—抵消”排序，体现生态损失可替代性递增：让工程避开敏感栖息地，损害根本不发生；技术措施只能缩小损害；事后修复难以复原原有物种组成与生态功能；抵消则是在别处重建同类生境，存在时间滞后与失败风险。把最不确定的手段放在末位，防止以纸面补偿掩盖原位的不可逆损失，从而实现净零损失。�:The mitigation hierarchy ranks measures as avoid, minimise, restore and offset, mirroring the increasing substitutability of ecological losses. Steering a project away from sensitive habitat prevents damage outright; engineering controls merely shrink it; restoration afterwards can hardly recreate the original species composition and function; and offsets rebuild similar habitat elsewhere, with time lags and failure risks. Placing the least certain instrument last stops paper compensation from masking irreversible on-site losses and serves the goal of no net loss.�ans��src��w国际金融公司（IFC），《绩效标准6：生物多样性保护与生物自然资源可持续管理》，2012年ٗInternational Finance Corporation (IFC), Performance Standard 6: Biodiversity Conservation and Sustainable Management of Living Natural Resources, 2012��id�env_24_003�body��这是自然体权利的前沿问题。1972年斯通提出树木应有法律主体地位的设想后,进展走向判例:2017年新西兰立法授予旺格努伊河法人地位,由毛利部落与政府组成的监护人代其表达意愿;印度北阿坎德邦法院一度宣布恒河为「活人实体」;中国则走公益诉讼路径——环境保护法第五十八条允许符合条件的社会组织起诉污染者,检察机关亦能提起。核心难题始终是:代理人如何忠实翻译难以人类化的生态利益。��This is the frontier question of environmental law on the rights of nature. After Stone's 1972 thought experiment on trees having standing, practice caught up: New Zealand granted the Whanganui River legal personhood in 2017, with Maori and government guardians speaking for it; an Indian court briefly declared the Ganges a living entity; China takes a public-interest litigation path — Article 58 of the Environmental Protection Law lets qualified social organizations sue polluters, and the procuratorate may also bring public-interest suits. The enduring puzzle: how representatives faithfully translate ecological interests that resist human framing.�ans��src��TStone,《Should Trees Have Standing?》,Southern California Law Review 第45卷,1972�QC. D. Stone, Should Trees Have Standing?, Southern California Law Review 45, 1972��id�env_24_007�body�� 每年约1.8亿吨撒哈拉沙尘升空,一部分搭乘东风急流跨越五千公里落在亚马逊盆地——所携的磷正是热带雨林最缺的营养(土壤淋溶严重,磷依赖外援)。研究估算这份补给可抵消水土流失损失的相当比例磷,堪称地球最大的生态补贴。沙尘亦有气候角色:落入海洋的铁元素喂养固碳浮游植物,高空沙尘影响云形成与辐射平衡。当然,近距沙尘暴是健康灾难——PM10爆表、呼吸道疾病激增,治理关键在源头植被与放牧管理。��Roughly 180 million tonnes of Saharan dust take wing each year, part riding easterly jets five thousand kilometers to fall on the Amazon — carrying phosphorus, the nutrient rainforest soils chronically lack through leaching; studies estimate this intercontinental delivery offsets a large share of hydrological phosphorus losses, Earths biggest ecological subsidy. Dust also plays climate roles: iron landing on oceans feeds carbon-fixing plankton, and high-altitude dust shapes clouds and radiation. Up close though, storms are health disasters — PM10 spikes and respiratory surges — managed best by source-zone vegetation and grazing control.�ans��src��zYu 等,《The fertilizing role of African dust in the Amazon rainforest》,Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics 第15卷,2015�wH. Yu et al., The fertilizing role of African dust in the Amazon rainforest, Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics 15, 2015��id�env_24_008�body��持久性有机污染物(POPs)的共同配方:难降解、亲脂、半挥发。DDT在土壤里能撑几十年,沿食物链脂肪逐级浓缩,顶级掠食者体内浓度可比环境高百万倍——此即生物放大。更狡猾的是蚱蜢跳效应:POPs在温暖处挥发、遇冷凝结,反复跳跃终聚高纬度,于是远离农田的北极熊肝脏也检出农药。2001年斯德哥尔摩公约据此建立全球淘汰清单,DDT、多氯联苯首批入列;监测显示浓度缓降,但全氟化合物等新成员仍在接力。��Persistent organic pollutants share a recipe: hard to degrade, fat-loving, semi-volatile. DDT persists in soil for decades, magnifies up food webs as lipids concentrate it, reaching million-fold enrichments in apex predators — biomagnification. Grasshopper effect adds cunning: warm regions re-evaporate POPs into the atmosphere to condense somewhere colder, hop by hop until they pool in polar regions — hence pesticides in polar bear livers far from any field. The 2001 Stockholm Convention built the global listing-and-elimination regime, banning DDT, PCBs and friends first; levels decline slowly while PFAS relatives queue behind them.�ans��src�ٙJones 与 de Voogt,《Persistent organic pollutants (POPs): state of the science》,Environmental Pollution 100,1999 (DOI: 10.1016/s0269-7491(99)00098-6)٠K. C. Jones and P. de Voogt, 'Persistent organic pollutants (POPs): state of the science', Environmental Pollution 100, 1999, DOI: 10.1016/s0269-7491(99)00098-6��id�env_24_018�body��~海洋已吸收人类排放二氧化碳的四分之一,溶解后生成碳酸使表层海水pH下降约0.1(氢离子浓度增三成)。受冲击最直接的是钙化生物:碳酸根离子减少,文石饱和度下降,牡蛎与贻贝的幼虫难以建造贝壳。美国西北太平洋的养殖场2007年起幼虫大规模死亡,溯源发现春季上升流把富含CO2的老水送上沿岸孵化场——预警系统让育苗场在低pH时段避峰进水才稳住产业。食物链下游效应仍在展开:珊瑚礁、翼足类与依赖它们的渔业都悬在这条化学曲线上。减排之外,红树林海草的局部碳汇是缓冲带。�gOceans absorbed a quarter of human CO2; dissolved it turns to carbonic acid, dropping surface pH about 0.1 (hydrogen ions up a third). Calcifiers feel it first: carbonate ions thin out, aragonite saturation falls, and oyster mussel larvae struggle to build shells. Pacific Northwest oyster farms saw mass larval deaths from 2007, traced to upwelling delivering CO2-rich deep water to hatcheries — pH early-warning systems timing water intake saved the industry. Food-web ripples spread through corals, pteropods and their fisheries. Beyond emissions cuts, mangrove and seagrass carbon sinks offer local buffering.�ans��src��cFeely 等,《Impact of anthropogenic CO2 on the CaCO3 system in the oceans»,Science 第305卷,2004�dR. A. Feely et al., Impact of anthropogenic CO2 on the CaCO3 system in the oceans, Science 305, 2004��id�env_24_020�body��Z土壤储存的碳比大气与植被总和还多,耕作翻土让有机质暴露氧化,百年来全球农田损失了两到三成土壤碳。再生农业的组合拳包括:免耕少耕减少扰动、覆盖作物全年有根、轮作豆科固氮、有机肥回田。元分析显示免耕表层的碳确实增加,但深层常持平甚至下降——碳只是被搬进了浅层,这提醒我们别把局部测量当全局胜利。更稳妥的共识是:再生实践同时改善水保持、生物多样性与肥料效率,碳汇是附带红利而非唯一目标;土壤碳信用额度因此仍需谨慎核算。��Soils hold more carbon than atmosphere plus vegetation combined; tillage exposes organic matter to oxidation, costing global croplands twenty to thirty percent of soil carbon historically. Regenerative combos — no-till or reduced till, year-round cover-crop roots, legume rotations, organic amendments — show real gains in topsoil carbon in meta-analyses, though subsoil often stays flat or falls as carbon merely relocates upward: a caution against local wins declared global. The sturdier consensus values co-benefits — water retention, biodiversity, fertilizer efficiency — treating carbon credits as bonus requiring careful accounting.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_26_002�body���泛指粒径小于5毫米的塑料颗粒。它既源于大块塑料的紫外老化和机械破碎,也包括洗衣释放的合成纤维、化妆品磨料与工业树脂颗粒这类一次微塑料;微小粒径让它能被浮游动物和滤食性贝类摄食,沿食物链逐级传递并在组织内蓄积,颗粒表面还会吸附持久性有机污染物和重金属而放大毒性。因其来源分散、粒度跨度大,海上拦截与打捞几乎不可行,治理重心只能放在源头减量。�hPlastic particles smaller than five millimetres. Besides fragments shed by weathering of larger debris, they include primary microplastics emitted directly as synthetic laundry fibres, cosmetic scrubs and industrial resin pellets. Being so small, they are ingested by zooplankton and filter-feeding shellfish, travel up food chains and accumulate in tissue, while their surfaces concentrate persistent organic pollutants and heavy metals that magnify toxicity. With scattered sources spanning orders of magnitude in size, interception or recovery at sea is nearly hopeless, so policy targets reduction at the source.�ans��src�ٰCole, Lindeque, Halsband, Galloway,《Microplastics as contaminants in the marine environment: A review》,Marine Pollution Bulletin,2011 (DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.09.025)ٮCole, Lindeque, Halsband, Galloway, 'Microplastics as contaminants in the marine environment: A review', Marine Pollution Bulletin, 2011, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.09.025��id�env_26_009�body���因为建筑垃圾是城市固废中体量最大的一类,欧盟《废弃物框架指令》为此设定了2020年起建筑拆迁垃圾按重量70%回收利用的目标。循环解法分两层:存量层面推行材料护照,记录每栋建筑构件的材质与安装位置,让旧楼成为可供检索的材料仓库;增量层面改用螺栓连接等可逆构造与模块化构件,翻新或拆除时可整体卸下高值部件直接复用,而非一律破碎降级为路基回填料。�cConstruction and demolition debris makes up the largest single share of urban solid waste, which is why the EU Waste Framework Directive required seventy percent recovery of it by weight from 2020. The circular response works on two fronts. For the standing stock, material passports record each component's substance and position, turning older buildings into searchable warehouses of parts. For new builds, reversible bolted connections and modular elements allow high-value pieces to be unbolted intact during refurbishment or demolition for direct reuse instead of being crushed wholesale into roadbed fill.�ans��src��k欧洲议会与理事会指令《Waste Framework Directive》(2008/98/EC,含建筑垃圾70%回收率条款)ٔEuropean Parliament and Council, Waste Framework Directive 2008/98/EC (clause setting seventy percent recovery of construction and demolition waste)��id�env_26_011�body���指田间节水并不等于流域节水。滴灌喷灌省下的主要是输水途中的渗漏与蒸发,而这些渗漏水原本会回归河道与地下水,被下游水井和取水口反复取用;设施升级后农民往往扩种增肥,作物蒸腾随之上升,「消失」的回流水不再回来,河湖与含水层的可用水量不升反降。因此节水政策不能止于补贴高效设备,还要为流域设定取水总量上限、按实际消耗量考核,否则效率提升只会刺激用水扩张。�pIt is the gap between saving water in the field and saving water in the basin. Drip and sprinkler systems curb seepage and evaporation during conveyance, yet those very losses used to recharge rivers and aquifers, where downstream wells and intakes pumped them back up. Upgraded schemes invite farmers to plant and fertilise more, so crop transpiration climbs while the recycled return flow vanishes, leaving less water in the channel than before. Policy therefore must go beyond subsidising efficient hardware and set basin-level caps on withdrawals, accounted by consumptive use, or efficiency gains simply fuel expansion.�ans��src��JGrafton RQ等论文《The paradox of irrigation efficiency》,Science 2018�HGrafton RQ et al., 'The paradox of irrigation efficiency', Science, 2018��id�env_26_015�body��它按单位发电量的碳排放基准免费发放配额,对冲经济与电力的增长不确定性:发电量上涨,配额随之增加,供电不会被碳价卡住。换来的是产业平稳与近乎百分之百的履约率,牺牲的则是约束刚性——配额整体偏松,碳价远低于欧盟,减排集中在少数落后机组,属相对减排而非绝对减排。欧盟ETS正相反,先立逐年收紧的总量上限,再靠拍卖让价格去执行。两种设计折射发展阶段之别:一边稳中降碳,一边硬性封顶。��Allowances are issued free against benchmarks for emissions per unit of electricity generated, hedging uncertain growth in both the economy and power demand: when output expands, allowances expand too, so supply is never squeezed by the carbon price. The reward is industrial stability and near-total compliance; the sacrifice is weak discipline - allocations stay comparatively generous, the carbon price sits far below Europe's, and cuts concentrate on a lagging minority of plants, delivering relative rather than absolute reductions. The EU ETS works in reverse: a tightening absolute cap comes first, and auctions let the price enforce it. Each design mirrors its stage of development - gradual decarbonisation versus a hard ceiling.�ans��src��~Zhang D等论文《Emissions trading in China: progress and prospects》,Energy Policy 2014(清华大学与麻省理工学院)كZhang D, Karplus VJ et al., 'Emissions trading in China: progress and prospects', Energy Policy, 2014 (Tsinghua University and MIT)��id�env_26_016�body���指「plastisphere」,即Zettler等人2013年命名的海洋塑料表面特有微生物群落。塑料疏水且在海面持久滞留,为细菌、藻类与原生生物提供了有别于海水的稳定附着基质,数天内便长成生物膜。其风险有二:弧菌等潜在病原体在其表面富集,并能随洋流远距离播散,充当疾病传播媒介;漂浮塑料又如木筏,载着附生物种跨越地理屏障,加剧海洋生物入侵。�MThe plastisphere is the distinctive microbial community that colonises floating plastic, a term coined by Zettler and colleagues in 2013. Because plastic repels water and lingers at the sea surface, it offers bacteria, algae and protists a stable substratum unlike seawater, and a biofilm takes shape within days. Two risks follow: potential pathogens such as vibrios concentrate on the particles and disperse over vast distances with the currents as disease vectors, while drifting plastics act as rafts carrying attached species across geographic barriers and sharpening marine invasion.�ans��src�٦Zettler ER等论文《Life in the Plastisphere: Microbial Communities on Plastic Marine Debris》,Environmental Science & Technology 2013(伍兹霍尔海洋研究所)٬Zettler ER et al., Life in the Plastisphere: Microbial Communities on Plastic Marine Debris, Environmental Science & Technology, 2013 (Woods Hole Oceanographic Institution)��id�env_26_019�body���把全天用电负荷逐时扣除风电光伏出力绘成净负荷曲线:午间光伏大发使其深陷谷底,日落后又陡峭攀升,轮廓酷似鸭子。难题在坡度——加州春季午后净负荷一度低到过发弃电,傍晚两三小时内却须爬升十几吉瓦,超出常规燃机调峰速度,机组频繁启停,损耗与成本俱增。电网因此加装电池储能吸纳午间余电,借需求响应把用电挪向白天,并以区域互联互济摊薄波动。��Subtract hourly wind and solar output from electricity demand and plot what remains: solar floods midday and sinks the net-load curve into a deep belly, then sunset sends it climbing steeply up the evening neck - the silhouette of a duck. The trouble is slope. On mild spring days California once had so much midday solar that output got curtailed, yet net load had to rise by more than ten gigawatts within two or three hours of dusk, faster than ordinary gas peakers cycle gracefully, so wear and costs mount. Grid operators answer with batteries absorbing midday surplus, demand response shifting use into daylight, and broader regional interconnection.�ans��src�٭Denholm, O'Connell, Brinkman & Jorgenson,《Overgeneration from Solar Energy in California. A Field Guide to the Duck Chart》,NREL/TP-6A20-64086,2015 (DOI: 10.2172/1226167)٫Denholm, O'Connell, Brinkman & Jorgenson, 'Overgeneration from Solar Energy in California. A Field Guide to the Duck Chart', NREL/TP-6A20-64086, 2015, DOI: 10.2172/1226167��id�f05cf7efec6d�body���单桩、导管架等固定式基础在水深超过约六十米后造价迅速攀升，而日本、挪威、美国西海岸等地的近岸海床很快就跌入深水，风资源却更为强劲稳定。漂浮式平台用系泊缆和锚固定在海床上，让机组随浮体运动，从而把可开发海域扩展到数百米水深。苏格兰 Hywind 于 2017 年投运，成为首个商业化漂浮式风场，其容量因数长期高于多数固定式项目。�Monopiles and jackets become sharply more expensive beyond roughly sixty metres of water, yet seabeds off Japan, Norway, and the U.S. West Coast plunge to depth close to shore even though the wind there is stronger and steadier. Floating platforms are held by mooring lines and anchors, letting the turbine ride on a buoyant hull and opening waters hundreds of metres deep. Hywind Scotland, commissioned in 2017 as the first commercial floating wind farm, has sustained capacity factors above most fixed-bottom projects.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�f0d0c2652b3a�body���北半球陆地面积大，春夏植物茂盛时大量吸收 CO₂，秋冬凋零分解又把 CO₂ 释放回大气，于是形成年度锯齿状波动。南半球相反，但全球整体被北半球的“呼吸”主导。�The Northern Hemisphere has more land; plants soak up CO₂ in spring and summer, then release it as they decay in autumn and winter, creating the yearly sawtooth. The Southern Hemisphere is opposite, but the global signal is dominated by the north's 'breathing'.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f284a731495e�body���巴黎协定把全球升温控制在远低于2°C、并努力限制在1.5°C写为目标，但不再强制分配减排指标，而是由各国自行提出“国家自主贡献”（NDC）并定期更新，每五年开展一次“全球盘点”评估集体进展。它同时要求发达国家提供资金技术援助，构成了一个有弹性、能不断加码的全球气候治理框架。��The Paris Agreement commits the world to hold warming well below 2°C and pursue efforts toward 1.5°C, but it does not impose national targets from above. Instead every country submits its own Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC) and updates it regularly, while a five-yearly global stocktake assesses collective progress. Developed countries also pledge finance and technology support — a flexible framework that can be ratcheted up over time.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f4f6b887797e�body��'联合国可持续发展目标是一套包含17个目标、169项具体指标的全球框架，于2015年由联合国会员国一致通过，作为“2030年可持续发展议程”的核心。它涵盖减贫、清洁能源、气候行动、水下与陆地生物等多个环境与社会议题。�UThe UN Sustainable Development Goals comprise a global framework of 17 goals and 169 targets, unanimously adopted by UN member states in 2015 as the core of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development. They span poverty reduction, clean energy, climate action, life below water, and life on land, among other environmental and social issues.�ans��src��5联合国《2030年可持续发展议程》（2015）�@United Nations, '2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development' (2015)��id�f553faa4de63�body���循环水系统把冷却或工艺用水处理后重复利用，大幅减少取用新鲜水量和废水排放。它需要配套沉淀、过滤和缓蚀防垢措施以维持水质。在缺水地区，循环水是保障生产和生态的关键手段。�Recirculated water systems treat and reuse cooling or process water, sharply cutting fresh withdrawals and effluent. They need sedimentation, filtration and corrosion-scale control to maintain quality. In water-scarce regions, recirculation is key to both production and ecology.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�f6ad947ff7da�body�ٮ它把水源林、人居、生产田和水道按海拔排好位置，让水自动分配、养分循环、风险分散；不是征服地形，而是顺着地形设计生活。ٷIt arranges water-source forest, homes, fields and channels by elevation so water self-distributes, nutrients cycle and risks spread—designing life with the terrain, not against it.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f6eab2b5da45�body�ٍ光污染指过多的人造夜间灯光，会扰乱海龟幼崽找海、候鸟迷失方向、昆虫减少，并改变动物的昼夜节律。ٮLight pollution is excessive artificial night lighting; it disorients sea turtle hatchlings, misleads migratory birds, reduces insects and disrupts animals' day-night cycles.�ans��src�ٱB.M. Van Doren 等,PNAS, 2017(高强度城市照明改变夜间鸟类迁徙);T. Longcore 与 C. Rich, Frontiers in Ecology and the Environment, 2004(生态光污染概念框架)��B.M. Van Doren et al., PNAS, 2017, high-intensity urban light installation dramatically alters nighttime bird migration; T. Longcore and C. Rich, Frontiers in Ecology and the Environment, 2004, framework of ecological light pollution.��id�f704b4f58076�body���2022 年通过的《昆明—蒙特利尔全球生物多样性框架》提出，到 2030 年保护至少 30% 的陆地、内陆水域和海洋。它是继《生物多样性公约》之后最具雄心的全球保护承诺之一。��Adopted in 2022, the Kunming–Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework aims to protect at least 30% of land, inland waters and oceans by 2030. It is among the most ambitious global conservation commitments under the Convention on Biological Diversity.�ans��src��vCBD第十五次缔约方大会第15/4号决定附《昆明-蒙特利尔全球生物多样性框架》目标3，2022年�pConvention on Biological Diversity Decision 15/4, Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework, Target 3, 2022��id�f725a9ce827e�body�ِ碳汇是能吸收并储存大气中二氧化碳的自然或人工系统，例如森林、海洋和土壤，其吸收的碳多于释放的碳。وA carbon sink is a natural or artificial reservoir that absorbs more carbon dioxide than it releases, such as forests, oceans and soils.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f7b900b47079�body��1PM2.5指空气动力学直径不大于2.5微米的细颗粒物，来源包括燃烧、机动车尾气和工业排放。它们能深入肺部甚至进入血液，与心血管疾病、肺癌和过早死亡风险上升相关，因此世界卫生组织为其设定了严格的年均指导值（5 μg/m³）。�~PM2.5 refers to fine particulate matter with an aerodynamic diameter of 2.5 micrometers or less, arising from combustion, vehicle exhaust, and industrial emissions. These particles penetrate deep into the lungs and can enter the bloodstream, linked to higher risks of heart disease, lung cancer, and premature death, which is why the WHO sets a strict annual guideline of 5 μg/m³.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�fc96da40d56c�body���生态足迹衡量人类消耗的资源与排放的废物需要多大面积的生产性土地来提供与吸收。生物承载力是地球（或某区域）实际能持续提供的这类面积，两者之差即为生态赤字。��The ecological footprint measures the productive land area needed to supply our resources and absorb our waste. Biocapacity is the area Earth (or a region) can sustainably provide; the gap between them is an ecological deficit.�ans��src��B全球足迹网络（Global Footprint Network）国家足迹账户�4Global Footprint Network National Footprint Accounts��id�ffe0c3542def�body�� 甲烷在二十年的时间尺度上单位质量的增温效应约为二氧化碳的八十多倍，因其红外吸收能力强。但它的大气寿命只有约十二年，远短于二氧化碳的百年以上，所以长期潜势会下降。控制甲烷是见效快的短期减缓路径。�2Methane's warming effect per unit mass is over 80 times that of CO2 over 20 years because of strong infrared absorption. But its atmospheric lifetime is only about 12 years, far shorter than CO2's centuries, so its long-term potential drops. Controlling methane is a fast-acting short-term mitigation path.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0c312a85f2d9�body���土壤通过有机质循环、持水、微生物固氮与结构支撑根系，决定作物产能；其形成需数百年，侵蚀与板结可在数季内毁掉，退化后极难恢复，故被称为慢变量基础。��Soil sustains crops via organic cycling, water holding, microbial N-fixation and root support; it forms over centuries but erodes or compacts within seasons, and once degraded is hard to restore—making it a slow-variable foundation.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�0d7bd92bdc70�body���种群内基因多样性越高，面对变暖、病害等新压力时出现适应个体的概率越大，避免近交衰退并维持进化潜力；单一栽培作物正是因基因狭窄而易遭疫病横扫。�
Higher within-population genetic diversity raises the odds that some individuals withstand warming or disease, avoiding inbreeding depression and preserving evolutionary potential; uniform crops fail exactly because their narrow genetics let epidemics sweep through.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1a62672d52d0�body��V反照率是地表反射太阳辐射的比例，冰雪反照率很高（约0.6–0.9），能大量反射阳光。当气候变暖使冰雪融化、露出深色海洋或陆地时，反照率下降、吸收更多热量，进一步加速融化和升温，形成正反馈。这种“冰雪—反照率反馈”会放大北极等地区的增温。��Albedo is the fraction of incoming solar radiation reflected by a surface; snow and ice have high albedo (about 0.6–0.9) and reflect most sunlight. When warming melts ice and snow to expose darker ocean or land, albedo drops and more heat is absorbed, which further accelerates melting and warming—creating a positive feedback. The ice–albedo feedback strongly amplifies warming in regions like the Arctic.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�21c76ba1e9a8�body��基林曲线是夏威夷冒纳罗亚天文台自 1958 年起对大气二氧化碳浓度的连续测量，由查尔斯·基林开创。它清晰显示 CO₂ 浓度从约 315 ppm 上升到如今的 420 ppm 以上，并带有每年植物呼吸造成的锯齿波动。��The Keeling Curve is the continuous record of atmospheric CO₂ begun in 1958 at Mauna Loa by Charles Keeling. It shows CO₂ rising from about 315 ppm to over 420 ppm today, with a sawtooth pattern from the yearly breathing of plants.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�23f9ec76d84e�body���碳足迹指个人、产品或活动在全生命周期中排放的温室气体总量，常用二氧化碳当量（CO₂e）表示。测算多采用生命周期评估（LCA），把原料、制造、运输到使用各环节的排放加总。�A carbon footprint is the total greenhouse gas emissions of a person, product, or activity over its life cycle, usually expressed in CO₂-equivalents. It is typically measured by life-cycle assessment (LCA), summing emissions from materials, manufacturing, transport, and use.�ans��src�م世界资源研究所与 WBCSD《温室气体核算体系产品寿命周期标准》(GHG Protocol Product Standard, 对应 ISO 14067)�EWRI & WBCSD, GHG Protocol Product Life Cycle Standard (cf. ISO 14067)��id�24942ef16fc6�body���水俣病是日本水俣湾因工厂排放含甲基汞废水、经鱼类富集后被人食用而引发的中毒事件。甲基汞会严重损伤神经系统，尤其危害胎儿和婴幼儿。��Minamata disease was caused by methylmercury discharged from a factory into Japan's Minamata Bay, where it built up in fish eaten by local people. Methylmercury severely damages the nervous system, especially in fetuses and infants.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�296b6c8f8a80�body���特有性指某个物种仅天然分布于很狭窄的地理范围，如某座岛屿或某段山脉。特有物种往往对栖息地变化极为敏感，一旦当地生境被破坏就极易灭绝。��Endemism means a species occurs naturally only in a very limited area, such as a single island or mountain range. Endemics are highly sensitive to habitat change and can go extinct quickly if their local habitat is destroyed.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�2a2731dcc5e0�body���REDD+通过为'避免毁林与退化带来的减排'付费，把森林的碳与生态价值变现，纠正'砍树比留树更划算'的市场失灵，但面临基线核算、泄漏与社区权益保障等挑战。��REDD+ pays for emissions avoided by not deforesting, monetizing forests' carbon and ecological value to fix the market failure where logging pays more than keeping trees—but faces baseline accounting, leakage and community-rights challenges.�ans��src�يEngel S.、Pagiola S.、Wunder S.，《环境服务付费设计的理论与实践综述》，Ecological Economics，2008年第65卷第4期ٮEngel S., Pagiola S. & Wunder S., 'Designing Payments for Environmental Services in Theory and Practice: An Overview of the Issues', Ecological Economics, Vol. 65 No. 4, 2008��id�39c8ab902ee6�body���甲烷水合物是封存在海底与冻土中的冰状甲烷晶体。若因升温而大规模失稳释放，甲烷这种强温室气体进入大气，可能进一步加剧变暖，形成正反馈。��Methane hydrates are ice-like crystals of methane locked in seabeds and permafrost. If warming destabilizes them at large scale, the potent greenhouse gas methane could escape to the atmosphere and amplify warming through a feedback loop.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�39fc9920262b�body���海冰和雪面反照率高，能反射大量阳光。升温使冰雪融化，露出深色海洋或陆地，吸收更多太阳辐射，进一步升温并加速融化，形成正反馈。这导致北极升温速率约为全球平均的2–4倍。�Ice and snow have high albedo, reflecting much sunlight. Warming melts them, exposing dark ocean or land that absorbs more solar energy, which warms further and melts more—a positive feedback. This makes Arctic warming roughly 2–4 times the global average.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�3a91ed85fba7�body�ٺ太阳能和风电时有时无，电网级电池在发电多时充电、缺电时放电，平衡供需。它还能在断电时提供备用电力，减少对化石调峰机组的依赖。��Because solar and wind are intermittent, grid-scale batteries charge when generation is high and discharge when it is low, balancing supply and demand. They also provide backup during outages and reduce reliance on fossil peaker plants.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�5a129b3afb94�body���海洋热浪是某片海域温度异常偏高并持续数天到数周的现象，常由洋流和大气环流异常叠加造成。它会引发珊瑚白化、藻类大量死亡和渔场位移，对海洋生物冲击很大。��A marine heatwave is an anomalously warm sea-temperature spell lasting days to weeks, often from unusual ocean and atmospheric circulation. It triggers coral bleaching, mass die-offs of algae and fish-range shifts, hitting marine life hard.�ans��src���Molony, Thomson, Feng,《What Can We Learn From the 2010/11 Western Australian Marine Heatwave to Better Understand Risks From the One Forecast in 2020/21?》,Frontiers in Marine Science,2021 (DOI: 10.3389/fmars.2021.645383)��Molony, Thomson, Feng, 'What Can We Learn From the 2010/11 Western Australian Marine Heatwave to Better Understand Risks From the One Forecast in 2020/21?', Frontiers in Marine Science, 2021, DOI: 10.3389/fmars.2021.645383��id�5d3b9c0c1092�body���黑碳吸收阳光加热大气，沉降到雪冰表面会降低反照率加速融化，是仅次于CO2和甲烷的强短期增温因子，寿命仅数天到数周，因此削减黑碳是见效最快的降温措施之一。��Black carbon absorbs sunlight, warms the air, and darkens snow/ice to speed melting. It is the strongest short-lived warming agent after CO2 and methane, lasting days to weeks, so cutting it is among the fastest cooling measures available.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6a7ca8b8f9d4�body���机械回收是把塑料清洗熔融再造粒，受杂质与降级限制；化学回收用热解、解聚把聚合物还原成单体或油，可处理混合脏料并产出原生级原料，但能耗与碳排放高，目前规模化经济性仍存疑。�OMechanical recycling washes and remelts plastic into pellets, limited by impurities and downcycling; chemical recycling uses pyrolysis or depolymerization to revert polymers to monomers or oil, handling mixed dirty feedstock and yielding virgin-grade material—but at high energy and carbon cost, with questionable scale-up economics.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�7504daa3da1c�body���填埋的有机垃圾在缺氧环境下被微生物分解，会产生以甲烷和二氧化碳为主的“填埋气”。甲烷是强温室气体，但也可收集起来发电或供热，化害为利。��Buried organic waste decomposes without oxygen and yields 'landfill gas' rich in methane and CO₂. Methane is a strong greenhouse gas, but capturing it can generate power or heat, turning harm into use.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�784a3600d065�body���成功依赖三点：威胁已消除或可控（如捕猎停止）、栖息地质量与连通度足够、以及种群达到最小可存活规模并具备遗传多样性，否则易再灭绝。�Success needs three things: the original threat removed or controlled (e.g., hunting stopped), habitat of sufficient quality and connectivity, and a population above the minimum viable size with genetic diversity—otherwise relapse to extinction is likely.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7a3131f0f328�body���单一栽培指连片只种一种作物，遗传和生境都单一，一旦遇上特定病虫害或极端天气容易整体歉收。它还会减少传粉昆虫和土壤生物，削弱农田自身的调控能力。��Monoculture means growing one crop over large areas, with uniform genetics and habitat, so a single pest, disease or weather shock can wreck the whole harvest. It also reduces pollinators and soil life, weakening the farmland's self-regulation.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7df889f19e8e�body���升高CO2可短期内提升部分植物光合与水分利用效率，但受氮、磷、水分与温度限制，且加速的呼吸与极端事件会回吐碳；观测显示其增益已现饱和迹象。��Higher CO2 can briefly boost photosynthesis and water use in some plants, but gains are capped by nitrogen, phosphorus, water and heat limits, and faster respiration plus extremes return carbon; observations show the bonus already saturating.�ans��src��Nature;Science�Nature;Science��id�8b191cc5bd41�body���厄尔尼诺期间东太平洋海面温度升高、信风减弱，常带来暖干天气；拉尼娜则相反，海面偏冷、信风增强，易引发洪涝与凉夏。两者每隔几年交替，显著影响全球降水与台风活动。�@During El Niño, eastern Pacific sea-surface temperatures rise and trade winds weaken, often bringing warm, dry conditions; La Niña is the opposite, with cooler seas and stronger winds that favor floods and cooler summers. The two phases alternate every few years, strongly shaping global rainfall and typhoon activity.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9603f17faab9�body���水电利用河流落差驱动水轮机发电，是迄今规模最大、最成熟的可再生电力来源，提供全球约六分之一的电力。但它也受生态影响（如阻断鱼道、淹没土地）和干旱气候风险的制约。�Hydropower uses the fall of rivers to spin turbines and is still the largest and most mature source of renewable electricity, supplying roughly one sixth of global power. Yet it faces ecological concerns like blocked fish passages and drought vulnerability.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�a071b5294aca�body���绿色基础设施把树木、绿屋顶、雨水花园、湿地等连成网络，既提供休闲空间，也主动承担防洪、降温、净化水质等生态功能。它把自然系统当作城市运转的“基础设施”来规划。��Green infrastructure links trees, green roofs, rain gardens and wetlands into a network that offers recreation and also actively controls floods, cools the city and cleans water. It treats natural systems as part of the city's planned infrastructure.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b6077214915b�body���《蒙特利尔议定书》（1987）逐步淘汰消耗臭氧层的氟氯碳化物（CFC）等物质。它已被所有国家批准，使臭氧层空洞开始恢复，并因 CFC 也是强温室气体而额外减缓了气候变暖。��The Montreal Protocol (1987) phased out ozone-depleting substances such as CFCs. Ratified by every country, it has put the ozone hole on a recovery path and, because CFCs are potent greenhouse gases, also slowed warming.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b9ee817ccc64�body���就地保护是在物种原本的栖息地直接保护，如建立自然保护区；迁地保护是把物种移出原生环境保存，如动物园、植物园和种子库。前者更根本，后者常作为危急时的“备份”。��In-situ conservation protects species in their natural habitat, such as nature reserves; ex-situ conservation moves them elsewhere, like zoos, botanic gardens and seed banks. The former is more fundamental, the latter often a backup in crises.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�bb2152347b74�body�پ棉花耗水与农药、化纤的石化原料、印染的高污染废水，以及高频弃置造成的填埋焚烧，构成主要负担；一件棉T恤全生命周期用水可达数千升。��Water- and pesticide-heavy cotton, petrochemical synthetics, polluting dye wastewater, and frequent disposal to landfill or incineration are the main burdens; one cotton T-shirt's lifecycle can use thousands of liters of water.�ans��src��Ellen MacArthur Foundation;UNEP�EMF;UNEP��id�bcb9ab821563�body���范围1是企业直接燃烧和工艺排放；范围2是外购电力热力间接排放；范围3是价值链上下游（原料、运输、使用、废弃）排放，通常占比最大也最难核算。��Scope 1 is direct combustion and process emissions; Scope 2 is indirect from purchased energy; Scope 3 covers value-chain emissions (materials, transport, use, disposal)—usually largest and hardest to account.�ans��src��GHG Protocol�GHG Protocol��id�cb6fd9b7891b�body���大气 CO₂ 溶入海水后与水反应生成碳酸，进而释放氢离子、降低 pH，同时减少构建贝壳和珊瑚所需的碳酸根离子。自工业革命以来表层海水 pH 已下降约 0.1，看似微小却意味着酸度显著增加。�Dissolved CO₂ reacts with seawater to form carbonic acid, releasing hydrogen ions that lower pH and reducing carbonate ions needed by shells and corals. Since the industrial era surface pH has fallen about 0.1—small in number but a large rise in acidity.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e5600c6cd161�body���NDC 是各缔约方自己制定、定期更新并相互通报的减排与适应计划，体现“自下而上”的气候治理思路。协定要求各国每五年提交更有雄心的 NDC，并定期盘点总体进展。�An NDC is the emission-reduction and adaptation plan each party sets, updates and reports itself, reflecting a bottom-up approach to climate governance. The Agreement asks countries to submit ever more ambitious NDCs every five years and regularly take stock of collective progress.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�eb0cbb642eb8�body���土壤有机碳是植物残体和微生物产物在土中积累的部分，是陆地上最大的活跃碳库之一，超过大气和植被碳的总和。它既关乎肥力和保水，也关乎把碳锁在地下、减缓气候变化。�Soil organic carbon is the part of dead plant matter and microbial products stored in soil, forming one of the largest active carbon pools on land, exceeding the carbon in air and vegetation combined. It matters for fertility and water retention and for locking carbon underground.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_25_011�body��n这是全球平均值——就像人的体温从36.5度升到38度,平均只涨1.5度却意味着大病。气候系统里,平均值小幅变化会放大成极端事件剧变:热浪频率翻倍、暴雨更强、海面上升淹没低洼岛国、珊瑚礁九成白化。2015年巴黎协定把1.5度写为努力目标,因为超过这个线,部分变化将不可逆转。�gThat figure is a global average — like body temperature climbing 36.5 to 38, a small mean change meaning serious illness. Climate systems amplify small averages into extreme swings: doubled heat waves, fiercer storms, island-drowning seas, ninety percent coral bleaching. The Paris Agreement set 1.5 degrees because beyond it some changes turn irreversible.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�env_25_012�body��\风不会一直吹,太阳下山光伏就歇工,而用电需求相对固定——供需错配是核心难题。解药是组合拳:电池储能削峰填谷;抽水蓄能把电变成水位势能;不同地区的电网互联(东边没风西边有);需求侧响应让工厂在电多时开工。多种手段配合,可再生能源占比才能稳步爬升。�QWind stalls, sun sets while demand holds steady — mismatch is the core puzzle. Remedies team up: batteries shift power between hours; pumped hydro stores energy as elevation; interregional grids share (windless east imports windy west); demand response schedules factories to surplus times. Layered together, renewables climb reliably.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_014�body��j一小时的节电量对电网微乎其微,集中开关甚至会造成负荷波动。但它真正的战场在人心:数以亿计的人同时参与一个象征行动,媒体传播环保理念,推动政策讨论与长期习惯改变。不少参与者后来更愿意随手关灯、换上节能灯。象征行动的价值不在那一小时的电,而在点亮意识。��An hour's saving barely dents the grid — simultaneous switching even wobbles loads. The real battlefield is hearts: hundreds of millions joining one symbolic act spreads environmental ideas and drives policy talk and lasting habits. Many participants later switch off idle lights and choose efficient bulbs more willingly. Symbolic acts matter less for the hour than for lighting minds.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�f10b352f7444�body���它指每个人都想从共享资源（如牧场、渔场、大气）中多拿一点，结果整体被过度消耗、谁都受害。破解之道通常是明确产权、设定配额或建立共同治理规则。��It describes everyone trying to take a bit more from a shared resource—pasture, fishery, atmosphere—until it is overexploited and all suffer. Solutions usually involve clear property rights, quotas or collective governance rules.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f8ae1e4e686e�body���海水淡化把海水中的盐分去掉变成饮用水，已在干旱沿海地区广泛采用。但它耗电高、成本高，还会排放浓盐水和化学药剂影响海洋，因此更适合作为补充而非万能解。�Desalination removes salt from seawater to make drinking water and is widely used in dry coastal regions. But it is energy- and cost-intensive and discharges brine and chemicals that can harm the sea, so it fits best as a supplement rather than a universal fix.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�016802d6d928�body���不是。生物累积指某个个体从环境里慢慢积累某物质、浓度高于周围介质；生物放大指该物质沿食物链向上、在更高营养级浓度进一步升高。后者常导致顶级捕食者受害最重。��No. Bioaccumulation is one organism building up a substance to a level above its surroundings; biomagnification is that substance rising further up the food chain at higher trophic levels. The latter often hits top predators hardest.�ans��src��lRachel Carson,《Silent Spring》Houghton Mifflin,1962;中译《寂静的春天》上海译文出版社,2011�iR. Carson, Silent Spring, Houghton Mifflin, 1962; Chinese ed. Shanghai Translation Publishing House, 2011��id�04e3b986324e�body���它们按制氢的碳足迹区分：灰氢来自化石燃料且无碳捕集，蓝氢同样来自化石但配套碳捕集封存，绿氢则用电解水、且电力来自可再生。绿氢被视为深度脱碳（如重工业、航运）的关键选项。�;They differ by the carbon footprint of production: grey hydrogen comes from fossil fuels with no capture, blue from fossil fuels with carbon capture and storage, and green from electrolyzing water using renewable electricity. Green hydrogen is seen as key for hard-to-abate sectors like heavy industry and shipping.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�2cc1b6bd0301�body�ٴ空调、电热水器、冰箱、洗衣机往往是用电大户。善用节能模式、夏季空调调高几度、热水器随用随开、冰箱不塞太满，能明显降电费。ٺAC, water heaters, fridges and washers are usually the biggest users. Eco modes, a few degrees higher AC in summer, on-demand heating and not overpacking the fridge cut bills noticeably.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2cec4c706292�body���它要求造成污染或环境损害的一方承担治理和赔偿成本，而不是由公众买单。这是经合组织提出的环境政策基石，被用于排污收费、环境税和损害赔偿等设计。�It holds that whoever causes pollution or environmental damage should bear the cost of cleanup and compensation, not the public. Proposed by the OECD as a cornerstone of environmental policy, it underpins pollution charges, environmental taxes and liability rules.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2fd9accbddf9�body���不完全是。水稀缺指一个地区本身可用的淡水量不足；水压力指取用水量占可用水量的比例过高，意味着竞争和枯竭风险大。两者常叠加，但缺水地区若用水克制也可能水压力不高。�Not exactly. Water scarcity means a region simply lacks enough freshwater, while water stress means withdrawals are a high share of available supply, signalling competition and depletion risk. They often overlap, but a scarce region using little water may still have low stress.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions